window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1101,"title":"Chapter 1101 - Two-Step Inversion","paragraphs":["Lu Muxue first instigated Shang Jing to expose Qiao Xi for cheating during the competition, then instigated Madam Zhou to accuse Qiao Xi of being a mistress. From these two things, it could be seen that Lu Muxue was determined to ruin Qiao Xi’s reputation. This was no simple matter.","At this moment, someone suddenly said loudly, “I heard about the calligraphy competition. Shang Jing slandered a contestant, and Yi Cang claimed that the contestant’s work was his. The two of them joined forces to frame her. It turns out that the contestant is Mrs. Gu!”","When one person mentioned this, the others echoed, “Yes, I still remember that Liang Pingchuan also went to the scene. He even said that the contestant was his last disciple. In that case, Mrs. Gu is Mr. Liang’s disciple! Then isn’t Lu Muxue deliberately framing Mrs. Gu?!”","“I heard everything clearly in the recording. Lu Muxue deliberately led Shang Jing to expose Mrs. Gu for cheating and even let Yi Cang claim her work as his. If Mr. Liang hadn’t arrived in time, Mrs. Gu wouldn’t have been able to clear her name.”","As for Madam Zhou mentioned in the recording, the noblewomen present were not unfamiliar with her. A noblewoman in bright clothes snorted. “Could it be that Madam Zhou is the one with her head up in the clouds and thinks her son is the most outstanding and invincible person in the world? She’s famous in our social circle.”","“Is she stupid? With Mrs. Gu’s looks and talent, how could she fall for that useless son of hers? Moreover, Mrs. Gu is already married. I heard that President Gu dotes on her very much. With such a handsome and rich husband, why would Mrs. Gu be a mistress for that piece of trash, Zhou Lin’an?”","“Tsk tsk... It was Lu Muxue who instigated it. She deliberately made Madam Zhou accuse Mrs. Gu of being a mistress to ruin her reputation. Lu Muxue is the daughter of the Lu family. Why is she spending so much effort to frame Mrs. Gu?”","Everyone looked at each other and seemed to have an answer in their hearts.","Qiao Xi quietly listened to everyone’s discussion. When the scene calmed down, she slowly raised her eyes to look at Lu Xiang and asked with a small smile, “I’m also very curious. I’ve never seen Lu Muxue before. Why is she so hostile toward me? She has framed me time and again.","“In the past, I was very puzzled and wanted to talk to the Lu family about it. Today, I finally understand that it’s because Lu Corporation doesn’t want to give me the 5% of shares, so they had Lu Muxue frame me at the university. Once my reputation is ruined, Lu Corporation will announce that someone like me isn’t worthy of owning the Lu family’s shares. Then, this bet won’t be valid anymore. Moreover, this way, no one will accuse the Lu family of being untrustworthy.”","Hearing Qiao Xi’s words, the muscles on Lu Xiang’s face trembled. It was not like that! They did not ask Lu Muxue to frame Qiao Xi. This was all a misunderstanding!","“Oh... No wonder I heard someone say ‘I didn’t expect Gu Zheng to be such a person’ when I walked over. It’s because Lu Muxue’s schemes ended in failure. According to the bet, you should’ve transferred the shares to me, but you were unwilling to accept this outcome, so you targeted Gu Zheng again. You wanted to ruin his reputation and force us to give up the transfer of the shares, right?","“May I ask whose plan this is? First, you framed me, then you slandered Gu Zheng. Who came up with such shameful methods? Was it you, Madam Lu?”","Everyone’s sharp gazes instantly landed on Lu Xiang. Lu Muxue was just a university student, and she had just transferred to Li City University. She should have only met Mrs. Gu a few times and had no grudges with her. Why would she frame her? Hence, the Lu family must have instructed her to do this!","There was a reason why the Lu family did this. It could only be for the shares!","Everyone instantly understood that all of this was a trap from the beginning until the end. It was just that the Lu family did not expect Mrs. Gu to avoid their schemes both times they tried to frame her. Hence, they changed their methods and said that Gu Zheng was unfilial.","After knowing this, everyone could not help but suspect the matter of Gu Zheng angering the Old Master Lu till he fell sick. After Lu Muxue’s scheme failed, the Lu family still did not want to fulfill the bet, so...","Qiao Xi was the same as Lu Xiang. She had already arranged her own people. With a glance from her, someone probed, “Then the real question here is, is Chairman Lu really sick? Even if he’s really sick, he can’t blame it on President Gu, right? I heard that President Gu has been busy dealing with the company and the international conference recently. How could he have time to care about those shares with Chairman Lu?! Could it be that... this is all the Lu family’s one-man show?”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up in satisfaction. This was the effect she wanted."]},{"number":1102,"title":"Chapter 1102 - Lu Yan Asked For The Bet","paragraphs":["At this moment, everyone could not help but be suspicious. “In that case, the Lu family failed to frame Mrs. Gu twice previously, so they targeted President Gu this time.”","The atmosphere instantly became awkward. The Lu family kept saying that President Gu had angered Chairman Lu and that he insisted on snatching the 5% of shares. However, President Gu held such a huge company like Gu Corporation. Would he be so obsessed with the Lu family’s assets?","If it were not for the recording in Mrs. Gu’s hand today, Lu Corporation’s plan would have succeeded a long time ago. Everyone would think that Mrs. Gu was immoral and President Gu was heartless and unfilial.","Now that the recording was out, the Lu family’s actions were no longer credible in everyone’s eyes.","Why did Old Master Lu fall sick at this time? Was it because he did not want to give President Gu the 5% shares and deliberately maligned President Gu? After all, everyone knew very well that Old Master Lu favored Lu Yan but did not have any feelings for President Gu, his biological grandson.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up into a smile, and her gaze was deep. She gestured slightly to the man not far away. There were some things that could not be said by her personally. They had to be said by others to be believable.","These methods were all learned from the Lu family. They were not the only ones who could attack using public opinion.","Lu Corporation could insinuate that she exposed Lu Muxue’s matter to complicate the matter. However, the Lu family did not have any evidence, so they would not be as convincing as her.","Lu Xiang bit her lip tightly. She did not expect Qiao Xi to spout nonsense and deliberately make everyone think that the Lu family had instructed Lu Muxue to malign her.","A higher-up of Lu Corporation could not help but say, “Lu Muxue framed you because you offended her. How can you confuse her matters with the company’s matters?”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were slightly red as she said aggrievedly, “Then what does Chairman Lu’s illness have to do with Ah Zheng? He’s old, so fainting just means that his health isn’t good. Why is your Lu family spreading the news that it’s Ah Zheng’s fault? After all, Ah Zheng has never stepped foot into your Lu family, much less angered Chairman Lu. You’re just bullying our Ah Zheng for having a good temper and not wanting to bicker with you, so you’re slandering him for being unfilial. Do you still have a conscience?”","The higher-up’s face instantly flushed red from Qiao Xi’s accusations, and he was unable to say a word.","She actually said that Gu Zheng had a good temper? Gu Zheng was the most terrifying person!","Qiao Xi had a helpless expression. “I heard that Lu Muxue has just transferred to Li City University. The first time we met was during the calligraphy competition. We didn’t even say anything to each other, so how could I have offended her? However, she spent so much effort framing me and even tried to ruin my reputation time and again. Previously, I didn’t understand why she did all that, but I finally understand now.”","The crowd booed. The Lu family’s methods were too vicious. For that bit of shares, they wanted to ruin Mrs. Gu’s reputation and even sent their juniors to do it.","The higher-up was angered to the point his entire body trembled. He pointed at Qiao Xi and shouted loudly, “Shut up! Shut up! This is all a misunderstanding. It’s not true!","“Chairman Lu was angered by Gu Zheng. If he hadn’t insisted on the 5% shares, how could...” The higher-up suddenly stopped talking, and his expression was very ugly.","Qiao Xi glanced at him indifferently and questioned in an icy-cold voice, “Then did Chairman Lu suddenly fall ill because he didn’t want to give us this 5% of shares?","“Why does Gu Zheng want this 5% of shares? It’s all because Lu Yan lost the bet with me. Back then, we agreed that he would bet on Lu Corporation’s shares while I would bet on Gu Corporation’s 5% shares. Since he lost in the end, shouldn’t he fulfill the bet?”","Everyone gasped. 5% of Gu Corporation’s shares?","The higher-up of Lu Corporation was still unconvinced. “That’s because you schemed to deceive Young Master Lu, so...”","“I schemed to deceive him?” Qiao Xi interrupted him with a cold smile, then said loudly, “Please get this straight. This bet was proposed by Lu Yan. I originally didn’t want to make a bet with him, but he joined forces with Yao Mengqing to mock me for not knowing how to ride a horse. He said that I embarrassed Gu Zheng. In the beginning, I refused twice, but he still insisted. For Ah Zheng’s sake, I agreed to this bet.","“Lu Yan was the one who took the initiative to ask for this 5% of shares. Because he thought that I didn’t know how to ride a horse, he asked me to bet on shares of Gu Corporation. The shares of Lu Corporation and Gu Corporation are not of the same value. Speaking of which, I’ve suffered a loss.”"]},{"number":1103,"title":"Chapter 1103 - Lu Yan Is An Idiot","paragraphs":["“In the end, I was forced to agree to the bet. This was Lu Yan’s idea from the beginning. If he had won, I would’ve fulfilled the bet and handed over 5% of Gu Corporation’s shares. Now that I’ve won, according to the agreement, Lu Yan should transfer the shares to me. However, a few months have passed, yet Lu Yan hasn’t fulfilled his promise.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes suddenly turned cold as her sharp gaze landed on the higher-up. She questioned word by word, “Do you have evidence to say that I deceived Lu Yan into making a bet? Could it be that it’s my fault that he lost? Is the heir of Lu Corporation so easy to deceive? If he was easily deceived into losing 5% of his corporation’s shares, I don’t think your Lu family’s business will last long. It’s only a matter of time before Lu Yan loses everything!","“Why don’t you change heirs as soon as possible? I wonder how much of the Lu family’s assets will Lu Yan squander next? At that time, Chairman Lu will be bedridden and unconscious all year round.”","As soon as she finished speaking, everyone laughed.","What Mrs. Gu said made sense. They were saying that the heir of Lu Corporation was schemed against, which resulted in him losing 5% of the shares. If news of this got out, it would be a joke. Lu Yan had done such an idiotic thing but still had the cheek to complain?","If the heir of Lu Corporation was really such an idiot, they would have to reconsider whether to collaborate with Lu Corporation.","The higher-up was instantly infuriated when he saw everyone laughing at him. He glared fiercely at Qiao Xi. “It’s all because you agreed to the bet! If you hadn’t agreed, none of this would’ve happened!”","“Heh!” Qiao Xi sneered. “I made it very clear that it was Lu Yan who forced me to make a bet. I rejected him twice, but he still didn’t let me off. If you don’t believe me, I can show you the surveillance footage. But are you sure you want me to show it to everyone?”","Everyone’s faces were filled with disdain. The Lu family was too unreasonable. Lu Yan was the one who suggested the bet. Now that he had lost, he said that Mrs. Gu tricked him into making the bet. Was he an idiot? Was he so easily deceived?","The higher-up’s face was livid. “Then the bet is unfair! Young Master Lu thought that you didn’t know how to ride a horse, so he made the bet. You were clearly pretending!”","Everyone’s gazes were filled with disdain. How could he say such things? If Mrs. Gu did not know how to ride a horse, why would she bet with him? She could have just given Young Master Lu Gu Corporation’s shares!","Qiao Xi was neither anxious nor impatient as she said slowly, “Lu Yan thought that I didn’t know how to ride a horse, so he wanted to bet with me. This means that he has always been thinking about Gu Corporation’s shares. It’s just that he didn’t expect me to know how to ride a horse, so he lost. The essence of this matter is actually Lu Yan’s greed. He wanted to snatch Ah Zheng’s shares, so he made a bet with me. Now that he has lost, he wants to go back on his word. Your Lu family is taking advantage of the situation here. Why are you so shameless?","“Lu Yan is allowed to scheme against me, but I can’t fight back? If I fight back, does it mean that I’m scheming and unfilial? In the eyes of the Lu family, I should deliberately lose the competition and give the shares to the Lu family, huh? Only then will you think that I did the right thing and won’t frame me and Gu Zheng anymore, right?”","Qiao Xi’s voice was icy-cold as she glanced fiercely at the Lu family.","At this moment, the hall was silent. Everyone was shocked by the Lu family’s shamelessness. From the beginning to the end, Mrs. Gu had not done anything wrong. She had only agreed to the bet according to Lu Yan’s wishes. This bet was also to protect her husband’s reputation. Now that she had won, it was reasonable for her to ask for shares. After all, the shares were her winnings. Logically speaking, the Lu family should fulfill the bet. It was fine that the Lu family had been delaying giving out the shares, but they even found someone to frame Mrs. Gu and reverse the truth. Rumor also had it that President Gu had made Chairman Lu sick.","If Chairman Lu was really sick, he could not blame it on President Gu. After all, Lu Yan had lost the shares himself. The Lu family could not go back on their word.","This bet was proposed by Lu Yan, and he lost the shares. In the end, even if Chairman Lu was sick, it would be Lu Yan’s fault. It had nothing to do with President Gu.","Seeing everyone’s disdainful gazes, Lu Xiang’s face instantly turned pale. She gritted her teeth and calmed down. Then, she said unhappily, “Mrs. Gu, back then, Ah Yan was too rash when he made a bet with you. However, Gu Zheng used his power to anger my father until he fell sick. This is the truth!”","Seeing this, the higher-up immediately echoed, “That’s right! Young Master Lu was rash and felt very guilty after the incident. However, because of this 5% of shares, President Gu disregarded family ties and directly angered Chairman Lu until he fell sick. Even now when the old master is still lying on the hospital bed, he still refuses to let the matter go! We’re too angry over this, so we spoke without thinking just now!”"]},{"number":1104,"title":"Chapter 1104 - Suspecting Lu Yan’s Identity","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent as she remained silent for a long time. Under the burning gazes of everyone, she slowly said, “I hope you understand a fact. Is 5% of Lu Corporation’s shares really important to Gu Zheng?","“Although we only bet on 5% of the shares back then, you know very well that Lu Corporation’s shares can’t compare to Gu Corporation’s at all. Why should Gu Zheng anger Chairman Lu to death just for this bit of shares?”","Everyone could not help but look at Lu Xiang, their eyes filling up with doubt. Only then did they realize that with Gu Zheng’s current wealth and power, he did not have to care about the Lu family’s shares at all, much less ask Old Master Lu for them.","Everyone present was involved in this matter. When Qiao Xi said that, they understood in their hearts. Lu Yan clearly wanted to ruin President Gu’s reputation and take this opportunity to make President Gu give up his shares and transfer them. Moreover, they heard that Lu Yan still wanted to compete with President Gu for the position of director. Coincidentally, these rumors broke out at this moment and attacked President Gu from the root, making him unable to continue working.","These things were originally Lu Yan’s fault. Now, he still wanted to push the blame on others. He was really shameless!","“Gu Zheng is Old Master Lu’s biological grandson! Could it be that he can’t compare to Lu Yan?”","“Lu Yan is the heir that Old Master carefully taught, while Gu Zheng has just reunited with the Lu family. In the Lu family’s eyes, Lu Yan is naturally more important.”","“Actually, the Lu family has already let Gu Zheng down. In the past, they treated him as an illegitimate child and said bad things about him everywhere. They slandered him and caused trouble for him. Now, even though they’ve acknowledged him, they’re still framing Gu Zheng for Lu Yan. They don’t treat Gu Zheng as family at all.”","“Speaking of which, Gu Zheng is Miss Lu Qingyun’s son. What’s going on with Lu Yan?” Someone in the crowd raised a question. “I heard that Chairman Lu has never liked his daughter, Lu Qingyun, but he likes Second Miss Lu Xiang. Lu Xiang is the illegitimate daughter of Old Master Lu and his mistress.”","“I still remember that the person who was originally engaged to the Jiang family was Miss Lu Qingyun. Later on, Lu Xiang liked President Jiang, so she married into the Jiang family. Miss Lu Qingyun was not favored, so she was forced to marry Gu Weiming. If Lu Yan is really Miss Lu Qingyun’s son, why is he so liked in the Lu family? Even Lu Xiang, who has always been at odds with Lu Qingyun, dotes on Lu Yan a lot. I keep feeling that something is wrong!”","The moment that was said, the hall instantly fell silent. These words were undoubtedly a bomb to everyone. Back then, after Gu Zheng’s identity was confirmed, the Lu family announced to the public that Lu Qingyun had given birth to two sons. They only found Lu Yan, but they did not know that the other son was Gu Zheng.","Although this explanation was a little far-fetched, everyone had to believe it. After all, if Lu Yan was not Lu Qingyun’s child, why would the Lu family keep him and nurture him as the heir?","All the noblewomen in high society knew that Lu Qingyun’s biological mother committed suicide. This matter could not be separated from Old Madam Lu. Ever since Lu Qingyun’s biological mother passed away, Lu Xiang and her daughter occupied the Lu family. They stole Lu Qingyun’s father and Lu Qingyun’s marriage contract. Why would Lu Xiang be so kind to Lu Yan?","If Lu Xiang had really repented and decided to take care of Lu Qingyun’s son to make up for her mistake back then, why was she only good to Lu Yan but spared no effort in suppressing Gu Zheng? Could it be that Lu Yan was not Lu Qingyun’s son?","“Shut up!” Lu Xiang pointed at the person who spoke just now. Her eyes were bloodshot as if she wanted to devour someone. Then, she glared fiercely at Qiao Xi. “Qiao Xi! Stop spouting nonsense. Ah Yan is my sister’s biological son!”","Qiao Xi said slowly, “Second Miss Lu, don’t bark at people randomly. I wasn’t the one who said that. Everyone is just making speculations about this odd situation. Why are you so agitated? Look at you, there are wrinkles on your face.”","“You...” Lu Xiang was angered to the point her face flushed red. Faced with everyone’s questioning gazes, she forcefully suppressed the anger in her heart and could only stare fixedly at Qiao Xi. Her eyes were about to burst into flames.","At this moment, she had a bad feeling. They had clearly occupied the moral high ground today to criticize Gu Zheng. Even if they could not ruin his reputation, he would still be negatively affected. By then, Ah Yan could snatch away his position as director.","However, things deviated from their expectations. Ever since Qiao Xi came, the situation had changed with just a few words. There were even people who suspected Ah Yan’s identity.","No! She would never allow this to happen! She had to think of a countermeasure."]},{"number":1105,"title":"Chapter 1105 - I Agree With President Gu’s","paragraphs":["At this moment, Gu Zheng was holding an international meeting. He was the leader of the meeting and the only focus of attention. The Lu family’s methods did not affect him at all.","“President Gu, the other party is already very sincere. As long as we agree to give up 2% of the profits, we can sign the contract. Why are you being so calculative?” Lu Yan said gently.","The entire venue was silent. Everyone knew that Lu Yan and Gu Zheng were not on good terms, so they were sandwiched between the two of them. No one dared to make a sound.","After a long silence, Song Shijing stepped forward and said, “2% of the profits isn’t much, but if we give in today, the other party will definitely go even further and challenge our bottom line. Business requires money. We’re all gathered here to create greater benefits. If we can’t achieve this effect when we’re together, then this meeting will be meaningless.”","With that, everyone applauded. “You’re right!”","“This 2% isn’t a lot, but it’s not a small sum when converted to cash. If we give in now, it means that we have to give in in the future, so we absolutely can’t give in.”","“After all, President Gu has been in the business world for so many years and has thought things through. Young Master Lu has just started managing his company, so he still lacks some experience.”","The smile on Lu Yan’s face gradually vanished, and his face was ashen. Why was everyone supporting Gu Zheng? As long as Gu Zheng appeared, he seemed weak in comparison. They clearly wanted to curry favor with Gu Zheng.","Why did everyone only have eyes for Gu Zheng? Qiao Xi liked Gu Zheng, and these people were all praising Gu Zheng too, but he was also very hardworking and outstanding. Why couldn’t everyone see him?","If he had started managing the company earlier, he would be the business tycoon in charge of Li City now. Gu Zheng would not have had the chance at all!","This meeting ended with Gu Zheng’s decision. Everyone raised their hands in agreement. Only Lu Yan’s face was gloomy, and his eyes were filled with anger.","“Young Master Lu, you look very unhappy!” Song Shijing smiled at him and said in a teasing tone, “If you have any objections, why don’t you tell us? Why are you bottling everything up alone?”","As soon as he finished speaking, everyone’s gazes landed on Lu Yan with disdain.","President Gu was the one with great wisdom. Lu Yan was far inferior to him. He was actually unhappy now. How laughable!","Hearing Song Shijing’s teasing voice, Lu Yan took a deep breath and suppressed the anger in his heart. He adjusted his expression and forced a smile. His throat was a little dry. “I have no objections. President Gu made the right decision.”","“Heh.” Gu Zheng sneered, but there was no expression on his face. His deep eyes swept over, and his voice was low but terrifying. “Looking at your expression earlier, I thought you were against my idea.”","Everyone gasped. The meeting room was silent, and the sound of breathing became clear. They could not help but look at Lu Yan. At this moment, Lu Yan was clenching his fists tightly and trying his best to control the restless anger in his heart. He gritted his teeth and said, “No... I’m just tired.”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow as if he did not believe this explanation.","Lu Yan looked up. Dozens of eyes in the meeting room were on him. Lu Yan’s face was filled with embarrassment. He could only brace himself and say, “I agree with President Gu’s decision.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the venue was still silent. Before Gu Zheng spoke, no one dared to speak first.","After a long time, Gu Zheng stood up elegantly and walked out of the meeting room without even looking at Lu Yan.","Song Shijing bowed to the crowd and announced, “The meeting is over. You can leave now.”","Lu Yan’s body was stiff as he sat on the chair, his eyes filled with viciousness. He would let Gu Zheng be arrogant for a while longer. Before long, he would know what was happening outside. He would suffer everyone’s condemnation.","Everyone admired Gu Zheng now, but they would find out that Gu Zheng had schemed to trick him into making a bet in order to get the Lu family’s shares and even forced the Lu family to hand over the shares. Gu Zheng had even angered his grandfather till he fell ill. Gu Zheng was a heartless person who treated his family so heartlessly. Doing business with him was like asking a tiger for its skin. One had to be on guard or they would be schemed against.","Lu Yan revealed a sinister smile. He stood up and left the meeting room. He had just taken a few steps when he saw the people from Lu Corporation and Qiao Xi not far away.","At this moment, Qiao Xi was talking to the people from Lu Corporation. He roughly understood Qiao Xi’s purpose for coming. She wanted to explain things for Gu Zheng’s sake, but who would believe a woman like her?"]},{"number":1106,"title":"Chapter 1106 - Cut The Nonsense","paragraphs":["Lu Yan looked at the scene in front of him proudly. It would not be easy for Qiao Xi to clear Gu Zheng’s name. If Gu Zheng did not give up the 5% shares today, his reputation would be ruined and he might even lose his position as director.","A trace of pride flashed past his eyes. He slowly stepped forward and said gently, “President Gu.”","Gu Zheng acted as if he did not hear him and ignored him at all. However, Lu Yan’s face was still gentle. He looked like a very patient person. He shook his head helplessly and advised softly, “President Gu, it’s been so long. You should go see Grandpa.”","His voice was not loud, but everyone was gathered in the hall. The people beside him naturally heard him and looked at the two of them in unison.","Lu Yan wanted everyone to hear it and let them know about the ugly things Gu Zheng had done. At that time, GU Zheng would not be able to protect his position as director!","Gu Zheng stopped in his tracks and turned his head slightly to glance at him condescendingly.","Seeing that he did not respond, Lu Yan continued to persuade him gently. “No matter what, Grandpa fell sick because of you. He’s still unconscious. Although you didn’t grow up in the Lu family, Grandpa is still your family.”","When Qiao Xi heard Lu Yan’s words, a trace of disdain appeared in her eyes.","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and exuded a powerful pressure. His thin lips parted slightly as he said casually, “Young Master Lu, my time is very precious. I hope you can cut the crap.”","Before Lu Yan could speak, a higher-up of Lu Corporation who was in the meeting with Lu Yan stood up. He did not know what was going on in the hall, so he rushed in front of Gu Zheng and said indignantly, “President Gu, don’t pretend anymore!”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up. As expected, the Lu family had already planned it out. They started attacking Gu Zheng as soon as the meeting ended. They were now accusing him of being heartless and unfilial in front of everyone.","In the eyes of everyone, Lu Yan had always been gentle and elegant. He would not take the initiative to criticize Gu Zheng, but someone would speak up on behalf of him. Qiao Xi had an impression of this higher-up beside him. Previously, at the perfume exchange, this higher-up was always by Lu Yan’s side.","This person must have been instructed by Lu Yan on what to say. Next, this person would definitely accuse Gu Zheng of making Chairman Lu sick in front of everyone and roast him while taking the moral high ground.","“President Gu, do you want me to say what you’ve done in front of everyone?” The higher-up was furious. Those who did not know better would think that Gu Zheng had really done something treasonous.","Qiao Xi revealed a meaningful smile because Lu Xiang’s expression was already terrifyingly gloomy. She hurriedly wanted to go forward to stop him, but the disdainful gazes around her caused her to not have the courage to go forward. She was afraid that she would become the target of public criticism again.","The people who found out the truth in the hall just now were not in a rush to stand up for Gu Zheng. They all looked at the Lu family with disdain. The Lu family’s people all lowered their heads with ashen expressions like defeated roosters.","Lu Xiang gritted her teeth. The Lu family had already lost everything today. She could not make a fool of herself anymore. Hence, she braced herself and went forward. She opened her mouth with difficulty and said in a hoarse voice, “Ah Yan, forget it. President Gu...”","“What did I do?” A cold voice interrupted Lu Xiang’s words. Gu Zheng was expressionless. His long eyes narrowed as he looked coldly at the higher-up.","The higher-up was so scared that his body trembled. Then, he straightened his neck and was about to retort. Lu Xiang’s expression changed drastically. Now that the Lu family’s plan had been exposed, Gu Zheng must also know about it. He deliberately interrupted her and did not let her open her mouth to remind the higher-up and Ah Yan. He wanted Ah Yan to take the bait and lose his reputation in public again.","No! Their Lu family could not be embarrassed anymore!","Before Lu Xiang could stop them, the higher-up shouted with a red face, “Mrs. Gu schemed to deceive Young Master Lu and stole 5% of our Lu family’s shares. She even made Chairman Lu sick from anger. Will you only be satisfied with me telling you this directly?","“I originally thought that since you were also a member of the Lu family, I shouldn’t blow things up and embarrass you, but I didn’t expect you to be so unforgiving. You only have eyes for the Lu family’s shares. Chairman Lu is already sick, yet you’re still forcing the Lu family to hand over the shares. Even though the old master has been sick for so long, you didn’t even visit Chairman Lu. He was so angry over the matter of the shares that he fell sick, but you don’t feel guilty at all. You’re unfilial!”","The entire venue fell silent. Everyone who already knew the truth had mocking expressions as they looked at Lu Yan."]},{"number":1107,"title":"Chapter 1107 - A Storm Is Coming","paragraphs":["Everyone looked at Lu Yan in disdain. Just now, Mrs. Gu had already explained the entire situation clearly. In the end, it was Lu Yan who was too greedy and wanted Gu Zheng’s shares. Who knew that he went out for wool but came home shorn? He even lost his own shares. Even if Chairman Lu was angered to the point of falling sick, it was because of Lu Yan, that idiot. He was the one who proposed a bet and even forced Mrs. Gu to ride a horse. Now that he had lost, he wanted to go back on his word and frame Mrs. Gu. He even spread rumors about President Gu.","After the higher-ups of Lu Corporation finished criticizing him, Gu Zheng suddenly chuckled and looked up.","Seeing that he was so calm, Lu Yan had a bad feeling. He did not understand why Gu Zheng was smiling. Although this matter could not bring Gu Zheng down, it was not a good thing for Gu Zheng either. At most, it would affect his reputation. At worst, it might affect the entire Gu Corporation.","How could he still smile at a time like this?","Lu Yan had already sensed that something was wrong. He hurriedly stopped the higher-up. The uneasiness in his heart grew stronger and stronger. He could only say gently, “President Gu, this is Director Liu. He’s a little rash. Please forgive him for what he just said.”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow. “You’re saying that I caused Chairman Lu to be unconscious for the sake of Lu Corporation’s shares? The Lu family doesn’t even blink when they lie!”","The entire venue was silent. Lu Yan frowned, and his expression was exceptionally ugly. He had already decided not to pursue the matter with Gu Zheng, but Gu Zheng actually accused them of lying in public.","Lu Xiang opened her mouth with difficulty, wanting to tell Lu Yan that the plan had failed, but Gu Zheng did not give her a chance to speak. His voice was low and hoarse, carrying a strong sense of oppression. She, who was standing in front of him, seemed to have stopped breathing.","“Even at this point, do you still think that your plan is foolproof, Young Master Lu?”","Suddenly, Lu Yan’s heart skipped a beat. He seemed to have understood what Gu Zheng meant, but he really did not understand what went wrong with his plan. Why was it exposed?","Lu Yan hesitated for a moment and frowned. “President Gu, I don’t understand what you mean. I’m talking to you about Grandpa being sick. Why are you changing the topic? I know that you’re all-powerful outside and no one dares to offend you, but as a junior, why can’t you visit Grandpa?”","The hall was eerily silent like a storm was about to break.","Lu Xiang clenched her fists tightly as her ears buzzed. Cold sweat broke out on her forehead. As long as she opened her mouth to stop Lu Yan, Gu Zheng would interrupt her. He wanted Ah Yan to lose his reputation in public!","At this moment, everyone was definitely discussing the Lu family in their hearts. If Ah Yan continued, then...","However, in the next second, Gu Zheng did not give Lu Yan a chance to speak at all. His eyes were filled with mockery as he glanced at Lu Yan with a hint of warning. This gaze was a great humiliation to Lu Yan.","The anger in Lu Yan’s heart surged. “Gu Zheng...”","“Young Master Lu, I haven’t settled the score with you yet, but you’re already looking for trouble with Ah Zheng.” At this moment, Qiao Xi suddenly spoke and smiled meaningfully.","Her voice was very soft, but it carried a trace of disdain and teasing. “Oh! Right, I remember now. Young Master Lu, you were still in the meeting room just now and don’t know what went on outside.”","Lu Yan’s heart trembled. He felt that something was wrong and subconsciously looked at Lu Xiang.","At this moment, Lu Xiang lowered her head. Her back felt like it was weighed down by a thousand pounds of rock. It was so heavy that her lungs hurt and she could not breathe. She said with difficulty, “Ah Yan, I...”","“Lu Yan, you were the one who suggested the bet and even forced Mrs. Gu to make a bet with you. It’s just that you didn’t expect her to win. Now, you don’t want to fulfill the bet, so you’re scheming against Mrs. Gu and President Gu behind their backs. Did you really think your plan was flawless?”","At this moment, a dignified male voice came from the crowd. Everyone looked in the direction of the voice. It was Gu Corporation’s partner and the person in charge of Qingfeng Entertainment and Heavenly Voice Entertainment, Mr. Li.","“I really didn’t expect the Lu family to play tricks behind our backs for this bit of shares. With people like the Lu family at the international meeting, I don’t think the rest of us should even attend this meeting!”","The moment that was said, Lu Yan felt as if his head had exploded. He could not even hear the voices around him and was only immersed in his own world.","How was that possible? How did they know about this?","He recalled Lu Xiang’s guilty expression just now and the disdainful gazes of the people around him. He instantly felt as if he had been struck by lightning. Gu Zheng had been in the meeting room just now. Who exactly turned the situation around and calmed public opinion in such a short period of time? Who caused the Lu family to fall into a predicament?"]},{"number":1108,"title":"Chapter 1108 - Harming Others","paragraphs":["Lu Yan’s eyes were filled with confusion. A few days ago, the old master had already shut himself in and refused to see anyone. Everyone knew that the old master was seriously ill and that he was angered by Gu Zheng. How did the situation completely turn around in just an hour?","“Young Master Lu, do you want to know how this happened?” Qiao Xi asked slowly.","She slowly walked toward Gu Zheng, but when she passed by Lu Yan, she suddenly turned around and said in a faint voice, “You planned for so long and even made Chairman Lu stay at home for so many days, but this crisis was resolved by me in an hour. I’m really too smart. With Young Master Lu’s IQ, you’re still hoping to fight me? Save it!”","Lu Yan’s eyes were bloodshot and almost burned with anger.","However, as soon as Qiao Xi finished speaking, she walked past Lu Yan and left. She stood beside Gu Zheng and gently held his arm. She said word by word, “Young Master Lu, your Lu family’s character is really bad. For the sake of this 5% of shares, you didn’t hesitate to spread rumors and slander Gu Zheng. You even said that you treated Gu Zheng as your family. Just how disgusting are you?!","“Actually, Gu Zheng doesn’t care about your Lu family’s shares at all. If he really wanted the shares, he wouldn’t have allowed your Lu family to delay the matter for a few months. He’s so busy every day and has projects worth tens of millions of yuan every minute. How could he have time to play with you?”","These words were like a fierce slap to Lu Yan’s face, causing him to see stars and his lips to turn pale. He could not help but roar angrily, “Qiao Xi!”","Lu Yan never expected that everything he had carefully planned would be resolved by Qiao Xi in an hour. Moreover, Mr. Li even publicly announced that he refused to collaborate with the Lu family. Following that, a group of companies that were working with Gu Corporation stood up to boycott Lu Corporation.","Everyone from the Lu family turned green. A trace of fear surged in Lu Yan’s heart. He knew very well what this international meeting meant to the Lu family, but now, the negative public opinion that should be on Gu Zheng had all fallen on him. He had no chance of competing for the position of director now.","If they were boycotted by these partners again, the Lu family would definitely have difficulty doing business.","“Young Master Lu, you should’ve just obediently handed over 5% of the shares, but you took the risk and harmed yourself. Now that the Lu family is in trouble, are you satisfied?”","Qiao Xi said in a teasing tone, “If Young Master Lu hadn’t forced me to make a bet back then, things wouldn’t have turned out this way. Actually, it doesn’t matter if you lost your shares. If you really had any difficulties, you could have talked to Ah Zheng. He wouldn’t have made things difficult for you on the account of the Lu family, but you just had to frame us. Who taught you these ideas?!","Song Shiyu pursed his lips. Others did not know what Young Madam meant, but he knew very well that Young Madam was deliberately trying to drive a wedge between the Lu family and make them turn on each other.","However, the higher-up of Lu Corporation who was in a fit of anger did not notice Qiao Xi’s intentions. These bad ideas were clearly thought up by Lu Yan. If it were not for his greed, how could this incident have happened?","Now that the Lu family was being boycotted by other entrepreneurs, who would still do business with the Lu family in the future?","“If the Lu family really gives the company to Lu Yan to manage, then it’s over!”","“From the beginning, it was Lu Yan who schemed against Mrs. Gu. In the end, he lost. He felt indignant and played tricks behind her back. Not only did he embarrass himself, but he also caused everyone in the Lu family to lose their dignity!”","“Why did Chairman Lu choose him to be the heir? How did he choose such an idiot? In the past, he caused the company to lose a lot of money. Now, he caused the company to be boycotted. In short, he’s not cut out to be the president!”","Lu Yan’s face was pale as he clenched his fists tightly. His fingers were pale. He forcefully suppressed his anger and said with difficulty, “Everyone, calm down. I’ll handle this.”","As soon as he finished speaking, his sharp gaze descended on Qiao Xi as if he wanted to devour her.","Qiao Xi smiled proudly at him when she heard everyone’s discussions. Now, the Lu family was having a taste of being plagued by rumors.","At this moment, everyone did not want to see the Lu family’s detestable faces anymore and left one after another. Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng also turned around and walked to the other corridor.","“So, the Lu family’s matter was resolved by Mrs. Gu.” Gu Zheng’s magnetic voice came from above her head. He bent down slightly and leaned close to her ear. He asked gently, “Mrs. Gu, how do you want me to thank you?”","His scorching breath sprayed by her ear, causing Qiao Xi’s entire body to tremble. She pondered. How exactly did she want him to thank her?"]},{"number":1109,"title":"Chapter 1109 - She Needs Another Kiss","paragraphs":["Recently, Qiao Xi had always felt that it was strange. Her taste buds would only recover occasionally, and only strong flavors would stimulate her taste buds. She had clearly recovered after detoxifying the poison in Gu Zheng’s body, but now, her taste buds were gradually disappearing. If she did not kiss Gu Zheng in advance, she would not be able to taste anything.","Coincidentally, there was a meeting later, so the catering department of Huazhong Building had already prepared a sumptuous meal for everyone. Coincidentally, Qiao Xi smelled a wave of fragrance and looked up with anticipation.","This fragrance was very familiar. It was a dish made by a chef from Fragrance Hotel. Qiao Xi had eaten it a few times before. The fragrance was tempting, but because she did not have a sense of taste, she could not taste the original taste of the food at all. However, it was different after she got together with Gu Zheng.","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes to look at her watery eyes and could not help but chuckle. “I already know what you want, Mrs. Gu.”","Qiao Xi’s face turned red, but this man still looked serious as if she had blasphemed a god. Unexpectedly, before she could say anything, Gu Zheng understood what she meant with just a glance.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with smiles as he stroked Qiao Xi’s soft hair affectionately. It was as if all his gentleness was reserved for the woman in front of him. He opened his arms and ignored the gazes of everyone as he pulled Qiao Xi into his embrace. His tone carried a trace of ridicule. “But I don’t know if I’m right. Why don’t you tell me what you want?”","Qiao Xi was stunned, and her cheeks turned even redder. Even her ears were slightly pink.","She looked around and realized that the two of them were in a corridor with people coming and going. Many people passing by greeted Gu Zheng. When the other party saw Gu Zheng hugging her, they did not come forward to disturb him. They just smiled at them or nodded slightly.","She could not hug and kiss Gu Zheng in such a place, right?","She thought for a while and said in a low voice, “There should be a lounge nearby, right? Why don’t we find a random one?”","Coincidentally, Gu Yao heard Qiao Xi’s words and widened his eyes.","Gu Zheng glanced at Gu Yao as if it was a warning. He turned around and looked gently at Qiao Xi in his arms. He chuckled and said, “Alright, let’s go.”","After that, Gu Zheng pulled Qiao Xi to the hall on the first floor and skillfully walked to the door of a private room. He pushed the door open, and the fragrance of food assaulted their noses. The table was filled with exquisite dishes. They were the dishes that Qiao Xi had been thinking about for a long time.","Gu Zheng was so meticulous! He knew that she liked to eat, but he also knew that it was inconvenient for her to eat outside, so he had already booked a private room. The two of them could spend time alone here.","However, before eating, she needed a kiss.","Qiao Xi looked at Gu Zheng slightly shyly. “Ah Zheng, you said you wanted to thank me, so you...”","Gu Zheng’s lips curled into a smile as he lazily leaned against the chair and pointed at the dishes on the table. “This is my gratitude to you, Mrs. Gu. I’m guessing you’ll definitely like it.”","The private room instantly fell silent, and Qiao Xi instantly widened her eyes. How could she eat it if she did not kiss him?! The food would have no taste at all!","Gu Zheng looked at Qiao Xi’s disappointed gaze, and the smile on the corners of his mouth grew wider. He deliberately pretended not to know because he wanted to tease the cute Mrs. Gu.","Gu Zheng picked up the chopsticks, picked up a bite of food, and placed it in Qiao Xi’s bowl. He gestured gently. “Xi Xi, quickly eat. It won’t taste good if it’s cold.”","Qiao Xi: “...” The bastard was definitely doing this on purpose!","At this moment, Qiao Xi really wanted to activate the automatic quarrel system and get it to scold Gu Zheng for her. Unfortunately, the system had already been deleted by Gu Zheng.","She must have been too gentle to Gu Zheng recently, so this bastard was crazy!","Gu Zheng swirled the wine glass elegantly and took a sip with his soft and thin lips. His voice carried a trace of temptation. “I probably guessed wrong. What do you want, Mrs. Gu? As long as I have it, I can satisfy you. Why don’t you do it yourself? I definitely won’t resist.”","These words caused Qiao Xi’s face to turn red, and her heart itched. She abruptly raised her eyes and looked into Gu Zheng’s eyes. His eyes were filled with smiles.","She could do it herself? Gu Zheng would not resist? These words made it sound like she wanted to conspire against Gu Zheng!","However, under the temptation of recovering her taste buds, Qiao Xi still slowly stood up and leaned against Gu Zheng’s side. Then, her eyes shifted as she pretended to lose her balance and accidentally fall into his embrace. She wrapped her arms around his neck and took the opportunity to kiss his soft lips.","Gu Zheng let out a hearty laugh. “Mrs. Gu, why are you so careless? Don’t tell me you were taking the opportunity to kiss me?”","Qiao Xi shook her head crazily, but the blush on her face had already betrayed her. She hurriedly struggled out of Gu Zheng’s embrace and returned to her seat."]},{"number":1110,"title":"Chapter 1110 - Chairman Lu Is Really Ill","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi was enjoying the delicacies on the table when Gu Zheng suddenly chuckled and said, “Mrs. Gu, my gratitude is very sincere. How are you going to thank me?”","Qiao Xi was dumbfounded. Why should she thank Gu Zheng? It was already good enough that she did not beat him up, yet she actually wanted to thank him.","However, in the next second, Qiao Xi understood.","Gu Zheng held a business card between his fingers and handed it to her. “This was found in Meng Fan’s residence.”","There was a word written on the business card—Xiao.","Qiao Xi’s pupils constricted abruptly, and her body instantly stiffened. The word ‘Xiao’ was in her grandfather’s name. She knew that her grandfather was definitely still alive because her grandfather had always secretly sent her news. However, she did not know where her grandfather was. Why had he not appeared for so long? Moreover, it was not just her. Even her teacher and her brothers could not find any clues. Her grandfather seemed to have vanished from the face of the earth.","Although this business card only had the word ‘Xiao’ on it and Grandpa was not the only person in the world who had the word ‘Xiao’ in his name, Qiao Xi had an inexplicable feeling that this business card belonged to Grandpa. Could it be that Grandpa knew Meng Fan?","Qiao Xi’s fingers stroked the business card. Gu Zheng smiled gently. “Mrs. Gu, do you think you should thank me?”","Qiao Xi could not help but roll her eyes. This bastard actually wanted to thank her. They were husband and wife. Did they have to be so courteous to each other?","“Actually, my request is very simple. I just want to ask you a question,” Gu Zheng said casually, his tone exceptionally gentle.","Qiao Xi nodded shyly. Gu Zheng leaned closer and whispered in her ear, “Junior, do you think Chairman Lu is really sick?”","Qiao Xi instantly choked. She originally thought that Gu Zheng would take this opportunity to tease her, but she never expected that he would actually ask about this. Qiao Xi replied without even thinking, “It’s definitely not true. The Lu family is deliberately acting and spreading rumors to slander you!”","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled up as he looked at Qiao Xi affectionately and praised, “Xi Xi, you’re so smart.”","Qiao Xi suddenly felt that something was wrong. Previously, Old Master Lu was indeed pretending, but in order to satisfy his hobby of pretending to be sick, she specially made Old Master Lu faint. However, she did it very secretly! No one should have noticed it. If the Lu family had noticed it, they would have exploded a long time ago. How could they let her eat her meal obediently?","Gu Zheng knew? Impossible! He must be bluffing!","Qiao Xi stabilized the emotions in her heart and asked with a shocked expression, “Could it be that Old Master Lu is really sick? If that’s the case, then it’s really well-deserved! But why are you asking me this question? I’ve been with you all day today! I even stayed in Longwan Residential while you cooked for me before this. How can I know if Old Master Lu is really sick?”","Gu Zheng smiled meaningfully. “You’ve been in Longwan Residential the entire time? Haven’t you gone out?”","Qiao Xi hurriedly nodded and looked at Gu Zheng with a sincere expression. Gu Zheng also looked at her with a gentle gaze. His tone was gentle, but the words he said caused Qiao Xi’s heart to palpitate.","“I understand. Then it mustn’t have been today. It must’ve been sometime in the past.”","Qiao Xi instantly choked on the chili in her throat. Her eyes instantly turned red. She hurriedly picked up the glass and drank the red wine in one gulp.","Gu Zheng patted her back gently. “Xi Xi, don’t be agitated. I’ll get you a glass of water.”","As he spoke, he stood up and left the private room. The gentleness and smile in his eyes instantly vanished, replaced by a layer of coldness.","“Looks like the Lu family hasn’t changed. They actually dare to look for trouble with Xi Xi.” Gu Zheng was expressionless, but a trace of killing intent flashed past his eyes.","His thin lips parted slightly as he chuckled. “Song Shijing, since Chairman Lu likes to pretend to be sick so much, let him lie in bed for a few more days.”","Xi Xi must have attacked Old Master Lu not only because of Lu Muxue but also for other reasons. Could it be that the Lu family had done something to Xi Xi behind her back?","Gu Zheng’s body was filled with killing intent. When he thought of the wife he doted on being schemed against and bullied by others, he could not control the anger in his heart.","Song Shijing was silent for a moment before asking, “President, is Chairman Lu’s fainting related to Young Madam?”","Gu Zheng nodded, and his voice carried a hint of coldness. “Xi Xi did it, but Xi Xi wouldn’t have attacked for no reason. Since she attacked the old master, it must be because of what the Lu family did.”"]},{"number":1111,"title":"Chapter 1111 - Beauty Is In The Eye Of The Beholder","paragraphs":["Song Shijing fell silent again. In fact, he really wanted to ask the president if he was sure that the Lu family had bullied Young Madam and that was why she attacked. Was it possible that Young Madam had heard about the Lu family’s plan and wanted to take the initiative?","Could it be that in the president’s eyes, Young Madam was really weak and kind? Did she only know how to resist when she was bullied? However, in his eyes, Young Madam had never been a weak little flower. To be able to know the Lu family’s scheme in advance, drug Chairman Lu, and even kill the Lu family’s plan was not something a weak woman could do.","However, Song Shijing did not dare to say it in front of Gu Zheng. He could only say tactfully, “President, beauty is in the eye of the beholder!”","At this moment, Qiao Xi was already very full in the private room, but she still could not help but take a few more bites. After all, it was very rare for her to eat so many of her favorite dishes. She was slightly unable to control herself.","However, she did not understand why Gu Zheng looked a little angry just now. How did he know that she had drugged Old Master Lu?","Previously, when Lu Muxue framed her, she had sent people from Ling Pavilion to follow Lu Muxue. She even sent people to infiltrate the Lu family and found out about the Lu family’s plan. Apart from using public opinion to frame Gu Zheng, Old Master Lu also decided to expel Gu Zheng from the Lu family next month on the grounds that Gu Zheng was an unfilial grandson who angered him to the point of falling sick because of the shares.","When she knew that Old Master Lu was going to pretend to be sick, she thought that she might as well go all out and poison Old Master Lu to prevent him from pretending to be sick. Now that he was really unconscious, there was no need for him to pretend anymore. However, she did not expect that Gu Zheng would still notice it even though she had done it so secretly.","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with helplessness. She should do a better job in the future and not let Gu Zheng discover her. Otherwise, her image as a weak woman would be ruined.","Seeing that Gu Zheng was not back yet but she was already full, she planned to go out to digest her food. Unexpectedly, as soon as she pushed the door open, she bumped into someone she did not want to see.","Lu Yan stood at the door with an ugly expression. “Miss Qiao, can we talk?”","When Qiao Xi saw that the person standing at the door was Lu Yan, she was instantly agitated. She was just about to mock him when she suddenly choked on her saliva. The spicy taste in her mouth filled her mouth, and tears instantly flowed down.","Lu Yan instantly choked. “...” Why was she crying? Was she acting again?","On the other hand, Gu Yao was representing Gu Corporation’s branch company to discuss a collaboration with a few entrepreneurs. Gu Yao invited the people there for a meal together, and those people were also very polite to Gu Yao. However, when everyone was walking toward the private room, Gu Yao suddenly stopped in his tracks, and his body stiffened.","Everyone followed his gaze and saw that the stunning Mrs. Gu’s eyes were red and tears were streaming down her face. She was covering her mouth as if she was suppressing her tears.","At this moment, the person standing in front of her was... Lu Yan! The Lu family had just slandered President Gu and Mrs. Gu. What did Lu Yan say in front of Mrs. Gu that made her so sad?","This man was actually bullying a weak woman!","The scene in front of them made everyone have different expressions. They all looked at Gu Yao. After all, he was also a member of the Gu family, so only he could deal with this situation."]},{"number":1112,"title":"Chapter 1112 - Young Master Lu, Are You","paragraphs":["The anger in Gu Yao’s heart surged. He could not suppress the anger in his heart anymore and quickened his pace. However, when he approached, he heard a cold female voice, “What right do Young Master Lu and Madam Lu have to talk to me? I don’t want to see you!”","At this moment, although Qiao Xi’s eyes were slightly red, her eyes were filled with disdain. When she looked at the two people from the Lu family, it was as if she was looking at a pile of trash. She did not conceal the disgust in her heart in the slightest.","However, her voice was sobbing and there were tears in her eyes. These did not match her disdainful tone at all.","Gu Yao heaved a sigh of relief. As expected, how could Qiao Xi be bullied by the two pieces of trash from the Lu family? Then why was Qiao Xi crying? Could it be that she saw the others and deliberately pretended to cry?","Gu Yao admired her even more. He had to admit that Qiao Xi’s methods were really good. It was only right for her to use unusual methods to deal with the Lu family.","Lu Yan’s expression was extremely gloomy, but his tone was still gentle. “Miss Qiao, I just want to calmly talk to you. Why are you so resistant? Moreover, what I want to say is about your grandfather. You must be very interested, right?”","The surroundings instantly fell silent, and the air seemed to have frozen.","Gu Yao gasped. He knew very well how important Qiao Xi’s grandfather was to her. That was her bottom line.","Why would Lu Yan mention Qiao Xi’s grandfather? Could it be that he knew where he was? If he was mentioned, would Qiao Xi go chat with Lu Yan? Then wouldn’t she have put on such a show for nothing?","At this moment, Gu Yao’s mind was a little chaotic. He was not in a rush to approach her. After all, it was a matter related to Qiao Xi’s grandfather. It was better to let her handle it herself.","The next second, Qiao Xi sneered and glanced at Lu Yan with disdain. Her eyes were narrowed and filled with danger. “Young Master Lu, are you threatening me?”","Lu Yan smiled. “I’m not threatening you. I just want to invite you to chat and improve our relationship.”","Qiao Xi was about to vomit from disgust. Lu Yan wanted to improve their relationship. In his next life! She would absolutely not like a vicious person like Lu Yan!","She was very sure that Lu Yan did not know that her grandfather was the divine physician. However, he definitely knew that the rumors outside said that Liang Pingchuan’s senior was her grandfather. However, her grandfather had more than just this title. He had extraordinary accomplishments in several fields in his life. He had many identities that Lu Yan could not reach in his life.","After a few seconds of silence, Qiao Xi suddenly sneered. “Who do you think you are? I can’t even find out anything about Grandpa, yet you can?”","She did not believe that Lu Yan would have such ability. No one around her could find any clues, so how could an idiot like Lu Yan find out? Did he really think she was easy to deceive?","Gu Yao could not help but laugh.","When Lu Yan heard Qiao Xi’s words, the smile on his face froze. Even though he had been pretending to be gentle since he was young, he was still unable to suppress the anger in his eyes at this moment.","He suppressed his anger and took a deep breath before slowly saying, “Miss Qiao, I really have something very important to tell you. If you’re not interested in Mr. Xiao, then let’s talk about my grandfather.","“Actually, my grandfather really fainted. He’s already...”","“Lu Yan.” Qiao Xi interrupted him mercilessly and chuckled. “Do you think I’m very free? What makes you think I want to talk to you?”","The muscles on Lu Yan’s face instantly stiffened, and he could not help but clench his fists.","Qiao Xi swept a cold glance at Lu Yan and Lu Xiang. Her beautiful eyes were filled with coldness and a trace of hatred. It was this group of people from the Lu family who gave Gu Zheng a tragic childhood. He was abused by Huang Lilan and locked in Maple Garden without food or water. Meanwhile, Lu Yan, this fake, was living a luxurious life in the Lu family.","Everything that Lu Yan had originally belonged to Gu Zheng. Now, he was actually shameless enough to want to use the Lu family’s power to show off in front of Gu Zheng and snatch everything that Gu Zheng had attained. Was he worthy?","Qiao Xi’s heart ached. Even though she had never seen him when he was a kid, she could imagine how Gu Zheng had survived all these years. At that time, when he found out about his background, he dragged his injured body to look for the Lu family to ask for help, but the Lu family rejected him. From that moment onward, the Lu family was already a stranger in his eyes.","The Lu family did not treat Lu Qingyun as family, much less Gu Zheng. They would rather choose Lu Yan, who was not related to them by blood, than accept Gu Zheng. The Lu family did not have a heart at all!"]},{"number":1113,"title":"Chapter 1113 - Apologize To My Sister-in-law!","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi’s eyes were cold as she stared at the two of them. Lu Xiang and Lu Yan were both imposters who occupied someone else’s family. One was an illegitimate daughter, while the other was a bastard who was even inferior to an illegitimate child. What right did they have to pick on Gu Zheng? Moreover, Gu Zheng was not in the wrong at all. All of this was the Lu family’s plan.","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes and shook her wrist. “Lu Yan, my temper isn’t too good.”","Lu Yan suddenly realized that something was wrong. Immediately after, Qiao Xi raised her fist and attacked him. He dodged in a sorry state, but he was kicked in the leg.","In the past, Lu Yan must have known that Huang Lilan often beat and scolded Gu Zheng. He did not feel guilty at all and even felt happy. Now, he even dared to disgust her. She did not have a good temper like Gu Zheng. She would definitely beat this idiot up!","“Bastard! I haven’t hit anyone in a long time. Since you insist on forcing me to do it, then I’ll satisfy you!” Qiao Xi flew up and kicked Lu Yan’s knee. Lu Yan instantly gritted his teeth in pain.","Gu Yao was shocked!","‘Damn! There are others here! How can I hide it for you now? Your image as a weak woman has completely collapsed! Calm down, Qiao Xi!’","Lu Yan’s knee was already numb from the pain. It spread to his entire body. He cried out in pain and staggered a few steps before supporting himself against the wall.","Qiao Xi crossed her arms and smiled happily. He was indeed a good-for-nothing. Her kick almost took Lu Yan down. Why was a young man in his 20s so weak?","Back then, when Gu Zheng was only a few years old, he had to endure beatings 10 times more painful than this. Before he returned to the Gu family, he was still wandering outside for many years. Since he was young, Huang Lilan had abused him and treated him as a punching bag. Whenever she was unhappy, he would be beaten up. After that, Huang Lilan brought him back to the Gu family, but she often locked him in the basement and abused him. To him, returning to the Gu family was just a change of environment but he would still be beaten up all the same.","These were all the crimes committed by Lu Yan’s biological mother, so Qiao Xi wanted Lu Yan to have a taste of being beaten up today. She wanted him to experience how Gu Zheng struggled in pain in the past!","She had only kicked Lu Yan lightly, but he could not take it anymore. She had even more painful methods!","Qiao Xi took out a needle from her sleeve and held the silver needle between her fingers. She was just about to attack...","“Qiao Xi!” Gu Yao hurriedly stopped her, his face filled with panic.","‘Sister-in-law, look around! There are others around! Why did you attack? If others see this, not only will your weak image be ruined, but the Lu family will also have something on you.’","Gu Yao hurriedly coughed twice and ran over to pull Qiao Xi back. Only then did she realize that Gu Yao was here. Then, she slowly turned around and saw a group of people standing not far away.","Qiao Xi: “!!!” ‘Damn! When did so many people come? Did they see me kick Lu Yan just now?’","Her expression changed drastically, and her eyes were filled with panic. However, her eyes were red, and her voice was filled with tears. She looked pitiful.","Gu Yao shifted his eyes and hurriedly shielded Qiao Xi behind him. He roared at the two of them, “Young Master Lu, Madam Lu! What right do you have to bully my sister-in-law?”","Lu Yan endured the intense pain from his knee, and his forehead was covered in sweat. He had clearly seen a needle between Qiao Xi’s fingers just now. At that instant, a huge fear arose in his heart.","He wanted to escape, but his legs did not seem to listen to him anymore. If Gu Yao had not stopped him and the needle had already pierced into his body, would he have died? That needle might be poisonous!","Was Qiao Xi such a vicious person? Was she still a woman? This kick almost broke his leg. Moreover, he could sense that Qiao Xi did not use her full strength. If she had really used her full strength, he would probably be rolling on the floor in pain now.","Lu Yan’s face was filled with viciousness. Before he could recover from the pain and shock, he heard Gu Yao say, “What right do you have to bully my sister-in-law?!”","Lu Yan’s throat was filled with the smell of blood. They were bullying Qiao Xi? They had never touched Qiao Xi’s finger from the beginning until the end. It was clearly Qiao Xi who kicked him and even wanted to stab him with a needle. Could it be that Gu Yao did not see the needle in Qiao Xi’s hand?","“My sister-in-law is just a weak woman. She’s so gentle, but she was so angry that she kicked you away. What did you say that made her cry from anger?!”","Gu Yao questioned Lu Yan word by word. He wanted to take the initiative and catch Lu Yan off guard. He frowned and ordered, “Apologize to my sister-in-law!”","Lu Yan was so angry that he was about to vomit blood. He felt that his head was about to explode."]},{"number":1114,"title":"Chapter 1114 - Is Young Master Lu Really Weak?","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi was thinking about how to explain when she heard Gu Yao’s series of questions. Her eyes instantly widened.","Gu Yao... had also learned to lie through his teeth?","However, after Gu Yao’s roar, the group of onlookers walked over. They originally did not want to interfere in this matter. After all, this was a private matter between the Lu and Gu families. However, Gu Yao was especially loyal and pure. He had already become friends with these entrepreneurs and young masters. When they saw Gu Yao arguing with the Lu family, they could not stand by and do nothing.","Moreover, everyone knew what had happened today. It was the Lu family’s fault. How could they have the cheek to look for trouble with Mrs. Gu?","Immediately after, a gentle-looking middle-aged man walked forward and advised, “Young Master Lu, you’re a man. Why can’t you sit down and talk calmly? Why make things difficult for a weak woman like Mrs. Gu?”","Lu Yan’s heart seemed to be stuffed with a huge rock.","Lu Xiang, who was at the side, was already unable to suppress her anger. They had clearly not said anything, yet Qiao Xi had already started crying. Moreover, she had only said a few words when Qiao Xi kicked Ah Yan. She was clearly pretending to cry to gain sympathy, yet this group of idiots actually believed her.","The flames of rage in Lu Xiang’s heart raged crazily. She could not help but roar. “All of you are being deceived by Qiao Xi. She’s pretending. She even kicked Ah Yan just now.”","“Madam Lu, we have eyes. We saw it for ourselves. If you hadn’t bullied her, why would my sister-in-law cry? You said that my sister-in-law kicked Lu Yan, and we did see it, but that’s also because of Young Master Lu’s nasty words. Even someone as gentle as my sister-in-law won’t be able to help but attack him! This is a private room. My sister-in-law was eating when Young Master Lu came over to look for trouble. He took advantage of my brother’s absence and bullied Qiao Xi. She’s crying from grievance, but you’re saying that she’s pretending. Aren’t you guys going too far?!”","Gu Yao shouted at the top of his voice. He had to be strong and let everyone know that the Lu family was bullying Qiao Xi. He had to make Lu Yan unable to explain himself.","After being reprimanded by him, Lu Xiang was instantly stunned. She really did not dare to believe it. How could Gu Yao and Qiao Xi play the blame game so stubbornly?","Lu Xiang was angered to the point her entire body went numb. She pointed at Qiao Xi and shouted loudly, “Ah Yan didn’t say anything, yet she kicked him. All of you saw it just now. Ah Yan almost fell. Don’t believe Qiao Xi. She’s lying!”","Qiao Xi had an awkward expression. Actually, she really did not use much strength. She just did not expect Lu Yan to be so weak. This could not be blamed on her! She just wanted to teach Lu Yan a lesson, but he...","Hearing Lu Xiang’s words, Gu Yao spat on the floor and pointed at Lu Yan as he shouted, “The future heir of the Lu family actually pretended to fall to frame my sister-in-law. Look at my sister-in-law’s thin arms and legs. How could she kick Young Master Lu down with one kick?”","Lu Xiang was almost angered to the point of vomiting blood. They were framing Qiao Xi? It was clearly Qiao Xi who was framing them. Ah Yan spoke in such a gentle tone when they were talking, but she suddenly cried. She was deliberately trying to gain sympathy and make everyone believe her!","Lu Xiang was instantly infuriated. “Yes! It’s her!”","Gu Yao was a little guilty, but his tone was very firm. “If Qiao Xi can kick Young Master Lu down with one kick, then it just means that Young Master Lu is too weak! Is his kidney weak?! Then he should hurry up and go to the hospital to get himself checked. He’s not married yet. What will he do in the future?!","“If Young Master Lu isn’t sick but he was kicked down by Qiao Xi, then you must be deliberately framing her!”","What he meant was that Lu Yan either had a kidney deficiency or was deliberately framing Qiao Xi. There was absolutely no other possibility. No matter which one Lu Yan admitted, it was a humiliation to him.","As soon as he finished speaking, Lu Xiang was about to retort when Gu Yao did not give her a chance at all. He continued to nag, “No way! Young Master Lu, do you really have weak kidneys? Your body isn’t good either! Don’t always think about how to frame others. It’s not good for your health. If you have time, you should train your body more! Even Qiao Xi can kick you down. If my brother were to attack, he’ll kick you into the morgue!”","Lu Yan’s face alternated between red and white as he gritted his teeth.","Qiao Xi stood at the side and looked at Gu Yao, who was attacking crazily. She could not help but give him a thumbs up.","Actually, Gu Yao was still very nervous after he finished speaking. He knew very well that Qiao Xi only looked weak. Her kick was indeed very lethal, so when he lied in public, he was still a little guilty.","Second Young Master Gu had never lied. At this moment, he felt a little guilty. For the sake of protecting Qiao Xi’s weak image, he had really suffered too much."]},{"number":1115,"title":"Chapter 1115 - What Right Does He Have To Look","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi whimpered. The spiciness in her mouth was still spreading. Her eyes were filled with tears as she said aggrievedly, “I was just about to leave when Young Master Lu said that he had something to tell me. He said it was about Chairman Lu, but why is he talking to me about this? Why didn’t he look for Gu Zheng?”","Everyone looked at Lu Yan suspiciously.","Qiao Xi’s voice was soft as she said with a trace of crying, “Actually, I know why. I’m too weak, so Young Master Lu came to look for trouble with me.”","Everyone’s eyes were filled with disdain.","The gentle uncle’s face could not help but darken as he said unhappily, “Young Master Lu, if you have anything to say, you can look for President Gu directly or say it in front of everyone. Mrs. Gu is still young, so she can’t handle some things herself.”","Lu Yan’s heart was dead. After a moment of silence, he took a deep breath and said, “It’s fine. Since you don’t want to talk to me, I have nothing to say.”","Qiao Xi widened her eyes and pretended to be surprised. “Young Master Lu, you made things difficult for me and I even kicked you, but it turns out that you actually have nothing to say. Then please leave quickly.”","Originally, Qiao Xi thought that Lu Yan wanted to talk to her about Old Master Lu’s illness. After all, she had drugged Old Master Lu, but Lu Yan did not seem to have noticed that something was wrong!","Lu Yan had lost his reputation twice in a day and could not retort. He could only smile and say helplessly, “I’m sorry to have disturbed your rest, Mrs. Gu. We’ll be leaving first.”","“Wait.” Suddenly, a cold male voice sounded.","Gu Zheng held a pot of tea in his hand, his eyes as cold as sharp swords. His sharp gaze landed on Lu Yan. “I’m very interested in what Young Master Lu wanted to say. Tell me.”","Everyone looked in the direction of the voice and could not help but gasp. Everyone could sense a chill surrounding Gu Zheng. The surroundings instantly fell silent as if the air had frozen.","Lu Yan’s expression was slightly stiff. He originally wanted to use the old master’s illness to pressure Gu Zheng. At this moment, Gu Zheng should be surrounded by public opinion. However, after Qiao Xi disrupted the situation, the situation changed. The situation was extremely disadvantageous to the Lu family.","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled up slightly, but the smile did not reach his eyes at all. His deep eyes were filled with disdain as if looking at Lu Yan again would dirty him. He said impatiently, “Young Master Lu, if you don’t want to say it, then forget it. Please leave my wife’s sight immediately and don’t disturb her anymore.”","Lu Yan’s face was livid. Actually, his grandfather was really sick. The Lu family’s doctor said that he would wake up soon. Originally, Lu Corporation planned to force Gu Zheng to give up the 5% of shares and then find a suitable time to announce that his grandfather had woken up. However, after Qiao Xi’s commotion, if they rashly announced that his grandfather had woken up, everyone would believe the rumor of Old Master Lu pretending to be sick.","Lu Yan knew that he could not discuss this matter in public, or it would attract more suspicion.","However, at this moment, Lu Xiang was already overwhelmed by anger. Coupled with Gu Zheng’s disdainful look that was as if the Lu family was nothing in his eyes, she was instantly angry.","Gu Zheng also had the Lu family’s blood flowing in his veins. What right did he have to look down on the Lu family?","Lu Qingyun, that b*tch, was already dead. Why did she still leave her son in this world? This bastard was even looking at them like that! The Lu family was a century-old family that he could not reach. What right did he have to not take the Lu family seriously?","Anger accumulated layer by layer. Lu Xiang instantly lost her mind. She pointed at Gu Zheng and roared, “My father has been unconscious for so many days, but you, his unfilial son, haven’t even visited him. Ah Yan is here to look for you because he wants you to go home with him. But you actually want to chase Ah Yan away. You bastard, you’re too heartless!”","Lu Yan frowned and wanted to stop her, but Gu Zheng smiled meaningfully. “So what Young Master Lu wants to say is that Chairman Lu fell sick.”","Lu Xiang glared at him fiercely. “What else could it be? Your grandfather has been sick for so many days, yet you’re not worried at all. Do you still have a conscience?”","As soon as she finished speaking, Lu Xiang suddenly sensed strange gazes from the surroundings. She noticed Gu Yao’s gaze first. The people behind him also looked at her as if they were looking at a fool. At a time like this, she still had the cheek to threaten President Gu with Chairman Lu’s illness.","Earlier, President Gu and Mrs. Gu had already made themselves clear outside the meeting room. Everyone knew that the Lu family would do anything for the 5% shares. Was Chairman Lu really sick? Or was he just forcing President Gu to give up the shares?"]},{"number":1116,"title":"Chapter 1116 - Participating In The Ancestral","paragraphs":["Hearing Lu Xiang’s words, Lu Yan could not help but clench his fists. He knew that saying these words would not do the Lu family any good at all. It would even make everyone doubt the authenticity of his grandfather’s illness.","Lu Xiang was really an idiot. She was actually led by the nose so easily!","He was about to stop her when Gu Zheng acted first. He raised an eyebrow and said, “I thought you were talking about the Lu family paying respects to their ancestors.”","Lu Yan’s heart trembled, and his eyes were filled with horror. He suddenly looked at Lu Xiang, who had the same expression as him. They were both very puzzled as to how Gu Zheng knew about the ancestral worship ceremony.","At this moment, Lu Yan finally knew why he had been uneasy since he saw Gu Zheng. It was because Gu Zheng was too calm and looked confident as if he had everyone in the Lu family in his hands. It turned out that he already knew that the Lu family paying respects to their ancestors.","However, they had only discussed this matter in the Lu family’s mansion. Gu Zheng had never stepped into the Lu family’s door, so how could he know? Moreover, not many people in the Lu family knew about this. In order to stop Gu Zheng from participating, they deliberately wanted to pay respects to their ancestors in advance.","Those who could attend the ancestral worship ceremony were all descendants of the Lu family. Although Gu Zheng was also a member of the Lu family, Lu Yan did not want him to return to the Lu family. Old Master Lu naturally did not agree to have Gu Zheng attend as well, but now that everyone in Li City knew that Gu Zheng was Old Master Lu’s grandson and Lu Qingyun’s only son, if they did not invite Gu Zheng to attend, they would definitely be criticized.","After thinking about it, Lu Xiang thought of holding the ceremony in advance. On that day, she would get the descendants of the Lu family to come and would not inform anyone else.","However, they never expected Gu Zheng to know about this and even say it in public.","Lu Yan bit his lip hatefully.","After a moment of silence, Qiao Xi chuckled. “I see! Young Master Lu, why didn’t you say so earlier? If you wanted to invite Ah Zheng and me to the Lu family’s ancestral worship ceremony, you could’ve just told me! You said so many unimportant things just now. I thought you were here to look for trouble with me!”","When she heard this, Lu Xiang hurriedly retorted in exasperation, “Qiao Xi! You want to participate in the Lu family’s ancestral worship ceremony? Dream on! It’s impossible...”","“Madam Lu, what do you mean?” Qiao Xi had an innocent expression as she asked with tears in her eyes, “Why can’t I participate? I’m Ah Zheng’s wife. Could it be that you and Young Master Lu didn’t come to look for me to invite us to attend the ancestral worship ceremony?”","Lu Xiang had already completely lost her mind. She listened to Qiao Xi’s words and roared angrily. “Don’t even think about it! You don’t have the qualifications to participate in the Lu family’s ancestral worship ceremony. It’s absolutely impossible for Ah Yan and I to invite you and him!”","“Who are you referring to?” Qiao Xi asked softly, “Is the person you’re talking about Ah Zheng? Does your Lu family think that Ah Zheng and I aren’t worthy of attending the Lu family’s ancestral worship ceremony?”","Lu Yan felt terrible. He felt his blood pressure rise.","Qiao Xi frowned and had an aggrieved expression. “If Madam Lu doesn’t like me, I’m willing to withdraw my participation in the ancestral worship ceremony, but Ah Zheng’s mother is the eldest daughter of the Lu family. Why doesn’t he have the right to participate?”","Before Lu Xiang could react to Qiao Xi’s meaning, she heard Qiao Xi continue to question, “Miss Lu Qingyun is the daughter of the first wife of the Lu family and the legitimate eldest daughter of the Lu family. If even the son she gave birth to isn’t qualified to participate, who is?”","Qiao Xi glanced at her indifferently. “Madam Lu, what right do you have to say these things to us? Do you think you’re worthy?”","It was no secret that Lu Xiang was an illegitimate daughter. If an illegitimate daughter like her was qualified to attend the Lu family’s ancestral worship ceremony, why was Gu Zheng not qualified?","An illegitimate daughter wanted to climb over President Gu’s head? Who gave her the confidence?","Seeing everyone’s burning gazes, Lu Xiang gulped in fear and retorted with difficulty, “But Gu Zheng didn’t participate in the competition in the past, so—”","“He didn’t participate in it in the past because he was framed to be the illegitimate child of the Gu family. Now that his identity has been proven, everyone knows that he’s Miss Lu Qingyun’s biological son. There’s a paternity test from the Medical Association to prove that. If Gu Zheng isn’t worthy of attending the ceremony, then Young Master Lu is even less worthy because he doesn’t have a written test report to prove that he’s of the Lu family’s bloodline!”","Qiao Xi mercilessly interrupted Lu Xiang, then sighed. “I heard that Miss Lu Qingyun only gave birth to one son back then, which was Gu Zheng. Whose child is Lu Yan? What right does the Lu family have to let an unknown person participate but not Gu Zheng?”"]},{"number":1117,"title":"Chapter 1117 - This Was Her And Gu Zheng’s Scheme","paragraphs":["Everyone could not help but be stunned when they heard Qiao Xi’s words, but they had to admit that Qiao Xi’s words made sense.","Miss Lu Qingyun was a talented woman. She started managing the company at a young age. At that time, the company was in good order under her management. The Lu family was also at their peak at that time. After Eldest Miss Lu passed away, the Lu family’s business gradually lost its luster. After more than 10 years, President Gu built a new business kingdom. His reputation resounded both domestically and overseas. How similar the mother and son were! They were both so outstanding!","However, from the moment Lu Yan started managing the company, there had been problems one after another. They were not just some small problems either as the sales of the resort villa and new perfumes had caused the Lu family to lose nearly 20 billion yuan. This money was all saved by the Lu family for many years, but Lu Yan had only taken over Lu Corporation for less than a year before he lost all the liquid assets in Lu Corporation’s hands. He did not have the slightest bit of Eldest Miss Lu’s talent from back then, yet he still had the cheek to say that he was Eldest Miss Lu’s son.","Be it in terms of looks or strength, Lu Yan was different from Lu Qingyun, while Gu Zheng was like a replica of Lu Qingyun. It was just that Gu Zheng was more decisive than Lu Qingyun. He was a little more vicious and decisive. However, it was also because of this that he was able to create the current Gu Corporation in just a few years.","From the looks of it, Lu Yan’s identity was indeed suspicious. Whose child was he?","Qiao Xi shook her head helplessly. “Ah Zheng, forget it. Since Madam Lu doesn’t agree, it means that they don’t treat you as a member of the Lu family at all. Previously, they kept saying that they would compensate you and dote on you as a member of the Lu family, but now... Tsk tsk.","“My heart just aches! Miss Lu Qingyun lost her mother and had to live in the shadows of a mistress when she was young. She had to constantly obey others. Ah Zheng has also suffered a lot under Huang Lilan all these years, but Old Madam Lu and Madam Lu Xiang dote on Lu Yan very much. How strange. Could it be...”","“Miss Qiao, watch your words!”","Hearing Qiao Xi’s nonsense in public, Lu Yan interrupted her with a gloomy expression. Then, he announced, “I came to look for Mrs. Gu to invite President Gu and Mrs. Gu to attend the ancestral worship ceremony.”","The entire venue fell silent.","After a few seconds of silence, Qiao Xi smiled. “But Madam Lu kept saying that I’m not worthy. Did I misunderstand? I guess the Lu family is still willing to let us participate in the end.”","The veins on Lu Yan’s forehead twitched. Qiao Xi’s tone was clearly mocking them!","He suppressed his anger and said, “Mrs. Gu, we don’t have any ill intentions. Grandpa fainting has nothing to do with President Gu. We’re here today to invite you to pay respects to our ancestors. Let’s let bygones be bygones.”","“Sure. When will the ceremony be held?” Qiao Xi asked.","Lu Yan could not lie in front of everyone, and there was no need either. “On the third of next month.”","Qiao Xi nodded and said with a smile, “Ah Zheng, that’s great! The Lu family has invited us to participate in the ancestral worship ceremony!”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and looked at her gently. When he looked up again, the gentleness in his eyes suddenly dissipated. He glanced coldly at Lu Yan, seemingly warning but also mocking him.","At this moment, Lu Yan only felt that he had suffered extremely great humiliation. His original plan was supposed to go very smoothly, but Qiao Xi insisted on stepping out to cause trouble. Now, they were even forced to invite Gu Zheng to participate in the ancestral worship ceremony. Those who could participate in the ancestral worship ceremony were all descendants of the Lu family. What right did Gu Zheng have to participate?","Lu Yan gritted his teeth, and he could taste blood in his throat. However, in front of everyone, he had no choice but to smile.","Qiao Xi was extremely happy when she saw Lu Yan’s aggrieved appearance.","Before Lu Xiang could react, the situation had turned out like this. She was angered to the point of having a ferocious expression. She looked at Lu Yan unwillingly, then at Qiao Xi.","It was all because of this little b*tch!","Qiao Xi deliberately cried in front of everyone and revealed the matter of the ancestral worship ceremony in public, causing them to have no choice but to agree. This was all her and Gu Zheng’s scheme!","This b*tch! She still had the cheek to cry? She relied on her seductive face to shed a few tears to gain sympathy, and this group of people really believed the little b*tch’s words. No one believed them.","Lu Xiang’s eyes were filled with madness and unwillingness. All these years, she had worked hard to get the chance to attend the ancestral worship ceremony. When she was young, only Lu Qingyun could worship their ancestors. She was the eldest daughter of the first wife and the honor of the family. Everyone knew that the Lu family had a talented daughter, but no one knew that the Lu family had a second daughter.","She was jealous of Lu Qingyun. Why did she have to be an illegitimate daughter who was despised by everyone since she was born while Lu Qingyun got to be the high and mighty eldest daughter?"]},{"number":1118,"title":"Chapter 1118 - He’s The Most Scheming Man","paragraphs":["Jealousy and anger surged out of Lu Xiang’s heart like a tide. Her grandfather had only liked Lu Qingyun since she was young. She and her mother were humble, but she still could not obtain her grandfather’s affirmation. Hence, when she was young, she had hoped that Lu Qingyun would die. This way, she would be the only daughter in the Lu family.","After Lu Qingyun died, the Lu family would be hers. Unexpectedly, Lu Qingyun’s son returned and wanted to snatch everything away.","Impossible! She would never allow this to happen.","Lu Yan pulled Lu Xiang back and glared at her. Then, he lowered his voice and warned, “Let’s go.”","“Ah Yan, he can’t participate in the ancestral worship. He’s not worthy...” Lu Xiang was still unwilling.","“Shut up!” Lu Yan roared angrily and interrupted Lu Xiang. He resisted the urge to flare up and gritted his teeth. “Haven’t you embarrassed yourself enough? Let’s go!”","Lu Xiang’s face was filled with embarrassment, but seeing that Lu Yan was so angry, she could only leave with him dejectedly.","As she watched Lu Yan and Lu Xiang leave in a sorry state, the corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up. She grunted coldly in disdain. “Please leave at once!”","Lu Yan stopped in his tracks, and the veins on his forehead popped out. He suppressed his anger and gritted his teeth.","Did Gu Zheng want to participate in the ancestral worship ceremony? Well, he would absolutely not let Gu Zheng have an easy time! At that time, Gu Zheng would come to the Lu family’s territory. Was he so confident that nothing would go wrong?","Seeing Lu Yan leave without a word, Gu Yao frowned. “Lu Yan must be holding it in! Maybe he’s thinking of another way to deal with Gu Zheng!”","“By the way, is the Lu family holding the ceremony in advance? They probably decided on this because of Old Master Lu! If Old Master Lu has yet to wake up when the ceremony is being held, it’ll prove to everyone that Old Master Lu is really unconscious. If he’s not sick, how could he not participate in the ancestral worship ceremony? That’s a great disrespect! In short, this kid definitely doesn’t have good intentions. When Gu Zheng goes, he’ll definitely cause trouble again! Lu Yan is too cunning! We have to be careful of him!”","Qiao Xi: “...” Was Gu Yao thinking too much?! Lu Yan probably did not have that many thoughts running through his mind, but after Gu Yao’s reminder, Qiao Xi felt that Lu Yan would definitely not be able to take this lying down. He would attack behind the scenes.","At this moment, Gu Yao was still indignant. “I’ve never seen a man as scheming as Lu Yan. He’s full of schemes. He’s really scheming!”","Everyone: “???”","Gu Yao was just about to turn around and complain about this to Qiao Xi when he suddenly saw Qiao Xi’s fierce expression. She was like a kitten that had exploded. He hurriedly lowered his voice and said, “Qiao Xi! Watch your expression. Your current appearance will contradict your image too much.”","As soon as she finished speaking, a noblewoman at the side, Madam Ye, could not help but look over. She suddenly saw Qiao Xi’s fierce expression and was momentarily confused. “Mrs. Gu...”","Gu Yao thought that this matter could not be hidden anymore. It was fine if he and Gu Zheng saw it, but if others saw it, they would say that Qiao Xi was deliberately pretending to be weak.","Even in the next second, Qiao Xi’s expression did not change. It just gradually returned to normal. She raised her hand weakly and wiped the remaining tears from the corners of her eyes. She smiled weakly at Madam Ye. “Madam Ye, what’s wrong?”","Madam Ye even thought that the scene just now was an illusion, but she clearly saw Mrs. Gu’s fierce expression. Moreover, she had just kicked Lu Yan. She did not look like a very weak woman at all!","She stared fixedly at the weak Mrs. Gu. She was clearly a petite woman who had been bullied by Lu Yan until she cried. She must have seen it wrong just now.","Mrs. Gu was so weak and kind. How could she hit Lu Yan and even show a fierce expression?","Madam Ye dispelled the doubts in her heart and asked with concern, “Mrs. Gu, are you okay?”","Now, the Ye family and Gu Yao were discussing a collaboration. Madam Ye expressed her goodwill to Qiao Xi firstly to please Gu Yao and Gu Zheng, but it was also because she saw her being bullied by Lu Yan and crying pitifully, so her heart ached for her.","Madam Ye said gently, “President Gu, I think Mrs. Gu is scared. Hurry up and leave with her.”","Qiao Xi nodded and sniffed weakly. “Ah Zheng, I was really afraid. I didn’t expect Young Master Lu to come looking for me directly. If Ah Yao hadn’t come, I don’t know what would’ve happened!","“He even said bad things about you just now, Ah Zheng. Actually, it doesn’t matter how much he bullies me, but I can’t allow him to say anything about you, Ah Zheng, so I impulsively kicked him. At that time, his gaze seemed to want to kill me. I was so scared that I cried. I’m too much of a coward!”"]},{"number":1119,"title":"Chapter 1119 - He Sympathized With Lu Yan A Little","paragraphs":["Hearing Qiao Xi’s confession, Madam Ye’s heart ached even more. Lu Yan was really too arrogant. He could not win against Gu Zheng, so he came to make things difficult for Mrs. Gu. What kind of man would make things difficult for a weak woman?!","If Lu Yan was really unconvinced, he could look for Gu Zheng to have a chat with. However, he did not dare to offend Gu Zheng. Even though he knew that Mrs. Gu had a weak character, he chose to make things difficult for her while Gu Zheng was not around. Was such a vile person worthy of being Lu Qingyun’s son?","Madam Ye gently bade farewell to Qiao Xi and left with her husband.","When she left, she even complained to her husband, “Lu Yan is too much of a bully!”","Gu Yao knew that he had to discuss a collaboration with them later, so he gestured for everyone to wait for him in the private room. He walked to Qiao Xi’s side and asked tentatively, “Q-Qiao Xi, why were you crying just now?”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched slightly. She was about to answer when she was interrupted by Gu Yao’s agitated voice. His eyes were filled with anger as he asked in shock, “Could it be that Lu Yan really bullied you? This bastard! How dare he?”","Ever since he met Qiao Xi, he had never seen her cry so hard. If she was really wronged, she would take revenge on the spot. However, she actually cried today. Moreover, she did not look like she was pretending. Her eyes were so red. She clearly looked very sad.","Could it be that before he came, Lu Yan had really done something overboard that made the usually strong Qiao Xi unable to help but cry?","Gu Yao felt like there was a huge rock in his heart. He should not have let Lu Yan leave just now. A scumbag like him should be beaten up and sent to the intensive care unit!","“Actually... I choked on some chilies,” Qiao Xi said in embarrassment. “I came out to digest my food and find some water to drink, but I accidentally choked. Then Lu Yan happened to appear.”","At this moment, Gu Yao’s face was filled with confusion. He stood rooted to the ground in a daze and asked in confusion, “Does that mean you cried from the spicy food? It had nothing to do with Lu Yan?”","At this moment, Gu Yao seemed to sympathize with Lu Yan. He had clearly not done anything, yet he was accused of bullying Mrs. Gu. How tragic!","At this moment, in the Lu family’s private room, Lu Yan looked at his red and swollen knee, his eyes filled with viciousness.","Lu Xiang, who was at the side, shouted with a ferocious expression, “Those two bastards want to attend the Lu family’s ancestral worship ceremony? Are they worthy?","“If it weren’t for that little b*tch, Qiao Xi, today’s plan would’ve succeeded. This little b*tch always ruins the Lu family’s plans. Sooner or later, I’ll...”","Lu Xiang suddenly stopped talking and looked around in a panic. Although they were in a private room, this was Huazhong Building. Perhaps the walls had ears. She only dared to say these words in the Lu family’s mansion. She definitely did not want Gu Zheng to catch wind of her saying these things.","She hated Gu Zheng, but at the same time, she was afraid of him. Hence, even though she hated Gu Zheng to the core, she did not dare to say anything too overboard in front of him because she knew that Gu Zheng was a vicious person. If she angered him, the consequences would definitely be unimaginable.","Lu Xiang lowered her voice and said angrily, “They actually mentioned the ancestral worship ceremony in front of everyone. If it wasn’t because it would’ve affected the Lu family’s reputation, we definitely wouldn’t have agreed to let them participate!”","“Let them attend.” Suddenly, Lu Yan said in a hoarse voice, “It’s just an ancestral worship ceremony. They can come if they want to.”","Lu Xiang’s expression changed drastically, and her face was filled with shock. “Ah Yan! What are you talking about?! Those who can participate in the ancestral worship ceremony are the most outstanding descendants of the Lu family. This represents their status in the Lu family. I’ve worked hard for so many years to get the chance to participate in the ancestral worship ceremony. What right do Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi have to participate?”","Gu Zheng’s influence was huge now. Everyone in Li City knew that if he officially returned to the Lu family and became a descendant of the Lu family, Lu Yan would no longer have a place in the Lu family.","Even though they supported Lu Yan’s rise to power, those shareholders were already dissatisfied with him. If Gu Zheng returned to the Lu family, the shareholders would definitely support the more outstanding heir.","How could Ah Yan not know what she knew? Then why did he agree to let Gu Zheng go home to pay respects to their ancestors?","Lu Yan glanced at Lu Xiang indifferently. Lu Yan did not care about this aunt of his who was a little stupid. They were not even related by blood. He showed a trace of disdain, but his tone was still gentle. “Aunt, we did agree to let him attend the ancestral worship ceremony, but we didn’t agree to let him enter the ancestral hall to pay respects to our ancestors.”"]},{"number":1120,"title":"Chapter 1120 - Crazily Testing Her Bottom Line","paragraphs":["The corners of Lu Yan’s mouth curled up into a cold smile. “Since it’s the Lu family’s door, the Lu family has the right to decide who can enter and who can’t. At that time, if they come but are rejected, won’t it be even more embarrassing?”","Lu Xiang was enlightened and got extremely excited. “Yes! Ah Yan, you’re so smart. The Lu family indeed won’t stop him from attending the ancestral worship ceremony, but an outsider like him won’t be able to enter the ancestral hall!","“Gu Zheng kept saying that he didn’t want to return to the Lu family, but Qiao Xi told everyone about Huang Lilan and almost let everyone know your identity. She’s clearly trying to harm you!","“That bastard is coveting the position of heir of the Lu family. He wants to pull you down and snatch everything that belongs to you. Ah Yan, you can’t give it to him. You have to hold on to it tightly!”","Hearing Lu Xiang’s words, the killing intent in Lu Yan’s eyes spread. He would never allow anyone to snatch his things.","In the eyes of the Lu family, Lu Yan had always been gentle like jade. Now that she saw him with vicious eyes, Lu Xiang could not help but be a little afraid.","Lu Yan glanced at Lu Xiang coldly. He hated Lu Xiang from the bottom of his heart. She was stupid and rash. She was easily blinded by anger and almost ruined the plan.","This stupid woman. Since she wanted to kill Lu Qingyun back then, she should kill that bastard, Gu Zheng, too. Then, no one would trip him up and snatch the position of heir from him.","Lu Yan’s eyes narrowed slightly. Since Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi were suspecting that Grandpa was pretending to be sick, then on the day of the ancestral worship ceremony, he wanted everyone to know that Grandpa was really sick and Gu Zheng was spreading rumors.","...","On the other hand, Gu Zheng had concluded his last meeting and left Huazhong Building with Qiao Xi.","“Are you really going to the Lu family to pay respects to your ancestors?” Qiao Xi asked casually, “Lu Yan doesn’t welcome you!”","Gu Zheng smiled. “He’ll welcome me.”","“Why?” Qiao Xi asked.","“If I go to attend the ancestral worship ceremony, he’ll refuse to let me in. He’ll tell me that outsiders can’t participate in the ancestral worship ceremony and it’s the rule of the Lu family’s ancestors. I’ll end up losing my reputation there, so who’ll end up the happiest?”","Qiao Xi nodded thoughtfully. If that were the case, Lu Yan would definitely be the happiest. If Gu Zheng returned to the Lu family, it would definitely threaten Lu Yan’s interests. After all, Gu Zheng was Miss Lu Qingyun’s biological son, and Lu Yan’s identity was still suspicious. He could not produce strong evidence to prove his identity and say that he was Miss Lu Qingyun’s other son. Only the Lu family would believe such a thing.","“Lu Yan pretended to agree to let you go, but he’ll get Old Master Lu to appear and refuse to let you enter the ancestral hall by bringing up the rules of the Lu family’s ancestors. In that case, the high and mighty president of Gu Corporation would’ve returned to the Lu family to pay respects to his ancestors but got rejected. It’ll be big news.","“Even if the Lu family is wrong in this matter, your reputation and dignity will be ruined in the Lu family’s hands if news of it gets out.”","Only then did Qiao Xi realize why Lu Yan agreed to let participate so readily. It turned out that he had such intentions!","“Why does Lu Yan like to test my limits?” Qiao Xi clenched her fists. She suddenly felt that the kick she gave Lu Yan today was too light. She should have used a little more force.","Gu Zheng smiled dotingly. “Mrs. Gu, you’re a lady. In the future, you’re not allowed to hit anyone in front of outsiders. I’ll handle everything.”","Qiao Xi immediately restrained her expression and looked at Gu Zheng shyly. “Oh, you’re so annoying! I was just casually saying it. What can a weak woman like me do to Lu Yan?”","Gu Zheng stroked her hair gently, his eyes shrouded in coldness. “If Lu Yan wants to deal with me, he’ll definitely start with Old Master Lu. What do you think, Mrs. Gu?”","Qiao Xi cried out in surprise, then covered her mouth with a shocked expression. “Ah! Lu Yan is really vicious! Even if Old Master Lu is fine, he won’t be anymore with Lu Yan’s methods. No matter what, he’s the grandfather who raised him since he was young! He won’t make the old master unconscious for a few more days, right? He’s too heartless!”","After she finished speaking, she suddenly revealed a sly smile. “If he wants the old master to be unconscious for a few more days, I can fulfill his request.”","Lu Yan had already fallen into the traps she and Gu Zheng laid out so many times. Why was he still so naive? He actually wanted to use Old Master Lu’s illness to his advantage. Wasn’t he afraid that Old Master Lu would really fall unconscious?","When the two of them arrived at Longwan Residential, Qiao Xi hurriedly went upstairs to call the people from the Medical Association. Unexpectedly, she had just walked halfway when Gu Zheng’s cold voice came from behind. “Mrs. Gu.”","Qiao Xi stopped in her tracks and turned around to look at him. She heard Gu Zheng say casually, “I have something to ask you.”"]},{"number":1121,"title":"Chapter 1121 - I Don’t Believe A Word","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi met Gu Zheng’s deep eyes and suddenly had a bad feeling. The next second, he smirked and slowly took a few steps closer to her. He stood on the steps below and raised his head to look at her. He raised his eyebrows and asked, “Mrs. Gu, how did you know that the Lu family was going to hold the ancestral worship ceremony?”","Qiao Xi’s body instantly stiffened as she panicked.","Gu Zheng smiled faintly. “Since you haven’t been out recently, how did you know that Chairman Lu is unconscious and that the Lu family will be paying respects to their ancestors?”","Qiao Xi was instantly at a loss. It was not difficult for Gu Zheng to find out about these things, but she had been busy with the university’s affairs recently and had never logged into Black Tide’s account. How could she explain the reason why she knew about the Lu family?","Qiao Xi smiled awkwardly. “Ah Zheng, I’m Black Tide! What’s strange about me knowing all this? I haven’t logged into my account recently, but it’s obvious with my identity, isn’t it? I don’t have to personally investigate anything I want to know. Someone will naturally report it to me. Moreover, everyone in Stars knows that I have a grudge against the Lu family, so once there’s any news about the Lu family, they’ll inform me immediately.”","She thought that she had a good reason, but Gu Zheng stared at her calmly. After a long time, he retracted his gaze and chuckled. “Mrs. Gu, you have a point, but...”","Qiao Xi had just heaved a sigh of relief when she heard Gu Zheng’s words. Her heart jumped again. The next second, she heard his teasing voice that contained a trace of a smile. “But... I don’t believe you.”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched slightly as she widened her eyes. ‘Since you don’t believe me, why are you still listening to me?’","Gu Zheng pretended not to see her angry face and continued to smile gently. “Mrs. Gu, you look quite cute when you’re trying your best to deceive me. Unfortunately, I don’t believe a word you say.”","Qiao Xi forcefully resisted the urge to flare up and laughed dryly. “Ah Zheng, I’m telling the truth.”","Gu Zheng held her hand and walked down the stairs. They sat on the sofa together. “Do you want to know about the Lu family’s matters so badly?”","Qiao Xi knew that she could not hide these things from Gu Zheng, so she stopped pretending and nodded calmly.","“Then come closer.” Gu Zheng waved at her.","Qiao Xi was filled with curiosity and did not put up any defenses. She hurriedly approached Gu Zheng, and half of her body was leaning against him. Her large watery eyes looked at him expectantly. “Tell me.”","The man’s hot breath sprayed into her nose, and the smell of sandalwood from Gu Zheng’s body lingered around her. It was intoxicating.","He straightened his body slightly and inadvertently brushed his lips past her earlobe. The slightly cold touch caused Qiao Xi’s entire body to tremble. Her heart thumped violently, then the man’s magnetic voice sounded in her ears. “There’s no rush. I’ll tell you next month.”","As soon as he finished speaking, he distanced himself from her with a smile. The ambiguous atmosphere between the two of them instantly vanished.","Qiao Xi gritted her teeth and could not help but clench her fists. Was this bastard looking for a beating? Was it fun to tease her time and again?","A minute later, Qiao Xi went upstairs angrily. After returning to the bedroom, the more she thought about it, the more aggrieved she felt. She knew that Gu Zheng suspected that she was secretly investigating things, but even Third Brother did not know about the two people she had planted in the Lu family. How could Senior know?","Perhaps Gu Zheng did not actually know everything and it was all guesswork, but how could he suspect her of being the one responsible for the poisoning incident? Even the Lu family could not figure out if Old Master Lu was really unconscious or pretending to be sick. Where did Gu Zheng get the news?","No matter what, she had to arrange everything before the ancestral worship ceremony. She would not let Lu Yan’s plan succeed. She picked up her phone and sent a message, then waited for her subordinates to report the situation.","“Eldest Miss, Old Master Lu is still unconscious. He won’t be waking up for a while.”","When Qiao Xi heard the report from her subordinate, she smiled in satisfaction. Then, she told her subordinate that Gu Zheng suspected her. The other party was silent for a moment before replying, “Eldest Miss, you and President Gu have been married for so long. Moreover, he has already guessed everything you’ve done. Why don’t you tell him about this? In any case, everything you’ve done is for him!”","“No! Absolutely not!” Qiao Xi objected without the slightest hesitation.","“But...”","Qiao Xi interrupted her aggrievedly, “You have to remember! I’m the weak Mrs. Gu who can’t take care of myself. I’m kind-hearted and weak. I absolutely wouldn’t poison anyone. The fact that Chairman Lu is unconscious has nothing to do with me!”","The subordinate was instantly speechless. He could understand Eldest Miss. After all, she had been pretending to be weak for so long. She definitely did not want to ruin her image in President Gu’s heart."]},{"number":1122,"title":"Chapter 1122 - How Many More Secrets Does","paragraphs":["In the study of Longwan Residential.","Gu Zheng leaned lazily against the chair and lowered his eyes. “Is it done?”","When he left Huazhong Building, he instructed Song Shijing to go to the Lu family’s house and make Chairman Lu unconscious for a few more days.","Song Shijing stood there and hesitated. After a moment, he replied, “I guess so.”","Gu Zheng looked up slowly and saw Song Shijing say with a strange expression, “President, I don’t have to do anything and Chairman Lu will remain unconscious.”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow, signaling him to continue.","Song Shijing gulped nervously. “Logically speaking, Chairman Lu should have woken up today. I received your order, but when I arrived at the ward, I found Chairman Lu still unconscious. Someone seemed to have poisoned him again before me.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled up slightly, and his eyes were filled with a smile. “Did you see that person?”","“I’ve been hiding in the dark and observing. Other than the spies we planted in the Lu family, only one person has entered the ward. That person is Chairman Lu’s assistant.”","That assistant had been working by Chairman Lu’s side for two years. He was young, but Chairman Lu liked and trusted him very much. However, this person was not Chairman Lu’s subordinate. This person must have been the one who poisoned him when he first fell into a coma.","He was already planted by Chairman Lu’s side two years ago. Whose subordinate was he?","Song Shijing felt that something was wrong. He frowned and asked, “President, do you want me to investigate this person’s identity? He’s been hiding by Chairman Lu’s side for two years. If he finds out about our people, then...”","“There’s no need.” Gu Zheng waved his hand casually. “He can do whatever he wants. You don’t have to investigate. Just pretend that he doesn’t exist.”","Song Shijing was even more confused, but he was in no position to question the decisions his boss makes. He had roughly guessed that the president knew this person’s identity, but he still did not understand who had planted spies in the Lu family two years ago. Did this assistant go to the Lu family with a purpose, or was he bribed after going there?","Could this person really be trusted? If he found out that the president had spies in the Lu family, would he expose them?","After Song Shijing left, Gu Zheng could not help but smile. What other secrets did Mrs. Gu have that he did not know about? She planted spies in the Lu family two years ago. At that time, Mrs. Gu probably did not know that Mo Yuan was Gu Zheng or the grudge between him and the Lu family. If that was the case, why did she send people to the Lu family?","At this moment, Qiao Xi was drawing designs in the studio when there was a sudden knock on the door. Gu Zheng pushed the door open and walked in. She slowly raised her eyes and could not help but frown.","Why was this bastard here?","Gu Zheng’s burning gaze landed on her as he sized her up. He stroked his chin and said with a faint smile, “Mrs. Gu, you really surprise me.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Gu Zheng turned around and left. Qiao Xi’s face was filled with confusion as she watched him leave.","Was this person crazy? He pushed the door open and left after saying something strange. How did she surprise him? Could it be that he had discovered something?","...","A few days later, the Lu family decided to hold the ancestral worship ceremony on the original date. Since Gu Zheng already knew about the ancestral worship ceremony, there was no need for them to bring it forward.","Although the Lu family had been unlucky all these years, they were still a long-standing family. They had many descendants, and the annual ancestral worship ceremony was very important. It was also a chance for the descendants of the Lu family to get closer.","On this day, the Lu family woke up early to prepare. Lu Xiang walked into the Lu family’s ancestral hall with her head held high. She glanced around with a sharp gaze. Suddenly, her gaze froze. She pointed at one of the tablets and shouted, “Who asked you to bring this dirty thing in?!”","Logically speaking, all the ancestral tablets of the deceased members of the Lu family would be placed in the ancestral hall. There had been countless ancestral tablets in the past hundred years, so no one would care who these ancestral tablets belonged to. After all, the only people who were qualified to enter the ancestral hall to pay their respects were the few core members of the Lu family.","As soon as Lu Xiang walked in, she realized that there was a memorial tablet on the bottom floor. It was so dazzling. She was so angry at the servants that they were all trembling in fear.","When Lu Xiang saw the name ‘Lu Qingyun’ written on the tablet, the veins on her forehead popped out. Which idiot brought Lu Qingyun’s tablet in?","That b*tch was clearly dead. She was an ominous person. How could her memorial tablet be placed in the Lu family’s ancestral hall?","All these years, Lu Qingyun’s memorial tablet had never appeared in the Lu family’s ancestral hall. Who dared to bring this b*tch’s memorial tablet in?"]},{"number":1123,"title":"Chapter 1123 - Throw Her Tablet Out","paragraphs":["The anger in Lu Xiang’s heart was about to overflow. It had to be known that during the ancestral worship ceremony, everyone had to kneel in front of the memorial tablets and offer incense to their dead relatives. Lu Qingyun’s memorial tablet was placed here, which meant that she had to kneel to Lu Qingyun and offer incense to that b*tch!","The servants lowered their heads and did not answer. Lu Xiang was even angrier. She pointed at the group of people and shouted at the top of her voice, “Are all of you mute? I’m asking you who brought this memorial tablet in! How can this b*tch’s memorial tablet be placed in the Lu family’s ancestral hall?!”","With a bang, Lu Qingyun’s memorial tablet was slammed to the floor.","Everyone exclaimed. An older servant was a little angry when she saw her throw Eldest Miss’ tablet on the floor. She gritted her teeth and said, “T-This is Eldest Miss’ tablet...”","She thought that Lu Xiang had not seen the name on the tablet. After all, Eldest Miss Lu had already passed away many years ago. It was normal for Lu Xiang to not be able to react in time. However, no matter what, Lu Qingyun was the eldest daughter of the Lu family. It was only right for her tablet to be placed in the Lu family’s ancestral hall.","The servant’s trembling words completely angered Lu Xiang. She shouted crazily, “Shut up! I have eyes. I know that this is that b*tch’s tablet! Tell me who brought her tablet in! Which bastard is it?”","That b*tch had been dead for so many years, and she never had a memorial tablet. Who in the Lu family was so bold as to make a memorial tablet for Lu Qingyun behind her back? They even secretly brought it in when she was not paying attention. Did they want her to kneel and kowtow to Lu Qingyun?","The servant was so scared that her face turned pale. She did not expect Lu Xiang to say such vicious words. She replied in a trembling voice, “Second... Second Miss, I’m not sure either! Shouldn’t Eldest Miss’ ancestral tablet be placed here? In the past, even Eldest Miss could enter the ancestral hall. Since she has passed away, it’s only normal that her tablet should be placed here!”","Lu Xiang shouted at the top of her voice, “Shut up! You idiot, cut this memorial tablet into pieces and throw them out!”","A trace of gloom flashed past the servant’s eyes, but she quickly lowered her head. She hesitated for a moment and asked in disbelief, “Throw Eldest Miss’ tablet out? But President Gu will be coming to the Lu family to pay his respects to the ancestors today. If we throw the tablet away, it’ll be difficult to explain things to President Gu. Moreover, Old Master...”","“B*tch! What right do you, a mere servant, have to interfere in the Lu family’s matters? I order you to immediately chop this memorial tablet into pieces and throw them out! Don’t worry about my father. He can’t wait for Lu Qingyun to disappear forever. No one in the Lu family wants to see Lu Qingyun’s name!”","Lu Xiang sneered crazily. “We can’t even be sure that Gu Zheng will be able to step into the ancestral hall. You’re worried that he won’t be able to see Lu Qingyun’s memorial tablet when he comes in? That little bastard isn’t even worthy to come to the Lu family to worship our ancestors at all. Ah Yan is the only heir to the Lu family!”","Lu Yan had just walked to the door when he heard Lu Xiang’s roar. He had a bad feeling. He went forward angrily to stop her. “Why are you so noisy?”","“Ah Yan!” Lu Xiang turned around and said agitatedly, “Do you know that someone brought that b*tch’s tablet in to disgust me? Quickly throw this dirty thing out! Take it away!”","Lu Yan’s gaze was sharp as he glanced coldly at the servant.","The servant was so scared that her entire body trembled. Lu Yan suddenly felt that it was a little strange. Then, he recalled the servant’s words from when he was outside just now. She seemed to be deliberately angering Lu Xiang.","Lu Xiang originally only ordered the servant to take out the ancestral tablet, but the servant deliberately lured Lu Xiang into saying those words. Hence, Lu Xiang ended up saying that Lu Qingyun’s ancestral tablet could not appear in the ancestral hall and Gu Zheng was not qualified to come to the Lu family to pay respects to the ancestors. She also said that Old Master Lu did not want to see Lu Qingyun at all.","A mere servant was deliberately trying to get information from the person she served. Why would she do that?","Lu Yan’s expression darkened. Looking at the memorial tablet on the floor, a thought suddenly appeared in his mind.","“Ah Yan! Ah Yan?” Seeing that Lu Yan was silent, Lu Xiang called out tentatively.","A trace of disdain flashed past the servant’s eyes. She did not panic at all. It did not matter even if Lu Yan suspected her. After all, her mission had been completed.","Lu Yan suppressed the uneasiness in his heart and bent down to pick up the memorial tablet. “Aunt, take a good look. This is my mother’s memorial tablet. This is your sister. Of course, it has to be placed in the Lu family’s ancestral hall. You probably saw wrongly, so you said something wrong.”","After he finished speaking, he warned Lu Xiang with a sharp gaze. She was stunned for a few seconds before suddenly regaining her rationality. She actually said those words in public just now?"]},{"number":1124,"title":"Chapter 1124 - Hand Over The Recording Pen","paragraphs":["“Y-Yes! I was wrong. Since it’s my sister’s memorial tablet, of course, it has to be placed here,” Lu Xiang explained awkwardly, but everyone did not believe a word she said. They had clearly heard her curse Lu Qingyun for being a b*tch just now. She even said that she wanted to throw Lu Qingyun’s memorial tablet out.","Lu Yan’s cold gaze landed on the servant. “Aunt must have been too tired from paying respects to our ancestors recently, so she spouted some nonsense. Everyone present is from the Lu family. I hope you won’t spread the news.”","Everyone from the Lu family knew that they had just witnessed a scandal, but Lu Yan was the young master of the Lu family. Since he had already warned them, everyone naturally did not dare to say anything and hurriedly nodded in agreement.","Lu Yan nodded in satisfaction, then pointed at the servant. “Take it out!”","Everyone was puzzled, and the servant’s expression was indifferent. She was stunned for a few seconds before confusion appeared in her eyes. “Y-Young Master, what do you want me to take out?”","As soon as the servant finished speaking, a figure flashed past the door. No one noticed that person at all.","Lu Yan’s eyes were filled with killing intent as he slowly approached. “You know very well what I’m telling you to do. Quickly hand over the recording pen!”","The servant was so scared that she broke out in a cold sweat. She explained in horror, “Young Master, I... I didn’t do anything like that! You must have misunderstood. I really didn’t do that!”","Lu Yan’s voice was gentle, but the killing intent in his eyes was undisguised. “No matter how much the other party offered you, I can offer you double. Moreover, you don’t want to offend the Lu family because of this. As long as you obediently hand over the item, I can let bygones be bygones. You can continue to work in the Lu family.”","The servant said helplessly, “Young Master, I’m just a servant. How would I dare to make a recording?! Moreover, what good will the recording do for me? I wouldn’t dare!”","Even though Lu Xiang was slow-witted, she could not help but react at this moment. This servant had deliberately tricked her just now. She must have recorded everything she said just now. If this recording was leaked, the Lu family’s secret that they had kept for many years would be exposed.","The corners of Lu Yan’s mouth curled up into a vicious smile. He waved at the people behind him. The bodyguards behind him walked forward and grabbed the servant. They searched her carefully, but they did not find any recording equipment.","Lu Yan even suspected that she had a pinhole camera on her. Then, he ordered his men to check the servant’s hair, ears, and even the soles of her shoes. However, they still did not find anything.","Was it really just a misunderstanding? This servant did not look like she was pretending. Could it be that she just happened to say those words?","Lu Yan was still worried. He sent someone to search the bodies of the others. After confirming that there were no recording devices, Lu Yan felt even more uneasy. If the person recording was not at the scene, then...","He suddenly thought of something and stopped breathing. He hurriedly left the ancestral hall. The ancestral hall was surrounded by his people. If that person had been standing outside and recording it, they would have been captured long ago!","After a while, Lu Yan’s assistant rushed over. “Young Master, we’ve looked everywhere but found nothing.”","Lu Yan frowned and did not look too good.","“Young Master, one side of the ancestral hall is guarded by our people, while the other side is guarded by Assistant Ji, the man beside Chairman Lu. He said that he didn’t find any suspicious people. He’s gone to check the surveillance cameras.”","Assistant Ji, the man beside his grandfather?","Lu Yan was deep in thought. Assistant Ji came to the Lu family two years ago. He was careful and serious. Grandpa kept him by his side to handle the trivial matters around him.","This person had a weak character and was loyal to his grandfather. Knowing that he was looking into anyone suspicious, Assistant Ji would definitely cooperate with him. Since Assistant Ji was even going to check the surveillance footage, it meant that he was not hiding anything.","They searched the ancestral hall but found nothing. Could it be that Lu Yan was too sensitive?","Lu Yan even suspected that that person had already run out of the ancestral hall, so he went to search the entire Lu family. However, he still didn’t find anything.","Lu Xiang was uneasy. “If the recording is leaked out, I...”","“Don’t worry.” Lu Yan retracted his gaze. “Maybe we’re thinking too much. If someone really recorded it, there would definitely be traces.”","Lu Xiang heaved a sigh of relief, but when she thought about how Lu Qingyun’s memorial tablet was still in the ancestral hall, she gritted her teeth in hatred. “But Lu Qingyun’s memorial tablet is placed in the ancestral hall. When it’s time to worship the ancestors, we’ll all have to kneel. Are we going to kneel to that b*tch, Lu Qingyun?”"]},{"number":1125,"title":"Chapter 1125 - Those Who Do Great Things Don’t","paragraphs":["Lu Xiang’s heart was filled with unwillingness. Why should she kneel down to Lu Qingyun? This was absolutely impossible!","Lu Yan’s expression was calm. After a moment of silence, he said indifferently, “Aunt, she’s already a dead person. So what if we kneel down to her? So what if we offer incense?”","“But Lu Qingyun...”","Before Lu Xiang could finish, Lu Yan waved his hand and interrupted her. “You’re the daughter of the Lu family now. You’re the madam of the Lu family, while she doesn’t even have a corpse. So what if we put her memorial tablet in the ancestral hall? It’s just a piece of wood. It’s meaningless! Only the living are the winners. She has long disappeared from this world.”","Lu Yan said casually, “Those who achieve great things don’t care about small matters. If you can’t even accept this small grievance, how can you manage the Lu family in the future? Our Lu family is a long-standing family. Even if we hate Lu Qingyun, we can’t throw her memorial tablet out, lest others use this against us.”","Hearing Lu Yan’s words, Lu Xiang’s expression softened a little. She had to admit that Lu Yan’s words made sense. Lu Qingyun had been dead for so many years. What was placed in the ancestral hall now was just a piece of wood. She was the final winner!","Lu Xiang glanced around and confirmed that what she had just said was not recorded. They were just too sensitive. Her tone softened. “That’s right. So what if we put Lu Qingyun’s memorial tablet in the ancestral hall? She was hated by the Lu family when she was alive. She’s only qualified to enter the ancestral hall after she died. How laughable!”","The corners of Lu Yan’s mouth curled up as a trace of viciousness appeared in his eyes.","...","Longwan Residential.","Qiao Xi leaned against the bed and quietly listened to the news from Ji Nan. “Eldest Miss, it’s done.”","She nodded in satisfaction. “That servant from the Lu family is one of yours?”","Hearing her question, Ji Nan instantly choked and was a little hesitant. “No, no...”","Qiao Xi hurriedly straightened up, and her gaze was slightly surprised. She almost bit her tongue. “What? She’s not one of yours?”","Even Lu Yan sensed that the servant was deliberately angering Lu Xiang and making her say those words in public. Of course, Qiao Xi also realized that something was wrong. The servant clearly knew that Ji Nan was recording, so she deliberately led Lu Xiang to say those words.","If that servant was not Ji Nan’s subordinate, who was she?","Hearing Qiao Xi’s surprised voice, Ji Nan cleared his throat and said, “Eldest Miss, actually, I don’t know what’s going on either. I originally planned to anger Lu Xiang myself, but I didn’t expect that the servant would beat me to it just as I was about to enter. Immediately after, Lu Yan even ordered people to search the servants there, but they didn’t find anything.”","Qiao Xi held her chin and pondered for a few seconds before a thought suddenly flashed through her mind.","On the other end of the phone, Ji Nan added, “The ancestral hall was surrounded by Lu Yan’s people. The servant angered Lu Xiang to say those words, but she didn’t record it. Moreover, I don’t know her. Perhaps the servant couldn’t stand Lu Xiang’s actions and casually said a few words.”","Casually?","Qiao Xi did not think that the servant’s words were casual. Every word was clearly meant to infuriate Lu Xiang. If she were really an ordinary servant, she would have taken out the ancestral tablet the moment Lu Xiang got angry. However, she revealed Lu Xiang’s true colors with just a few words. Coincidentally, Ji Nan was outside the door at that moment, recording the scene.","The servant seemed to have predicted that Ji Nan would come and was already prepared. She did not have any recording equipment on her, but everything she did was to help Ji Nan record the conversation. Even so, Ji Nan said that the servant was not one of his people.","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows as a trace of interest flashed past her eyes. “Have you found out the identity of that servant?”","Ji Nan was silent for a few seconds before he said in a subtle tone, “Eldest Miss, I’ve already investigated, but this servant is just an ordinary person. Her family background is average. When she heard that the Lu family paid a high salary, she applied to become their servant. She’s been here for a few years. Nothing has gone wrong during this period of time. It’s because Lu Yan didn’t find anything that he can’t look for trouble with this servant.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly. It was indeed too much of a coincidence. The servant’s appearance and every word she said seemed to have been carefully planned.","After a while, Ji Nan said mysteriously, “Eldest Miss, I think there’s another group of people in the Lu family. They’re very mysterious. They seem to be spies planted in the Lu family.”","Qiao Xi’s tone was indifferent. “Oh.”","“This group of people is very capable. They’re clearly using us to scheme against Lu Xiang and Lu Yan. After the truth is exposed, their hands will be clean of the matter and everything will be pushed to us!” Ji Nan sighed."]},{"number":1126,"title":"Chapter 1126 - The Inheritance Is His Life","paragraphs":["Ji Nan frowned and said, “What’s even more shocking is that those people seem to know that I’m an undercover spy in the Lu family, so they specially arranged for a servant to anger Lu Xiang when I appeared.”","Qiao Xi nodded. The maid and Ji Nan were not in the same group. This was why even when Lu Yan noticed that something was wrong, he was not able to find the recording equipment. This was indeed a mission that could only be completed by two separate parties. This way, no one would notice.","However, from the looks of it, the other party did not seem to have any ill intentions. It was more like they were helping Ji Nan. After all, if Ji Nan had personally angered Lu Xiang today, it was very likely that his identity would be exposed.","So who exactly sent the servant? Qiao Xi thought for a few seconds and suddenly thought of the most likely person. Everything was arranged so appropriately. Who else could it be?","However, how did Gu Zheng know Ji Nan’s identity? Or he didn’t know who she had planted in the Lu family and only knew that such a person existed, so he deliberately got the servant to put on an act? As for whether Ji Nan could record any useful evidence, that would depend on his own performance.","“Eldest Miss?” Ji Nan did not hear Qiao Xi’s response for a long time, so he spoke in confusion.","Qiao Xi smiled and replied lazily, “It’s fine. They won’t hurt you.”","Ji Nan was still a little worried. “Eldest Miss, it’s not that I’m afraid they’ll hurt me, but we don’t know their identities yet. If they threaten you...”","“No, they’re our people.” Qiao Xi chuckled. “I already know their identities.”","He was the only one who could place a servant in the Lu family in advance and who could make Lu Yan unable to find anything wrong with her.","After hanging up, Qiao Xi pondered for a moment and decided to test Gu Zheng.","At this moment, Gu Zheng had already found out that Ji Nan had recorded the video, but he was still focused on handling the documents with a calm expression.","Song Shijing stood in front of him and said respectfully, “President, the Lu family can’t hide their wild ambitions anymore. It doesn’t matter to you even if you can’t enter the ancestral hall to worship your ancestors. So why are Lu Xiang and Lu Yan still...”","Gu Zheng put down the document in his hand and looked up lazily. “You want to ask why they naively think I care? Then think carefully about what they’re most afraid of losing.”","Song Shijing pondered for a moment and replied tentatively, “All these years, Lu Xiang has hated her identity as an illegitimate daughter. She has always wanted to be the legitimate daughter of the Lu family, but even after Madam Lu Qingyun passed away, she can only be the second daughter of the Lu family. That’s why she’s colluding with Lu Yan. She wants to completely control the Lu family and become the madam of the Lu family. What she’s most afraid of is losing her status and power.","“As for Lu Yan, he was raised as the heir of the Gu and Lu families since he was young. Now, he no longer has any hope of becoming the heir of the Gu family. However, with Old Master Lu’s full support, he has already become the president of Lu Corporation. This is all he has now, so he’s most afraid of losing his identity as the heir of the Lu family.","“To Lu Yan, the inheritance is his life. If he loses it, he’ll have nothing left.”","Gu Zheng’s long fingers tapped lightly on the table as he said in a low voice, “Yes, the inheritance is his life. That’s why Lu Yan is worried about losing it.”","Now that Lu Yan had already become crazy, he would not allow anyone to snatch his position as the heir. Hence, he was afraid of Gu Zheng and was worried that when Gu Zheng returned to the Lu family one day, he would no longer be the only choice for the Lu family.","He stubbornly thought that Gu Zheng wanted to snatch back the Lu family’s inheritance, so he had to hold on to his power and identity. However, he did not know that everything he cared about was trash in Gu Zheng’s eyes.","Gu Zheng’s voice was very calm, but it was filled with coldness. “I’ve never thought of occupying the Lu family. I just want to see Lu Yan suffer.”","If he took away the inheritance, Lu Yan would probably be in so much pain that he wished he were dead! Lu Yan would be unwilling, angry, and question him why he was still fighting for Lu Corporation when he already had Gu Corporation.","Lu Yan had probably forgotten that the Lu family’s things originally belonged to Lu Qingyun, and Gu Zheng was Lu Qingyun’s son. Gu Zheng had every right to take back all of these things. Even if he did not need them, he would rather destroy them than leave them to Lu Yan, who was occupying the family’s territory, and Lu Xiang, who caused the death of her own biological sister.","Song Shijing sighed in his heart. If it were not for Lu Yan and his mother, the president might have had a happy childhood. He could not help but say, “President, even if you don’t want the Lu family’s inheritance, you can’t leave it to Lu Yan. We have to seek justice for Madam Lu and make everyone pay the price!”"]},{"number":1127,"title":"Chapter 1127 - They’re My Family","paragraphs":["After Song Shijing finished speaking, he saw that Gu Zheng’s expression did not change. Instead, Gu Zheng smiled calmly. “President, you’ve been tolerating the Lu family all these years. Now, you can finally hold your head high.”","All these years, no matter what the Lu family did, the president would turn a blind eye. Even though he was capable enough to crush the Lu family, the president still did not retaliate. Ever since he married Young Madam, the president had started to attack the Lu family.","Song Shijing had always thought that the president was tolerating it because of kinship, but the Lu family did not appreciate it at all. Instead, they became even more aggressive and even targeted Young Madam. That was why the president finally chose to resist.","Hearing Song Shijing’s words, Gu Zheng sneered and raised an eyebrow at him. “You’ve been by my side for so many years. Do you think I’m such a tolerant person?”","Song Shijing choked.","Gu Zheng’s deep eyes were filled with a cold smile. His thin lips parted slightly as he said word by word, “Killing them directly or destroying the Lu family will be letting them off easy. I just want to see them fall into pain and despair bit by bit. They’ll gradually be devoured by desire and be consigned to eternal damnation.”","Song Shijing’s heart trembled. In order to make the Lu family suffer, Gu Zheng should let them watch as the family’s hundred years of hard work declined in their hands. Such pain was equivalent to cutting their hearts out.","Hence, the president had never tolerated the Lu family all these years. Instead, he was secretly paving the way and guiding the Lu family into the trap he set up. Lu Corporation was far inferior to how it was a few years ago. Coupled with Lu Yan’s wrong judgments, the company lost nearly 20 billion yuan. Now, Lu Corporation was already in a precarious situation.","At this moment, there was a knock on the door. Qiao Xi pushed the door open and walked straight in front of Gu Zheng.","That servant entered the Lu family a few years ago. With Gu Zheng’s methods, he had definitely done more than just plant a spy. It was likely that nothing that happened in the Lu family would be able to get past him, but Qiao Xi did not understand. Gu Zheng had already completely controlled the Lu family in his hands. Why had he not attacked the Lu family? Why was he even tolerating the Lu family that were like little fleas jumping around on his head?","Although the Lu family’s business was getting worse by the year, they still had a hundred years of foundation. The Lu family was still a noble family in Li City. Even though Lu Yan knew that he could not win against Gu Zheng, he was still struggling tenaciously. This meant that Gu Zheng had never been ruthless and always left the Lu family with a chance of survival.","At this moment, Qiao Xi suddenly sensed that something was wrong. Gu Zheng knew that Lu Qingyun’s death was related to the Lu family. Although he had yet to investigate clearly, he had the ability to make the Lu family disappear from Li City and make these scumbags pay the price they deserved.","Qiao Xi abruptly raised her eyes, and her burning gaze landed on Gu Zheng.","Song Shijing was shocked. Did Young Madam know about the servant? Or was she here to explain Ji Nan’s identity? After all, this was between the couple. He should leave first.","However, before Song Shijing could leave, Qiao Xi frowned and asked seriously, “Ah Zheng, the Lu family has already stepped on your toes. Why are you still keeping them around?”","Gu Zheng froze instantly. Song Shijing did not expect Young Madam to suddenly come in just to ask this. He had asked this question just now, and the president gave him a clear answer.","The reason why he kept the Lu family around was to watch them fall into pain and despair bit by bit. They would gradually be devoured by desire and be doomed.","The president was good at attacking the spots where it hurt most. The best way to make the Lu family suffer was not to overthrow the Lu family overnight but to let Old Master Lu and Lu Yan see hope but gradually fall into despair. When the Lu family could not make a comeback, they would suffer even more. This punishment was the most terrifying.","Previously, the president’s tolerance was not because of their relationship. He did not treat the Lu family as family at all. From the moment he went to the Lu family to seek help and was chased out, the Lu family had become the target of his revenge.","Song Shijing thought that he could answer Young Madam directly and say that the president wanted to take revenge on the Lu family. He wanted the Lu family to collapse in despair and receive the punishment they deserved. Just as he was about to explain, however...","“No matter what, the Lu family is my mother’s family. They’re considered my relatives by blood.” Gu Zheng’s voice was calm and even a little helpless.","Song Shijing choked on the words in his mouth. His body stiffened as he looked at Gu Zheng in shock.","Did he hear wrongly? The president said that he had familial affection for the Lu family?"]},{"number":1128,"title":"Chapter 1128 - Ah Zheng Is The Best Man In The World","paragraphs":["Hearing Gu Zheng’s words, Qiao Xi’s heart instantly ached. She originally thought that Gu Zheng was tolerating the Lu family because he wanted to destroy the Lu family bit by bit and make them gradually collapse.","When Ji Nan mentioned the servant’s identity, Qiao Xi realized that Gu Zheng had arranged for his people to stay in the Lu family many years ago. Even Ji Nan did not notice it, which meant that Gu Zheng was already prepared to take revenge.","10 years ago, Gu Zheng established Gu Corporation. From then on, the Lu family was no longer in a position to fight him. At that time, the Lu family had already begun to decline without Lu Qingyun. However, this change was small. Hence, although Gu Zheng had already started to guard against the Lu family, he had never attacked them.","Gu Zheng raised his eyes to glance at Qiao Xi with a disappointed expression. He smiled bitterly and said, “It’s my fault for still having slight hopes about them, but they’ve never taken me to heart.”","Song Shijing: “???” ‘President, what’s there to be disappointed about? Can you stop pretending?’","Today, he finally understood why Song Shiyu kept calling the president a bastard. This man was too scheming. He was the same even with his wife. He was pretending to be pitiful in front of Young Madam to gain sympathy!","Fortunately, he was the one standing in the study now. After all, he was very tight-lipped and knew how to observe people’s expressions. He would not expose the president. If Song Shiyu were here, he would definitely expose the president’s true colors on the spot!","Gu Zheng glanced at Song Shijing calmly. There was no warning in his eyes, nor did it seem as if he was pretending to be pitiful or guilty. It was as if everything was real.","In front of Qiao Xi, Gu Zheng lowered his eyes in loneliness. His soft hair covered his eyes, making him look like a pitiful and gentle dog. He was extremely sad. “Let bygones be bygones. Since the Lu family isn’t willing to acknowledge me, then I don’t have to treat them as family.”","Qiao Xi’s heart almost ached to death. How old was Gu Zheng back then?! He established Gu Corporation and endured the double pressure of the Lu and Gu families. He hoped for the support of his family, but those people from the Lu family actually had the heart to hurt him. Actually, he was a man with a soft heart. It was just that he was forced to grow up after countless schemes.","“Ah Zheng, there are rumors outside that you’re vicious and irritable. Actually, they don’t understand you at all. You’re clearly very kind and have given them countless chances,” Qiao Xi said gently. Ah Zheng was the best man in the world. Even if he did something vicious, it was because he was forced to. He was still a gentle and kind man!","Song Shijing: “...” ‘Wow! I’m going to vomit!’","One of them was pretending to be weak, while the other was pretending to be pitiful. The two of them were really a match made in heaven! Was there a point in pretending like this?","Song Shijing endured the discomfort and walked out of the study. At this moment, only the couple was left in the room. Only then did Qiao Xi remember her original intention of looking for Gu Zheng.","She leaned against Gu Zheng’s shoulder and said with a smile, “Ah Zheng, they’ll definitely play tricks on us during the Lu family’s ancestral worship ceremony this time, so what do you plan to do?”","The corners of Gu Zheng’s lips curled up, and his deep eyes were filled with a doting smile. He lowered his head, his hot breath spraying on her ear as he asked softly, “Xi Xi, what good ideas do you have?”","“Ah Zheng, you’re so smart, so you should’ve already arranged for your own people in the Lu family, right? Even if Lu Yan makes things difficult for you, you’ll definitely be able to resolve the problems. You should have something on the Lu family, right?” Qiao Xi carefully probed.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were calm. After a moment of silence, he pretended to be puzzled. “What do you mean?”","The anger in Qiao Xi’s heart instantly surged. She already knew that the bastard had planted people in the Lu family, yet he was still pretending?","However, for the sake of avoiding being exposed, Qiao Xi still said patiently, “With your intelligence, you must’ve already thought of a way to solve those problems when they crop up, right?”","The smile in Gu Zheng’s eyes grew wider. Teasing Mrs. Gu was really a delight.","A moment later, Gu Zheng cleared his throat and replied seriously, “Mrs. Gu, you’re right. I’ve indeed come up with a way.”","Qiao Xi suddenly became nervous. When Gu Zheng asked her about Ji Nan later, how should she explain it? After all, at that time, she did not know that Gu Zheng was Mo Yuan and did not know the Lu family at all.","Just as Qiao Xi was deep in thought, Gu Zheng pulled her into his embrace and let her lean into his embrace. His voice was gentle as he said, “I originally didn’t want to tell you these things, but since you asked, then I’ll tell you. A few years ago, I arranged for a servant to secretly enter the Lu family. She angered Lu Xiang today and made her say some compromising words in public.”"]},{"number":1129,"title":"Chapter 1129 - Saved Ji Nan’s Life","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi nodded. As expected, that servant was one of Gu Zheng’s people. What the servant did earlier today was probably Gu Zheng’s idea, but how was he going to explain what happened after that?","Gu Zheng saw the doubt in her eyes and added, “Chairman Lu has an assistant by his side called Ji Nan.”","When Qiao Xi heard this name, her entire body instantly stiffened. Sure enough, Gu Zheng already knew that Ji Nan was one of hers, but Ji Nan had remained hidden for so long. How did Gu Zheng discover him?","“Ji Nan...” The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled up as he said casually, “Ji Nan’s secretary is one of my people as well.”","Qiao Xi: “!!!”","Her ears buzzed, and her heart skipped a beat.","Ji Nan’s secretary?","Gu Zheng knew the truth, but he did not expose her. Instead, he continued, “Ji Nan is Chairman Lu’s personal assistant. Of course, Ji Nan will hire a secretary to handle miscellaneous matters. This secretary can be hired by Ji Nan himself. Besides, the Lu family won’t investigate the identity of a secretary.","“Ever since Ji Nan joined the Lu family as an assistant, I’ve arranged for a secretary to follow Ji Nan. Today, Ji Nan recorded a video when no one was paying attention. If the Lu family makes things difficult for me, this can be used to threaten the Lu family.”","Qiao Xi was silent for a short while before asking with a strange expression, “The person you arranged is Ji Nan’s secretary, not Ji Nan himself?”","Gu Zheng smiled and nodded. “Of course. Ji Nan is Chairman Lu’s personal assistant. No matter how powerful I am, I can’t bribe Chairman Lu’s trusted aide. Although Ji Nan has only been by Chairman Lu’s side for two years, he’s especially valued. Everything in the Lu family is handed to Ji Nan to handle. He can even speak on behalf of Chairman Lu. Even Lu Yan respects this assistant very much. Mrs. Gu, do you think he can be bribed by me?”","Qiao Xi said, “Uh...”","The glint in Gu Zheng’s eyes grew brighter as he asked casually, “Why would you ask about Ji Nan, Mrs. Gu? Could it be that Ji Nan was really planted in the Lu family by someone else?”","Qiao Xi gulped nervously. “Um... I heard you mention Ji Nan, so I just asked casually.”","Gu Zheng smiled meaningfully. “Just because I mentioned Ji Nan, you guessed that he was bribed? Could it be that you... know the inside story?”","Qiao Xi blinked and pretended to be calm as she smiled charmingly. “Oh, I was really just asking casually. Ji Nan is in an important position. If he’s been bribed, then it can only mean that Chairman Lu is too stupid!”","Although she said that, Qiao Xi’s heart was filled with disdain. The Lu family was indeed hopelessly stupid. Gu Zheng was so outstanding, yet they insisted on supporting Lu Yan, whose aptitude was average.","Seeing the change in Qiao Xi’s expression, Gu Zheng suddenly chuckled. “Mrs. Gu, you have a point. Since his position is so important, it looks like we should find a chance to get rid of him.”","Qiao Xi: “!!!” ‘Damn you! He’s my subordinate!’","The smile on her face gradually disappeared. Ji Nan was her subordinate. If he died in Gu Zheng’s hands, who could she reason with? Hence, she gritted her teeth and said with difficulty, “I think...”","Gu Zheng smiled even more arrogantly. Before he met Qiao Xi, he had never smiled like this. If he continued to tease Mrs. Gu, Mrs. Gu would be exposed. At that time, she would inevitably be angry with him.","Gu Zheng restrained his smile and said in a gentle voice, “Mrs. Gu, don’t be nervous. I’m not an unreasonable person. Although Ji Nan is the man by Chairman Lu’s side, he has never harmed me. Why should I attack the innocent?”","Only then did Qiao Xi’s expression ease up a little. She had finally saved Ji Nan’s life. From what Gu Zheng said, he did not know that Ji Nan was one of her people.","She sized Gu Zheng up seriously a few more times. Seeing that his expression was normal, she was relieved. Fortunately, Gu Zheng did not notice. If she was discovered, her weak image would be ruined.","After testing the waters, Qiao Xi left in relief.","After a while, Song Shijing walked in, wanting to report on the company. Unexpectedly, as soon as he entered, he saw Gu Zheng’s cold expression. His eyes were vicious, and he exuded a cold aura.","“President, what’s wrong?” Song Shijing asked.","Gu Zheng frowned, his eyes revealing a trace of impatience. His tone was cold. “Who let you in? Get lost!”","Song Shijing was shocked. Didn’t the president ask him to come in and report? Had he forgotten what he had just said? Now that he knew the president was in a bad mood, he’d better get out!","Just as he was about to turn around and leave, Qiao Xi suddenly returned. She pushed the door open and rushed in while shouting, “Ah Zheng!”"]},{"number":1130,"title":"Chapter 1130 - This Person Actually Has Two Personalities! Translator: Henyee Transl","paragraphs":["As soon as Qiao Xi spoke, the coldness in the entire study dissipated, and the pressure around them disappeared. Then, Song Shijing saw Gu Zheng, who had a vicious expression just now, looking up gently and smiling affectionately. “Xi Xi, is there anything else?”","Song Shijing: “!!!” Gu Zheng had become a different person from before!","Qiao Xi seemed to have noticed that the atmosphere in the study was not right. She blinked and asked, “Ah Zheng, you don’t look too good. What’s wrong?”","Song Shijing was instantly nervous. He had just entered to report his work and the president told him to get lost. Would he be angry with Young Madam now?","Gu Zheng’s tone was gentle. “No! I’m probably a little tired.”","On this day, Song Shijing finally knew what kind of person the president was. This person had two personalities!","Fortunately, he was different from Song Shiyu. No matter how shocked and dissatisfied he was, he would only complain in his heart. He would not show it on his face, and the president would certainly not notice his emotions. He was a mature man!","Qiao Xi’s sudden return was actually not for anything important. When she saw that Gu Zheng’s face was slightly pale, she reminded him with heartache, “It’s getting late. Sleep early. We still have to go to the Lu family’s place tomorrow.”","Gu Zheng smiled and nodded. He was gentle like a bright boy.","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi returned to her room to rest.","Song Shijing wondered if he could get off work now that Young Madam had asked the president to rest. Just as he said excitedly, “President, you should rest. I’ll...”","“What’s the meaning of this? As your boss, I haven’t gotten off work yet, yet you’re thinking of slacking off?” The gentleness in Gu Zheng’s eyes instantly vanished.","Song Shijing’s heart sank. This man was so gentle in front of Young Madam. But when Young Madam was not around, he was like a demon!","He complained crazily in his heart, but he still replied respectfully, “Alright, President. I’ll go ahead with my report, then.”","By the time the two of them were done with the company’s matters, it was already 10 at night. Gu Zheng’s vision was a little blurry, and there were waves of sharp pain. Recently, his vision had been getting worse.","“President, since you’re going to the Lu family’s house tomorrow, do you need me to deal with the rumors outside first?” Song Shijing asked.","“There’s no need.” Gu Zheng leaned against the chair and closed his eyes to rest.","“But the rumors outside are very disadvantageous to you now. Chairman Lu has been unconscious for a long time. Many people are saying that you caused it. If this goes on, tomorrow...”","Gu Zheng said casually, “They’re right. I’m indeed the one who caused Chairman Lu to fall into a coma.”","Song Shijing: “...” That was indeed the case, and it could be said that the Lu family had not wronged the president this time. However, such rumors would affect the president’s wise and divine image!","He really could not understand the president’s mind!","...","In the Lu family’s mansion.","Everyone gathered in Old Master Lu’s room. The atmosphere was very gloomy. Old Master Lu, who should have woken up a long time ago, was still unconscious.","Originally, the old master was only pretending to be sick as he wanted Gu Zheng to give up 5% of the shares. That way, not only would he be able to keep the shares, but he would also make Gu Zheng bear the infamy of being unfilial. At that time, Gu Zheng would not have the right to fight for the position of heir.","However, no one expected that the old master would really fall sick.","A few days ago, the family doctor said that he would wake up by today at the latest. The old master did show signs of waking up, but he had only opened his eyes for a moment before falling unconscious again.","The old master was the head of the family. The matters relating to the ancestral worship ceremony still needed to be decided by the old master. It was still uncertain whether they should let Gu Zheng enter the ancestral hall or not.","The family doctor’s forehead was covered in a cold sweat. He had already done a full-body check-up on the old master. His vital signs were normal, and there was no poison in his body. Logically speaking, the old master should have woken up long ago, but he was still unconscious.","Although he was unconscious, he looked more like he had fallen asleep. His expression was relaxed, and his breathing was normal. He would even turn over on his own, but he would not wake up no matter how much they shouted.","Lu Xiang’s expression darkened as she cursed, “You piece of trash! The Lu family spends so much money on you every year, but you can’t even treat the old master’s illness? When will the old master wake up?”","The family doctor endured Lu Xiang’s curses with a helpless expression. Actually, he thought that Old Master Lu was pretending to be sick!","Previously, when the old master first fell unconscious, he had indeed detected poison in the old master’s body, but the dosage was very small. It would not be long before the old master woke up. Now, there was no poison in the old master’s body anymore and everything was normal. Hence, there could only be one reason why he had not woken up."]},{"number":1131,"title":"Chapter 1131 - Rumors","paragraphs":["The family doctor looked suspiciously at Old Master Lu, who was lying on the bed, then at Lu Yan. Before he entered, he had clearly heard this group of people say that they would not let President Gu attend the ancestral worship ceremony. Previously, the old master seemed to have fainted because of this. Could it be that the old master wanted President Gu to bear the responsibility for his illness?","However, he was just a family doctor. The Lu family was considered his boss, so he naturally would not say anything. He had no say over the grudges between these noble families. It would be troublesome if he offended the Lu family.","Hence, he could only pretend not to know anything and say helplessly, “After all, the old master is old. He’s been unconscious for a long time now, and his health was poor to begin with. Even though he woke up for a short while today, he hasn’t completely recovered. The poison is still in his body. I’ll prescribe some medicine to nurse the old master back to health and try to wake him up as soon as possible.”","Hearing the doctor’s answer, Lu Yan’s expression softened a little, but then his eyes were filled with coldness and doubt. Who poisoned the old master? During this period of time, the old master had been surrounded by the Lu family’s trusted aides. Who could poison the old master in front of everyone?","Could it be that the person who poisoned him did not want the old master to attend the ancestral worship ceremony?","The family doctor glanced at Lu Yan and was very puzzled. Didn’t Lu Yan know that Old Master Lu was pretending to be sick?","Everyone had a tacit understanding that Old Master Lu was pretending to be sick. Moreover, there were only the Lu family members in this room. However, Lu Yan was pretending to be angry as if he was very worried about Old Master Lu.","The family doctor’s heart was filled with disdain. Lu Yan was too scheming. President Gu was a much better person. He was more suitable to be the heir of the Lu family.","...","The next morning, the Lu family was about to hold the ancestral worship ceremony. The descendants of the Lu family all came to the Lu family’s mansion.","The ancestral worship ceremony was the largest family banquet of the year where all the members of the Lu family would gather. At this moment, the Lu family’s mansion was filled with people. Fortunately, the Lu family had a deep foundation in Li City, and there were several villas around. Hence, all the Lu family members who came to pay respects to their ancestors stayed near the mansion.","In order to fulfill the agreement, Lu Yan naturally arranged a place for Gu Zheng to stay. However, everyone knew very well that whether Gu Zheng could participate in the ancestral worship ceremony or not depended on Old Master Lu’s nod of approval.","Paying respects to the ancestors was a big matter for the entire family. Gu Zheng had been wandering outside for so many years and had yet to be listed in the family register. He had not received the recognition of the rest of the Lu family, so whether he could enter the ancestral hall to pay his respects depended on the old master.","However... they heard that the old master was still unconscious.","On the other hand, Qiao Xi had just gotten into the car when her phone rang a few times. She took her phone and saw that she had received messages from Xue Yi: [Xi Xi, your husband has gotten into trouble recently. There are more and more rumors online, and they’ve already seriously affected Gu Zheng’s reputation. Besides the Lu family, who else dares to badmouth Gu Zheng behind his back?]","Who else in Li City would dare to go against Gu Zheng apart from the Lu family?","Xue Yi: [I heard people talking about Gu Zheng yesterday. I didn’t expect things to be even worse today. The rumors have spread throughout Li City. They said that if it weren’t for Gu Zheng, Chairman Lu would have woken up a long time ago. That man is old, so what does his sudden illness have to do with Gu Zheng? I’m really speechless! Why is the Lu family always targeting you and Gu Zheng?!]","Qiao Xi replied with a helpless emoji.","Xue Yi continued: [If they have a grudge against Gu Zheng, then they should just talk about Gu Zheng! Why would they bully you?! Are the Lu family’s brains fried? With your strength and methods, if you really wanted that old man to die, you could have sent him to hell with one move. Why would you need to poison him?]","Qiao Xi, who had indeed poisoned Old Master Lu: [...] Well, wasn’t this awkward?","Xue Yi was indignant: [This group of people from the Lu family is unscrupulous for power and shares. They’ve gone crazy. Fortunately, Gu Zheng didn’t grow up in the Lu family. Otherwise, he would definitely have become a lunatic! Little Six, I can’t interfere if the Lu family wants to look for trouble with Gu Zheng, but you must tell me if they bully you. I’ll tear down the roof of the Lu family!]","Qiao Xi was slightly nervous. She did not tell Xue Yi that she had poisoned Old Master Lu. She would maintain a weak and kind image in Xue Yi’s heart!","The car slowly stopped at the entrance of the Lu family’s mansion. Then, under the guidance of the security guards, they entered the basement. The people from the Lu branch family had already arrived at the Lu family’s mansion a day ago. The people arriving now were all from the Lu family who lived in Li City and were not far away.","After Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng got out of the car, they did not meet any acquaintances on the way, nor did anyone stop them. They successfully entered the Lu family’s mansion."]},{"number":1132,"title":"Chapter 1132 - This Is Called Returning Something To Its Owner","paragraphs":["“Ah Zheng, where are we staying?” Qiao Xi raised her head and looked at the main building of the Lu family’s residence. She chuckled. “This is the main residence, right? Old Master Lu, Old Madam Lu, Lu Xiang, and Lu Yan have been living quite well!”","Old Master Lu was a direct descendant of the Lu family, but he only had a few descendants. The old master’s first wife had passed away, and the eldest daughter, Lu Qingyun, had also passed away. Now that he had announced to the public that Lu Yan was Lu Qingyun’s biological son, the position of heir naturally fell to him. He naturally had the right to stay in the main residence.","Logically speaking, Gu Zheng should stay in the main residence. After all, he had already proven that he was Lu Qingyun’s biological son. No matter Lu Yan’s identity, Gu Zheng’s identity was unquestionable.","Even if the Lu family refused to let Qiao Xi enter the main residence, Gu Zheng had the qualifications to enter.","The corners of Gu Zheng’s lips curled up slightly, but his eyes were filled with coldness. He looked up at the luxurious mansion. He rarely came to the Lu family’s residence since he was young. The last time he came here was to ask for help. He never stepped into the Lu family’s main residence again.","In the past, Huang Lilan was afraid that he would disturb Lu Yan, so she would never allow him to come to the Lu family. However, he would secretly run over when no one was paying attention. He only wanted to see her from afar. He would appear very satisfied just seeing that she was still alive.","Now that he had officially entered the Lu family and was respected by everyone, he did not feel happy at all because that person was no longer around.","Gu Zheng restrained the cold expression on his face and said gently, “Xi Xi, do you like this mansion?”","Qiao Xi smiled and replied, “Yes, I like it. This designer is very thoughtful, and every part of the design is very fitting. Moreover, the scenery around the villa is very beautiful. This should be the best residential building here.”","Gu Zheng said faintly, “I like it too.”","Qiao Xi was stunned for a moment. She simply said she liked this mansion, but Gu Zheng’s words made her hear intense desire. He wanted to snatch this mansion and even control the entire Lu family.","As expected, Gu Zheng chuckled. “Since you like it, Xi Xi, I’ll snatch the mansion for you.”","Hearing this, Song Shiyu pursed his lips at Song Shijing. His expression seemed to say, ‘The president is so domineering! Why would Young Madam like such a violent and domineering man?’","The next second, Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with admiration as she said, “Ah Zheng, you’re so powerful! But we’re civilized people. How can you call taking back what belongs to you stealing? This is called returning something to its rightful owner!”","Song Shiyu looked terrified. No wonder the president liked Young Madam. The couple was the same kind of people! Young Madam was even more domineering than the president!","Everyone from the Lu family had lived in this mansion for so many years. With just one sentence from Young Madam, the owner of this mansion had changed. She did not take the Lu family seriously at all!","Gu Zheng stroked her smooth cheek gently and smiled dotingly. “Xi Xi, you’re so smart.”","Qiao Xi raised her head and smiled proudly. This mansion was designed by Miss Lu Qingyun when she was alive. Moreover, if it were not for the support of Lu Qingyun’s biological mother, would the Lu family’s current huge mansion exist?","Back then, the old madam’s will stated that the mansion would be left to Lu Qingyun. After Lu Qingyun passed away, the will stated that it would be left to her biological son. That person was Gu Zheng!","Lu Yan had pretended to be Gu Zheng for more than 20 years, but he was just an impostor. He would never be able to replace Gu Zheng. He would be exposed sooner or later.","Qiao Xi sized up the mansion in front of her. Before long, this would be her asset. She had already thought of throwing away all the things that the Lu family had used and renovating the house to become her and Gu Zheng’s home.","However, now...","“Ah Zheng, where are we staying?” Qiao Xi asked.","Gu Zheng said softly, “Yun Court.”","Qiao Xi nodded. She knew about Yun Court. Ji Nan had been in the Lu family for two years and had passed on the news of the Lu family to her. Yun Court was Lu Qingyun’s former residence.","The eldest daughter of the Lu family did not live in the main residence but in a remote courtyard. This was because the mansion left behind by her biological mother was occupied by the mistress and the illegitimate daughter, Lu Xiang. There was no longer a place for her in the Lu family. Hence, her moving to a remote place might be a good thing.","She heard from Ji Nan that although Yun Court was remote, the courtyard was very spacious. The villa was also designed to give off a warm atmosphere. There was also a garden, but after Eldest Miss Lu passed away, no one stepped into Yun Court anymore. The place became a wasteland."]},{"number":1133,"title":"Chapter 1133 - Can I Have Both?","paragraphs":["Old Master Lu valued his reputation and had always maintained the image of a great father. Hence, he announced to the public that he was afraid of messing the place up, so he did not dare to step into Yun Court again. He also did not allow anyone to disturb Lu Qingyun’s former home. Now, the Lu family actually let Gu Zheng stay there. What did this mean?","Qiao Xi grunted lightly. “Chairman Lu actually arranged for you to stay in Eldest Miss Lu’s former residence. It sounds like a reasonable arrangement. Even if outsiders know that you’re not staying in the main residence, they won’t think that the Lu family is treating you badly.","“But outsiders don’t know what Yun Court is like now. That villa has been abandoned for 20 years. There’s probably a thick layer of dust on everything. There won’t even be a clean bed or sofa. How can we stay there?!”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent. “This wasn’t arranged by the old master. It was Lu Xiang’s idea.”","Qiao Xi nodded and instantly understood. “Old Master Lu is such a smart person. He won’t allow himself to be gossiped about like this. A few years ago, he announced to the public that because he missed Lu Qingyun too much, he wouldn’t set foot in Yun Court anymore and sealed it. He didn’t allow anyone to enter. Now that the door of Yun Court has opened 20 years later, it’ll definitely be very dilapidated and desolate. How will she explain herself once someone figures out what she did?","“Lu Xiang actually used such a boring method to deal with you. She’s really brainless.”","Gu Zheng’s expression remained indifferent. “She’s naturally not as smart as you. Let’s go in.”","“We’re really staying here?” Qiao Xi was slightly surprised. “Ah Zheng, aren’t you angry at all that they’re asking you to stay here?”","Gu Zheng did not answer. Instead, he held Qiao Xi’s hand and walked to the door of Yun Court. At this moment, the voices of a few people came from another courtyard.","“I heard that the Gu family’s illegitimate child is also coming to the Lu family to pay respects to our ancestors. How embarrassing!”","Another person replied, “What are you talking about?! He has already proved his innocence. He’s Lu Qingyun’s son!”","“Who would believe that?! Everyone knows that he’s rich. Isn’t it very easy to fake a certificate? Lu Qingyun’s only son is Brother Lu Yan. However, that illegitimate child also wants to compete with Brother Lu Yan for the position of heir? So what if he’s really from the Lu family? If we don’t admit it, he’ll never be able to enter the ancestral hall. He’ll never be qualified to be the heir of the Lu family!”","“I heard that Aunt Lu Xiang said that she won’t let him pay his respects to our ancestors!”","On the other side of the wall was the courtyard of another villa. There were probably a few young masters from the Lu branch family chatting together. One of them asked, “Is the old master still unconscious?”","“Yes! I heard that he was poisoned. Could it be that it was really Gu Zheng who did it? He’s too vicious! He’ll even go as far as to kill his own grandfather!”","“He has always been vicious and merciless. Otherwise, how could he have established Gu Corporation in just 10 years? Previously, Mrs. Gu even said that the Lu family deliberately publicized the old master’s illness in order to frame Gu Zheng and that the old master was pretending to be sick. Now, it seems that it’s clearly Gu Zheng’s doing!”","Qiao Xi clenched her fists tightly and wished for nothing more than to jump over the wall and beat them up.","Gu Zheng rubbed her cheek comfortingly and said casually, “Let’s enter Yun Court first.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the two of them entered the courtyard. Qiao Xi originally thought that the courtyard would be desolate and it would be a heartbreaking sight when they pushed the door open. She originally thought that she would definitely clean the place up tonight before going to bed. Unexpectedly, the courtyard was clean and tidy.","The pavilion in the courtyard was very clean. There was even a small floral tablecloth on the stone table and thick cushions on the chairs. The small garden was also planted with flowers. When they entered the villa, the furniture and floor were all very clean. The air even emitted a faint floral fragrance that made one feel relaxed.","Qiao Xi was extremely shocked. “Ah Zheng, what’s going on?”","“I already guessed that Lu Xiang would arrange for us to stay here, so I sent someone to clean the place up,” Gu Zheng said casually, then smiled. “Mrs. Gu, do you still like the main residence?”","Qiao Xi sized up the villa in front of her. Miss Lu Qingyun was very talented in design. Although this villa was not big, it was exquisite enough and made one feel very warm. The main residence, although it was indeed very big and imposing, it lacked the feeling of a home.","Moreover, there were many Lu family members living in the main residence who revolted against her. Her mood would probably be affected if she stayed there, but if those people moved out, she still wanted to go to the main residence to experience it.","Hence, she thought for a while and came to a conclusion. “I like both. Can I have both?”","Gu Zheng could not help but laugh as he gently pulled her into his arms. His magnetic voice came from above her head. “Sure. As long as my Xi Xi wants it, I’ll do my best to satisfy her.”"]},{"number":1134,"title":"Chapter 1134 - Gu Zheng Is A Jinx?","paragraphs":["After entering Yun Court and settling down, Gu Zheng found a study in Yun Court to handle his work while Qiao Xi strolled around.","After a while, Ji Nan called. “Eldest Miss, are you in Yun Court?”","“Yes, who cleaned Yun Court?” Qiao Xi asked.","She knew that Gu Zheng had sent someone to clean Yun Court, but it was such a big project. It was definitely not something that could be done by just one or two people. However, it was unrealistic to send a group of people to swagger into the Lu family’s residence to clean Yun Court, so it was very likely that it was done by people Gu Zheng had planted in the Lu family.","Ji Nan hesitated for a moment before replying, “Yun Court has always been sealed off. Old Master had ordered that no one was allowed to enter. From the outside, it does look very desolate and dilapidated. Coupled with the fact that Miss Lu Qingyun has passed away, the Lu family finds the place to be unlucky and rarely approaches the villa. No one knows what it looks like inside.","“I heard that Lu Xiang wanted you to stay in Yun Court, so I wanted to send people over to clean the place up. I didn’t expect the interior of Yun Court to be clean and tidy. It doesn’t look like it has been abandoned for 20 years at all. It’s as if someone has been living there.”","Qiao Xi instantly understood. “I understand. You don’t have to come.”","It seemed that Gu Zheng had been sending people to clean this place all these years. Even though Lu Qingyun had already passed away, Gu Zheng still wanted this place to remain in its original state as if Lu Qingyun were still alive.","After hanging up, Qiao Xi walked out along the small path in Yun Court. Suddenly...","“That jinx! He caused the old master to fall unconscious. He’s a prick like Lu Qingyun!” A sharp and vicious female voice sounded. Qiao Xi did not seem to have heard this voice before. It was probably someone from the Lu branch family.","The jinx she was referring to was probably Gu Zheng, right?","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly as she clenched her fists.","The voice was sharp and filled with anger and hatred. Even though she did not see this woman’s face, she knew that her eyes were filled with resentment.","“Lu Qingyun is a vixen! She’s a jinx. Her son isn’t a good person either. It’s only right that he stays in Yun Court, which has been abandoned for 20 years. Why don’t we reunite the mother and son as soon as possible?!”","As soon as she finished speaking, a young man’s voice came from the side. “Mom, you said that Lu Qingyun is a jinx, but what about Brother Lu Yan?”","The woman chuckled. “Ah Yan is different from her! Ah Yan has a conscience. Ever since he took over, he promoted your father to the general manager of the branch company. When Lu Qingyun was still alive, she looked down on our family because we’re from the Lu branch family. She didn’t want to promote your father, so she let your father start from the bottom. She doesn’t have any kinship with us at all and is selfish. No wonder she died at a young age!”","Qiao Xi could not help but roll her eyes. Lu Yan was a good-for-nothing, so how powerful would the person he promoted be? Miss Lu Qingyun asked that person to start from the bottom because she felt that he was not capable enough to be in a high position. He was clearly the one who was useless, yet his wife still blamed Eldest Miss Lu for not caring about kinship!","Back then, when Eldest Miss Lu was in power, the Lu family could be said to be a top noble family in Li City. They were extremely glorious. Now that the family and corporation were in Lu Yan’s hands, they were struggling at death’s door. Didn’t this explain the problem?","However, the middle-aged woman was still indignant. “I only borrowed a sum of money from the corporation, yet Lu Qingyun kept urging me to return it. With such a big family business, that bit of money is nothing to them! I’m her sister-in-law, yet she actually fired me from the company and embarrassed me in public. Also, Gu Zheng...”","At the mention of Gu Zheng, the middle-aged woman seemed to be a little afraid. She lowered her voice and said, “So what if he has Gu Corporation now? He’ll still be despised by the Lu family. Who in the entire Lu family has ever taken him seriously? The child of a b*tch is not a good person either. Whoever is with him will be unlucky!”","Qiao Xi clenched her fists tightly. Why did she want to hit someone so badly?","She could tell that these two were the ones who were talking bad about Gu Zheng in the courtyard opposite just now. Gu Zheng pulled her into Yun Court just now, so she held back from beating them up. Now, they actually dared to gossip behind their backs again?","It seemed that they would not learn their lesson if she did not teach them a lesson!","The middle-aged woman complained, “The Lu family has so many businesses under their name but they’re not even willing to arrange a position for your father. They’re so petty with their own family. They deserve to die!”","The young man also chimed in, “That’s right! We shouldn’t let benefits go to outsiders! The Lu family’s business is so big. Instead of hiring an outsider to be the general manager, they might as well let a family member be the general manager. We’ll definitely side with the Lu family. How can others be as attentive as us?”"]},{"number":1135,"title":"Chapter 1135 - Ghost","paragraphs":["“Gu Zheng is as heartless as his mother. He even angered the old master to the point of falling sick. In my opinion, today’s ancestral worship ceremony...”","As the man spoke, he suddenly felt someone pat his back and stopped talking.","He abruptly turned around, but there was no one behind him. However, the touch just now was terrifyingly real.","The middle-aged woman also hurriedly turned around and muttered, “Maybe it’s the leaves on the tree. Anyway, Gu Zheng...”","Before she could finish, the two of them felt someone pat them from behind. The two of them were instantly stunned. The woman shouted in exasperation, “Who is it?! Come out!”","She looked around angrily and suddenly broke out in a cold sweat. Her eyes were filled with horror. The mother and son had unknowingly walked down this path.","This path was the path to Yun Court, which was where Lu Qingyun lived when she was alive.","She had just said bad things about Lu Qingyun, then someone patted them from behind. Could it be...","Cold sweat trickled down her forehead. The middle-aged woman was so scared that her entire body was trembling. Her voice trembled slightly. “S-Son, let’s go. This place is too strange. That woman died at such a young age. Maybe... Ahhh!!”","The mother and son screamed. They felt as if a ghost was floating around them and was about to take their lives.","In the study on the second floor of Yun Court.","When Gu Zheng heard the shouts outside, he raised his eyes slightly and looked outside. Then, he looked at the person opposite the computer. “It’s nothing. Continue.”","On the small path in Yun Court, the middle-aged woman clearly did not see anyone around her. However, when she turned around, a face suddenly appeared in front of her. She was so scared that she screamed crazily. Her son was so scared that he squatted on the floor and covered his eyes. The two of them screamed until their throats were hoarse. They then collapsed on the floor, their bodies still trembling uncontrollably.","Qiao Xi stood in front of the two of them and smiled in satisfaction when she saw their sorry state.","After a minute, Qiao Xi slowly opened her mouth and said with a smile, “What are you shouting for? Could it be that you saw a ghost?”","Hearing Qiao Xi’s voice, the middle-aged woman raised her eyes tentatively and realized that it was a young and beautiful woman in front of her. She carefully sized her up and felt that she seemed to have seen this person somewhere before.","After thinking for a long time, she finally reacted. Wasn’t this Gu Zheng’s weak wife? The person who patted them from behind just now was this little vixen! She was clearly doing it on purpose!","The middle-aged woman was burning with anger. She struggled to stand up and roared, “Mrs. Gu, why did you scare us on purpose? Do you know that scaring people like this can kill them?”","Qiao Xi had an innocent expression. “I wasn’t scaring you!”","“Didn’t you take photos of us just now? Why are you so vicious at such a young age? You and Gu Zheng are really...”","Before she could finish speaking, Qiao Xi’s eyes suddenly turned cold, but the corners of her mouth were still filled with a smile. “I really didn’t take any photos of you! Are you hallucinating? I was walking on this path when I suddenly heard your heart-wrenching screams. I thought there were people in danger, so I ran over to take a look. After all, I stay in Yun Court. Your voices were very loud!”","The middle-aged woman instantly choked as fear spread from her heart to her limbs and bones. She looked at the innocent and confused Qiao Xi, and her heart seemed to skip a beat.","Could... Could it be that... something really patted them just now? If it was really Qiao Xi who patted them, it was impossible for them not to have seen anything after turning around! So was it really a ghost?","“Are you Third Uncle’s wife?” Qiao Xi chuckled and asked.","The middle-aged woman looked around warily. “What’s wrong?”","“It’s nothing. I just think that you look very afraid. Did you encounter something paranormal just now?” Qiao Xi pretended to ask casually.","Hearing Qiao Xi’s words, the woman’s entire body could not help but tremble. Previously, someone had always said that Yun Court was haunted and there would be figures and voices at night. Lu Qingyun died for no reason. Could it be that her ghost was causing trouble here?","She was so scared that her entire body went cold. She looked around again.","Qiao Xi smiled and comforted her. “Madam, don’t be afraid. I can help you so that you won’t be afraid of ghosts anymore.”","The middle-aged woman looked at her with a puzzled expression. Why was Qiao Xi helping her? Could it be that she wanted to please her? When she thought about this, the woman instantly became arrogant and smiled proudly. “Alright! Since you’re willing to help me, then quickly...”","Before she could finish speaking, the woman felt a sharp pain on her face. She could not help but grunt, then she looked at Qiao Xi in disbelief. “You hit me? Are you crazy?”"]},{"number":1136,"title":"Chapter 1136 - I’m Worse Than A Ghost","paragraphs":["“Stop arguing, Madam.”","Qiao Xi rubbed her knuckles and looked at the woman who had fallen to the ground in a sorry state. She smiled lightly and said in a gentle voice, “Madam, I really want to help you! Weren’t you very afraid of ghosts just now? If I beat you up, you’ll realize that I’m even more terrifying than ghosts. This way, you won’t be afraid of ghosts anymore!","“Madam, how do you feel? You’re not afraid anymore, right?”","The woman on the ground was so angry that her face turned red. She held her red and swollen face. This woman looked weak, but the punch just now almost knocked out her teeth.","At this moment, her son reacted as well. He pointed at Qiao Xi and roared furiously. “You actually dare hit my mother? I won’t...”","“You won’t let me off?” Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows and raised her fist. Since she had already hit this woman, she couldn’t let her son off. She couldn’t be biased.","“I can take down two good-for-nothings like you with a single punch. Do you have the ability to say such harsh words to me?” As she spoke, Qiao Xi gave the young man a heavy punch.","At this moment, Qiao Xi, who looked gentle, was like a demon from hell in their eyes. She was really more terrifying than a ghost.","Qiao Xi wiped her hands as if she despised making any physical contact with them.","The middle-aged woman was unwilling to give up and roared angrily, “This is the Lu family’s residence, not Longwan Residential! Y-You actually dare to beat me up in the Lu family’s residence?!”","“Yes, I do. What’s wrong?” Qiao Xi blinked as if she didn’t care.","“You clearly know that this is the Lu family’s residence, yet you still dare to attack? My husband is the general manager of the Lu family’s branch company. You’ll definitely pay the price for hitting me!”","Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression. “Oh.”","The middle-aged woman flew into a rage and pointed at Qiao Xi while shouting, “Let me tell you, help me up immediately and kneel on the floor to beg for my forgiveness. Otherwise—”","Before she could finish speaking, Qiao Xi spoke first, “Shut up, you idiot!”","The surroundings were silent for a few seconds. The woman’s face turned red as she roared with all her might, “What? Say that again? How dare you insult your elders?”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up in disdain. “I really didn’t expect you to have such a strange hobby. Since you want to hear it, I’ll say it again. I said... you’re an idiot!”","“Ah!!!” The middle-aged woman shouted at the top of her voice, “I’m from the Lu family! I’m Gu Zheng’s aunt. You’re actually scolding me? A junior like you is actually scolding me?”","This middle-aged woman was the wife of Lu Qingyun’s cousin. According to seniority, Gu Zheng should indeed call this woman ‘Aunt,’ but this did not mean anything! This woman shouldn’t have spoken ill of Gu Zheng and Eldest Miss Lu behind their backs!","“You just said that Gu Zheng isn’t from the Lu family, and now you’re saying that you’re Gu Zheng’s aunt. Don’t you think it’s very contradictory?” Qiao Xi’s tone suddenly turned cold.","“You want to use your status as an elder to suppress me? Do you think you’re worthy? If you can’t control your mouth, I’ll help you sew it up so that you won’t gossip behind my back!”","The middle-aged woman moved back in horror. She was afraid and angry. “No matter what, I’m Gu Zheng’s elder. Y-You actually dare to... Alright! I won’t let you off!”","A trace of impatience flashed past Qiao Xi’s eyes. “So, you’re unconvinced?” She shook her neck, cracked her knuckles, and smiled sweetly at the two of them.","Gu Zheng’s aunt? How laughable!","Had anyone admitted that Gu Zheng was from the Lu family all these years? In the past, Gu Zheng was thought to be an illegitimate child, so the Lu family had reason to target him. Now that his identity had been confirmed, the Lu family was still unwilling to accept him and chose to make do with the situation.","In that case...","The flames of rage in Qiao Xi’s heart surged. She had long wanted to beat these two idiots up, but Gu Zheng was present just now, so she could not attack. Coincidentally, Gu Zheng was not around now, so she could fight to her heart’s content.","That woman never expected the seemingly weak Mrs. Gu to be so violent.","A few minutes later, Qiao Xi withdrew her hands again and smiled indifferently, but her tone was very impatient. “Quickly disappear from my sight!”","The two of them hurriedly stood up and staggered. They were about to escape when they suddenly saw something. Their eyes were filled with horror, and their legs seemed to not listen to them anymore.","Qiao Xi frowned. “What’s wrong? Are you trying to scare me? Do you think I’m as timid as you two pieces of trash?”","The woman’s mouth was wide open as her entire body trembled in fear. She raised her trembling hand and pointed behind Qiao Xi. “Back there, he...”","Qiao Xi had already lost her patience. They were pretending to be frightened and thinking of scaring her? That was impossible! She wanted to see what was behind her. If there was nothing, she would beat them up again!"]},{"number":1137,"title":"Chapter 1137 - Stop Gu Zheng From Entering The","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi turned around confidently and saw the tall man. Her expression instantly stiffened. After a long time, she smiled awkwardly.","Gu Zheng’s expression was gentle as his deep eyes met Qiao Xi’s eyes that were filled with shock. He stared at her with a faint smile and did not say anything.","The surroundings were terrifyingly quiet, and Qiao Xi’s heart collapsed.","The middle-aged woman and her son retreated in fear. They knew very well that Gu Zheng’s methods were vicious, so they only dared to badmouth Gu Zheng behind his back. If Gu Zheng heard what they said just now, they would definitely die miserably.","The moment they saw Gu Zheng appear, their hair stood on end as if someone was grabbing their throats. They could not say a word.","“Take them away,” Gu Zheng ordered. Then, a few strong bodyguards appeared and dragged the two of them out. Only Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng were left in the surroundings.","Gu Zheng turned around and continued to stare at Qiao Xi with a burning gaze. The corners of his mouth curled up slightly as he teased, “Mrs. Gu, did you pretend to be a ghost to scare them just now?”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched slightly.","It was over! Her image had collapsed!","Qiao Xi followed Gu Zheng back to Yun Court. After the two of them entered, Gu Zheng said slowly, “So, it turns out that Mrs. Gu cares about me so much. You heard them talking bad about me behind my back, so you attacked. Do you hate them so much?”","Qiao Xi nodded. Of course, she hated them because they were targeting Gu Zheng. Gu Zheng was clearly so outstanding and innocent, yet he was still cursed and there were rumors about him being spread.","After a moment of silence, Gu Zheng said gently, “The people you hate will never appear in front of you again.”","At night, Qiao Xi heard of a big matter. Gu Zheng’s third uncle’s family actually left the day before the ancestral worship ceremony. Lu Yan’s explanation to everyone was that Third Madam suddenly fell sick, so the family left early.","At this moment, in the Lu family’s residence.","Lu Xiang slammed the table and roared, “They actually left? We made him the general manager of the company, but this is how he repays us? That little bastard is still in Yun Court, but he ran away with his tail in between his legs. How useless!”","“They’ve already left. What’s the point of getting angry now?” Lu Yan interrupted impatiently and said casually, “They’re just a group of irrelevant people. They’re not important to us. Let’s move on. The most important thing now is how to deal with Gu Zheng.”","Lu Xiang’s anger gradually calmed down. She asked in a low voice, “Ah Yan, can we really stop Gu Zheng from entering the ancestral hall tomorrow?”","The Lu family’s ancestral worship ceremony would last for a total of two days. On the first day, everyone had to offer incense and pay their respects outside the ancestral hall. This was a group ceremony. The next day, the direct descendants of the Lu family would enter the ancestral hall to pay their respects. The people from the Lu branch family were not qualified to enter at all.","Gu Zheng was Lu Qingyun’s son. Logically speaking, he should attend the ancestral worship ceremony for two days, but Lu Yan would never let Gu Zheng participate in the ceremony smoothly.","Lu Yan smiled sinisterly. “Rumor has it that it was Gu Zheng who poisoned Grandpa, causing Grandpa to be unconscious until today. I don’t care if it’s true or not, but I have to make it real!”","Lu Xiang frowned. “But...”","“Aunt, we have to take a gamble. We can’t let Gu Zheng return to the Lu family no matter what!”","Lu Yan looked in the direction of Yun Court through the window. As long as the old master remained unconscious, Gu Zheng would have to bear the infamy.","On the other hand, Qiao Xi was not idle either. She knew that Lu Yan would definitely stop Gu Zheng from participating in the ancestral worship ceremony. He would use the excuse that Gu Zheng poisoned Old Master Lu, causing him to be unconscious.","A long time ago, there were rumors that Gu Zheng had angered Old Master Lu to the point of falling sick. Now, there were rumors that the old master was poisoned, so everyone naturally thought that Gu Zheng had poisoned him.","Lu Yan had long planned it out. He had to firmly pin the blame on Gu Zheng for Old Master Lu’s coma. After the ancestral worship ceremony began, he would join forces with everyone in the Lu family to ask Gu Zheng to leave. After all, he was the criminal who tried to kill his grandfather. How could such a person enter the ancestral hall?","However, what if Old Master Lu suddenly woke up at this moment? Not only would Lu Yan have no excuse, but Old Master Lu would also be suspected of pretending to be sick. Hence, Qiao Xi wanted Old Master Lu to wake up.","Now, the old master was lying in his room with the door closed and bodyguards guarding him. Even if the old master really woke up, the others would not know. Hence, she had to let others see the old master with their own eyes. Then, all the rumors would be buried.","As for the person who would see the old master wake up, she already had someone in mind."]},{"number":1138,"title":"Chapter 1138 - Absent For The Ancestral Worship Ceremony","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi picked up her phone and made a call. Soon, a respectful voice came from the other end. “Eldest Miss.”","“The Lu family will probably call the Medical Association to treat someone in the family. Arrange for two young doctors to come over.”","The person on the other end of the phone hesitated for a moment. “The Lu family? I heard that Chairman Lu has been unconscious for a few days. Could it be him?”","“It’s him,” Qiao Xi replied casually. She needed people to witness Old Master Lu’s awakening. Moreover, they couldn’t be from the Lu family. Otherwise, it would be meaningless.","Lu Yan probably did not expect that his plans would be foiled by her. The person who would be embarrassed tomorrow would definitely not be Gu Zheng!","The next morning.","Everyone woke up early to freshen up. At nine o’clock, they gathered outside the ancestral hall for the ancestral worship ceremony.","At this moment, the people from the Medical Association arrived. Lu Xiang warmly invited them in. “My father has been unconscious for 10 days. Please see what’s going on and let me know when he’ll wake up.”","Hearing Lu Xiang’s words, the Lu family’s family doctor took the initiative to give up his position. He let those from the Medical Association take the old master’s pulse.","These two people from the Medical Association were still very young. They had just entered the Medical Association. After one of them checked the old master’s pulse, he could not help but frown.","Was Chairman Lu unconscious? He looked like he was sleeping!","He could not help but look at the Lu family’s family doctor. The doctor’s eyes were filled with helplessness and doubt. The people from the Medical Association were enlightened. It seemed that Chairman Lu was not unconscious at all. He was clearly pretending to be sick. The Lu family was clearly making things difficult for their eldest miss!","The old master was clearly pretending to be sick but even invited people from the Medical Association over. Did he have nothing better to do?","Lu Xiang looked worried. “Doctor, how’s my father’s condition?”","The two people from the Medical Association: “...” How could this person have the cheek to ask them that? The so-called patient was only pretending!","The two of them remained silent. Lu Xiang thought that Old Master Lu’s condition had worsened and was instantly at a loss. However, Lu Yan, who was at the side, felt relieved.","He knew that his grandfather doted on him and treated him very well, but in this situation, it was best if his grandfather was unconscious. As long as his grandfather did not wake up, they had a reason to stop Gu Zheng from entering the ancestral hall.","If his grandfather really woke up, even if he hated Gu Zheng, he had to forgive Gu Zheng on the account of Lu Qingyun. After all, in the eyes of outsiders, the old master had always been a good father who doted on Lu Qingyun. Now that his grandson had finally been found, he could not criticize him. Otherwise, the image he had maintained all these years would be ruined.","When the people from the Medical Association confirmed that Old Master Lu was not unconscious, they looked at Lu Yan’s expression and instantly understood the Lu family’s thoughts. The Lu family really knew how to scheme!","Lu Yan said gently, “Doctors, Grandpa needs to recuperate. Why don’t we talk in the living room?”","The two of them looked at each other and knew what Lu Yan meant.","Lu Yan was clearly afraid that they would notice that something was wrong, so he hurriedly asked them to leave. After the ancestral worship ceremony ended and the Lu family achieved their goal, he would invite them in to “treat” the old master. At that time, the old master would wake up. Everything would seem reasonable and logical.","However, Lu Xiang was not as smart. She looked at Lu Yan in confusion. The people from the Medical Association were here to treat the old master, so why was Lu Yan chasing them out? Could it be that he did not want the old master to wake up?","Lu Yan glanced at Lu Xiang with a hint of warning in his eyes. Lu Xiang lowered her head and did not dare to voice the doubts in her heart.","At this moment, the ancestral worship ceremony was about to start, but Old Master Lu still had not appeared. All these years as the head of the family, he had never missed the ancestral worship ceremony. At this moment, only Lu Xiang and Lu Yan were standing in front.","Everyone looked at each other. Could it be that the old master was really dying? Otherwise, why didn’t he appear?","“Didn’t they say that the old master’s coma was a rumor? Why isn’t he attending the ancestral worship ceremony, then?”","“That’s right! Previously, I heard that he fell sick from anger because of Gu Zheng. Later on, Gu Zheng proved that this matter had nothing to do with him. At that time, Mrs. Gu even suspected that the old master was pretending to be sick in public! I thought...”","“How is that possible? If the old master had really woken up, he would definitely have come to attend the ceremony. This is a huge matter. It’s absolutely impossible for him to be absent, so he must still be unconscious!”","Everyone had different expressions and could not help but look at Gu Zheng. Old Master Lu had not woken up even after a long time, so how could Gu Zheng, this sinner, have the cheek to participate in the ancestral worship ceremony?","When Qiao Xi arrived, the surrounding atmosphere was extremely subtle, and strange gazes would be cast over from time to time. However, she didn’t panic in the slightest and still stood by Gu Zheng’s side with an indifferent expression."]},{"number":1139,"title":"Chapter 1139 - Hypnosis Lifted","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng lowered his eyes to look at Qiao Xi. “Mrs. Gu, where did you go just now?”","Qiao Xi smiled sweetly. “This is my first time in the Lu family, so I didn’t know the way. I went the wrong way.”","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled up slightly as he sneered. “Did you go the wrong way?”","“That’s right! The Lu family’s residence is so big. I spent a long time looking for the way, so it’s understandable that I’m late. Fortunately, the ancestral worship ceremony hasn’t started yet!”","The glint in Gu Zheng’s eyes grew brighter when he heard Qiao Xi’s explanation.","Would Mrs. Gu go the wrong way? He did not believe it.","After a moment of silence, the man said meaningfully, “There are surveillance cameras everywhere.”","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with innocence. “I know that. Why are you talking about this? I didn’t do anything bad. So what if there are surveillance cameras? Even if I was captured in the surveillance cameras, you’d just see me lost and going to the wrong place. You can’t blame me for this! Everyone else came over so early, so there was no one available to show me the way.”","She replied confidently. In order not to be suspected, she even pretended to be lost and walked around twice. After that, she sneaked into the main residence from the backyard to avoid the surveillance cameras. She opened the small porcelain bottle in her hand and waved the bottle below the old master’s nose.","Actually, Old Master Lu was indeed not poisoned and had just fallen asleep. Hence, no matter who checked on the old master, the result would still be the same. She did poison Old Master Lu in the beginning, but when she came over the second time, she changed her mind about poisoning him again.","Qiao Xi had read the notes left behind by her grandfather. It clearly recorded that hypnosis could also make someone fall asleep. Moreover, this kind of hypnosis could only be lifted if the subject smelled the medicine Qiao Xi had concocted.","Now that the hypnosis had been lifted, Old Master Lu would wake up soon. She hurriedly took out her phone and told the people from the Medical Association that they could come in. Then, she quickly left the main residence.","At this moment, the corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up as she looked at Gu Zheng who was beside her and smiled in embarrassment. “Ah Zheng! Why are you always staring at me? I’m getting all shy! There are so many people here!”","Gu Zheng snorted and retracted his gaze.","The ancestral worship ceremony officially began, but the head of the Lu family, Lu Bai, still did not appear. The fifth uncle of the Lu branch family could not help but ask, “Ah Yan, why isn’t the head here yet?”","Finally, someone asked the question in everyone’s hearts. Everyone stared at Lu Yan and waited for his answer.","Lu Yan slowly looked up, his eyes filled with sorrow. At the same time, a trace of scheming and gladness flashed past his eyes. He hoped that Lu Bai was still unconscious.","He took a deep breath and said word by word, “I’m sorry, everyone. Grandpa is still unconscious.”","Everyone knew that the old master was sick, but they did not expect that he was still unconscious after so many days. Moreover, he could not even attend the ancestral worship ceremony.","Fifth Uncle frowned and asked, “Ah Yan, what illness does the head of the family have? Why has he been unconscious for so long? Didn’t they say that he...”","Everyone knew that Old Master Lu had deliberately pretended to be sick a few days ago to force Gu Zheng to give up the 5% of shares. Could it be that he wanted to continue pretending during the ancestral worship ceremony?","The ancestral worship ceremony should be presided over by the head of the family. Since the old master was not around, everything could only be handed to Lu Yan to handle. However, this also meant that Lu Yan was the next head of the family. However, the old master was clearly still alive. This seemed to be against the rules.","Everyone knew the reason why Old Master Lu was unconscious. After a moment of silence, someone asked loudly, “I heard that Gu Zheng made Old Master Lu sick because of the shares?”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart. Lu Yan was finally going to make a move. The corners of her mouth curled into a proud smile.","Lu Xiang’s expression did not look too good. Lu Yan sighed and said, “That’s what the rumors say, but...”","When everyone heard Lu Yan’s affirmative answer, they immediately started chattering. “What I heard is that the 5% of shares is related to Lu Corporation’s next quarter’s project. That’s why the head of the family was unwilling to give the shares to Gu Zheng. It’s just that Gu Zheng insisted that the head of the family hand over the shares, so the head of the family pretended to be sick and wanted to force Gu Zheng to give up.","Qiao Xi knew clearly in her heart that these people were clearly defending the old master and Lu Yan. These words were probably all thought of by Lu Yan. He got them to memorize their lines and deliberately say them in public.","She looked impatient. Everyone was still discussing the 5% of shares.","“Although it’s not good for Gu Zheng to insist on getting Lu Corporation’s shares, it’s not right for the old master to pretend to be sick! No matter what, Gu Zheng is from the Lu family and Lu Qingyun’s biological son. It’s not too much to give him 5% of the shares, right?!”"]},{"number":1140,"title":"Chapter 1140 - This Is Wrong!","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi glanced at that person. It sounded like he was speaking up for Gu Zheng and saying that Old Master Lu should not be pretending to be sick, but she sensed that something was wrong.","As expected, Lu Yan sighed the next second. “Where did you hear that Grandpa is pretending to be sick?”","The moment that was said, the area outside the ancestral hall instantly fell silent. Everyone widened their eyes. After a moment of silence, someone asked tentatively, “Ah Yan, you mean that the head of the family isn’t pretending to be sick and is really unconscious?”","A trace of victory flashed past Lu Yan’s eyes, then he said sadly, “Yes, Grandpa has been unconscious. We’ve invited many doctors to treat him these past few days, but they haven’t been able to wake him up. The ancestral worship ceremony is about to start, but he still can’t wake up.","“Everyone should know that a week ago, my aunt went to Huazhong Building to look for Gu Zheng to ask for an explanation. For some reason, the Lu family suddenly became the target. My aunt and I were afraid that it would bring calamity to the Lu family, so we didn’t explain it to the public. Later on, rumors spread that Grandpa was pretending to be sick. Actually, he really is in a coma.”","Everyone could not help but think of what had happened a week ago. At that time, Lu Xiang was in Huazhong Building and forced Gu Zheng to give up his shares in public. After that, Mrs. Gu appeared and embarrassed the Lu family. She even made the entire high society suspect that Lu Bai was deliberately pretending to be sick.","However, now that Lu Yan said that Lu Bai had really fainted, it meant that Lu Xiang was telling the truth. A week ago, the old master was really angered by Gu Zheng to the point of falling sick. Because of Mrs. Gu’s words, everyone not only mistakenly thought that the old master was pretending to be sick but also felt indignant for the culprit, Gu Zheng.","The moment that was said, everyone looked at Gu Zheng with disdain.","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with disdain. Lu Yan sure knew how to beat about the bush. Since he wanted to push the blame on Gu Zheng, then he should be more straightforward. How could he be the heir of the Lu family with such a character?","Fifth Uncle had a serious expression. He had clearly discussed it with Lu Yan a long time ago, yet he still pretended to be puzzled in front of everyone and questioned, “President Gu, is Ah Yan telling the truth? Did you really anger the head of the family to the point of falling sick? Aren’t you going to explain?”","At this moment, the members of the Lu family were all gathered here. Everyone’s gazes were on Gu Zheng. They were all waiting for Gu Zheng’s answer.","Qiao Xi really found it laughable. How was Gu Zheng supposed to answer this? It was clearly Lu Yan who lost his shares to her. He had to admit defeat, but he was unwilling to fulfill the bet. Old Master Lu got so angry that he fainted, so now they want Gu Zheng to take the blame. This matter was Lu Yan’s fault from the beginning until the end. It had nothing to do with Ah Zheng!","However, these people were completely unreasonable! In their opinion, the heir whom the head of the family had carefully nurtured, Lu Yan, was the most perfect. Everything he said was right, while Gu Zheng was just an outsider. He was not worthy of taking the Lu family’s shares.","Moreover, once Gu Zheng returned to the Lu family, these vermin who were hiding in the dark and reaping benefits from the Lu family would all be exposed to the sunlight. Gu Zheng would never let them off, so they had to help Lu Yan chase Gu Zheng out of the Lu family.","Since this group of people liked acting, why didn’t they become actors?! Was there a point in acting in front of her and Ah Zheng?","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to glance around and chuckled. “What do you want Ah Zheng to explain?”","Everyone’s unhappy gazes landed on Qiao Xi. They were talking to Gu Zheng, so how could this woman have the right to speak? Hence, they said unhappily, “Mrs. Gu, this is the Lu family’s ancestral worship ceremony. We’re questioning Gu Zheng. This has nothing to do with you.”","Qiao Xi blinked and curled her red lips. “How is it unrelated to me?! Ah Zheng is my husband, so, of course, I have to speak up for him. I really don’t understand what’s there to explain about this.”","She stroked her hair delicately and said in a soft voice, “Don’t forget that the person who wanted to make a bet back then was Lu Yan. The person who lost Lu Corporation’s shares was also Lu Yan. In the end, however, you’re blaming Old Master Lu’s coma on Ah Zheng. This doesn’t make sense, right?”","Everyone was instantly speechless.","Lu Xiang pointed at Qiao Xi and roared angrily. “Stop spouting nonsense here. The shares have already been lost, so stop blaming Ah Yan! However, Gu Zheng angered my father to the point of falling sick for the sake of those shares. He’s unfilial!”","“Keep your voice down. It doesn’t matter who has the louder voice.” Qiao Xi rolled her eyes at her and said calmly, “Even if Gu Zheng did anger the old master to the point of falling sick for the sake of the shares, that’s not his fault. Back then, both parties agreed to the bet. Whether you win or lose, you have to bear the responsibility yourself. You can’t ask Ah Zheng to give up the shares just because your Lu family is in trouble, right? I think there’s a higher chance that the old master fainted in a fit of anger because he thought that the Lu family was about to be handed to a stupid heir like Lu Yan!”"]},{"number":1141,"title":"Chapter 1141 - Puppet Technique","paragraphs":["Hearing Qiao Xi’s words, everyone instantly fell silent. Did Mrs. Gu mean that Lu Yan was the one who angered Old Master Lu to the point of falling sick?","Fifth Uncle’s expression darkened as he berated loudly, “Gu Zheng! Previously, you said to the public that the head of the family was pretending to be sick. Now, everyone knows that the head of the family is really in a coma and can’t even participate in the ancestral worship ceremony. However, you’re actually spreading rumors here. Are you qualified to come and pay respects to our ancestors?”","Look, they were finally getting to the main topic!","Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing. “Fifth Uncle, Gu Zheng didn’t say that Old Master Lu was pretending to be sick. That was everyone’s guess. Moreover, the Lu family didn’t retort back then, nor did you guys reveal Old Master Lu’s medical record. Hence, it made everyone think that the Lu family was guilty and tacitly agreed to Old Master Lu’s act.","“Isn’t it a little unreasonable for you to blame Ah Zheng for spreading rumors now? Your Lu family didn’t even explain it to the public. Did you want Ah Zheng to explain things on behalf of you?”","Everyone was speechless again. Mrs. Gu looked young, but she was very eloquent.","Fifth Uncle was so angry that his face turned red. He questioned loudly, “Gu Zheng, why are you hiding behind a woman? Don’t forget that the Lu family’s blood flows in your veins. If the Lu family’s reputation is ruined, you’ll be affected too!”","Qiao Xi whimpered aggrievedly. “I just can’t stand you bullying Ah Zheng. Just because Ah Zheng has a good temper and doesn’t want to bicker with you, you’re forcing him into a dead end! How unreasonable!”","Fifth Uncle: “...” Gu Zheng had a good temper?","He pointed at Qiao Xi and roared angrily. “You have no right to speak here. Shut up!”","Qiao Xi was like a frightened little white rabbit as she hid behind Gu Zheng with a terrified expression. However, a trace of disdain flashed past her eyes. She deliberately got entangled with Fifth Uncle not because she was bored but because she wanted to stall for time.","It would take some time for the hypnosis to lift. Moreover, Old Master Lu had been unconscious for so long. It would take time for him to completely wake up and regain control of his actions and thoughts.","The current Old Master Lu was equivalent to a puppet in her palm. She could control him as she pleased. She gently stroked her palm, and soon, a red line appeared on her skin. The red line seemed to have a life of its own as it trembled slightly.","On the other hand, Old Master Lu slowly walked out of the door. As everyone in the Lu family was paying respects to their ancestors outside the ancestral hall, only the family doctor and two doctors from the Medical Association were guarding the old master’s bedroom.","The three of them were expressionless when they saw Old Master Lu walk out. After all, they knew that Old Master Lu was pretending. There was nothing to be surprised about now that he had woken up. However, what was Old Master Lu doing? Could it be that he was going to attend the ceremony?","Old Master Lu was really responsible. He was going to pay respects to his ancestors as soon as he woke up!","At this moment, outside the ancestral hall, Qiao Xi looked at the red line on her palm that was getting deeper and deeper. She knew that Old Master Lu was walking over. Soon, everyone would see Old Master Lu appear. Then, the people from the Medical Association would reveal the old master’s health in public. At that time, the truth would be known about whether he was pretending to be sick or if he was really unconscious!","Qiao Xi was not ashamed in the slightest. She had indeed hypnotized the old master and made him faint for a few days. Today, the old master and Lu Yan would also lose their dignity in public. However, she could not be blamed for this. If the Lu family had not wanted to scheme against Gu Zheng, why would she deliberately counterattack?","Hence, Qiao Xi felt that Lu Yan and Old Master Lu were not innocent at all. They had shot themselves in the foot. They deserved it!","Gu Zheng’s cold eyes landed on Fifth Uncle. The surrounding temperature seemed to have dropped. His voice carried a trace of coldness. “Are you done talking?”","Seeing that he was so unconcerned, Fifth Uncle was so angry that he almost vomited blood. “Gu Zheng, I know you’re in control of Li City, but the Lu family’s residence isn’t a place for you to fool around. You’ve already angered the head of the family to the point of falling sick, yet you’re still spreading rumors outside that the head of the family is pretending to be sick. You’re really heartless!”","Gu Zheng curled his lips. His deep eyes had long seen through everyone’s thoughts, but he still raised an eyebrow and asked, “So what do you think I should do?”","Everyone hesitated for a moment and could not help but look at Lu Yan.","Lu Yan had a gentle smile on his face as he nodded imperceptibly. Fifth Uncle seemed to have received a signal and said gently, “Ah Zheng, we don’t want to blame you, but this ancestral worship ceremony is the most important event in the Lu family every year. Logically speaking, the head of the family has to attend. If the head of the family doesn’t attend, I’m afraid our ancestors will blame him.","“You caused the head of the family to fall unconscious and made him unable to pay respects to his ancestors, so you’re the culprit behind this matter. You can’t continue to participate in the ceremony.”"]},{"number":1142,"title":"Chapter 1142 - The Lu Family’s Rules Are Strict","paragraphs":["Fifth Uncle glanced at Lu Yan and continued, “Ah Zheng, this is your first time coming to the Lu family to pay respects to our ancestors. You don’t know the rules yet. As the head of the family is still unconscious, you can’t enter the family register. To our ancestors, you’re not a member of the Lu family yet.”","He then curled his lips and said in a disdainful tone, “Since you’re not from the Lu family, how can you participate in the ancestral worship ceremony? Gu Zheng, the Lu family’s rules can’t be broken!”","The surroundings were silent. He had said so much nonsense for one reason, and that was to not let Gu Zheng participate in the ancestral worship ceremony. Although Gu Zheng’s identity had already been confirmed, the patriarch was not around, so he could not enter the family register. Hence, he was not qualified to participate in the ancestral worship ceremony.","At this moment, everyone was discussing softly. “He’s chased out of the Lu family during the ancestral worship ceremony. Tsk tsk... How embarrassing! In the end, it’s his fault. If he hadn’t angered the head of the family to the point of falling sick, he would’ve been able to participate in the ancestral worship ceremony.”","“Lu Qingyun’s memorial tablet is also in the ancestral hall. Gu Zheng can’t even pay his respects to his mother now. I can only say that he reaped what he sowed.”","“The Lu family is a century-old family. We have strict rules, especially when it comes to paying respects to our ancestors. We absolutely can’t make any mistakes. Gu Zheng, we can’t make an exception for you just because you have power and influence. Please leave!”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent, and he paid no attention to the others. However, Qiao Xi could not help but say, “Do you mean to say that because Old Master Lu is unconscious now, Ah Zheng won’t be able to participate in the ancestral worship ceremony? He won’t even be able to pay his respects to his biological mother?”","When Fifth Uncle heard Qiao Xi’s question, he replied with extreme confidence, “That’s right!”","They originally thought that Qiao Xi had given in, but who knew that Qiao Xi’s voice would be icy-cold in the next second? She asked word by word, “If Old Master Lu isn’t unconscious, will Ah Zheng be able to participate in the ancestral worship ceremony?”","The entire venue was in an uproar.","If the old master was really not unconscious, then logically speaking, they could not stop Gu Zheng from paying respects to their ancestors.","Fifth Uncle’s expression was gloomy as he looked at Lu Yan. He saw a trace of viciousness and uneasiness flash past Lu Yan’s eyes. What was Qiao Xi talking about?","Before Lu Yan could speak, Lu Xiang retorted guiltily, “Qiao Xi, what nonsense are you talking about? My father has been unconscious for so many days, yet you’re still here...”","“Second Miss Lu.” Qiao Xi interrupted her softly, and the corners of her mouth curled up slightly as she said casually, “I’m just raising a reasonable doubt. Why are you so agitated? Why do I feel that you don’t want the old master to wake up?”","Qiao Xi’s voice was gentle, but she seemed to be luring those around her. “Could it be that all of you don’t want the old master to wake up? This way, you’ll have a reason to stop Ah Zheng from participating in the ancestral worship ceremony. After all, Ah Zheng’s name isn’t in the genealogy, so Ah Zheng won’t have the right to compete with Lu Yan for the position of heir.","“Old Master’s coma is good for you, so you hope that he won’t wake up today, right?”","Boom!!!","The entire venue was silent. Everyone seemed to have been struck by lightning and subconsciously looked at Lu Yan.","Actually, most of the people in the Lu family supported Lu Yan. It was because of Lu Yan that they could have a place in the Lu family. They all knew Lu Yan’s thoughts, so they did not want Gu Zheng to participate in the ancestral worship ceremony.","As for the others who were not close to Lu Yan and had never participated in the Lu family’s internal strife, it did not matter to them who the heir of the Lu family was. They had a neutral attitude. Now that they heard Mrs. Gu’s words, they could not help but shudder. In that case, the person who did not want the old master to wake up was clearly Lu Yan!","Lu Yan clenched his fists, and his lips were pale, but the expression on his face was still gentle. There was a smile on the corners of his mouth as he shook his head helplessly. “Mrs. Gu, your analysis is very reasonable, but Grandpa is indeed unconscious. The Lu family’s family doctors and the doctors from the Medical Association have all diagnosed him, but they aren’t able to do anything. I didn’t cause Grandpa to be unconscious.","“Mrs. Gu, you can misunderstand me and say that I’m not pure-hearted, but I hope you can respect my grandfather. He’s still unconscious on the bed. It’s hard to say if he’ll survive. Do you think it’s appropriate for you to slander an elder like this?”","As soon as he finished speaking, Qiao Xi grunted coldly. “Young Master Lu, you’re quite filial! However, what I said just now is a reasonable analysis. I didn’t say that you’re the culprit who harmed Old Master Lu. If you’re in such a rush to explain, it’ll make others think that you’re guilty!”","The expression on Lu Yan’s face instantly stiffened. He calmly controlled his emotions, but Lu Xiang, who was at the side, instantly exploded. “Qiao Xi! Shut up! Ah Yan grew up by the old master’s side since he was young. He absolutely wouldn’t harm my father! You’ve been talking for a long time. Are you trying to help Gu Zheng escape punishment and let him participate in the ancestral worship ceremony? Let me tell you clearly that if my father isn’t awake, you shouldn’t even think about it!”"]},{"number":1143,"title":"Chapter 1143 - He Poisoned Her","paragraphs":["Lu Xiang was furious and wished for nothing more than to rush over and tear Qiao Xi’s mouth apart. At this time, Qiao Xi was actually still spouting nonsense in front of everyone!","Lu Yan took a deep breath and calmed himself down. As long as his grandfather was unconscious, Gu Zheng could not participate in the ancestral worship ceremony. As for who caused his grandfather to be unconscious, it was no longer important. The entire Lu family was his. Could it be that Gu Zheng could cause a scene in the ancestral hall in front of everyone?","“If Old Master Lu doesn’t wake up, Gu Zheng can’t forcefully enter the ancestral hall. But who says Old Master Lu won’t wake up?” As soon as Qiao Xi finished speaking, she tapped her palm with her finger.","She slowly looked up and pointed not far away with a smile. “Quick, take a look. Isn’t Old Master Lu here?”","Lu Yan’s body trembled as he subconsciously turned around. His body suddenly stiffened, and his ears buzzed.","Everyone from the Lu family also looked in the direction Qiao Xi pointed, and they were all dumbstruck.","At this moment, Old Master Lu was slowly walking over with the help of the family doctor. His eyes were a little confused, but he was in a very good state. Behind him were people from the Medical Association.","Lu Yan gasped as if a huge rock was blocking his heart. He suddenly reacted and looked at Qiao Xi with a sharp gaze. Her eyes were filled with the pride of victory as she smiled sweetly at him.","Lu Yan’s pupils suddenly constricted. He could not even believe the scene in front of him. How did Grandpa suddenly wake up?","Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi must have done something, or was it someone from the Medical Association who cured his grandfather?","“Oh! Ah Zheng, the old master is awake! This is great! You can participate in the ancestral worship ceremony now!” Qiao Xi chuckled.","Gu Zheng gently stroked the top of Qiao Xi’s head and said softly in her ear, “That’s all thanks to Mrs. Gu.”","Qiao Xi blinked her big watery eyes and waved her hand in embarrassment. “What does this have to do with me? I just spoke up for you. I have to thank Old Master Lu. If he hadn’t fought to wake up at this moment, we would’ve been chased away.”","The smile in Gu Zheng’s eyes grew wider. He understood in his heart that Lu Bai suddenly woke up because... Mrs. Gu wanted him to wake up. Otherwise, he would’ve continued to sleep.","Seeing that the head of the family was awake, the Lu family went forward. Lu Xiang asked with concern, “Dad, why did you come out when you just woke up?”","“Old Master! You came at the right time. The ancestral worship ceremony is about to start.”","“Didn’t they say that the old master was unconscious? Why did he suddenly wake up? Is it because the people from the Medical Association are here?”","Lu Yan pursed his lips tightly, and his thoughts raced. His grandfather was indeed awake, and everyone had seen him. There was no way to deny it, but if the person who caused his grandfather to faint was Gu Zheng... As long as his grandfather said in public that Gu Zheng poisoned him, Gu Zheng would be expelled from the Lu family for attempting to kill his grandfather. He would still be unable to attend the ancestral worship ceremony.","At the thought of this, Lu Yan shot Lu Xiang a look. Lu Xiang hurriedly asked, “Dad, the doctor said that you should have woken up a long time ago. Why did you only wake up today? Could it be that... someone poisoned you?”","The family doctors and people from the Medical Association had strange expressions. They were speechless.","At this moment, Old Master Lu had already recovered his senses. He also understood what Lu Xiang meant and could not help but look at Gu Zheng. This little bastard actually dared to attend the ancestral worship ceremony?","So what if he woke up? Gu Zheng still could not enter the ancestral hall to pay respects to their ancestors!","Lu Bai had been the head of the Lu family for decades. He knew what Lu Xiang and Lu Yan meant. Whether they had evidence or not, they had to push the blame on Gu Zheng.","He was about to speak when he suddenly felt his throat become constricted as if it was blocked by a foreign object. He could not say a word and lost control of his body. His body was extremely stiff. He had clearly used all his strength, and his face was red, but he still could not say a word.","Seeing that the old master did not speak for a long time, Lu Xiang started to become anxious. She hurriedly gestured to Fifth Uncle, who was beside her. Fifth Uncle roared, “So, it was you who poisoned the head of the family, causing him to suddenly fall unconscious. Gu Zheng! How can you be so heartless?”","The Lu family had many members, and they were a little far away from Old Master Lu. It was unknown if he had spoken or not. When they heard Fifth Uncle’s angry roar, they thought that Old Master Lu had spoken up to testify against Gu Zheng, so they all looked at him.","Lu Xiang hurriedly accused, “Gu Zheng, you actually dared to poison your biological grandfather. My father is old, and his body can’t take it anymore, yet you poisoned him to kill him! If the doctors from the Medical Association hadn’t come today, my father might not have woken up!”"]},{"number":1144,"title":"Chapter 1144 - The Pitiful Are Pitiful For A Reason","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng’s eyes were indifferent as he ignored Lu Xiang.","Qiao Xi smiled lightly and shot a glance at the people from the Medical Association.","The Lu family was crusading against Gu Zheng, saying that he was the culprit who tried to harm the head of the family. Since he was the culprit, he naturally could not participate in the Lu family’s ancestral worship ceremony. Moreover, if news of this got out, Gu Zheng’s reputation would be completely ruined.","Lu Yan heaved a sigh of relief, his heart filled with pride. Today, not only could he expel Gu Zheng from the Lu family, but he could also ruin Gu Zheng’s reputation. Even if Gu Zheng was powerful now, everyone in Li City knew that he was vicious. Who would work with him?","The surroundings instantly fell silent as everyone stared at Gu Zheng. After a long silence, a young doctor from the Medical Association suddenly walked over and asked in confusion, “Do you think Mr. Gu caused the old master to faint?”","When Lu Xiang heard the doctor’s question, she was instantly excited. If the people from the Medical Association also believed that Gu Zheng had poisoned the old master, Gu Zheng would definitely not be able to explain himself.","At the thought of this, she immediately fanned the flames. “It’s him! For the sake of that 5% of shares, he even poisoned his own grandfather. My father is his family too, but he actually disregarded kinship and heartlessly attacked my father. My father is already so old and can’t take it at all. If you hadn’t come, I’m afraid my father would have been unconscious for a long time!","“Gu Zheng! Let me tell you, you have to take responsibility for any injuries to my father’s body!”","The young doctor could not help but fall silent. He looked at Lu Xiang with a subtle expression.","Before he could speak, Fifth Uncle chimed in, “Gu Zheng! You have to explain this matter clearly. You clearly know that the head of the family is old, but you actually did such a thing just for some shares. Just what do you think of the Lu family?! What right do you have to participate in the ancestral worship ceremony?”","The doctor from the Medical Association said, “Listen to me...”","Lu Yan spoke first, “President Gu, I hope you can give everyone a reasonable explanation.”","Everyone from the Lu family said, “Yes! President Gu, you have to apologize to the head of the family no matter what!”","“Although he’s the old master’s biological grandson, he’s led a wandering life since he was young and has no feelings for the old master. He actually used such despicable methods on his elders. No wonder such a person was misunderstood as an illegitimate child. The Lu family has just acknowledged his identity, but he poisoned the old master. The pitiful are pitiful for a reason.”","“Lu Yan is much more filial. I heard that during the time the old master was unconscious, Lu Yan would talk to him whenever he had time and even feed him medicine. The heir of the Lu family should be Lu Yan. Gu Zheng has no right to compete with Lu Yan!”","After everyone finished speaking, they all looked at Gu Zheng. However, Gu Zheng, who was being criticized and watched by everyone, had an indifferent expression from the beginning until the end. It was as if what they said had nothing to do with him.","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly as she revealed a disdainful expression.","Seeing that the two of them were so indifferent, a trace of uneasiness surged in Lu Yan’s heart. Gu Zheng had always had a cold face, but Qiao Xi also had an indifferent expression now. Why was that?","Before Lu Yan could think it through, the Lu family started urging Gu Zheng to give them an explanation.","The doctor from the Medical Association was about to explain again when he was interrupted by Lu Xiang. “Gu Zheng! Don’t think that we’re afraid of you just because you can do whatever you want in Li City! This is the Lu family, and you tried to harm the head of the family. Don’t you have any explanation? You’ll go to jail for poisoning others!”","The doctor said, “Second Miss Lu, actually...”","“Gu Zheng! The doctors from the Medical Association are here as well. What else do you have to say? I advise you to quickly apologize to the old master. Otherwise, don’t blame us for being merciless!”","Qiao Xi crossed her arms over her chest. She was clearly impatient when she heard Lu Xiang’s noisy voice. The people from the Medical Association had also noticed it and could not help but become anxious.","Lu Xiang was still nagging. “Gu Zheng! Do you still want to deny it in front of the people from the Medical Association?”","“Second Miss Lu!” the young doctor finally shouted. Then, ignoring everyone’s stunned gazes, he quickly said, “You’ve misunderstood. I didn’t say that Old Master Lu’s coma is related to President Gu!”","The entire venue was silent for a few seconds before it instantly became noisy again.","Lu Yan felt as if he had been struck by lightning. His ears buzzed, and his face was pale. Old Master Lu’s face was filled with anxiety. He wanted to speak but could not say anything.","Everyone from the Lu family looked at each other. This doctor was from the Medical Association. There was no need for him to lie. However, if this matter had nothing to do with Gu Zheng, why did the old master faint?","Lu Xiang’s face instantly turned livid. She pointed at the doctor and roared, “Shut up! Were you bribed by Gu Zheng?”"]},{"number":1145,"title":"Chapter 1145 - Bribed By Gu Zheng","paragraphs":["“Second Miss Lu, I’m telling the truth. You’re insisting that President Gu poisoned Old Master Lu, but do you have evidence?” The doctor’s tone was serious. As a doctor of the Medical Association, he was respected no matter where he went. He had never seen such an unreasonable person.","The doctor was already a little dissatisfied after being interrupted by Lu Xiang so many times. Now that Lu Xiang was slandering him for being bribed, he was naturally even angrier. He originally wanted to save the Lu family some dignity, but at this moment, he only wanted to make the truth public.","Lu Xiang’s expression was a little ugly. Was this doctor bribed to speak up for Gu Zheng?","Fifth Uncle could not help but panic. The Medical Association was not something the Lu family could offend. Previously, Lu Xiang’s interruptions had already made the other party unhappy, but she actually asked the other party to shut up. Was she crazy?","Fifth Uncle was silent for a moment before asking gently, “But the head of the family is sure that Gu Zheng poisoned him. Why do you think this has nothing to do with Gu Zheng?”","Lu Yan took a deep breath and said with a smile, “The two of you might not know yet, but Grandpa woke up once two days ago. For some reason, he fell into a coma again. Now that he’s awake, Grandpa is testifying that Gu Zheng poisoned him. Doesn’t this explain everything?”","The Medical Association had always been fair and would not be bribed by Gu Zheng. Hence, Lu Yan simply thought that the two doctors had been deceived by Gu Zheng and did not know about the grudge between the Lu family and Gu Zheng at all.","The old master had already testified in public. How could it be fake?","Just as Lu Yan was feeling proud, the doctor suddenly asked, “Young Master Lu, have you studied medicine?”","Lu Yan was stunned for a moment before answering truthfully, “No.”","“Then how did you confirm that Old Master Lu was poisoned? I don’t think anyone told you that Old Master Lu fainted because of poison.” The doctor’s face was serious.","Lu Yan’s heart trembled, but there was still a smile on his face as he explained, “Previously, we had already taken Grandpa to the hospital for a check-up. The results show that Grandpa was poisoned. If you don’t believe me, I can give you the medical records later—”","“I heard from the family doctor that the old master was indeed poisoned, but the poison was very mild. It might have come from something he ate. The poison is no longer in his body, and it won’t affect his body at all. The old master should have woken up a long time ago.”","The family doctor looked helpless. If Second Miss had not angered the people from the Medical Association, perhaps they could still cover up for the Lu family. However, she actually told this young doctor from the Medical Association to shut up. She now had to reap what she sowed!","Lu Xiang bit her lip tightly and said indignantly, “The family doctor also said that my father should have woken up a long time ago, but he only woke up for a moment and fell unconscious again without saying anything. Who else but Gu Zheng could do such a vicious thing?! You were clearly bribed by Gu Zheng!”","“Second Miss Lu, you’ve repeatedly emphasized that I was bribed. May I ask what evidence you have? The Medical Association has always been fair. You’re not only slandering my reputation but also the reputation of the entire Medical Association. I’ll represent the Medical Association to hold you responsible!”","Lu Xiang widened her eyes. The doctor in front of her looked to be in his 20s, but he actually spoke to her like this. She was instantly infuriated. She pointed at the doctor and shouted heart-wrenchingly, “Fair, my *ss! So what if you’re from the Medical Association? Gu Zheng is so rich. He must’ve given you money, so you’re now working for him—”","The doctor could not stand being slandered anymore and berated angrily, “Second Miss Lu! I didn’t say it directly before because I wanted to save your Lu family some dignity, but you’re actually slandering us like this and insisting on pushing the blame for Old Master Lu’s coma on Mr. Gu. Well, don’t blame me for this, then!”","Lu Yan suddenly had a bad feeling. What did this doctor mean? Could it be that the doctors knew something else?","“Xiao Zheng, pay attention to your identity.” At this moment, the doctor who looked to be in his 30s walked forward and stood in front of the young doctor.","Although he was only in his 30s, he was already an elder of the Medical Association. He exuded a dignified aura and said firmly, “The people of the Medical Association have always been fair. Second Miss Lu, if you don’t believe me, you can invite other doctors here. Even if Mr. Gu had bribed us, he definitely wouldn’t have been able to bribe anyone else.”","Lu Xiang hurriedly retorted, “How do you know that it wasn’t Gu Zheng who poisoned my father? He was unconscious for so long. It must be Gu Zheng’s doing! You’re just protecting him!”","The elder was not angry. His voice was still calm. “Second Miss Lu, don’t rush to a conclusion. There’s a reason why I’m sure this has nothing to do with Mr. Gu.”","Everyone immediately pricked up their ears. Lu Xiang could not help but take a few steps closer."]},{"number":1146,"title":"Chapter 1146 - The Lu Family Must Be So Bored","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi glanced at Old Master Lu’s face. His face was red, and he did not look like a patient at all. She smiled lightly and nodded at the elder of the Medical Association.","After receiving Eldest Miss’ order, the elder of the Medical Association slowly said, “Actually, Old Master Lu wasn’t unconscious.”","His tone was calm, but it was like a huge rock that smashed into everyone’s hearts. What did he mean? Old Master Lu had been lying on the bed for so many days. How could he not be unconscious?","Lu Xiang’s face was pale as she suddenly looked at Lu Yan. Lu Yan was also uneasy, and his eyes were filled with shock.","Impossible! If Grandpa was not unconscious, why did he not wake up? At first, he thought that Grandpa was deliberately pretending to be sick for outsiders to see. However, when the two of them were alone, he tested him. Grandpa did not react at all. He was clearly unconscious.","“Nonsense—”","Before Lu Xiang could finish, she was interrupted by the elder, “Old Master Lu was not unconscious at all. He was just asleep. It’s just that we don’t understand why he slept for so long. So, how did Mr. Gu make Old Master Lu fall asleep?”","Lu Xiang’s face was ferocious, and the muscles on her face were contorted. If the old master was not unconscious, wouldn’t they have wronged Gu Zheng? Could it be that they really had to let Gu Zheng enter the Lu family’s ancestral hall?","She shouted crazily, “Nonsense! My father was clearly unconscious. What you said is all lies—”","“I’ve said that if you don’t believe me, you can find another doctor to diagnose the old master. If you can find a trace of poison in Old Master Lu’s body, I’ll withdraw from the Medical Association. Even if you don’t believe me, you should believe your family doctor. Why don’t you ask him?”","Everyone’s gazes landed on the family doctor. Lu Xiang rushed forward and pointed at the family doctor’s nose as she questioned, “Tell me! My father was unconscious and Gu Zheng poisoned him, right?”","The family doctor wanted to say something but hesitated. However, his silence had already explained everything. The doctor from the Medical Association had come to a conclusion, and the family doctor had also come to the same conclusion. Hence, Old Master Lu had been pretending these past few days!","“Sigh! I really didn’t expect this! Old Master Lu, you’re already so old, yet you still like to play games where you pretend to be sick! At the end of the day, it’s all because your Lu family doesn’t want Gu Zheng to participate in the ancestral worship ceremony. You even slandered him for poisoning you. You want to ruin Gu Zheng’s reputation and make him completely unqualified to compete with Lu Yan, huh?","“I remember that it was Young Master Lu who personally invited Ah Zheng and me to attend the ancestral worship ceremony that day! Now, the Lu family is trying their best to chase us away. What are you doing? The Lu family must be so bored! If you have time, why don’t you think about how to strengthen the company? Don’t always think about useless things!”","Qiao Xi’s teasing voice sounded. These words completely slapped the faces of the Lu family. All of their faces were livid. At this moment, the expression on Lu Yan’s face froze, and the veins on his forehead popped out.","Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes to look at Gu Zheng, and her voice carried a trace of disdain. “Ah Zheng, in order to stop you from paying respects to your ancestors, your grandfather actually pretended to be sick to frame you! The Lu family doesn’t welcome us either. Why don’t we leave? In any case, this isn’t your fault. They shouldn’t even think about making you the scapegoat!”","The young doctor also echoed, “In the future, if there are rumors going around saying that Mr. Gu didn’t participate in the ancestral worship ceremony, feel free to look for me. I’m willing to swear on my character and professionalism that Mr. Lu wasn’t unconscious and Mr. Gu didn’t poison him!”","Lu Yan’s pupils suddenly constricted, and Old Master Lu’s ruddy face instantly turned pale. If it were not for the fact that the people from the Medical Association were present, how could Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng have had the chance to prove their innocence?","In order to stop Gu Zheng from paying respects to their ancestors, he, as the grandfather, actually pretended to be sick. If news of this got out, the Lu family would lose all their dignity.","However, he was not pretending to be sick. He had been in a daze recently and could not feel anything. Why did the doctors of the Medical Association insist that he was pretending to be unconscious?","Old Master Lu was burning with anger. Now, he did not have the time to argue. No matter what, he had to control the situation and not let this news spread. He hurriedly looked at Lu Yan and Lu Xiang.","He was the head of the Lu family, so his reputation could not be damaged in any way. Hence, someone had to take the blame, but—","Just as Old Master Lu was hesitating, Lu Yan suddenly said with a guilty expression, “President Gu, Xi Xi, I’m sorry. Actually, it’s all my fault!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows, and Old Master Lu widened his eyes. He expected Lu Yan to give a reasonable explanation to protect his reputation."]},{"number":1147,"title":"Chapter 1147 - Officially Becoming A Member Of The Lu Family","paragraphs":["Lu Yan looked at Old Master Lu guiltily. “Grandpa, Doctor Fei said that you might not be unconscious, but I didn’t care about his words. Later on, I thought that perhaps it was because you were old and your body was weak from the poison, so you slept for a few days.","“President Gu, I’ve wronged you. This is all my fault. Don’t misunderstand Grandpa. He has always cared about you!”","Old Master Lu’s eyes gradually became affectionate. Lu Yan had been raised by his side since he was young. Even though the two of them were not related by blood, he had long treated him as his biological grandson. Now, Lu Yan had even taken on all the blame for the Lu family, unlike Gu Zheng who only cared about his own interests and did not care about the Lu family at all.","He glared at Gu Zheng unhappily, then cleared his throat and said, “Alright, Ah Yan has already admitted his mistake. Let’s forget about this matter. Let’s not delay the ancestral worship ceremony.”","With that, everyone prepared to pay respects to their ancestors as if nothing had happened.","However, how could Qiao Xi let the matter go just like that? Hence, she sneered. “Old Master Lu, you were unconscious earlier and couldn’t write Gu Zheng’s name in the family tree. He’s not officially from the Lu family yet, so he can’t participate in the ancestral worship ceremony. Now that you’re awake, shouldn’t you officially introduce Gu Zheng’s identity to your ancestors?”","The moment that was said, everyone looked at Old Master Lu. If he had not woken up, according to the rules, Gu Zheng would naturally not be able to participate in the ancestral worship ceremony. However, he was already awake now, so there was no reason to refuse.","Lu Bai’s expression was quite heavy, and his beard trembled slightly. He suppressed the anger and unwillingness in his heart. He did not answer Qiao Xi for a long time.","Qiao Xi’s tone was gentle. “Old Master Lu, say something! Do you not know how to answer? It’s okay, Ah Zheng and I have plenty of time. We can talk after you’ve thought it through.”","Lu Bai’s face alternated between red and white. He had never seen a woman as shameless as Qiao Xi. At this point, he could only officially introduce Gu Zheng’s identity. However, this way, Gu Zheng would become a member of the Lu family. As Lu Qingyun’s son, he had the right to participate in the ancestral worship ceremony and the right to compete for the inheritance.","However, in front of everyone, Lu Bai had no reason to refuse. He could only kneel in front of the ancestral tablets according to the rules and officially introduce Gu Zheng’s identity. His name was also written in the family tree.","It was just a simple segment that could be completed in a few minutes, but Lu Bai felt that it was very long. After the introduction, he glared at Gu Zheng with bloodshot eyes.","Gu Zheng looked up lazily, his eyes filled with coldness. His entire body exuded strong pressure. His entire body seemed to be shrouded in black smoke, and the temperature around him made one shudder.","Lu Bai found it difficult to breathe. The strong suffocating feeling in his chest took a long time to ease.","The ancestral worship ceremony began, and everyone went forward to offer incense. It quickly ended. Qiao Xi stood not far away and quietly watched. She said unhappily, “Ah Zheng, your grandfather is too biased. I asked him to introduce you, but his face was extremely ugly. In the end, he didn’t say that you’re the young master of the Lu family and only said that you’re Lu Qingyun’s son.”","Gu Zheng looked indifferent.","“Old Master Lu is biased toward Lu Yan. Even though Lu Yan’s identity has been exposed and he’s Huang Lilan’s son, Old Master Lu still can’t bear to abandon Lu Yan. He’ll even clear Lu Yan’s name. At that time, Old Master Lu will announce to the public that Lu Yan didn’t know anything from the beginning to the end. All these years, he had always thought that he was Lu Qingyun’s son and was dedicated to the Lu family. Old Master Lu wants him to stay with the Lu family and work for him. Naturally, no one else has the right to speak.”","Even if Lu Yan’s identity was really exposed, as long as the old master still doted on Lu Yan, Lu Yan would still be the noblest young master of the Lu family.","Qiao Xi did not want to see such an outcome. She wanted to see Lu Yan be chased out of the Lu family with her own eyes. From then on, he would only be Huang Lilan’s son and the Gu family’s illegitimate child. He would have nothing to do with Lu Qingyun anymore.","Gu Zheng listened quietly, and a trace of a smile appeared in his deep eyes. He lowered his eyes and said in a gentle voice, “Xi Xi, what should we do?”","Qiao Xi’s body was suffused with killing intent, and her eyes gradually became gloomy. “Of course...”","The words in her mouth suddenly stopped. She suddenly realized that she was a weak and kind little rabbit in Ah Zheng’s heart! How could she be exposed like this?","After a few seconds of silence, Qiao Xi smiled sweetly and said, “I don’t know either! But if Lu Yan continues to stay in the Lu family even when his identity is exposed, that’ll be too annoying! Ah Zheng, what do you think we should do?! How can such a person continue to stay in the Lu family?”"]},{"number":1148,"title":"Chapter 1148 - Killing Him?","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng looked up slightly, and the corners of his mouth curled into a smile. “Xi Xi, you’re so smart. Don’t you have any good ideas?”","Qiao Xi smiled shyly. “I’m so stupid and weak. How would I know?!”","Gu Zheng quietly looked at her. After a long time, he smiled and nodded. Meanwhile, Qiao Xi was dumbfounded. What did this man mean? Why did he nod for no reason?","After that, the Lu family did not mention Gu Zheng again. Logically speaking, he was already a member of the Lu family now and should have an identity. Was he the eldest young master of the Lu family or the second young master?","However, the Lu family did not care about this at all. The servants also called him Mr. Gu or President Gu. Nothing seemed to have changed.","The Lu family was clearly telling everyone that even though Gu Zheng had returned to the Lu family and his name was in the family register, no one in the Lu family welcomed him. Moreover, the Lu family already had an heir. No one could replace Lu Yan.","Some of the higher-ups of Lu Corporation were once Lu Qingyun’s subordinates. When they saw this scene, they were a little dissatisfied. However, after thinking about it carefully, Lu Yan was raised by the old master since he was young. The two of them had a deep relationship, so the old master naturally had to leave the Lu family to him. Although Lu Yan was not too smart and was not good at business, as long as he did not make a big mistake, he would still be the heir of the Lu family.","Faced with the Lu family’s cold attitude, Gu Zheng did not care in the slightest. He only lit incense for Lu Qingyun outside the ancestral hall and returned to Yun Court with Qiao Xi. He did not speak to the Lu family at all.","...","In the Lu family’s residence.","“Ah Yan, remember that you’re the heir of the Lu family. Even though Gu Zheng has come back, he can’t change this fact!” Old Master Lu looked at Lu Yan seriously.","“Gu Zheng spent so much effort to return to the Lu family because he wants to snatch everything from the Lu family, but I won’t fulfill his wish. As long as I’m alive, the Lu family will absolutely not fall into his hands!” Old Master Lu said with a firm gaze.","Lu Yan smiled gently. “Grandpa, as long as I can contribute to the Lu family, it doesn’t matter who the heir is. If President Gu can lead Lu Corporation to greater heights, I’m willing to give up my position.”","“Ah Yan, you’re too sensible.” Old Master Lu looked at Lu Yan with affection. “The position of heir will always be yours. I’ll officially announce this matter to the board of directors tomorrow. I won’t give Gu Zheng any chance.”","At 10 p.m.","Ji Nan arrived at Yun Court and passed Old Master Lu’s words to Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi leaned against the sofa, supported her chin, and blinked. “The old master wants to make the announcement after the ancestral worship ceremony tomorrow. How impatient of him! Then let’s not make him wait until tomorrow.”","Ji Nan’s face was instantly filled with horror as he said while trembling, “Eldest Miss, this is the Lu family. There’ll be trouble if you kill someone. Calm down.”","Qiao Xi had an innocent expression. “What nonsense are you talking about?! Am I such a violent person? I’m very reasonable. I’ve never done anything illegal!”","Ji Nan’s expression was subtle as if he did not believe her. He replied helplessly, “The main residence is surrounded by bodyguards. Even if I personally appear, I don’t have the right to transfer them away, so...”","What she said just now successfully made Ji Nan misunderstand. He kept having the feeling that Eldest Miss wanted to silence the old master. It made Ji Nan’s heart thump.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up slightly as she hurriedly left. Ji Nan followed behind and shouted helplessly, “Eldest Miss, don’t go!”","Hearing Ji Nan’s voice, Qiao Xi turned around slightly with a stunning smile. Then, she looked at the main residence and said with a smile, “Don’t worry, I’ll be fine.”","Ji Nan stood in the wind in a mess. He was not worried that something would happen to Eldest Miss, but he was afraid that something would happen to the Lu family. If Eldest Miss killed someone, how could the Lu family let the matter go?!","At this moment, in the study upstairs.","Song Shijing stood in front of Gu Zheng and repeated the old master’s words. After a moment of silence, Gu Zheng sneered. “Old Master, why are you in such a rush?”","“President, we...”","“I don’t have time to play with them.” Gu Zheng waved his hand and lazily leaned against the chair with his eyes closed. His thin lips parted slightly. “Go do it.”","These few words had already announced Lu Yan’s outcome. Tomorrow, the direct descendants of the Lu family would pay respects to their ancestors, but Lu Yan would be completely removed from the Lu family. He was not related to the Lu family by blood at all. It was enough for him to have stolen these 20 years of peace. From now on, he would no longer be Lu Qingyun’s son.","Gu Zheng’s tone was indifferent. In his eyes, Lu Yan was just an ant. He did not treat Lu Yan as his opponent at all."]},{"number":1149,"title":"Chapter 1149 - Congratulations On Living A New Life","paragraphs":["Song Shijing replied and was about to leave when hurried footsteps came from outside. Song Shiyu ran in in a hurry and said in a panic, “P-President, there’s bad news.”","Gu Zheng frowned. “When did you get a stutter?”","Song Shiyu pointed outside the door and said in a terrified tone, “I-I-It’s not that. Young Madam... She’s gone to the main residence!”","The moment that was said, the study was eerily quiet.","After a moment of silence, Gu Zheng tapped his long fingers on the table and looked at Song Shiyu with a smile. “You saw Xi Xi go to the main residence?”","“Yes, yes!” Song Shiyu nodded crazily. “President, why is Young Madam going to the main residence so late at night? Could it be because of what happened during the day? The Lu family’s main residence is surrounded by bodyguards! Young Madam is really...”","“Go take a look first,” Gu Zheng interrupted him slowly. Song Shiyu wanted to cry but had no tears. What was the point of him going? If Young Madam wanted to hit someone, he could not stop her!","Just as he was about to turn around and leave, Gu Zheng suddenly said, “Wait.”","Song Shiyu widened his eyes in surprise. “President, I knew you couldn’t bear to let me go.”","Gu Zheng had a gentle expression. “I’ll go too. Xi Xi is my wife. I should support her in whatever she wants to do.”","Song Shiyu: “...” Support? Young Madam was going to cause trouble, yet he was still so calm! Moreover, it was the middle of the night, and the surroundings would be dark. What could they see even if they went?","At this moment, Qiao Xi’s footsteps were vigorous as she walked aggressively toward the main residence. When she was about to reach the main residence, she slowed down. The bodyguards around the main residence did not notice her. She walked around the surroundings, then took out a magnetic card and swiped it at the electronic lock on the back door. The door was instantly unlocked.","Qiao Xi swaggered into the main residence. The bodyguards around the Lu family’s residence did not notice her. She walked around the main residence, then slipped into Lu Yan’s bedroom.","She stood by the bed and quietly looked at Lu Yan with a sinister smile. Then, she took out a small porcelain bottle and a dripper. She dripped the liquid on Lu Yan’s eyes. The liquid flowed into his eyes from the corners of his eyes, and he trembled uneasily.","Qiao Xi’s heart suddenly ached slightly. “The medicine I developed is very expensive! These few drops cost at least 50,000 yuan. It’s a pity for me to give them to you just like that!”","“However, if they can blind you, this 50,000 yuan won’t be spent in vain. Ah Zheng was poisoned when he was young and was even locked in the dark basement by Huang Lilan to be tortured. He had to suffer the pain of losing his eyesight. As Huang Lilan’s biological son, you should experience Huang Lilan’s methods!","“Unfortunately, Huang Lilan is imprisoned now and can’t see you go blind with her own eyes. If you have time, you should tell her this news. I think she’ll be very excited!","Qiao Xi smiled in satisfaction and said in a gentle voice, “Young Master Lu, from now on, you’re blind. Congratulations on living a new life. You don’t have to thank me!","“I know that even if your identity is exposed, with Old Master’s liking for you, he won’t chase you out of the Lu family. He’ll even force you to firmly sit in the position of the Lu family’s heir, but that’ll make me very unhappy!","“You’re bullying Ah Zheng and looking down on him. As his wife, I should do something for him. First, I’ll make you blind. Then, I’ll frame you for Old Master Lu’s coma. You’ll replace Ah Zheng as the culprit who tried to kill Old Master Lu and be hated by everyone. This way, our grudges will be settled, right?","The smile on Qiao Xi’s face grew wider and wider as she nodded affirmatively. “That’s right. I’ll let Young Master Lu have a taste of the pain of being schemed against and poisoned. I really want to see your identity getting exposed and you leaving the Lu family in disgrace.","“Yes! I must take more photos and videos. If I’m in a bad mood, I’ll take them out to take a look. Thank you, Young Master Lu.”","At this moment, Gu Zheng was hiding outside the bedroom window and heard Qiao Xi’s words through the gap in the window.","Song Shiyu’s voice trembled slightly. “How scary!”","Gu Zheng looked at the person in the room with a doting expression. His eyes were gentle like water, and his voice was low and a little gentle. “Xi Xi looks so beautiful when she’s standing up for me.”","Song Shiyu’s expression froze as he looked at Gu Zheng in horror. He even wondered if the president was blind.","Gu Zheng clearly saw Qiao Xi do something to Lu Yan’s eyes before taking a few steps back. Her eyes suddenly turned light red. He slowly lowered his head and curled his lips into a smile before jumping down from the window on the second floor."]},{"number":1150,"title":"Chapter 1150 - Entering The Lu Family’s Main Residence At Night","paragraphs":["Song Shiyu followed Gu Zheng into the mansion in confusion and asked in a low voice, “President, what are we going to do?”","Gu Zheng did not answer but walked all the way to the Lu family’s surveillance room. Song Shiyu immediately understood that the president wanted to delete the surveillance footage to prevent others from discovering that Young Madam had secretly sneaked into the main residence.","Gu Zheng entered the surveillance room and inserted a USB drive into the main computer. His long fingers quickly tapped on the keyboard a few times, then he smiled in satisfaction.","At the same time, Lu Yan, who was in the bedroom, suddenly opened his eyes. His eyes were empty like an emotionless doll as he stood up stiffly.","Qiao Xi’s eyes were red as she stood in front of Lu Yan. Her fingertip gently tapped on the red line on her palm. Lu Yan seemed to have received an order, and his body suddenly trembled. He opened the drawer and took out the medicine bottle inside before slowly walking out of the door.","A moment later, Qiao Xi left the main residence. When she thought about how Old Master Lu would fall into a coma again tomorrow and Lu Yan would lose his eyesight, she could not help but be happy.","Qiao Xi was just about to return to Yun Court when she suddenly recalled that there were surveillance cameras everywhere. She had to delete all the surveillance footage. She hurriedly rushed to the surveillance room but realized that the door was open.","She suddenly recalled that when she went to the main residence just now, she kept feeling that there were eyes staring at her from behind. However, when she turned around, she did not find anything. Even when she looked around, she still did not see anything. However, she inexplicably felt that she was being followed.","If she was really being followed, she should be able to see who it was from the surveillance cameras.","Qiao Xi hurriedly turned on the surveillance footage and checked the surveillance footage from when she came over. She was the only one who went to the main residence from Yun Court. Even after checking the previous footage, she still did not find anyone coming out of Yun Court.","Could it be that she was hallucinating?","She originally thought that Gu Zheng was worried and followed her here. Now, it seemed that she had a guilty conscience, so she felt as though she was being watched.","Qiao Xi quickly deleted the recording and jumped out of the window of the surveillance room. She avoided all the surveillance cameras and secretly returned to Yun Court.","When she returned to Yun Yuan, the lights in Gu Zheng’s study were still switched on. The courtyard was very quiet as if no one had noticed that she had gone out. She heaved a sigh of relief. She was so careful, so no one should notice.","In Yun Court’s study.","Song Shiyu was a little uneasy. “President, will we be captured by the surveillance cameras?”","Gu Zheng said casually, “The surveillance cameras can’t capture that path.”","“But what about Young Madam? If she takes the main path, will she be discovered?” Song Shiyu was still worried.","Gu Zheng paused and smiled meaningfully. “Xi Xi will naturally think of what you can think of. You don’t have to worry.”","Song Shiyu thought for a moment. That seemed to be the case. Young Madam would never be caught red-handed.","...","The next morning.","Qiao Xi had a good night’s sleep. She had just opened her eyes when she heard a gentle voice. “Mrs. Gu, did you sleep well?”","Hearing this familiar voice, Qiao Xi’s body instantly trembled as she stiffly turned to look at the man beside her.","Gu Zheng’s face was gentle, and his voice carried a smile. “The alarm clock has been ringing for so long, but you haven’t woken up yet. Do you want me to wake you up personally?”","Qiao Xi looked at the alarm clock. It was already past eight o’clock. She set the alarm clock at half-past seven. This was because Old Master Lu usually woke up at seven. Lu Yan would also wake up at about this time and go downstairs to wait for the old master to eat. Hence, at half-past seven, Lu Yan would realize that he had lost his eyesight. Immediately after, everyone would realize that the old master had fallen into a coma again.","Originally, Qiao Xi intended to wake up early, freshen up, and watch the show in high spirits. Unexpectedly, she slept until past eight. However, it was already so late. Why was there no movement in the main residence at all?","Seeing that she did not answer for a long time, Gu Zheng smiled and asked, “Mrs. Gu, you were sleeping so soundly. It looks like you slept very late last night. Did you go out last night?”","Qiao Xi met Gu Zheng’s probing eyes and gulped nervously. “N-No! I was playing games yesterday. Why would I go out so late at night?”","The glint in Gu Zheng’s eyes grew brighter. He raised an eyebrow. “Didn’t you sleep at 10:30 pm last night?”","Qiao Xi: “...”","At half-past 10, Ji Nan left. In order to go to the main residence without being discovered, she told Gu Zheng that she was going to sleep and asked him not to disturb her.","She was instantly speechless and did not know how to explain. After a moment, Qiao Xi said uneasily, “I-I woke up later and couldn’t sleep, so I played games for a while.”"]},{"number":1151,"title":"Chapter 1151 - Eyes Are Windows To The Soul","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng sized up Qiao Xi and stared at her for a moment before smiling meaningfully. “So that’s how it is!”","Qiao Xi was slightly guilty from his gaze, but she did not want to be discovered, so she said righteously, “I did sleep at 10:30 pm, but I wasn’t used to suddenly changing beds, so I woke up in the middle of the night. I played games for a long time and only fell asleep at two in the morning. Is there something wrong with that?","“Ah Zheng, you’re too suspicious. I just had insomnia, but you suspected me of doing something bad outside. You have to change your habit.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Gu Zheng laughed out loud. His voice was hearty, and his chest trembled slightly. He said happily, “Xi Xi, you look so cute when you explain in a panic.”","Then, Gu Zheng said slowly, “I didn’t say that you went out to do bad things. You seem to be a little guilty after explaining so much, though.”","Qiao Xi’s expression suddenly stiffened. As expected, nothing could be hidden from this bastard. She even hated herself for explaining too much. Gu Zheng did not say that she had done something bad, but she seemed to have confessed.","Qiao Xi’s throat seemed to be blocked, and she remained silent for a long time.","Suddenly, Song Shiyu shouted from outside, “President! Something big has happened in the main residence. Let’s go take a look!”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth instantly curled up, but she still had to suppress her smile with all her might in front of Gu Zheng, so the corners of her mouth twitched.","For some reason, it was a little later than she had expected, but what should have happened still happened. Lu Yan was blind and his identity was exposed. At the same time, Old Master Lu was unconscious again. The Lu family was probably going to turn the world upside down!","Qiao Xi forced herself to think about sad things before managing to control her smile. She pretended to be alarmed and said, “Ah Zheng, something big must have happened in the main residence. Let’s go quickly!”","Gu Zheng nodded as usual.","Qiao Xi sighed in her heart. Song Shiyu had come at the right time. Otherwise, she really did not know how to explain it to Gu Zheng. She quickly got up, put on her clothes, washed up, and followed Gu Zheng out without makeup.","On the way, Gu Zheng glanced at her and asked softly, “Xi Xi, you seem to be looking forward to it. Could it be that you know what happened in the main residence?”","This bastard was testing her again!","Qiao Xi calmed down and smiled sweetly. “How could I know? It’s just that I hate the Lu family, so I’m definitely looking forward to their misfortune! Is there a problem with that?”","Gu Zheng nodded thoughtfully, but Song Shiyu pursed his lips. When he came in, he did not say whether it was a good thing or a bad thing that happened in the main residence, but Young Madam was very sure that the Lu family had encountered misfortune. Wasn’t it obvious enough?","When they were about to reach the main residence, Qiao Xi realized that she had said something wrong. She hurriedly changed the topic. “Ah Zheng, what’s going on in the main residence so early in the morning?”","Gu Zheng turned his head to look at her and asked with a smile, “Xi Xi, you don’t know?”","Qiao Xi’s entire body trembled as she was quick to respond, “I don’t! I don’t stay in the main residence. How would I know what’s going on there?!”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow. “From what you said just now, I thought you knew very well!”","Qiao Xi lowered her head and did not retort anymore. She knew that she was not Gu Zheng’s match.","The two of them arrived at the main residence. At this moment, many people were gathered outside the door. The villa was already in a mess. Lu Xiang’s flustered voice and Lu Yan’s angry roar came from inside.","Qiao Xi stood outside the door and pretended to be curious. “Ah Zheng, what’s wrong with them? I hear Lu Yan shouting that he can’t see. He was fine yesterday, so how can he not see today?”","Gu Zheng said slowly, “He must have done too many bad things. Even the fairy can’t stand it anymore, so she made him blind.”","Qiao Xi’s heart trembled: “...”","Fairy? Was she talking about her?","She pretended to be calm. “That’s right! Eyes are windows to the soul. What’s the use of a heartless person like Lu Yan having eyes? By the way, doesn’t Old Master Lu dote on Lu Yan very much? Why do I only hear Lu Xiang’s voice but not Old Master Lu’s?! Old Master Lu is too heartless. His own grandson is blind now, but he’s not saying a word.”","A smile appeared in Gu Zheng’s eyes, and Qiao Xi beamed.","The two of them entered the main residence and saw the chairs in the living room. The tea set and ornaments on the table had all been smashed into pieces, and the floor was covered in fragments.","The servants hid in a corner and trembled. No one dared to make a sound. Lu Xiang pointed at the crowd and questioned, “Tell me! Why did Ah Yan suddenly lose his eyesight? What did you feed him or what did you use on him?”"]},{"number":1152,"title":"Chapter 1152 - They’re All Poisoned","paragraphs":["As soon as Lu Xiang finished speaking, a servant rushed down from upstairs and shouted in a panic, “Second Miss! Bad news! The head of the family... The head of the family has fallen into a coma again!”","Initially, everyone thought that it was strange. Things were already like this downstairs, but Old Master Lu had not come downstairs yet. Now, the servant actually said that Old Master Lu was unconscious again!","Lu Xiang felt as if she had been struck by lightning. She stood rooted to the ground in a daze. Her ears buzzed. After calming down for a long time, she said with trembling lips, “What did you say? My father is unconscious?”","The doctors from the Medical Association hurriedly went upstairs to diagnose the old master. After a while, the doctors went downstairs and determined that Old Master Lu was poisoned. Lu Yan also lost his eyesight because of poison.","Qiao Xi grunted coldly. “Lu Yan has been poisoned! Old Master Lu has also been poisoned. Who exactly did this? There are so many bodyguards around the Lu family’s main residence. Who could’ve entered the main residence and poisoned them? The Lu family must’ve done too many bad things. Even the fairies in the sky couldn’t stand it anymore, so they punished them! Ah Zheng, don’t you think so?”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and smiled. “Xi Xi, not only are there bodyguards but there are also surveillance cameras.”","What he meant was that if the Lu family wanted to investigate the culprit, they could start with the surveillance footage. Perhaps they could find clues. However, Qiao Xi was not nervous at all. She had already dealt with the surveillance footage.","“Sigh! Even if we catch the culprit, it’s meaningless! Lu Yan is already blind. It looks like he’ll go crazy soon!”","Gu Zheng nodded and said, “The person clearly knows that there are so many bodyguards and surveillance cameras around the Lu family’s main residence, yet they still dared to poison the people in the main residence. This means that they’re completely confident that they won’t be discovered. Xi Xi, what do you think?”","Qiao Xi was speechless. She kept having the feeling that this bastard was secretly mocking her.","Seeing that she was silent, Gu Zheng did not continue teasing her and looked up at Lu Xiang.","At this moment, the main residence was in chaos. Lu Xiang’s mind was buzzing. Today, the direct descendants of the Lu family were going to pay respects to their ancestors, but now that the head of the Lu family was unconscious and the heir of the Lu family was blind, the entire Lu family would fall into Gu Zheng’s hands. The old master had to wake up!","The doctors told Lu Xiang seriously, “Old Master Lu was poisoned around 11 o’clock last night. It’s been so long, and the poison has already penetrated deep into his body. He can’t wake up for the time being. Young Master Lu and Old Master Lu were poisoned at about the same time. Both poisons are very strong, and it’s been a few hours since they were poisoned. It’ll be very difficult for them to recover.”","Gu Zheng looked at Qiao Xi who was beside him and lowered his voice. “Xi Xi, Old Master Lu and Lu Yan were poisoned at 11 o’clock!”","Qiao Xi widened her eyes and pretended to be surprised. “11 o’clock! Everyone was busy for the entire day, so they would have long been resting at that time. That person must have planned it out seeing as they poisoned the two Lu family members while everyone was asleep!”","Gu Zheng bent down and whispered into her ear, “Although there are many surveillance cameras in the Lu family’s mansion, there’s a small path that doesn’t have any.”","Qiao Xi cried out in surprise. “So that’s how it is! I didn’t expect that in order to save money, the Lu family didn’t install any surveillance cameras on that small path. We must get them installed after this. If the culprit manages to escape, we won’t be able to catch them!”","Song Shiyu: “...” ‘I really have to give it to you two! One of you was the one who poisoned, while the other was the one who deleted the surveillance footage, yet you two are still pretending to be innocent!’","“Are you very happy that the culprit managed to run away?” Gu Zheng asked with a smile.","Qiao Xi’s heart trembled, but her expression did not change. “How is that possible?! A dangerous person appeared in the Lu family’s mansion. It made me very afraid as well! It’s best if we catch them as soon as possible. The people who were poisoned today are Lu Yan and Old Master Lu. Perhaps it’ll be us tomorrow. It’s really too terrifying!”","On the other hand, the doctors from the Medical Association had already examined the two patients and shook their heads helplessly. “Second Miss Lu, we’ve given Chairman Lu medicine. The poison in his body has temporarily stabilized, but we can’t guarantee when he’ll wake up. As for Young Master Lu’s eyes, they need long-term treatment. He won’t be able to recover in the short term.”","Lu Yan sat on the sofa, his face pale. His lips were pursed tightly. When he woke up in the morning and opened his eyes, it was dark in front of him. At first, he thought that the sky was not bright yet. It was only when Lu Xiang came over and knocked on the door that he knew that he could not see.","Suddenly falling into endless darkness, Lu Yan could not remain calm. The gentle mask he had maintained for many years finally cracked.","Usually, Old Master Lu and Lu Yan were the ones in charge of the Lu family. Now that one of them was blind and the other was unconscious, Lu Xiang was instantly at a loss. With her ability, she could not manage the Lu family at all. She did not know what to do for the ancestral worship ceremony today."]},{"number":1153,"title":"Chapter 1153 - Lu Yan Is Uneasy","paragraphs":["Lu Xiang’s expression darkened. Why did it have to be on the day of the ancestral worship ceremony? Lu Yan was blind, and the old master was unconscious.","At the thought of this, Lu Xiang suddenly turned to look at Gu Zheng. Her fingers trembled as she pointed at Gu Zheng. “You! It must be you! Only you would poison my father and Ah Yan!”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent. There was no fluctuation in his deep eyes at all. There was even a trace of disdain.","Lu Xiang hated Gu Zheng’s expression the most. He was clearly the bastard that no one wanted. He had been abused by Huang Lilan since he was young. The Gu and Lu families hated him, but now, he was high and mighty. He was not respectful or afraid of her at all. Instead, he was filled with disdain.","She was furious and roared, “Gu Zheng! Take out the antidote! Why are you so vicious?! I’m going to call the police! Guards! Quickly arrest this culprit who harmed his family!”","The main residence instantly fell silent. The servants all stood in the corner, not daring to move.","Lu Xiang pointed at the group of people and shouted angrily, “You bunch of trash! If you don’t dare to do it, I’ll do it myself!”","As she spoke, her face turned ferocious as she rushed toward Gu Zheng like a shrew. “Quickly take out the antidote! You must have poisoned them, you—”","“Second Miss Lu, what evidence do you have to say that Gu Zheng poisoned them?” Qiao Xi stood in front of Gu Zheng and grabbed Lu Xiang’s wrist. Her expression was cold, and her voice became low. “It’s slander if you don’t have any evidence! I can sue you for slander!”","Everyone’s gazes landed on the two of them. Lu Xiang struggled, but Qiao Xi’s hand was like an iron clamp that did not waver in the slightest.","On the other hand, Lu Yan’s vision was dark. His heart was filled with panic, and he could only sit on the sofa without daring to move. Hearing Qiao Xi’s voice, Lu Yan gritted his teeth, and his heart was filled with resentment.","At this moment, Lu Xiang had already gone mad. She pointed at Qiao Xi and roared furiously. “Let go of me! Gu Zheng, it was you who poisoned them! Give me the antidote! If you don’t take it out, I’ll definitely make you regret it. Aren’t you afraid that if news of this gets out, it’ll affect you?”","The entire venue was deathly silent. A moment later, Qiao Xi sneered. “Second Miss Lu, the doctor said that Old Master Lu and Lu Yan were poisoned at 11 o’clock last night. At that time, Gu Zheng and I were resting in Yun Court. How could we have come to the main residence and poisoned them by avoiding the bodyguards and surveillance cameras?","“Old Master Lu and Lu Yan have both been poisoned. I know you’re very sad about it and can’t accept this fact. Even so, you can’t malign others!!”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were still indifferent. Lu Xiang was so angry that she almost vomited blood. As she roared angrily, her voice became hoarse. “I’m not maligning him! It must be Gu Zheng! Only he has the guts to poison them in the entire Lu family’s mansion!”","Qiao Xi had a helpless expression. “Ah Zheng and I won’t take the blame. Second Miss Lu, why don’t you quickly check the surveillance footage? There might be clues. At the same time, it’ll prove that Ah Zheng and I never came to the main residence.”","Lu Xiang bared her fangs and brandished her claws as she shouted, “Then check the surveillance footage! Hurry up and go!”","Lu Yan sat on the sofa and had a bad feeling. He kept having the feeling that Qiao Xi was guiding Lu Xiang to say certain things, but when he wanted to stop Lu Xiang, it was too late.","His eyes were dry, and he felt very uncomfortable. His heartbeat was chaotic as if something bad was about to happen.","The only way now was to check the surveillance footage. At that time, they would be able to discover who poisoned him and Grandpa. However, Lu Yan was very uneasy. He was the victim, and the person who poisoned him was clearly Gu Zheng. He did not have to be afraid at all.","“Second Miss, I’ve copied the surveillance footage into my laptop.” Soon, the butler came to the hall with his laptop.","Everyone’s eyes were fixed on the screen. The surroundings of Yun Court were very quiet. No one entered or left. It was as quiet as a painting.","Gu Zheng glanced at the surveillance footage and looked at Qiao Xi with smiling eyes. Qiao Xi had an innocent expression. “Ah Zheng, why are you looking at me?”","“It’s nothing. I just think you’re very powerful, Xi Xi.”","Qiao Xi’s heart trembled. When she went to the main residence yesterday, she kept feeling that someone was watching her. Moreover, when she went to the surveillance room, she realized that the door was open as if someone had been there.","If she did not sense it wrongly, that person must have come to the surveillance room in advance and modified the surveillance footage. That was why she did not see anyone else in the surveillance footage.","There was only one person in the Lu family’s mansion who had such superb skills—Gu Zheng!","Qiao Xi could not help but raise her eyes to look at Gu Zheng. The corners of his mouth carried a gentle smile, but his expression was indifferent."]},{"number":1154,"title":"Chapter 1154 - He’s The Culprit!","paragraphs":["“Second Miss Lu, did you see it clearly?” Qiao Xi asked coldly.","Everyone had also clearly seen the surveillance footage. Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi had not left Yun Court since they returned. Lu Xiang’s heart felt like it was stuffed with a huge rock as she retorted indignantly, “Maybe they weren’t poisoned last night. Maybe Gu Zheng poisoned them a long time ago but the poisons just acted up last night.”","Qiao Xi grunted coldly. “Second Miss Lu, this is just a guess of yours. Besides, the doctor has already said that the two of them were poisoned last night. If you don’t believe it, you can look for a doctor you trust to re-examine them.”","The moment that was said, the doctors of the Medical Association were instantly unhappy. They represented the authority of the Medical Association. An illegitimate daughter of the Lu family actually doubted their medical skills?","Lu Xiang was speechless. She did not expect that Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi had really never left Yun Court. However, who else would poison Lu Yan and the old master?","Gu Zheng was the most suspicious. If Lu Yan lost his sight, he would have a chance to be the heir. If the old master was unconscious, he could also use this opportunity to control the Lu family. Gu Zheng would be the greatest beneficiary.","Just as Lu Xiang was deep in thought, the butler’s panicked voice suddenly came from beside her. “Young Master! Why did you go to the master’s room so late at night? And what’s that in your hand? It was exactly 11 o’clock!”","The moment that was said, everyone looked at the surveillance footage. At 11 o’clock, Lu Yan entered Old Master Lu’s bedroom with a white medicine bottle.","One of the doctors asked in disbelief, “Could it be that he poisoned the old master?”","The doctor said that Old Master Lu was poisoned at 11 pm, and the surveillance footage showed Lu Yan entering Old Master Lu’s bedroom with a bottle of medicine at night.","No one could see the scene in the room, but only Lu Yan had entered during this period. It seemed obvious what he had done. He was not asleep in the middle of the night and had secretly entered the old master’s room. Could it be that he was there to chat with the old master?","At this moment, everyone looked at Lu Yan with eyes that were filled with shock and disdain. Qiao Xi smiled lightly. This was the effect she wanted.","When Lu Yan heard the voices around him, cold sweat broke out on his forehead. He was blind and could not see the surveillance footage, but he did not remember going to his grandfather’s room at all, let alone poisoning him.","The hall was terrifyingly quiet. Qiao Xi sighed. “Young Master Lu, I know you don’t want Ah Zheng to return to the Lu family, but even if Ah Zheng returns, the old master will still dote on you. How could you poison the old master?”","The moment that was said, the entire venue was silent. Time seemed to have frozen. After a long time, someone said in shock, “It’s actually... Lu Yan!”","“I really didn’t expect this! The head of the family spent so much effort nurturing a snake!”","“Idiot! Now that the head of the family is poisoned and unconscious, who can protect him?”","Hearing everyone’s voices, Lu Yan felt as if he had been struck by lightning. He retorted weakly, “I didn’t poison anyone!”","He gritted his teeth and said in an extremely dry voice, “Grandpa is so good to me. Just as everyone said, if he’s unconscious, no one will be around to protect me. I won’t be so stupid!”","Lu Xiang also stood up to defend him. “It can’t be Ah Yan! He’s the most filial. Moreover, he was poisoned as well and is blind now. If he really poisoned the old master, why is he blind?”","Qiao Xi said thoughtfully, “Perhaps he deliberately blinded himself. In this way, he’ll become a victim as well and no one will suspect him.”","“Theoretically speaking, Young Master Lu wouldn’t have poisoned the old master. But even if he can come up with many excuses, how will he explain the scene in the surveillance footage? Young Master Lu, aren’t you the one in the surveillance footage?”","Everyone nodded. With the surveillance footage as evidence, what else could they deny? At this point, Lu Yan was still defending himself. Other than Lu Xiang, who would believe him?","Gu Zheng’s burning gaze landed on Qiao Xi, and the corners of his mouth curled up slightly. Xi Xi was really too beautiful when she stood up for him.","Lu Yan bit his lip until it bled. His vision was dark, but he could still feel the disdainful and disgusted gazes around him. However, he did not poison anyone at all!","He clenched his fists tightly and smashed them fiercely onto the table. He gritted his teeth and said, “Qiao Xi! You’re wrongly accusing me!”","“Young Master Lu, you know very well whether you’re innocent or not. Moreover, everyone has seen that you’re the one in the surveillance footage.” Qiao Xi grunted coldly. “If it weren’t for the surveillance footage, I’m afraid Ah Zheng would have taken the blame for you. Could it be that your motive for poisoning Old Master Lu was to frame Ah Zheng?”","Without waiting for Lu Yan to retort, Qiao Xi turned around and said unhappily, “Ah Zheng, after paying respects to your mother, let’s leave the Lu family. We shouldn’t interact with the Lu family anymore. They’re constantly thinking of ways to frame you. How annoying!”"]},{"number":1155,"title":"Chapter 1155 - She’s Suspected Of Being An Accomplice","paragraphs":["The surrounding discussion made Lu Yan’s heart drop. He wanted to explain, but he did not know what to say. He could not see anything now, and this group of people was saying that they saw him in the surveillance footage.","Lu Xiang’s face was ferocious as she almost broke down. For the first time, she felt helpless. It was as if a thousand-kilogram rock was pressing down on her body. She could not breathe.","Qiao Xi frowned unhappily and questioned, “Second Miss Lu, we’ve already found the culprit who poisoned Old Master Lu. What do you want to do with him? Not only did this person cause Old Master Lu to be unconscious, but he also tried to frame Ah Zheng. You can’t let this go. After all, when you thought that Ah Zheng was the culprit just now, you wanted to call the police to arrest him. If you don’t deal with Lu Yan, everyone will think that you’re still biased toward him and indulge him even after he poisoned Old Master Lu!","“Could it be that the poisoning is also related to you, Second Miss Lu? After all, if you two poison Old Master Lu, you and Ah Yan can monopolize the Lu family’s assets.”","As soon as these words were spoken, everyone could not help but gasp. This crime was huge. Qiao Xi meant that if Lu Xiang did not deal with Lu Yan, she would be suspected of being an accomplice!","“Qiao Xi!” Lu Xiang roared angrily as her temples twitched.","Qiao Xi covered her ears with a disdainful expression. “Lower your voice. I’m not deaf. Old Master Lu is unconscious, but you’re not worried at all. Instead, you’re concerned about Lu Yan. I suspect there’s a good reason for you two to conspire to harm Old Master Lu!”","The surroundings instantly fell silent. Gu Zheng had a smile on the corners of his mouth as he nodded elegantly. “Xi Xi, you’re right.”","Lu Xiang instantly panicked and retorted in horror, “I didn’t! Ah Yan would never have poisoned my father. The surveillance footage is fake! You must have tampered with it!”","As soon as she finished speaking, the butler said helplessly, “Second Miss, we’ve already found the medicine bottle in Young Master’s room. The doctor has confirmed that it’s the poison that poisoned Old Master. I think we should quickly get Young Master to admit his mistake! Otherwise, if this matter blows up, it won’t be good for our Lu family.”","Qiao Xi’s gaze paused. She had long taken the medicine bottle away, so why did the butler say that he found poison in Lu Yan’s room? Moreover, even if the butler had found the medicine bottle, shouldn’t he tell Lu Xiang about it in private? If he said it in front of everyone, wouldn’t it be equivalent to telling everyone that Lu Yan had indeed poisoned the old master?","How could the Lu family’s butler be so unreasonable? In that case...","Qiao Xi gulped and could not help but look at the man beside her. This butler was one of Gu Zheng’s people!","At this moment, Gu Zheng was still elegant and noble as if everything that was happening had nothing to do with him.","Lu Xiang’s face was pale. Her legs went weak as she fell onto the chair. She never expected that after her father fell back into a coma, not only would Ah Yan lose his eyesight, but he would also become the culprit behind the poisoning.","Just as everyone was about to leave, someone said indignantly, “The surveillance cameras captured it very clearly. It was clearly Lu Yan who poisoned the old master. Now that the truth is out, shouldn’t Second Miss Lu and Lu Yan apologize to President Gu? Old Master Lu taught Lu Yan well, but he actually poisoned Old Master Gu for the sake of power. He’s really heartless!”","“I think Lu Yan was afraid that President Gu would snatch his position as the heir after returning to the Lu family, so he poisoned the old master. That way, he could inherit the Lu family as soon as possible. He’s vicious!”","Hearing the ridicule from around him, Lu Yan gritted his teeth. “Gu Zheng!!!”","“Young Master Lu, we can hear you. There’s no need to be so loud.” Qiao Xi’s tone was mocking. “Young Master Lu, you’re the heir of the Lu family now. If Old Master Lu continues to be unconscious, according to the rules, you’ll be the next head of the family. The entire Lu family will fall into your hands, right?”","“Qiao Xi! What nonsense are you talking about? My father will definitely wake up!” Lu Xiang shouted at the top of her voice, “The heir of the Lu family can only be Ah Yan. Gu Zheng can forget about it!”","Qiao Xi had an indifferent expression. “Second Miss Lu, you’re so protective of Lu Yan. Do you think he’s your son?! Since you’re so confident, just wait and see!”","Lu Xiang’s expression suddenly darkened. She wanted to curse, but Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng had already turned around and left.","Hearing their footsteps getting farther and farther away, Lu Yan’s expression was as gloomy as ink. He gritted his teeth and said, “Aunt, we absolutely can’t let Gu Zheng enter the ancestral hall!”","Lu Xiang hurriedly went forward and comforted him. “Ah Yan, we haven’t lost yet. You’re still the heir of the Lu family. As long as Gu Zheng announces that he’s giving up the inheritance in public, no one will fight with you anymore!”","Lu Yan took a deep breath. His body was extremely tired, and his vision was still dark. His eyes were empty as if he had lost his soul."]},{"number":1156,"title":"Chapter 1156 - Live Broadcast Of The Ancestral","paragraphs":["Lu Yan leaned against the sofa and panted heavily. “Yes, I haven’t lost yet. It hasn’t reached the last moment. It’s still uncertain who will win.”","Gu Zheng was very proud now, but he would not continue to be proud.","Lu Yan clenched his fists tightly and said word by word, “Aunt, in my current situation, I can’t participate in the ancestral worship ceremony. I’ll leave the ceremony to you and Fifth Uncle. You can’t let Gu Zheng enter the ancestral hall.”","At the same time, Qiao Xi received a USB drive from Ji Nan. She inserted it into her laptop and opened it. Then, she revealed a surprised expression. “There are so many things here! You’ve been busy in the Lu family for the past two years!”","Ji Nan smiled in embarrassment. “Since you’ve given me your orders, I’ll naturally do my best. There are also some audio recordings of Lu Bai here. This evidence is enough to overturn the Lu family.”","Qiao Xi sighed lightly. “The tide is turning. The Lu family will definitely go bankrupt after this.”","The identity of the heir of the Lu family, Lu Yan, would be exposed during the ancestral worship ceremony today. He would be chased out of the house after losing his eyesight. At the same time, all kinds of negative news were exposed about the Lu family. The already unstable Lu Corporation wouldn’t be able to withstand such a blow at all.","Lu Bai was unconscious. As the heir, Lu Yan should stand up and take charge of the situation. However, he couldn’t even protect himself. After his identity was exposed, the Lu family would naturally not listen to his orders. Moreover, Lu Yan had poisoned the old master and was an illegitimate child. In addition to his crime of pretending to be Lu Qingyun’s son, the Lu family would definitely not tolerate such a person becoming the next head of the family.","“Investigate who that butler belongs to.” Qiao Xi was silent for a moment before asking softly.","Ji Nan hesitated for a moment before replying, “This butler has been in the Lu family for decades. He should be Lu Bai’s subordinate.”","Decades? In that case, the butler should not be one of Gu Zheng’s people. Then why did he say those words in public? Did he hate Lu Yan for poisoning Old Master Lu?","...","On the other hand, Gu Yao was reviewing documents in the Gu family’s company office when he suddenly received a call from his assistant. After he picked it up, he found out that the Lu family’s ancestral worship ceremony had made the headlines.","As a century-old family in Li City, the Lu family held an ancestral worship every year. This was not anything special. Why was it on the news?","Gu Yao stopped what he was doing and suddenly remembered that Gu Zheng was also attending the Lu family’s ancestral worship. Could it be that Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi had done something big?","After thinking carefully, he suddenly recalled Lu Yan’s identity. With his understanding of Gu Zheng, Gu Zheng would probably take this opportunity to expose Lu Yan’s true identity. From then on, Lu Yan would no longer be a member of the Lu family. He would not be able to target the identity of Lu Qingyun’s son and rely on that to commit crimes. He would just be an illegitimate child born to Huang Lilan.","After hanging up, a notification popped up on Gu Yao’s phone. He clicked on it and was stunned.","Live broadcast of the ancestral worship ceremony?","‘F*ck! Are you kidding me?! Aren’t they going too far?’","An hour later, the direct descendants of the Lu family were prepared to enter the ancestral hall to pay their respects. However, Old Master Lu was still unconscious. As Lu Yan was blind, he could not attend either, so the host was the fifth uncle of the Lu family.","Fifth Uncle and Lu Xiang looked at each other and had a tacit understanding. Lu Xiang took out her phone and wanted to send Lu Yan a message, but she realized that there was no signal on her phone. Soon, the others also realized that there was no signal in the Lu family’s mansion, but they thought that perhaps the surrounding circuits were being repaired. They did not take it to heart. Anyway, the ancestral worship ceremony was about to start, so they did not have time to look at their phones.","Lu Xiang’s mind was filled with how to deal with Gu Zheng, so she did not care about there being no signal.","Ji Nan, who was in the crowd, sneered in his heart and gestured to his subordinates. The invisible cameras around him were turned on and aimed at the interior and exterior of the Lu family’s ancestral hall.","A live broadcast of the ancestral worship ceremony would soon spread throughout the country. At that time, Lu Yan’s true identity and the Lu family’s actions all these years would be made public.","Qiao Xi stood obediently by Gu Zheng’s side. Gu Zheng glanced at Ji Nan and the people around him and asked softly, “Xi Xi, what’s your plan for today?”","Qiao Xi smiled sweetly. “You’ll know in a while. Just watch!”","The next second, the clock rang. The direct descendants of the Lu family could now enter the ancestral hall to pay their respects. At this moment, all the major platforms on the internet were dominated by the topic of the Lu family paying respects to their ancestors.","The netizens clicked on the notification curiously and realized that it was a live broadcast. They started chatting in the live broadcast: [Is it the Lu family from Li City? They’re actually doing a live broadcast of the ancestral worship ceremony! Amazing!]"]},{"number":1157,"title":"Chapter 1157 - Better To Be Cautious","paragraphs":["The live-stream was very lively. Someone said in a disdainful tone: [The Lu family is doing a live-stream of them paying respects to their ancestors! The Lu family’s company is in a difficult situation now, so they’re starting to earn money by doing live-streams?]","[We’re not here to see the ceremony. We’re here to see the two handsome men, Gu Zheng and Lu Yan! I heard that they’re the two men that the socialites of Li City want to marry the most. We can’t marry into a rich family, but we can look at how big families pay respects to their ancestors online to broaden our horizons!]","Although the Lu family was not as prosperous as before, they were still a century-old family. A starving camel was still bigger than a horse. Naturally, they lived a life of a noble family that ordinary people could not reach. The Lu family’s residence also included several villas. They were expensive and could not be bought by ordinary people even if they were to work for a few lifetimes. Hence, the Lu family’s live broadcast attracted many people’s attention.","No one in the live-stream explained why they wanted to do a live-stream, but this live-stream inexplicably became a hot topic and attracted many netizens to watch it.","At this moment, outside the Lu family’s ancestral hall, Gu Zheng’s eyes narrowed slightly. He had already noticed the location of the cameras. Then, he leaned close to Qiao Xi’s ear and chuckled. “Xi Xi, don’t you feel like we’re being watched?”","Qiao Xi knew that there were cameras around, so she tried her best not to enter the range of the cameras. Faced with Gu Zheng’s question, she could only laugh dryly. “Those people from the Lu family must think that we’re a perfect match, so they’re taking a few more glances at us.”","The man smiled elegantly, then raised his eyebrows. “Xi Xi, don’t you realize that everyone’s phones have no signal?”","Qiao Xi hurriedly took out her phone to take a look and pretended to be surprised. “Ah! It’s true! What kind of lousy place is this?! There’s actually no signal!”","Gu Zheng’s expression was calm as he quickly glanced at her phone. Realizing that her signal was normal, he could not help but smile. Then, he secretly put his phone, which also had a signal, in his pocket. “Yes, it’s indeed not good here. We’ll leave after the ancestral worship ceremony.”","Qiao Xi thought that Gu Zheng would definitely not notice it, so she lowered her head and smiled like a little fox that had succeeded.","Gu Zheng stroked her hair affectionately and sneered. “Xi Xi, it’s better to be safe than sorry. If you play such a big game, you’ll be easily discovered.”","Qiao Xi had an innocent expression. “Ah Zheng, what are you talking about? Why don’t I understand?! I’ve always been very serious about paying respects to my ancestors. What’s this talk about playing? Don’t always say strange things.”","The two of them stood in a corner. There were very few people around, and no one heard their conversation. At this moment, Lu Yan, Lu Xiang, and Fifth Uncle, who was in charge of the ancestral worship ceremony, were at the front.","Today’s ancestral worship ceremony was for the direct descendants of the Lu family to enter the ancestral hall to pay their respects. The others had to pray outside the ancestral hall. Many large-scale ceremonies would be carried out as well. The netizens in the live-stream had never seen such a big scene and were excited.","[The ancestral worship ceremony is so complicated! As expected of a century-old family. I’ve really learned something new today! Moreover, only the direct descendants of the Lu family can enter the ancestral hall!]","[That’s right! Large families value their direct descendants very much. This is the Lu family’s mansion, so naturally, the owners of the Lu family’s mansion will pay respects to their ancestors. But I remember that Gu Zheng is Lu Qingyun’s wandering son! Lu Qingyun was Old Master Lu’s most beloved daughter. Logically speaking, Gu Zheng should enter the ancestral hall!]","[Is Gu Zheng here? Where is he? Why don’t I see him?]","Gu Zheng was the god of Li City. The netizens wanted to see him. After all, who wouldn’t love a handsome, rich, and capable man?","Actually, Gu Zheng rarely showed his face, but everyone knew that this president was a handsome man. He was even more handsome than celebrities, but everyone looked around and did not see Gu Zheng. Could it be that he was not participating in the ancestral worship ceremony?","No way!","Even if Gu Zheng did not want to interact with the Lu family, he would still pay his respects to his mother, Lu Qingyun!","At this moment, Qiao Xi was hiding in a corner and asked meaningfully, “Why isn’t Lu Xiang sensible at all?! Why isn’t she inviting you over at a time like this?”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent as if everything was expected.","Qiao Xi nodded thoughtfully. “Lu Xiang definitely doesn’t want you to enter the ancestral hall, but you’re a direct descendant of the Lu family. What right does an illegitimate daughter like her have to stop you from entering the ancestral hall?”","The glint in Gu Zheng’s eyes grew brighter. He already knew what Lu Xiang wanted to do, and he knew that Qiao Xi had long guessed it too. Even so, Qiao Xi insisted on pretending to rack her brains before saying, “Lu Xiang doesn’t have any other excuses now. She’ll probably mention your mother and say that Eldest Miss Lu visited her in her dreams and doesn’t want you to pay your respects. Ah Zheng, don’t you think so?”","Gu Zheng smiled affectionately. “You’re right.”"]},{"number":1158,"title":"Chapter 1158 - Dreamt Of Lu Qingyun","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi took out her phone to take a look. There were already millions of viewers in the live-stream. Everyone was anxiously waiting for the Lu family’s direct descendants to pay respects to their ancestors.","In a few minutes, the door of the ancestral hall would open. The Lu family had to enter the ancestral hall to pay their respects to their ancestors under everyone’s gazes.","[Is President Gu not here yet?]","[I think I saw President Gu standing in a corner! He’s also a direct descendant of the Lu family. Why is he standing behind?]","[Did you notice that there seems to be something wrong with Lu Yan’s eyes? His face is very pale! He seems to be sick. My heart aches for Brother Lu Yan!]","Lu Yan had a gentle appearance. At this moment, he was sitting in a wheelchair with a pale face, making him look even more lovable. However, compared to Gu Zheng, he looked pale.","At half-past 10, everyone was ready to enter the ancestral hall, but Gu Zheng still did not walk to the door.","Lu Xiang glanced at Fifth Uncle, feeling uneasy. “Do you think Grand Old Master will...”","Fifth Uncle pursed his lips. “Impossible. The grand old master has been in a vegetative state since long ago. The doctors from the Medical Association tried to treat him, but it was useless. Unless the divine physician appears, it’s absolutely impossible for him to wake up. However, the divine physician went missing a few years ago. The grand old master isn’t around, so no one will stand up for Gu Zheng.”","For some reason, Lu Xiang felt a little uneasy. Two major events happened to the Lu family early in the morning. She kept having the feeling that the ancestral worship ceremony would not go smoothly.","The grand old master of the Lu family was Lu Bai’s father, the previous head of the Lu family, and Lu Qingyun’s biological grandfather. He had always doted on Lu Qingyun. Whenever he woke up, he would always be protective of Lu Qingyun. Hence, even though Lu Bai hated his daughter, he had no choice but to listen to the grand old master’s instructions and let Lu Qingyun manage Lu Corporation.","Now that the grand old master had already become a vegetable, he could no longer wake up. Even if he really opened his eyes, he probably would not have the strength to stand up for Gu Zheng in front of everyone.","Originally, they did not care about the grand old master at all. However, Lu Xiang saw the grand old master’s capable assistant this morning. That person had a smile on his face as if he had good news to share. From then on, she felt a little uneasy. She kept having the feeling that the grand old master was about to wake up.","However, on second thought, the grand old master had been unconscious for so many years. Why would he wake up on this day? Moreover, even if he woke up, he might not recognize Gu Zheng.","At the thought of this, Lu Xiang suddenly felt confident. As long as they did not relent, what right did Gu Zheng have to enter the ancestral hall?","Lu Yan was blind and could not walk. He could only sit in a wheelchair, but his face was still gentle. He was no different from the gentle noble young master in everyone’s impression.","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent as he stood quietly in a corner.","Thump!","The butler rang the bell. The ceremony had reached the most important part. Everyone from the Lu family looked up and saw Lu Xiang clear her throat before saying loudly, “Before we enter the ancestral hall, I have something to say.”","The audience in the live-stream could not wait anymore and posted comments crazily. Qiao Xi lazily raised her eyes and shot Ji Nan a look. Ji Nan hurriedly aimed the camera at Lu Xiang and gave her a close-up.","Lu Xiang did not know that there were cameras at all. She said seriously, “Last night, I dreamed of my sister. She told me...”","Everyone was puzzled. Why was Lu Xiang talking about this before paying respects to her ancestors?","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up. It was indeed exactly as she had guessed. Lu Xiang was helpless and could only use Eldest Miss Lu Qingyun’s name to force Gu Zheng to leave.","“Sister knows that we’re holding the ancestral worship ceremony today. She doesn’t want to see anyone related to Huang Lilan. She originally had a beautiful marriage and a happy family, but she eventually died of depression. All of this is Huang Lilan’s fault, so...”","Everyone looked at her with burning eyes. Lu Xiang gritted her teeth and said, “President Gu, in order to fulfill my sister’s wish, please leave!”","The entire venue instantly fell silent.","Everyone looked at each other and could not help but look at Gu Zheng at last. Just because Lu Xiang dreamed of Lu Qingyun, she wanted to chase Gu Zheng out of the Lu family?","However, in the Lu family’s mansion, the only person related to Huang Lilan was Gu Zheng. After all, Gu Zheng was raised by Huang Lilan for more than 20 years. Even though Huang Lilan did not treat him well, he had always been Huang Lilan’s son all these years.","The surroundings were terrifyingly quiet. The fifth uncle of the Lu family hypocritically stood up to mediate the situation. “Lu Xiang, it was just a dream. How can we believe it? Although our Lu family is holding the ancestral worship ceremony today, we can’t be too superstitious. How can we chase President Gu out because of this?”"]},{"number":1159,"title":"Chapter 1159 - Huang Lilan’s Biological Son","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng sneered. Did Lu Xiang and Fifth Uncle really think that they could not tell?","Qiao Xi also knew clearly in her heart that Lu Xiang had long discussed it with Fifth Uncle. That person must be on Lu Xiang’s side. Immediately after, Fifth Uncle said, “But you’re about to enter the ancestral hall, yet you actually dreamed of Qingyun. If Qingyun is really unhappy, it won’t be a good thing for us. After all, Qingyun is the daughter the head of the family dotes on the most. She passed away at a young age. If she has any requests, we should do our best to satisfy them. If the head of the family is present, he’ll definitely respect Qingyun’s wishes!”","Gu Zheng leaned lazily to the side, his figure tall. He was expressionless as he quietly listened to Fifth Uncle’s words, but his aura was strong, and he exuded a chill.","At this point, Fifth Uncle even pretended to be sad. “President Gu, you also know that it’s all thanks to Qingyun that the Lu family is where they are today. Even if this is just a dream, we can’t go against Qingyun’s wishes. I hope you can understand us. Please leave first. If you have the chance in the future, come and pay your respects again.”","The live-stream fell silent, and the scene was terrifyingly quiet. The rest of the Lu family also widened their eyes. Although Gu Zheng grew up by Huang Lilan’s side, he was Lu Qingyun’s biological son! Now that Lu Qingyun appeared in Lu Xiang’s dream to forbid Gu Zheng from participating in the ancestral worship ceremony, what exactly was going on?!","Everyone looked at Gu Zheng, waiting for his response. After a long silence, he said calmly, “Alright.”","??","Gu Zheng actually agreed?","If he agreed, it would be equivalent to admitting that he was hated by Lu Qingyun. How could someone who was hated by his biological mother be qualified to be the heir of the Lu family? Wasn’t he giving the opportunity to Lu Yan?","Amidst the silence, Qiao Xi said slowly, “Ah Zheng is kind and doesn’t want to make things difficult for everyone. Moreover, as Madam Lu Qingyun’s son, he should fulfill his mother’s wish. It’s normal for Madam Lu to hate Huang Lilan! Ah Zheng understands!”","Everyone was dumbfounded. They did not expect President Gu and Mrs. Gu to really agree. Lu Xiang, who was at the side, was extremely excited and hurriedly said, “Alright! Since you’ve agreed, please...”","“However, Ah Zheng is just Huang Lilan’s adopted son. Moreover, he was snatched away by Huang Lilan when he was born. At that time, he didn’t know anything at all and was forced to become an illegitimate child. Eldest Miss Lu was such a kind and tolerant person. She’ll definitely understand Ah Zheng. Why would she chase Ah Zheng away? Hence, I think there must be someone else she doesn’t want to see!”","As soon as Qiao Xi finished speaking, her gaze swept past everyone as she said casually, “If Ah Zheng, who was forced to become Huang Lilan’s son, can’t participate in the ancestral worship ceremony, then Huang Lilan’s biological son surely isn’t worthy, right?!”","Her words were light, but they caused ripples in everyone’s hearts.","Huang Lilan’s biological son? Who was it? The only people who grew up by Huang Lilan’s side were Gu Zheng and Gu Yao. Now that it was confirmed that neither of them was Huang Lilan’s biological son, could it be that her biological son was someone else?","Lu Xiang’s face was pale as intense fear engulfed her heart. She shouted uncontrollably, “Shut up! You’re spouting nonsense!”","“Second Miss Lu, don’t be so agitated! I’m just asking questions. Considering how you want to chase Ah Zheng away, then Huang Lilan’s biological son should also withdraw from the ceremony, right?” Qiao Xi questioned in a sharp voice.","The secret that Lu Xiang had hidden in the depths of her heart was about to be dug out. She was so afraid that her entire body was trembling as she pointed at Qiao Xi with trembling fingers.","“Mrs. Gu, who’s the son you’re talking about? Is he at the scene?” An elder from the Lu branch family could not help but ask, “The Lu family won’t invite outsiders to the ancestral worship ceremony. The people attending the ancestral worship ceremony are all from the Lu family. Moreover, Huang Lilan doesn’t have a biological son at all. Mrs. Gu, did you remember wrongly?”","If the son of a mistress could participate in the ancestral worship ceremony but Eldest Miss Lu’s biological son had to be chased out, then the Lu family would be too muddle-headed. Hence, this elder could not help but stand up and ask.","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up as her burning gaze landed on Lu Yan. She said meaningfully, “Young Master Lu, who do you think I’m talking about?”","Young Master Lu?","Everyone was dumbstruck. Could it be that the person Qiao Xi was talking about was Lu Yan?","After a long silence, someone asked tentatively, “Mrs. Gu, y-you’re saying that Lu Yan is Huang Lilan’s biological son?”","Impossible! Lu Yan had grown up in the Lu family since he was young. If he was Huang Lilan’s son, why would he be left at the Lu family’s door? Moreover, the Lu family had also done a DNA test back then and confirmed that Lu Yan was Lu Qingyun’s son."]},{"number":1160,"title":"Chapter 1160 - Sowing Discord Between The Brothers","paragraphs":["Everyone looked at Qiao Xi with slight displeasure. Although the Lu family’s actions were unreasonable, they could not casually slander Lu Yan just because Qiao Xi hated him!","Their gazes kept wandering between Lu Yan and Qiao Xi, and a trace of doubt arose in their hearts. To be honest, Lu Yan was indeed not similar to Miss Lu Qingyun at all.","Lu Yan’s vision was dark, but he could sense everyone’s sizing gazes. His heart was in turmoil. After suppressing his fluctuating emotions for a long time, he gritted his teeth and said, “Miss Qiao, watch your words.”","Lu Xiang’s eyes were filled with horror. She bared her fangs and brandished her claws as she shouted, “Qiao Xi! You’re taking revenge. Just because I’m not letting Gu Zheng participate in the ancestral worship ceremony, you want to slander Ah Yan. Ah Yan is already sick, yet you’re still bullying him. Why are you so heartless?!”","Fifth Uncle also stood up and berated, “Mrs. Gu, please apologize to Ah Yan. The children of our Lu family are definitely innocent. How could we raise the child of a mistress? Lu Yan has always been Qingyun’s child. He’s the direct descendant of the Lu family!”","Everyone’s doubtful gazes landed on Qiao Xi. It seemed that Qiao Xi could not stand Lu Xiang wanting to chase Gu Zheng away, so she slandered Lu Yan.","The comments in the live-stream exploded...","[No way! How could Lu Yan be Huang Lilan’s biological son? What nonsense is this woman talking about?!]","[This woman is always mysterious when she speaks. She can’t casually slander others just because her husband is being targeted! Young Master Lu Yan has always been so gentle. Such a gentle and elegant young master is definitely not the son of a mistress!]","[Why would President Gu marry such a woman? President Gu and Lu Yan are biological brothers. If it weren’t for this woman instigating things, the two of them wouldn’t have so many conflicts!]","Seeing that the situation had stabilized, Lu Xiang’s expression softened. Then, she said indignantly, “Qiao Xi, please apologize to Ah Yan immediately. Don’t delay our ancestral worship ceremony!”","Lu Yan also heaved a sigh of relief and said in a serious tone, “Miss Qiao, you’re slandering me without any evidence. I can sue you. I hope you can apologize to me seriously!”","Lu Xiang’s heartbeat was chaotic, and her eyes were filled with panic. She was afraid that she would not be able to keep the Lu family’s secret that had been hidden for many years. Then, she shouted self-righteously, “Yes! Qiao Xi, you don’t have any evidence and only know how to spout nonsense. We’re letting you off easy by just asking you to apologize! Leave the Lu family immediately after you apologize!”","Qiao Xi remained silent and even smiled in disdain. Lu Xiang felt that she had been insulted and looked at Gu Zheng angrily. “President Gu, you clearly know that Ah Yan is your biological younger brother. The two of you are brothers from the same mother! How can you let Mrs. Gu sow discord between the two of you? Ever since he found out about your identity, Ah Yan has always felt sorry for you and wanted to do his best to make it up to you. However, your wife publicly slandered Ah Yan as the son of a mistress. You’re trying to harm him!”","Gu Zheng’s expression was normal as if he did not hear Lu Xiang’s complaint at all.","Qiao Xi turned her head slightly to look at the door behind her, and the corners of her mouth curled into a confident smile.","All these years, the Lu family had always been under Lu Bai’s control. It seemed that everyone had forgotten that the former head of the family was still alive! Lu Bai’s father, who was also Lu Qingyun’s grandfather, was only unconscious. He was not dead.","After Lu Qingyun’s biological mother committed suicide, Lu Bai married his mistress and brought back Lu Xiang, who was a few years younger than Lu Qingyun. Lu Qingyun then had to live under the same roof as the mistress and the illegitimate daughter. Lu Qingyun’s life was naturally very difficult, but fortunately, the grand old master doted on Lu Qingyun very much. He nurtured her management skills since she was young and handed the company to her to manage when she reached adulthood. Lu Qingyun did not let the grand old master down. Lu Corporation reached greater heights with her guidance, which was also the Lu family’s peak.","When Lu Bai saw that his daughter was like a fish in water in the business world, he was not happy at all. Instead, he felt that Lu Qingyun and her biological mother made him look very useless and stole his limelight. Hence, the more outstanding Lu Qingyun was, the more he hated her.","It was precisely because of this that Qiao Xi did her best to awaken the grand old master of the Lu family. As long as he appeared, coupled with the evidence in her hands, Lu Yan’s identity would definitely be exposed.","“Second Miss Lu, I was just asking Young Master Lu just now. The others are all very shocked, but you’re the only one who’s very flustered and angry. Why is that?” Qiao Xi looked at her with disdain.","Just as Lu Xiang was about to retort, Qiao Xi spoke first, “Everyone is right. Huang Lilan’s biological son is Lu Yan!”"]},{"number":1161,"title":"Chapter 1161 - Who Said I Don’t Have Evidence?","paragraphs":["Hearing Qiao Xi’s words, Lu Yan felt as if a large rock was pressing against his heart. He could not say a word. Lu Xiang’s expression was panicked as she stopped her loudly. “Shut up! You’re slandering Ah Yan without any evidence. You’re deliberately here to cause trouble! Guards! Chase her out. Don’t let her delay our Lu family’s ancestral worship ceremony!”","“Who said I don’t have evidence?” Qiao Xi smiled confidently. She lazily raised her eyes, and her cold gaze landed on Lu Xiang. “Second Miss Lu, what evidence do you need? I have evidence that Eldest Miss Lu only gave birth to Ah Zheng and evidence that Huang Lilan swapped the child. Moreover, I have evidence that the Lu family knew that Lu Yan wasn’t a child of the Lu family, but they still raised him by their side and nurtured him to be the heir.”","Qiao Xi’s gaze was sharp, and her voice was icy-cold. Every word smashed into everyone’s hearts. They reacted for a long time before understanding Qiao Xi’s words. Hence, Miss Lu Qingyun only had Gu Zheng as her son, while Huang Lilan swapped her child with Gu Zheng. The Lu family clearly knew that the two children were swapped, but they pretended not to know.","In that case, how could Miss Lu Qingyun visit Lu Xiang in her dreams and even ask her to chase Gu Zheng away?","If all of this was true, then what Lu Xiang said in her dream today was a lie. It also proved that the Lu family was biased toward Lu Yan but hated Gu Zheng.","Lu Xiang revealed a terrified expression, and Lu Yan, who was at the side, was also trembling. He gritted his teeth and controlled his emotions. He could not panic, and he absolutely could not expose himself. Perhaps Qiao Xi was just trying to deceive him. She did not have any substantial evidence at all.","The entire venue was in an uproar as everyone discussed softly. Lu Yan said loudly, “Everyone.”","The surroundings fell silent. His expression was serious as he said calmly, “The Lu family knows that I’ve lived here since I was young. They also know that my mother is Lu Qingyun, but now, someone’s actually saying that I’m Huang Lilan’s son. How laughable! Miss Qiao, I understand that you’re targeting me for Gu Zheng. In the past, we had some misunderstandings, but the truth is out now. We’re biological brothers from the same mother. My mother is watching us from the sky. Why do you have to make the brothers go against each other?","“If I’m Huang Lilan’s biological son, why did Huang Lilan abandon me in the Lu family? Why didn’t she keep her biological son by her side? Moreover, if I’m really Huang Lilan’s son, why didn’t I say anything when Ah Zheng exposed Huang Lilan and chased her out of the Gu family some time ago?","“If she were my mother, I definitely wouldn’t have stood by and done nothing. However, she’s just a lowly and despicable mistress. She was the one who caused our mother’s death. I wish I could kill her to vent my anger. How can I be her son?”","Hearing Lu Yan’s sad explanation, everyone’s hearts could not help but ache. Qiao Xi, on the other hand, had a look of disdain on her face. She was so disgusted that she almost vomited. She really did not have the patience to watch Lu Yan act anymore.","However, Lu Yan was getting more and more confident. He took a deep breath and continued, “Miss Qiao, do you think that now that Huang Lilan has gone missing and there’s no way of verifying it that you can casually slander me?","“Ah Zheng was snatched away by Huang Lilan when he was young. All these years, he has suffered a lot in the Gu family. My heart aches for him, but all of this isn’t my fault! I shouldn’t be wronged just because I was lucky and led a carefree life in the Lu family!”","As soon as Lu Yan finished speaking, Lu Xiang, who was at the side, hurriedly chimed in, “That’s right! Ah Yan is my sister’s biological son. He and Ah Zheng are from the same mother. It’s just that back then, Huang Lilan secretly stole Ah Zheng, while Ah Yan was lucky enough to stay in the Lu family. Qiao Xi, now that the two brothers are reunited, as Ah Zheng’s wife, you should mediate the relationship between the two of them. However, you’re instigating trouble everywhere. Now, you’re actually spouting nonsense in public. You’re really too evil. Ah Zheng should divorce you!”","Fifth Uncle also said with a serious expression, “Mrs. Gu, we’re all family. As long as you apologize to Ah Yan, this matter will be over. If it goes to court, you won’t look good either!”","The entire venue was silent as everyone looked at Qiao Xi. Gu Zheng, who was at the side, had his arms crossed as he looked at her with interest. He was looking forward to Qiao Xi’s next plan. After all, she was so smart, so she would definitely not let the Lu family ride on her head.","The glint in Gu Zheng’s eyes grew brighter and brighter. His eyes were filled with affection as he bent down slightly and whispered into her ear, “Xi Xi, do whatever you want. You don’t have to care about me.”"]},{"number":1162,"title":"Chapter 1162 - Who Dares To Tell Xi Xi To Scram?","paragraphs":["Chapter 1162: Who Dares To Tell Xi Xi To Scram?","Qiao Xi slowly raised her eyes and revealed a crafty smile. Since Gu Zheng had said so, then she would let Lu Yan know the consequences of angering her!","The surroundings were silent as everyone waited for Qiao Xi to apologize.","After a long silence, Qiao Xi stroked her hair with an indifferent expression and sneered. “Let’s talk about the matter of apologizing first. I have to explain what Lu Yan just said. He mentioned the farce in the Gu family a few months ago. If he were Huang Lilan’s son, he would probably have saved her, but he didn’t. It wasn’t because he hates Huang Lilan but because he’s selfish and heartless. He didn’t hesitate to abandon his mother for his own benefit. He looks down on his mother from the bottom of his heart, and that’s because Huang Lilan is a mistress. As long as he’s involved with her, he’ll be mocked and scolded. That’s why he didn’t stand up for Huang Lilan. Otherwise, his identity would’ve been exposed and he would’ve been implicated right then and there.","“This also explains why Huang Lilan didn’t keep her son by her side. It’s because she knew that she was a mistress, so her son would be labeled as an illegitimate child and discriminated against like her. If she wanted to change Lu Yan’s fate, she had to make him the son of the first wife. Hence, she swapped the two children and left Lu Yan in the Lu family. I think Lu Yan hopes that Huang Lilan will die because if she does, we won’t be able to do a DNA test. We won’t be able to prove the two’s relationship.”","Qiao Xi’s words caused everyone present to be dumbstruck. At the same time, it was like a sharp knife had stabbed into Lu Yan’s heart. He flew into a rage. “Shut up!”","“Miss Qiao, I gave you a chance to apologize. If you refuse to repent and insist on slandering me, I’ll sue you. I hope you—”","“You’re the one who needs to shut up!” Qiao Xi mercilessly interrupted Lu Yan and said with a disdainful expression, “Go ahead and sue me. I’m telling the truth. I’m not slandering you. It won’t change anything even if we go to court.”","Lu Yan’s face was livid as he gritted his teeth. “Miss Qiao, I’ve also said that I have nothing to do with Huang Lilan. My mother is Lu Qingyun!”","“Young Master Lu, don’t tell me you really think that I have no evidence? Since I confidently said all this in public, it means that I’m confident I can prove it. I’m not a fool. Without evidence, would I dare to cause trouble in the Lu family? If I do that, I know you’ll make a move on me. The gains won’t make up for the losses.”","Her voice was soft, but there was a trace of mockery in her tone, making Lu Yan’s and Lu Xiang’s faces turn pale. Lu Xiang wished she could rush over and tear Qiao Xi’s indifferent face apart.","“Qiao Xi! Are you done?! Guards! Chase this crazy woman out! Gu Zheng isn’t even acknowledged by the Lu family. What right does this crazy woman have to cause trouble in the Lu family? Quickly chase her away!”","As soon as she finished speaking, Gu Zheng stood in front of Qiao Xi. The many bodyguards and servants were all frozen on the spot as they looked at each other. No one dared to attack Gu Zheng.","Lu Xiang only felt anger engulf her entire body. Her face was ferocious as she laughed crazily. “Alright! You pieces of trash are getting paid by the Lu family but you’re not doing as you’re told? Since you guys aren’t doing anything, I’ll chase them out myself.”","Just as Lu Xiang was about to rush over, Qiao Xi took a step forward and grabbed her wrist. She looked at her with a smile. “If Lu Yan is innocent, why are you so afraid of me saying these things? Could it be that you have a guilty conscience?”","“Guilty conscience? How laughable! I just can’t stand you slandering Ah Yan. He’s of the Lu family’s bloodline, and the entire Lu family knows about it. However, you just insist on causing trouble at the ancestral worship ceremony. You’ve already delayed the ceremony. Now, quickly get lost. If you delay the Lu family’s matter, I’ll absolutely not let you off!”","As soon as she finished speaking, the entire venue was silent. Suddenly, footsteps came from outside the courtyard. It sounded like there were many people.","Not long after, dozens of bodyguards rushed into the courtyard with a few doctors and nurses. In the middle was a gray-haired old man in a wheelchair.","The old master’s gaze was like a torch. Although he was old, he exuded a powerful aura. His dignified voice sounded in the courtyard. “I want to see who’s so mighty that they actually want Xi Xi to get lost.”","These words were like a thunderclap that exploded in everyone’s ears. Everyone looked at the old man in front of them with dumbfounded expressions. There was a trace of disbelief in their eyes.","The grand old master had been unconscious for many years, but his mighty aura had not decreased in the slightest. His sharp eyes swept across everyone, and everyone lowered their heads in fear. The horror in Lu Xiang’s heart overflowed like a tide."]},{"number":1163,"title":"Chapter 1163 - Medical Miracle","paragraphs":["Chapter 1163: Medical Miracle","Lu Xiang’s body stiffened as if she had been struck by lightning. The entire venue was silent for a moment. Suddenly, everyone from the Lu family went forward and said warmly, “Grand Old Master is awake!”","“Grand Old Master is actually here!”","Although the grand old master was the previous head of the Lu family, his mighty aura had not decreased in the slightest. He was still respected by everyone in the Lu family. Back then, he had appointed Lu Qingyun to be the next family head before he fell unconscious. After all, he knew very well that Lu Qingyun’s ability was a hundred times stronger than Lu Bai’s. However, after he fell unconscious, the position of the head of the family naturally fell into Lu Bai’s hands.","When the grand old master was in a vegetative state, the doctors all said that he could never wake up again. However, he was awake now! It could simply be said to be a medical miracle!","At this moment, a portion of the Lu family was so excited that they could not say anything. However, there were also some people whose faces were ashen, especially Lu Xiang. Her eyes were filled with horror, and her ears were buzzing. She could not even hear the voices around her.","The grand old master’s words still echoed in her ears. ‘Who’s so mighty to actually want Xi Xi to get lost?’","How did the grand old master know Qiao Xi? Was he here to stand up for Qiao Xi? This was impossible! Could it be that the grand old master was here to stand up for Gu Zheng?","Back then, when Lu Qingyun gave birth, the grand old master was already sick. He was often asleep and did not know what Huang Lilan and Gu Weiming had done at all. He did not have the energy to care about Lu Qingyun either. Moreover, he did not seem to have seen Gu Zheng before.","Lu Xiang pondered deeply, and the uneasiness in her heart grew stronger and stronger. It was only when Qiao Xi called out to her that her entire body trembled and she looked at Qiao Xi with a vigilant expression.","“Second Miss Lu, you can choose not to believe me, but what about Grand Old Master Lu?” Qiao Xi looked at her with a smile and pointed at the old man behind her.","Lu Xiang looked up in fear and met the grand old master’s gaze. Her legs instantly went weak as she fell to the floor.","“Ah! Why did you fall?! Could it be that you’re guilty?! Are you afraid that the grand old master will expose your secret?” Qiao Xi’s tone was teasing.","Lu Xiang’s expression changed drastically as she stammered and explained, “I-I don’t have any secrets. I fell because... I was too excited to see Grandpa and lost my balance!”","She was so nervous that her forehead was covered in sweat. She said in a trembling voice, “Grandpa, why didn’t you... tell me that you’ve woken up?! You just woke up. You should quickly go back to your room and rest.”","Grand Old Master Lu did not like Lu Xiang. He had sharp eyes and was very good at judging people. Lu Xiang looked obedient like her mother, but she was actually vicious and selfish.","He glanced at Lu Xiang in disgust and said in a sharp tone, “It’s not your place to chase me away. This is the Lu family’s ancestral hall. Who dares to stop me from coming? If I hadn’t come, the Lu family would’ve probably turned the world upside down!”","“Grand Old Master!” The fifth uncle of the Lu family hurriedly went forward to explain, “You must have heard stories from those people who are trying to drive a wedge between us. Ah Yan grew up in the Lu family since he was young. He’s already the heir of the Lu family, but Qiao Xi just had to say that Ah Yan is an illegitimate child. Isn’t she trying to snatch Ah Yan’s position by acting like this?”","“What’s wrong with snatching it?” Grand Old Master Lu’s eyes turned cold as he said sternly, “I’ve been unconscious for all these years, and the Lu family has been in a mess because of you!","“Don’t think that I don’t know what you’ve been doing all these years when I was unconscious! Lu Xiang, you keep saying that Lu Yan is Qingyun’s son, but have you done a DNA test? Even though Qingyun isn’t alive, you can get any of the Lu family’s direct descendants to do the test. Do that and we’ll soon know if Lu Yan is the Lu family’s flesh and blood! You know very well that Lu Yan is the child of a mistress. Are you that crazy to raise him in the Lu family?”","Lu Xiang’s lips were pale, and her body was trembling violently. “No, no, Grandpa. Ah Yan is my sister’s child.”","Lu Yan sat in the wheelchair, his body stiff. His heart ached as he said with difficulty, “Grand Old Master, I’m from the Lu family.”","No matter what, he absolutely could not admit his identity. All these years, his grandfather had already paved the way for him. The doctors who took the test back then had also been paid to leave Li City. If Qiao Xi wanted to find the doctors at that time, it was tantamount to finding a needle in a haystack.","Moreover, they had already forged many DNA tests, and the Lu family had already covered up the truth. As long as Qiao Xi could not produce evidence, no one could prove that he was Huang Lilan’s son.","Lu Yan gritted his teeth and forced himself to calm down. The surveillance cameras in the hospital back then had already been destroyed, and more than 20 years had passed. Other than Mo Yuan, no one else could recover the surveillance footage from so long ago."]},{"number":1164,"title":"Chapter 1164 - Mo Yuan Makes A Move","paragraphs":["Chapter 1164: Mo Yuan Makes A Move","Mo Yuan had never cared about the grudges between families. Even if Gu Zheng offered Mo Yuan a high price, he could not be bribed. Moreover, the old master had found a top hacker to destroy the surveillance footage previously. Even if someone really wanted to recover it, it would take a lot of time and energy. Why would Mo Yuan do his best for Gu Zheng?","Lu Yan heaved a sigh of relief. Even if Qiao Xi wanted to expose his identity in public, she did not have any evidence. It would all be in vain. As for this grand old master, he had only listened to Qiao Xi’s instigation. When Grandpa woke up and explained it to the grand old master, this matter would naturally be over. He would still be the heir of the Lu family.","Lu Yan said gently, “Grand Old Master, you must have misunderstood me because of the rumors outside. In order to prove my identity, I’m willing to do a DNA test with the Lu family. When the results are out, I hope you can apologize in public and restore my reputation.”","Old Master Lu snorted. “You’re still stubborn at a time like this. Do you really think that I can’t tell right from wrong just because I’m old? Did you think we’d expose you in public without evidence?”","Without waiting for Lu Yan to speak, Grand Old Master Lu knocked on the wheelchair and said loudly, “Butler Wang! Bring the things over!”","“Alright!” Butler Wang Liang hurriedly walked forward with an old wooden box in his hand. He glanced at Lu Yan with disgust, then slowly opened the box.","Lu Yan was uneasy. He had a bad feeling. Could it be that the grand old master and Qiao Xi really had evidence? How was that possible? All the evidence had been destroyed back then!","Qiao Xi took a few steps closer and bent down slightly. She said casually, “Young Master Lu, this is the evidence you want! It’s the surveillance footage from back then.”","How was that possible? The surveillance footage had long been destroyed!","As soon as she finished speaking, the butler, Wang Liang, took out a USB drive from the box and inserted it into his laptop.","Lu Yan’s forehead was filled with cold sweat, and his entire body could not help but tremble. He had always been afraid that the surveillance footage of the hospital would resurface. The old master had dealt with it before, but he was still worried. Later on, he even found some top hackers to deal with the footage. How could it have fallen into Qiao Xi’s hands?","Only Mo Yuan could recover the surveillance footage from 20 years ago. Could it be that Qiao Xi had invited an expert?","Just as he was feeling uneasy, a video appeared on the screen. It showed the scene of a private hospital in Li City. The facilities were luxurious, and the surveillance footage was very clear. A name was written on the bottom right corner of the screen.","Lu Yan could not see anything, but he clearly heard the people around him gasp. Immediately after, he heard Lu Xiang spit out a name with trembling lips, “Mo Yuan...”","Mo Yuan? Lu Yan felt as if he had been struck by lightning. His mind was blank. The thing he was most afraid of had happened. All this while, he thought that as long as Mo Yuan did not make a move, there would be no problem. However, Mo Yuan was really working for Gu Zheng!","The words ‘Mo Yuan’ were marked on the bottom right corner of the surveillance footage. When everyone saw this name, they were instantly dumbfounded. The netizens in the live-stream were also stunned for a few seconds before they exploded.","[Am I seeing things?! Is it really Mo Yuan? Is it that top hacker, Mo Yuan?]","[Yes! This mysterious hacker is rich. I heard that his wealth is already comparable to Gu Zheng’s, so it’s impossible for him to be bribed. The videos and documents that are marked with his name are all real.]","[I believe that Mo Yuan wouldn’t lie, but I didn’t expect Gu Zheng to be able to get Mo Yuan onboard. The two big shots are working together. It’s like a real fantasy!]","[There are many rich people around, and many big families have invited Mo Yuan to work for them, but they were always rejected. However, Gu Zheng managed to work together with Mo Yuan. He’s too awesome!]","When the Lu family saw the name on the screen, they were instantly dumbfounded. Lu Yan’s and Lu Xiang’s faces were ashen as intense fear swept through their bodies.","“Old Master, it’s ready,” Wang Liang said respectfully.","Old Master Lu nodded and gestured for him to play. Wang Liang quickly pressed the play button.","“No! Quickly turn it off!” Lu Yan, who had always been calm and composed, panicked at this moment. He no longer cared about his gentle image. He suddenly stood up from the wheelchair and rushed in front of Wang Liang with a ferocious expression. He struggled to turn off the video. “No! I’m the heir of the Lu family. I won’t allow you to do this!”","“Young Master Lu, you’ve finally revealed your true colors! You’re usually quite good at pretending, but now that your secret has been exposed, you finally can’t take it anymore?” Qiao Xi’s tone was teasing, and her eyes were filled with disdain."]},{"number":1165,"title":"Chapter 1165 - Secret Exposed","paragraphs":["Chapter 1165: Secret Exposed","At this moment, the scene in the video moved. In the most luxurious private hospital in Li City, a young woman was carrying a child and looking around. Seeing that no one was around, she secretly entered Lu Qingyun’s ward. This woman was Huang Lilan from more than 20 years ago.","A few minutes later, Huang Lilan came out again with a child in her arms. The child was crying loudly. She helped the child put on his clothes in a panic. It was obvious that she had swapped her child with Lu Qingyun’s.","Everyone looked at each other. Before they could recover from their shock, another scene flashed. The young Huang Lilan gave the doctor a card and ordered, “Take the money and leave this place. Never come back. Keep this secret to yourself!","“From now on, my child will be the child of the first wife of the Gu family. He can legitimately inherit Weiming and Lu Qingyun’s assets. He can also become the heir of the Lu family. The little bastard Lu Qingyun gave birth to has to bear the reputation of an illegitimate child for the rest of his life. I’ll bring him back to the Gu family and let him endure my wrath every day. I’ll let him live in my son’s shadows!","‘Lu Qingyun would never expect that her son would become an illegitimate child while my son would enjoy all the glory and wealth! Hahaha...”","Huang Lilan’s laughter stopped abruptly. After the video ended, the place was eerily silent.","Lu Yan lowered his head as if his blood had been sucked dry. His legs went weak as he fell to the floor. He was dizzy, and his body was trembling violently.","No! No way! This was all fake!","How could the Lu family’s secret that had been hidden for so many years be exposed? If his identity was exposed, how could he be the heir of the Lu family? He had been using Gu Zheng’s identity to live for 20 years. Now that he was about to become the head of the Lu family and reach the peak of his life, why did these people have to expose him at this time?!","Everyone present had their mouths wide open. They could not accept this fact. Lu Qingyun’s son was swapped with the son of a mistress. Moreover, the son of the mistress had always been living in the Lu family. He was even about to become the head of the Lu family.","Lu Yan was Huang Lilan’s son, yet the Lu family actually raised him and even wanted him to be the heir. This position should belong to Gu Zheng!","In the past, everyone in the Lu family thought that Gu Zheng was a bastard and the culprit who caused Lu Qingyun’s death. However, they now knew that they were wrong. Gu Zheng was the most innocent person.","Grand Old Master Lu glanced at everyone coldly. “Lu Xiang, are you sure you still want Xi Xi to get lost?”","Lu Xiang’s vision darkened as she fell to the floor weakly. Tears welled up in her eyes. If this secret was exposed, she and Lu Yan would be doomed!","The veins on Lu Yan’s forehead twitched. He gritted his teeth and panted crazily. After a long time, he said with difficulty, “I... didn’t know anything!”","He tasted blood in his throat and suppressed his agitated emotions. He repeated, “I really didn’t know anything. I was just a child back then.”","A portion of the Lu family present were Lu Yan’s supporters. When they heard him say this, they immediately reacted and hurriedly chimed in, “Yes! At that time, Ah Yan was just a child. He didn’t know that Huang Lilan was his mother. You can’t blame Ah Yan for this. It’s all Huang Lilan’s fault!”","Some people in the live-stream also began to defend Lu Yan.","Lu Xiang, who had fallen to the floor, instantly gained confidence. She struggled to stand up. “Ah Yan didn’t do anything wrong. He didn’t know anything. He’s innocent!”","“He’s innocent, but what about Ah Zheng?” Grand Old Master Lu questioned coldly.","He stared at Lu Xiang with a sharp gaze. “Is Lu Yan innocent just because he didn’t know anything? He’s Huang Lilan’s son! Huang Lilan caused the death of my precious granddaughter, Qingyun. After that, Lu Yan occupied Ah Zheng’s identity and stole everything from him. All these years, Ah Zheng has been enduring Huang Lilan’s torture in the Gu family!","“As an illegitimate child, Lu Yan has been occupying the identity that should belong to Ah Zheng. Think about it carefully. Is he really innocent? He can’t be considered innocent because he has enjoyed these preferential treatments. He’s not innocent because he has been sitting in the position of the Lu family’s heir. At this point, he actually still thinks that he’s not in the wrong. He’s indeed as revolting as Huang Lilan!”","These words woke up a group of muddle-headed people. The grand old master was right. Lu Yan was innocent, but what about Gu Zheng? He was the most innocent person in this matter!","Who would repay the love he had lost and the grievances he had suffered all these years? Did Lu Yan want to continue being the heir of the Lu family just because he claimed to not have known anything?"]},{"number":1166,"title":"Chapter 1166 - Overturning The Lu Family","paragraphs":["Chapter 1166: Overturning The Lu Family","Huang Lilan caused Lu Qingyun’s death, and Lu Yan had been occupying Gu Zheng’s identity all this while, yet he actually thought that he was innocent.","Lu Yan’s face was pale. He struggled to stand up and quickly thought about how to deal with the situation. However, before he could think of a way, he heard the grand old master sneer. His tone was filled with disdain. “Lu Yan, Lu Xiang, you actually have the cheek to say that you didn’t know anything?”","Everyone in the Lu family instantly pricked up their ears. What did the grand old master mean?","Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at Gu Zheng. His expression was calm, and his deep eyes were dark. His emotions could not be seen clearly. He stood there with a straight figure as if he did not care about anything.","Even though he saw Lu Xiang and Lu Yan fall to the floor in a sorry state, Gu Zheng’s expression did not change at all. He was even a little impatient.","Gu Zheng was indeed impatient. He had planned for a long time to see Lu Xiang and Lu Yan in a sorry state after the truth was exposed. However, now that this scene was happening in front of him, he was uninterested.","To him, the Lu family was nothing. He did not take them seriously at all. He did not understand why Lu Yan was so determined to hold onto his position as the Lu family’s heir either. From the beginning until the end, he had never thought of snatching the position of the Lu family’s heir. He just wanted to torture Lu Yan and make him feel uneasy all day.","Actually, it was easy for him to deal with Lu Yan and Lu Xiang, so when he saw the two of them fall at his feet, he did not feel a sense of accomplishment at all.","Gu Zheng lazily raised his eyes and met Qiao Xi’s watery eyes. Her eyes were filled with anger and disgust. She hated Lu Yan and Lu Xiang very much, and all of this was because of him.","Gu Zheng’s heart seemed to skip a beat. Someone cared about him so much and was indignant for him. The expression on his face became a little gentler. He bent down slightly and asked, “You invited the grand old master over?”","Qiao Xi nodded proudly as if she was waiting to be praised.","Gu Zheng paused for a moment and continued to ask, “The grand old master was unconscious for so many years. How did you wake him up?”","Qiao Xi replied truthfully, “I gave him the precious medicine that Grandpa left behind, but it’s worth it.”","She did not say what medicine it was, but Gu Zheng knew very well that the divine physician had already gone missing, so the medicine he left behind was naturally precious.","The old master had been unconscious for so many years, and he could not have been awakened with just a normal pill. Hence, the reason why Qiao Xi had been missing for the past few days must be because she had been giving the grand old master acupuncture sessions.","Everything she did was to get the grand old master to expose Lu Yan’s identity and expose the Lu family’s secret to the public.","Gu Zheng’s heart ached as he abruptly pulled Qiao Xi into his embrace and called out softly, “Xi Xi.”","Qiao Xi was shocked by his sudden hug in front of everyone. She blushed shyly and said sweetly, “Ah Zheng, stop fooling around.”","“Xi Xi, thank you.” Gu Zheng’s voice was surprisingly nasal. He hugged her tightly as if he wanted to melt her into his bones.","At this moment, Gu Yao, who was sitting in front of his computer, saw the two people hugging in the distance. Although they were very far away, he still recognized them at a glance. They were Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi.","There were so many people here! Why was he hugging her?! It was really immoral to show off their affection in public like this!","In the Lu family’s mansion, everyone came back to their senses from the shock. Grand Old Master Lu said again, “Don’t think that you can hide your crimes just because you claim to not have known anything! I’ve already said that I have evidence, yet you actually dare to quibble in front of me!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Wang Liang received Grand Old Master Lu’s gaze and played another video.","Lu Yan’s face was ferocious, while the Lu family members hurriedly stopped the grand old master loudly. “Grand Old Master! You can’t play it!”","No matter what, the grand old master was the previous head of the Lu family. How could he let the Lu family’s scandal be exposed like this? The Lu family wouldn’t have a place in high society anymore!","They had indeed long known Lu Yan’s and Gu Zheng’s identities. In the eyes of some people, this was no longer a secret. Fifth Uncle had long known about it. He also knew that Lu Bai was hiding this matter for the sake of the Lu family’s reputation.","The Lu family, a century-old family in Li City, raised the child of a mistress and even targeted Lu Qingyun’s biological son. If news of this got out, the Lu family would become the laughing stock of the entire Li City. The Lu family’s reputation would disappear overnight!","The Lu family thought that for the sake of the entire family, they could only sacrifice Gu Zheng and continue to keep this secret. It was just that they did not expect Lu Qingyun’s son to actually have the ability to overthrow the Lu family and make this secret public."]},{"number":1167,"title":"Chapter 1167 - The Lu Family’s Reputation Is Ruined","paragraphs":["Chapter 1167: The Lu Family’s Reputation Is Ruined","The horror in Lu Xiang’s heart surged crazily. Her eyes were wide open as she hurriedly rushed over and knelt in front of the grand old master. “Grandpa, you can’t do this! No!”","The fifth uncle of the Lu family also stood up. “Grand Old Master, you’re destroying the Lu family!”","The grand old master had a serious expression and did not waver at all. Wang Liang did not hesitate and played the video.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were deep as he stared at the screen like everyone else. Suddenly, a pair of soft hands covered his ears. Qiao Xi stood on tiptoes and kissed his cheek before leaning close to his ear. She said gently, “Ah Zheng, don’t look or listen.”","He obediently closed his eyes and bent down slightly to pull Qiao Xi into his embrace. His Adam’s apple moved, and his eyes could not help but sting. He said in a low voice, “Actually, I’ve already seen it.”","This video recorded the Lu family discussing how to make him, Lu Qingyun’s son, never be able to make a comeback. They used all kinds of dirty methods to deal with Gu Zheng. Qiao Xi really did not want him to hear all of this.","However, Gu Zheng’s emotions were very calm. His voice was hoarse. “Don’t worry, I’ll be fine.”","Even though she knew that Gu Zheng had seen it, Qiao Xi still covered his ears. She only let go a little as she wanted to lean close to his ear and say, “But I don’t want you to see it. Just look at me.”","A different emotion surged in Gu Zheng’s heart. He was so overwhelmed that he could not say anything.","At this moment, Lu Yan was leaning against the wheelchair. His entire body was limp, and his suit was drenched in sweat. He was in a sorry state. He could not imagine how everyone would deal with him, the true illegitimate child, after finding out the truth.","What right did he have to be an illegitimate child? He had already used Gu Zheng’s identity to live for more than 20 years. Why couldn’t he continue to use that identity to live? Was bloodline so important? Wasn’t it enough as long as he could contribute to the Lu family?","Lu Xiang’s mind was in a mess. She hurriedly rushed in front of Wang Liang to stop him, but the bodyguards subdued her. The scene was silent. Everyone stared fixedly at the screen. The audience in the live-stream also watched quietly. Soon, sounds of conversation rang out from the surveillance footage.","The video showed the living room of the Lu family’s patriarch’s residence. Sitting on the main seat was the patriarch of the Lu family, Lu Bai. Beside him were Lu Xiang, the fifth uncle of the Lu family, Lu Yan, and a few others.","Lu Bai was putting on an act. “Since the two children were already miscarried, for the sake of the Lu family’s reputation, we can only make do with it. If news of this gets out, the Lu family will definitely become the laughing stock of Li City. Moreover, Ah Yan has already been living in the Lu family for so many years. We’ve grown fond of each other. If we make this matter public, Ah Yan won’t be able to continue staying in the Lu family.”","Lu Bai continued, “Since Gu Zheng is Qingyun’s son, he should make a sacrifice for the Lu family. It’s his honor to be able to protect the reputation of everyone in the Lu family by letting himself be abandoned.”","Fifth Uncle was in a difficult position. “But this is unfair to Gu Zheng. He can’t bear the reputation of an illegitimate child for the rest of his life. After all, he...”","Lu Xiang interrupted mercilessly, “What’s unfair about it?! He’s just a bastard. Since he’s already bearing the title of an illegitimate child, he should continue to do so. Why implicate Ah Yan? Ah Yan is obedient and sensible. He’s the future heir of the Lu family. If he’s replaced, Ah Yan’s future will be ruined!”","Fifth Uncle was a little worried. “But if Gu Zheng finds out, he definitely won’t let us off.”","Lu Bai smiled disdainfully. “Does an illegitimate child who’s hated by the Gu family have the ability to deal with the Lu family? Even if he really has the ability, he needs evidence! Hence, we have to strike first. We can’t let him discover this secret. Or...”","He did not continue, but the killing intent in his eyes was exposed. He wanted to kill Gu Zheng. Only when Gu Zheng was dead would no one investigate this secret.","At this moment, Lu Xiang’s and Fifth Uncle’s minds buzzed, and they instantly lost the ability to think.","Hearing the conversation in the surveillance footage, Grand Old Master Lu slammed the wheelchair. “Lu Xiang! Do you still dare to say that you didn’t know anything?”","Lu Xiang lost all feeling in her body. Her legs went weak as she sat on the floor. Her heart was dead, and her eyes were filled with despair.","“For the sake of that laughable reputation, you targeted and suppressed Ah Zheng. You even let the matter go. You raised Huang Lilan’s son and made him the heir of the Lu family. You’re truly one of a kind! The Lu family was destroyed in your hands!","“Lu Bai, that piece of trash! Is he worthy of being the head of the Lu family? With an idiot son like him, I’m the one who’s truly embarrassed! He didn’t investigate the cause of Qingyun’s death and didn’t keep Qingyun’s child by his side. On the contrary, he actually wanted to kill Ah Zheng to avoid future trouble. He’s really stupid!” the grand old master reprimanded loudly."]},{"number":1168,"title":"Chapter 1168 - Lu Yan’s Heart Is Dead","paragraphs":["Chapter 1168: Lu Yan’s Heart Is Dead","“Lu Xiang, I’ve always known that you hated Qingyun because she’s the legitimate daughter of the Lu family, while you’re an illegitimate daughter. You’ve always been jealous of her, but I didn’t expect you to raise Huang Lilan’s son and let Ah Zheng live in pain!”","Hearing the grand old master’s words, Lu Xiang could not help but tremble. She broke down and shouted, “No! I didn’t do it!”","“Lu Yan!” Grand Old Master Lu’s gaze landed on Lu Yan as he said word by word, “From now on, your surname is no longer Lu. Your surname is Gu!","“However, someone like you isn’t worthy of having the same surname as Ah Zheng. The Gu family might not even acknowledge an illegitimate child like you, so you can take your mother’s surname.”","Lu Yan’s eyes were filled with unwillingness and fear. It was not the last moment yet, so there was still room for negotiation.","The video had already ended, but he did not say anything from the beginning until the end. He could say that he was still young at that time and did not know what Lu Bai meant.","Lu Yan forced himself to calm down and explained, “Grand Old Master, actually, I didn’t know what Grandpa meant at that time, so...”","“Heh! Are you going to say that you didn’t understand what they were saying?” Grand Old Master Lu sneered. “Lu Yan! You’re really stubborn! Since you’re so unconvinced, don’t blame me for not showing you any respect! Wang Liang!”","“Yes!” Butler Wang responded, then pressed the play button again. Voices from the footage sounded again.","Fifth Uncle Lu asked, “Ah Yan, what do you think?”","At that time, Lu Yan was only in his teens. He had a gentle temperament and was like a noble young master. His voice was gentle, but the words that came from his mouth were cold and vicious. “Grandpa is only doing this for the sake of the overall situation. Sacrificing Gu Zheng can exchange for the peace of everyone in the Lu family. Moreover, the Lu family is already in trouble now. If such a scandal spreads, how can we establish ourselves in Li City in the future? Since Gu Zheng is the flesh and blood of the Lu family, he should make a sacrifice for the Lu family!","“My mother is kind-hearted. If she were still alive, she would definitely abandon Gu Zheng for the sake of the Lu family’s reputation!”","Lu Yan’s pupils suddenly constricted, and his lips trembled. His heart was dead.","When Grand Old Master Lu heard this, he could not help but curse, “Lu Yan! You still dare to say that you didn’t know anything? As expected of Huang Lilan’s son! You’re as vicious and pretentious as she is. You even dare to call Qingyun your mother. If she were alive, she definitely wouldn’t have abandoned Ah Zheng. You bastard, cough, cough...”","After all, Grand Old Master Lu had just recovered from a serious illness. However, he found out that his most beloved granddaughter had passed away for no reason, and her child was forced to wander outside, those idiots joined forces with the mistress to deal with Ah Zheng, and they even wanted to kill him to avoid future trouble.","He could not help but cough. Wang Liang hurriedly brought him a cup of tea. “Grand Old Master, you’ve just recovered from a serious illness. You can’t be too agitated.”","Grand Old Master Lu took a sip of tea, and his breathing gradually stabilized. His sharp gaze landed on Lu Yan. “Back then, Huang Lilan abused Ah Zheng because she wanted him to die a silent death. This way, no one would stand in your way.","“Lu Yan, you clearly knew that Huang Lilan was your biological mother, but you deliberately let Huang Lilan torture the young Ah Zheng. If Ah Zheng weren’t lucky, he would’ve died in Huang Lilan’s hands a long time ago!","“Not only did Huang Lilan kill my granddaughter, but she also wanted to kill Ah Zheng. You idiots actually helped two outsiders harm the Lu family’s flesh and blood! Lu Xiang, you and Lu Bai ruined the Lu family’s reputation for your own selfish desires. You should pay the price for everything you’ve done!”","Lu Xiang gasped. Her body seemed to not listen to her as she collapsed to the floor.","At this moment, the people from the Lu branch family and the audience in the live-stream finally reacted.","[Lu Yan... is really Huang Lilan’s biological son? He clearly knew his identity, yet he still said that Gu Zheng was an illegitimate child and made everyone curse and attack him. This man is so shameless!]","[With Gu Zheng’s ability, Lu Corporation never would’ve fallen to this state if he were in charge of the Lu family. I’ve really learned something today! Lu Qingyun’s biological father actually helped outsiders deal with his biological grandson. Has Old Master Lu become muddle-headed?]","[I only found out today that Lu Xiang is actually an illegitimate daughter! Lu Qingyun is the daughter of the first wife. After Lu Bai abandoned his first wife and married a mistress, he started to hate Lu Qingyun. Maybe Lu Qingyun’s death is related to Lu Xiang and Lu Bai!]","[Old Master Lu kept saying to the public that he doted on Lu Qingyun very much, but he colluded with outsiders to kill Lu Qingyun behind her back. Later on, he even wanted to kill Gu Zheng! The Lu family is too vicious!]"]},{"number":1169,"title":"Chapter 1169 - Revitalizing Lu Corporation","paragraphs":["Chapter 1169: Revitalizing Lu Corporation","At the scene, everyone from the Lu branch family also revealed looks of disdain and discussed in low voices. “Lu Yan is an illegitimate child! He’s not the flesh and blood of the Lu family at all. What right does he have to sit in the position of heir?!”","“Do you still remember that he competed with Gu Zheng for the release of the new perfumes previously? In the end, he lost a lot of money. Later on, because of the resort, the Lu family lost more than 10 billion yuan. I’ve always suspected that he wasn’t Miss Qingyun’s son. After all, when Miss Qingyun was in charge of the Lu family back then, she was a business wonder in Li City!”","Hearing everyone’s discussion, Lu Yan almost fainted.","Grand Old Master Lu’s voice was loud and clear. “I dragged my sick body here to expose Lu Yan’s identity in front of my ancestors! I want to tell everyone that the true heir of the Lu family is Gu Zheng!”","Lu Yan gritted his teeth so hard that they were about to shatter. His once gentle face also became ferocious and terrifying. He clenched his fists tightly and stopped him loudly. “Grand Old Master!”","He closed his eyes tightly and controlled the emotions in his heart. He took a few deep breaths before saying in a trembling voice, “This matter hasn’t spread yet. I’m still a member of the Lu family! The Lu family can’t withstand such a huge change now. Fortunately, everyone present is from the Lu family. We’ll pretend that nothing happened today and protect the Lu family’s reputation. I’m willing to give the position of heir to Gu Zheng. I only want the identity of the Lu family’s young master!”","Everyone was stunned.","Qiao Xi grunted coldly. “Lu Yan is really shameless!”","Gu Zheng glanced at Ji Nan beside him and smiled meaningfully. “Xi Xi, do you think Lu Yan knows that his words and actions have already been broadcasted live?”","Qiao Xi’s heart trembled. Could it be that Gu Zheng had noticed the surrounding cameras?","She pretended to be calm and replied, “You’re saying that someone is doing a live broadcast at the scene? That’s great. If Lu Yan’s actions are being broadcasted, he won’t be able to make a comeback at all!”","Lu Yan revealed his true colors. “Grand Old Master! You’re also from the Lu family. You probably don’t want to see the Lu family go bankrupt either. If my identity is exposed, the Lu family’s reputation will be ruined and we’ll be mocked by everyone. It’ll be a huge blow to the Lu family!”","His gaze was vicious as he shouted at the Lu family, “Don’t forget that the Lu family’s shares are all under my name. I’m still the nominal heir of the Lu family. Keep what happened today to yourself. If anyone dares to say anything, I’ll expel you from the Lu family! Believe me, I can revive Lu Corporation and give you a more perfect life!”","At this moment, Lu Yan seemed to have been enlightened. So what if the grand old master had exposed his identity? He now had shares and was the second-largest shareholder of the Lu family. When Lu Bai woke up, Lu Bai would help him. If the two of them joined forces, it would be easy for them to suppress this matter. In order to rely on the Lu family, the people from the Lu branch family would definitely not dare to leak the news.","At the thought of this, Lu Yan suddenly heaved a sigh of relief. His restless emotions gradually calmed down, and he smiled gently again. “Grand Old Master, if you don’t give me a way out, I can’t do anything about it! As long as you’re willing, I can immediately give up the position of heir. Gu Zheng and I are both the flesh and blood of the Lu family. From now on, I won’t snatch anything. I’ll even help Gu Zheng revive Lu Corporation. I’ve already made a concession. You won’t refuse, right?”","The entire venue was silent. The Lu family was dumbfounded. At this moment, they could not help but complain in their hearts. Lu Yan’s face was even thicker than the city walls!","He was Huang Lilan’s son and had nothing to do with the Lu family. However, now that he had the Lu family’s money, he claimed to be making concessions when he was clearly making stubborn demands while appearing to be very aggrieved.","If it were not for Huang Lilan, Eldest Miss Qingyun would not have died. If it were not for Lu Yan, Gu Zheng would not have been wandering outside, nor would he have been tortured by Huang Lilan. He would have returned to the Lu family a long time ago to manage Lu Corporation.","However, when they thought about it carefully, they felt that Lu Yan’s words were not unreasonable. If Lu Yan’s identity was not exposed, the Lu family’s reputation would be preserved and the losses would be minimal. As a branch family of the Lu family, they still had to rely on the Lu family to survive, so they naturally did not dare to casually say anything.","Could it be that they could only watch helplessly as Lu Yan continued to stay in the Lu family and enjoy his status as the young master of the Lu family?","Qiao Xi’s cold laugh broke the silence. Everyone looked in the direction of the voice, and Lu Yan’s body suddenly stiffened.","Lu Xiang was already nervous, so she was shocked by Qiao Xi’s sudden laughter. She broke down and shouted, “Qiao Xi! Is there something wrong with you?! Why are you laughing?!”"]},{"number":1170,"title":"Chapter 1170 - Cancel The Cooperation","paragraphs":["Chapter 1170: Cancel The Cooperation","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up slightly as she said in a disdainful tone, “I’m laughing at Young Master Lu for being too naive! Seeing Young Master Lu so happy, I really couldn’t bear to interrupt his happiness, but I couldn’t help but laugh.”","Lu Xiang’s expression was ferocious. What was Qiao Xi talking about?!","She was instantly infuriated, but Lu Yan’s heart thumped. He kept having the feeling that whenever Qiao Xi appeared, his plan would definitely be ruined.","However, he still did not understand what Qiao Xi meant. Could it be that she had other tricks up her sleeve? However, even if she and Gu Zheng told others about what had happened today, without the evidence from the Grand Old Master and Lu Bai, who would believe them?","The grand old master’s health was not good, and he might fall into a coma again at any time. He and the Lu family were on the same page, so those people would not reveal this secret. Now, as long as he snatched the surveillance footage, Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi would have no evidence. No one would believe them no matter what.","Ring! Ring! Ring!","At this moment, Lu Yan’s phone suddenly rang.","Previously, there was no signal in the Lu family’s mansion, and no one thought too much about it. Now that Lu Yan’s phone rang, everyone realized that the signal had been restored.","After Lu Yan picked up the call, his tone became respectful. “President Wu...”","“Lu Yan, our collaboration has been canceled. Although our Wu family isn’t a big family, we still know etiquette, integrity, and shame. It’s absolutely impossible for us to work with a despicable person like you!”","Before Lu Yan could respond, President Wu instantly hung up. Lu Yan looked confused. He did not understand why the Wu family would break the contract, but fortunately, the Wu family was not an important business partner to the Lu family. At most, he would look for someone else to collaborate with.","Immediately after, the phone rang again. The other party’s tone was gentle. “Young Master Lu, I’m sorry, but I think this project isn’t too good, so I’m backing out!”","Lu Yan’s expression suddenly changed. Before he could say anything, the other party had mercilessly hung up. Next, he received another call. It was also to cancel a collaboration. Lu Yan hurriedly seized the opportunity to ask, “President Zhong, why?”","“You still have the cheek to ask me?” Mr. Zhong sounded surprised. “Young Master Lu, why are you still pretending at a time like this?!”","Lu Yan suppressed his anger and asked patiently, “Mr. Zhong, I really don’t understand. What’s going on?”","“Heh! Isn’t your Lu family doing a live broadcast? The entire country is watching you make a fool of yourself! You’re the child of a mistress and have nothing to do with the Lu family at all. Now, you still want to use your identity as Young Master Lu to discuss a collaboration with us? Dream on! We’ll only work with the true heir of the Lu family. An illegitimate child like you isn’t worthy!","“You and Huang Lilan joined forces to plot against President Gu, so why are you still pretending to be innocent?! Everyone knows your true colors now! Lu Yan, don’t appear in front of me in the future. Otherwise, I might not be able to help myself from beating you up!”","Lu Yan’s ears buzzed, and his heart ached. He gasped. Before he could speak, the other party had already hung up in disgust. Mr. Zhong’s words kept echoing in his mind.","Live broadcast? Someone was actually doing a live broadcast in the Lu family? Now that the entire Li City knew his identity, would the news of him threatening the Lu family spread?","Lu Yan felt as if he had been struck by lightning and could not come back to his senses for a long time. Then, despair surged in his heart.","No wonder Qiao Xi laughed at him for being too naive just now. It turned out that someone was doing a live broadcast.","Lu Yan abruptly raised his eyes. His eyes were bloodshot, and his face was ferocious. He completely lost the demeanor of a noble young master. He roared, “Qiao Xi! It’s you! You started a live broadcast!”","However, how was that possible? If she had started a live broadcast, why didn’t anyone in the Lu family notice it? He had so many subordinates guarding the ancestral hall. If they had noticed the abnormality, they would have called to inform him or Lu Xiang.","Phone call? Right, there was no signal in the Lu family’s mansion just now.","Everyone could not help but look at Qiao Xi. Lu Xiang pointed at Qiao Xi and shouted crazily, “B*tch! You did it!”","Qiao Xi blinked innocently. “Don’t spout nonsense! I didn’t know that someone was doing a live broadcast here. I’ve always been standing in the corner, so how could I have started a live broadcast?”","Lu Yan could not help but tremble as he said with difficulty, “Q-Qiao Xi! I’ve never offended you. Why are you... doing this to me?”","“You’ve never offended me?” Qiao Xi chuckled and said in a gentle voice, “Young Master Lu, why do you think so? Don’t forget that I’m Ah Zheng’s wife! Back then, you abused and tortured Ah Zheng with Huang Lilan, so you have offended me. Yet you actually have the cheek to ask me why? How laughable!”"]},{"number":1171,"title":"Chapter 1171 - Every Man For Himself","paragraphs":["Chapter 1171: Every Man For Himself","“Young Master Lu, you’ve always thought that you were in the wrong. It’s not your fault that you and Gu Zheng were swapped, but you clearly knew Gu Zheng’s identity, yet you joined forces with Huang Lilan to torture him and attempted to kill him. Isn’t this your fault?” Qiao Xi questioned loudly.","Lu Yan’s face was pale, and he was about to break down.","“Every man for himself, Qiao Xi! If you were in my position, you would’ve been as unscrupulous as me. Who’d be willing to give up everything that was painstakingly obtained?”","“No!” Qiao Xi retorted without the slightest hesitation and said word by word, “You’re the only one who’s so vicious. Do you think everyone is like you? You relied on the Lu family’s power to obtain money and status, so you wanted to continue occupying the nest. Moreover, you even wanted to kill Gu Zheng to prevent future troubles. Do you still think you’ve been doing the right thing?","“Lu Yan, if it were a normal person, they would feel guilty and regretful at this moment. They wouldn’t be arguing about how innocent they are. You and Huang Lilan are both selfish demons. You only have yourself in your eyes!”","At this moment, the audience in the live-stream could not help but discuss: [I’m really going to vomit! Lu Yan actually thinks that he’s not wrong and that others are just like him!]","[If I knew that I had occupied someone else’s identity, I would definitely feel guilty and do my best to obtain the other party’s forgiveness so that I could return to my own life. What right does Lu Yan have to say that we’re like him?]","[Lu Yan is too disgusting! He clearly did something wrong, yet he’s still pushing the responsibility onto others. Not everyone is as selfish and vicious as him!]","Lu Yan collapsed weakly in the wheelchair, his face as pale as paper. Everything was clearly according to his plan. He wanted to chase Gu Zheng out of the Lu family and make him lose the qualifications to compete for the position of heir, but why was he the one who lost everything now?!","“Young Master Lu!” Qiao Xi walked in front of him and bent down slightly. She lowered her voice and said, “Don’t forget that you poisoned Old Master Lu! Don’t be too arrogant, or you’ll be courting death!","“Perhaps you and Huang Lilan have done too many bad things, so God is helping Ah Zheng seek justice. I hope you can live with regret for the rest of your life!”","Lu Yan’s eyes were filled with resentment. He gritted his teeth and said, “You were the one who started the live broadcast!”","Qiao Xi blinked innocently. “You’re wrongly accusing me here. I didn’t start the live broadcast. Perhaps a kind person couldn’t stand it anymore and made your crimes public!”","“Qiao Xi! I know your identity!” Lu Yan shouted heartbreakingly.","Gu Zheng narrowed his eyes and exuded cold killing intent.","“Young Master Lu, what do you mean? Why don’t I understand?” Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows with an indifferent expression.","“You’re the disciple of the divine physician!” Lu Yan laughed crazily. “Qiao Xi, I’ve already said that I’m your fiance. Why did you marry Gu Zheng? Why did you betray me?”","Qiao Xi’s gaze turned cold as she frowned with disgust. “It’s not even nighttime yet, but you’re already talking in your sleep!”","“If you don’t believe me, ask the divine physician when he comes back if the person you were engaged to back then was me or Gu Zheng.”","“So what?” Qiao Xi had a disdainful expression as her cold gaze landed on him. “Grandpa has always doted on me. How could he agree to marry me to someone like you? Even if I was really engaged to you, it must have been because Grandpa was deceived by you. The fiance Grandpa found for me is Madam Lu Qingyun’s biological son, while you’re just an illegitimate child. Moreover, Gu Zheng is more handsome and capable than you. Anyone with good taste will choose him. When Grandpa comes back, he’ll definitely think that the husband I’ve chosen is outstanding.”","“Shut up!” Lu Yan roared like a wild beast.","“Oh! You’re angry from embarrassment, huh? You can’t accept others praising Gu Zheng for being better than you? But this is the truth!” Qiao Xi looked at him with a smile, then took out her phone and clicked on the live broadcast. “The netizens in the live broadcast think so too!”","At this moment, the screen of the live-stream was filled with curses. [Gu Zheng is more handsome and richer than Lu Yan! Mrs. Gu is right!]","Lu Yan’s eyes were bloodshot as if he was about to vomit blood from anger.","“Young Master Lu, do you think you’re qualified to be compared to Ah Zheng?” Qiao Xi sneered, her tone extremely disdainful. “In the past, you were the young master of the Lu family, so you could show off in front of Ah Zheng. Now that your true identity has been exposed, what can you use to compare yourself to Ah Zheng?”","The moment that was said, Lu Yan instantly gasped and almost fainted."]},{"number":1172,"title":"Chapter 1172 - The Street Rat Everyone Wants To Beat Up","paragraphs":["Chapter 1172: The Street Rat Everyone Wants To Beat Up","Old Master Lu did not care about Lu Yan’s feelings at all. He directly instructed the butler to open the door of the ancestral hall. All the plaques of the Lu family’s deceased direct descendants appeared in front of everyone.","The butler pushed the old master’s wheelchair forward. The old master said loudly, “My ancestors, Lu Yan pretended to be the flesh and blood of the Lu family to commit crimes. From now on, Lu Yan will be expelled from the Lu family. He no longer has anything to do with the Lu family anymore!”","As soon as he finished speaking, a few burly bodyguards went forward and dragged Lu Yan out.","Lu Yan’s face was filled with horror. He was the heir of the Lu family, and the Lu family’s bodyguards had to listen to him. However, this group of people was actually dragging him away.","No! He could not leave the Lu family!","Wasn’t there still Ji Nan? He was Grandpa’s personal assistant. If Ji Nan stopped Grandpa, Lu Yan might have a chance.","Lu Yan’s vision was blurry, and he could only weakly call out Ji Nan’s name. However, he did not notice that Ji Nan was standing behind Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng at this moment, looking at him indifferently.","The door slowly closed, and Lu Yan was thrown out by the bodyguards. Before he could react, a group of reporters swarmed over and surrounded him.","“Young Master Lu, your true identity has been exposed and the Lu family has chased you out of the house. What are your plans next?”","“I heard that before this, you poisoned Chairman Lu. Were you going to take over the Lu family’s assets? If your identity wasn’t exposed today, would you have poisoned Gu Zheng next?”","Lu Yan pushed the reporters away with all his might, wanting to rush out of the encirclement. The next second...","With two bangs, two eggs fell on his head in a row. Sticky liquid flowed down his hair and covered his eyes. Someone kept throwing rotten food at him, and his body emitted a stench.","He could not see to begin with. Now that his eyes were covered in egg liquid, he could only hug his head and avoid everyone’s attacks.","“Stop hitting him! He’s already fainted!”","“He’s covered in trash. It’s too disgusting!”","“Damn! You guys are too vicious. You knocked him out?”","“How could two eggs knock him out?! He must have fainted from anger!”","Lu Yan was dressed in thin clothes. His body was wet as he fell to the cold floor. He opened his eyes with difficulty, and they were filled with despair.","...","In the Lu family’s mansion.","When Qiao Xi saw Lu Yan’s miserable state at the Lu family’s door, she turned off the live broadcast. Now that everyone knew the Lu family’s background, he probably would not have the chance to make a comeback.","A few days later, Lu Bai woke up, but Lu Yan had already been expelled from the Lu family. There was also the old master of the Lu family around, so he was naturally helpless.","Qiao Xi raised her eyes slightly, and her sharp gaze landed on Lu Xiang. Lu Xiang was terrified to the point of trembling and took a few steps back in horror. “Why are you looking at me?”","Qiao Xi looked away and did not hide the disgust in her eyes. Lu Xiang was just a small character and was nothing to be afraid of. She could keep her around for a period of time.","Old Master Lu seemed to be a little tired and sighed. “Let’s start worshipping the ancestors.”","The Lu family’s ancestral worship ceremony was a big matter. Although the event was delayed, it still had to be held. Everyone completed the worship according to the rules and left the ancestral hall.","“Gu Zheng, follow me,” Old Master Lu suddenly said.","Gu Zheng and the old master entered the main residence. Qiao Xi waited quietly outside the door. She raised her eyes to look at Ji Nan, who was beside her. “In the two years you were by Lu Bai’s side, did Lu Yan not discover your identity?”","Ji Nan hesitated for a moment before replying, “I don’t think so, but it doesn’t matter even if he did find out.”","“Yes, it’s been hard on you for the past two years. From today onward, you don’t have to continue staying by Lu Bai’s side,” Qiao Xi instructed.","“Eldest Miss, why are you suddenly telling me this? Is there something wrong?” Ji Nan asked.","“It’s nothing. I’m just a little worried about Lu Yan,” Qiao Xi said with some sympathy. “Lu Yan went from a genius to a street rat that everyone wants to beat up. I’m afraid that he’ll commit suicide. I haven’t had enough fun yet!”","Ji Nan: “...” ‘Women were too scary!’","Qiao Xi sighed. “If Lu Yan finds out that you’re one of mine, he’ll probably break down! He’ll definitely think that he’s very stupid for being played by me.”","Ji Nan: “...” ‘You probably don’t know yet, but Lu Yan’s assistant is one of President Gu’s people. If he finds out that the assistant who’s been beside him every day is one of President Gu’s men, he’ll probably break down even more!’","In the residence.","Gu Zheng sat on the sofa with a calm expression. Old Master Lu sat opposite him and said helplessly, “Ah Zheng, the Lu family has let you down all these years. I’m already old. The Lu family...”"]},{"number":1173,"title":"Chapter 1173 - The Reason For His Disappearance","paragraphs":["Chapter 1173: The Reason For His Disappearance","“No matter what, the Lu family is the result of Qingyun’s hard work. I can’t bear to see the Lu family destroyed just like that. Lu Bai is a good-for-nothing, and Lu Xiang is even more useless. Now that the Lu family is in a precarious situation, are you willing to take over the Lu family?”","Old Master Lu’s attitude was sincere, and his eyes were filled with pleading. His voice trembled slightly, but in the end, he still received a disappointing answer.","“No,” Gu Zheng refused without hesitation.","Old Master Lu lowered his head and said regretfully, “But this is Qingyun—”","“Old Master.” Gu Zheng interrupted him and said casually, “The Lu family has already been destroyed in my hands.”","Old Master Lu was stunned for a few seconds before he understood. The Lu family was no longer in Qingyun’s hands. There was no longer a need for the Lu family to exist after Lu Yan and Lu Xiang tainted it. Moreover, Gu Zheng had no feelings for the Lu family to begin with. He was naturally unwilling to take over the Lu family.","He thought that there was room for discussion, but when he saw Gu Zheng’s gaze, Old Master Lu knew that Gu Zheng looked down on the Lu family. He could not be the heir of the Lu family.","Wang Liang wanted to persuade him, but the old master waved his hand. “Ah Zheng, then I’ll let you decide everything!”","“Old Master!” Wang Liang exclaimed, his eyes filled with shock. The Lu family was the blood, sweat, and tears of the Old Master and Eldest Miss. Were they going to give up just like that?","“The Lu family is already filthy and meaningless. Back then, the Lu family was developed in the hands of Qingyun. It’s good for you to end all of this yourself now, lest the Lu family is ruined further by Lu Bai.”","At this point, Old Master Lu suddenly raised his voice. “Ah Zheng, I support you.”","Gu Zheng looked up slightly and nodded at the old master.","“Um...” The old master hesitated for a moment and asked, “Is Xi Xi your wife? When did you get married?”","Gu Zheng’s eyes darkened. “Old Master, can you tell me how she woke you up?”","The old master was stunned for a moment and could not help but smile. “The descendant of the divine physician does have a treatment method that requires the blood of a physician to treat patients. But don’t worry, she didn’t hurt herself when she saved me.”","Now, the old master finally understood why Gu Zheng had a cold face and a trace of gloominess between his brows. Even when he saw Lu Yan being expelled from the Lu family, he did not change in the slightest. It seemed that he was worried that Qiao Xi had hurt her body.","Gu Zheng looked at Old Master Lu’s expression and knew that he was not lying. His expression softened as he smiled lightly. “Xi Xi is my wife, so I’m naturally more concerned about her. Please don’t take offense.”","Old Master Lu sized up Gu Zheng. Although he had never met him before, he felt inexplicably close to him. Perhaps it was because this child was a little similar to Qingyun. They were both so strong and outstanding.","“Ever since I fell unconscious, I haven’t been able to feel anything. It was only when Xi Xi came to treat me that I realized that someone was by my side. Xi Xi is a good child. After all, she’s Ah Xiao’s disciple. She’s naturally as kind as him.” A loving smile appeared on the old master’s face, then it was covered in a layer of gloom.","“You should know about the disappearance of Xi Xi’s grandpa as well. She doesn’t seem to care on the surface, but before this, she has searched for him in many places. It was only after Ah Xiao sent Xi Xi some news that Xi Xi gave up on searching for him.","“Actually, I can roughly guess why Ah Xiao went missing. Do you still remember the time when your mother was poisoned back then?” The old master looked up at Gu Zheng.","Gu Zheng nodded.","The old master fell into his memories. “Years ago, I got to know Ah Xiao and became friends with him. After Qingyun was poisoned, he desperately wanted to detoxify the poison in Qingyun’s body. Unfortunately, even after he worked hard for a long time, Qingyun still passed away. Not long after, Ah Xiao went missing. At that time, he had six apprentices. Xi Xi was the youngest and hadn’t reached adulthood. Ah Xiao wouldn’t have suddenly disappeared without regard for his apprentice, so I think that in order to save Qingyun, his body was seriously injured and there were some irreversible consequences.”","Gu Zheng’s expression suddenly changed. The divine physician had used his blood to detoxify the poison and his body was seriously injured. What would the consequences be for Qiao Xi?","Sure enough, the thing he was most worried about had still happened. Using blood to detoxify poison was equivalent to using Qiao Xi’s life in exchange for his. Now that he was no longer using Qiao Xi’s blood, would there still be adverse consequences?","Old Master Lu realized that he was nervous and smiled comfortingly. “Ah Zheng, this is just my guess. Even if it’s really as I guessed, it might not happen to you and Xi Xi.”"]},{"number":1174,"title":"Chapter 1174 - Don’t Learn From Your Grandpa","paragraphs":["Chapter 1174: Don’t Learn From Your Grandpa","“I was unconscious for 20 years. The doctors all said that I wouldn’t wake up, but I still miraculously woke up. All of this is thanks to Xi Xi. The medicine Ah Xiao left behind must be for Xi Xi to save her life. I didn’t expect her to leave such precious medicine to me just to ask me to help you. I’m already in my 90s and won’t be able to live for long. It really wasn’t worth it for her to give me the medicine!” the old master continued.","Only then did Gu Zheng remember that Qiao Xi seemed to often go to Blue Dream Pavilion. That was the stronghold of the Medical Association. She went there for many days before coming to the Lu family to wake the old master up.","If that medicine was left behind by the divine physician, she could have taken it out to save the old master a long time ago. Why did she have to wait until now?","Perhaps this medicine was just recently developed to wake the old master up. If the divine physician had a medicine that could save the old master, why would he watch his good friend fall unconscious? Hence, Qiao Xi waking the old master up should be the divine physician’s idea.","Gu Zheng did not say what he was thinking. Old Master Lu had just woken up. At this moment, he closed his eyes tiredly. “Ah Zheng, go out first. Let Xi Xi in. I have something to tell her.”","Gu Zheng nodded, then walked out of the door and gestured for Qiao Xi to enter. Qiao Xi had just stepped in when Wang Liang walked out and closed the door.","At this moment, there were only two of them in the room. The old master pointed at the chair beside him and gestured for her to sit down. Then, he said earnestly, “Xi Xi, you’re still young and have a bright future ahead of you. Don’t learn from your grandfather.”","Qiao Xi sat obediently on the chair. She knew that the old master and her grandfather were friends, so she respected this old man very much. However, she did not understand the old master’s words.","Seeing that she was a little confused, Old Master Lu said with a serious expression, “Xi Xi, it’s not worth losing your life for anything.”","Qiao Xi’s pupils constricted abruptly. Could it be that the old master was talking about her detoxifying Gu Zheng’s poison? How did he know?","“Xi Xi, you’re kind-hearted, but you don’t owe anyone anything. There’s no need for you to sacrifice yourself for another person. Back then, in order to repay my kindness, your grandfather almost lost his life. Although he’s still alive, there’s no news of him.","“Ah Xiao is a responsible person. He wouldn’t abandon his disciples for no reason. He must have had a reason for leaving suddenly. I’m guessing that it might be related to him detoxifying Qingyun’s poison. I don’t want you to follow his path.","“You’re flesh and blood. You weren’t born to sacrifice for others. You don’t have to give up your life for another person.”","Old Master Lu took a deep breath, and his voice trembled slightly because of his sorrow. “Qingyun was my most beloved granddaughter. Her mother passed away early, so I kept her by my side to teach her. I watched her manage the company. I was also very sad when she passed away, but...","“But I don’t want anyone to lose their life because of Qingyun. If it’s possible, I’m willing to die for Qingyun. As long as she and Ah Xiao can be safe and sound, I’m willing to do anything. But she... won’t be able to live anymore.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were slightly red, and she could not help but lower her eyes.","Old Master Lu sighed helplessly. “Now that you’re married to Ah Zheng, the relationship between the two of you must be very deep. I also know that you’re willing to make sacrifices for Ah Zheng, but you’re Ah Xiao’s disciple! Ah Xiao has already paid a painful price for Qingyun. I owe you. I can’t watch you sacrifice yourself for Ah Zheng anymore!","“Moreover, with Ah Zheng’s feelings for you, he definitely won’t agree to let you bear the consequences for him. If you die, his life will be meaningless.”","Qiao Xi remained silent. She was clearly aware in her heart that detoxifying Gu Zheng’s poison was equivalent to luring the poison into her body. However, she had a body that was immune to all poisons. Even if this poison was very strong, she would not suffer as much as Gu Zheng.","Old Master Lu was telling her not to hurt herself for Gu Zheng. Her grandfather’s life was already ruined. Old Master Lu did not want to see such a thing happen again. He had let her grandfather down, so he hoped that she could live safely and wait for her grandfather to return.","People had to love themselves first before they had the right to be loved. She knew these principles very well, but what about Gu Zheng?","“Xi Xi, I’m done talking. As for what you decide, it’s your choice. I have no right to interfere.” Old Master Lu frowned, and his tone carried a trace of helplessness.","Before Qiao Xi could answer, Old Master Lu suddenly asked, “Has your grandfather contacted you recently?”"]},{"number":1175,"title":"Chapter 1175 - The Older, The Wiser","paragraphs":["Chapter 1175: The Older, The Wiser","Qiao Xi replied truthfully, “Every once in a while, Grandpa would send me a message to let me know that he’s safe. Moreover, I’m sure that he’s the one who sends those messages.”","There was no name or surname on the messages, but Qiao Xi had an inexplicable feeling that they were the messages her grandfather had sent her. His goal was to reassure her that she did not have to search for him.","Old Master Lu heaved a sigh of relief. “That’s right. He must still be alive. He’s just afraid that you’ll worry, so he sends you messages. That’s good!”","His tone was filled with delight. Qiao Xi could tell that he was really worried about her grandfather.","After a moment of silence, Old Master Lu looked at her affectionately. “Xi Xi, do you still remember what happened when you were young?”","Qiao Xi was slightly puzzled by the old master’s words, but she still said, “10 years ago, I lived in the Qiao family. After that, I was chased out by the Qiao family and had nowhere to go, so I was brought up the mountain by my grandfather. I learned medicine and painting from him. Sometimes, I would even travel around with him. My seniors were all capable, so they brought me around the world as well.”","Ever since she became the apprentice of the divine physician, Qiao Xi had gone to many places and gained a lot of knowledge, but nothing left a deep impression on her.","Hearing her words, Old Master Lu’s eyes changed. “Is that all?”","Qiao Xi hesitated for a moment, then thought carefully before replying seriously, “Yeah.”","“Xi Xi, do you like the beach? Although there’s no sea in Li City, if you like it, go to the beach and have a good time there. The scenery there is beautiful and makes one happy,” the old master said meaningfully.","Actually, Qiao Xi did not like the sea. Moreover, because she was pushed into the water by Qiao Rou when she was young, she had always been afraid of water, so she usually did not go to the beach.","Before she could answer, the old master asked affectionately, “Xi Xi, you don’t like the beach?”","“Yeah.” Qiao Xi nodded.","Old Master Lu smiled and said softly, “That’s all I have to say. I can’t interfere in the matters of you young people. It’s getting late today, so I should rest. You can leave.”","“By the way, when will Lu Bai wake up?” Old Master Lu suddenly remembered.","Qiao Xi instantly choked.","There was no trace of blame in the old master’s eyes. “I don’t mean to blame you. Ah Xiao used to like to tease others and drug them, but the drug wouldn’t be harmful to the human body. I just want to know when Lu Bai will wake up.”","Qiao Xi: “...” As expected, the older one was, the wiser one became. She thought that no one knew about this, but Old Master Lu had just woken up not long ago and had already guessed it. It was really too awkward.","“Um... he’ll wake up soon,” Qiao Xi replied in embarrassment.","“Alright, you can leave now.” Old Master Lu waved his hand.","After Qiao Xi left, Wang Liang walked in and asked softly, “Old Master, why do you believe that Miss Qiao wouldn’t hurt the head of the family?”","Although Old Master Lu kept calling Lu Bai a bastard, he still cared about his son. However, he did not blame Qiao Xi for poisoning him.","“You’ve never been to the head of the family’s room. You don’t know what poison he was poisoned with. How are you so sure that Miss Qiao won’t hurt the head of the family?” Wang Liang continued to ask.","Old Master Lu glanced at him and said casually, “Xi Xi is Ah Xiao’s disciple. Since he was willing to take her in as his disciple and even taught her carefully for so many years, it means that this child is promising. If Xi Xi was really vicious and unscrupulous, Ah Xiao wouldn’t have kept her by his side. Liang Pingchuan and Shen Yu wouldn’t dote on her so much either. I believe in Ah Xiao, so I naturally believe in Xi Xi.","“Although Xi Xi hates Lu Bai, she definitely won’t hurt him. At least, on my account, she’ll let him live.”","Qiao Xi did hate Lu Bai for treating Lu Qingyun badly. He abandoned Gu Zheng, but he was the son of the old master, after all, so Qiao Xi would not kill him.","Old Master Lu’s expression suddenly turned cold. “I really regret not abolishing Lu Bai’s position as the head of the family earlier and letting him rely on his identity as the head of the family to commit crimes. I’ve always tolerated him because he’s my only son, but now, for Qingyun and Ah Zheng, I can’t continue to tolerate him.”","With that, the old master gestured for Wang Liang to come closer and spoke into his ear.","On the other hand, after Qiao Xi left the main residence, she saw a tall figure standing at the intersection. His eyes were lowered lazily, and he slowly raised them when he heard footsteps. His light brown eyes were calm as he came forward to hold her hand. “Let’s go.”"]},{"number":1176,"title":"Chapter 1176 - Lu Bai Wakes Up","paragraphs":["Chapter 1176: Lu Bai Wakes Up","“Ah Zheng, aren’t you curious about what the old master told me?” Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at him.","Gu Zheng stopped in his tracks and revealed a faint smile. “I know it well. I naturally don’t need you to say anything, Mrs. Gu.”","Qiao Xi’s heart suddenly thumped. It was probably because her grandfather had detoxified Lu Qingyun’s poison back then, so Old Master Lu guessed that she had also detoxified Gu Zheng’s poison. However, Gu Zheng probably wouldn’t have guessed that they were talking about this just now, right?","But for some reason, she suddenly felt uneasy.","“Lu Bai should wake up soon. Let’s leave.” Gu Zheng held her hand. Just as the two of them were about to leave, Lu Bai’s heart-wrenching roar suddenly came from not far away.","“No! Impossible!” Lu Bai’s voice was hoarse and old. He had almost used all his strength. He was so agitated as soon as he woke up. He probably knew that Lu Yan had been chased out of the house.","Lu Bai had spent all his energy on Lu Xiang and Lu Yan. Unfortunately, Lu Xiang, his daughter, was useless. Even if he gave her the authority, she would not have the ability to manage Lu Corporation. Lu Yan had some tricks up his sleeve, but they were all crooked methods. If he could focus on the right things, perhaps the Lu family would not be in such a miserable state.","The drug Qiao Xi gave Lu Yan was not heavy. Lu Yan’s vision should recover in a few days, but in these few days, he would have the most painful experience of his life. He would feel the torture Gu Zheng had experienced in the past, but Qiao Xi did not intend to let him off just like that.","“Xi Xi.” Gu Zheng’s voice sounded in her ear with a trace of ridicule. “Don’t tell me you’re thinking about how to torture Lu Yan?”","Qiao Xi did not expect Gu Zheng to see through her thoughts at a glance. She hurriedly retorted righteously, “No! Lu Yan has already been expelled from the Lu family. His life is already ruined. Why should I torture him? I’m so weak and kind. It’s absolutely impossible for me to do such a thing!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Lu Bai’s roar sounded from the main residence again. It was filled with unwillingness and anger.","The two of them paused in their tracks, and Qiao Xi could not help but ask, “Ah Zheng, the people who bullied you have already been punished. Aren’t you excited at all when you see such a scene?","“If I were you and saw these people in such a miserable state, I would definitely jump up in joy. However, you’re not reacting at all. Why is that?”","Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow, but his expression remained indifferent. “It’s probably because... I don’t care about these people at all. Their outcome won’t affect my emotions, and there’s only one person who can affect my emotions now.”","Qiao Xi was stunned for a moment. Before she could react, she heard the man’s low and magnetic voice. “Only you are worthy of affecting me.”","His scorching breath sprayed onto Qiao Xi’s neck, and his voice carried a trace of charm while his eyes were filled with strong affection.","Qiao Xi’s body stiffened, and her cheeks were slightly red. She lowered her head shyly. She did not know when Gu Zheng had learned to say sweet words, but she was slightly unaccustomed to it!","...","10 minutes ago, in the Lu family’s residence.","Lu Bai’s face was pale. He lay on the hospital bed and panted heavily. He looked at the time on his phone and instantly broke out in a cold sweat. Today was the day to worship the ancestors, but he had actually fallen asleep.","Why did no one wake him up? Where were Lu Xiang and Lu Yan?","Just as he was feeling puzzled, footsteps came from outside. Lu Bai, who was already nervous, suddenly tensed up when he heard the footsteps. He was vigilant. He was uneasy, and his eyelids could not help but twitch.","The Lu family’s main residence was very quiet, so it was terrifying. The footsteps sounded like they were urging him to die, making him break out in a cold sweat.","The next second, Ji Nan pushed the door open and walked in. Lu Bai heaved a sigh of relief.","Ji Nan was his personal assistant. Although he was young, he was very capable and could complete the missions he was given. Moreover, he had a weak character and was careful. Lu Bai had to admit that Ji Nan was an outstanding assistant, so he had always trusted him.","Lu Bai thought that after a while, he would promote Ji Nan and get him to help Lu Yan manage the company. This way, Ji Nan could report to him about the company at all times. It was equivalent to him having another pair of eyes in the company.","However, when he saw Ji Nan now, Lu Bai’s heart surged with anger. “What time is it now? Why are you only here to get me now? The ancestral worship ceremony has already passed!”","Ji Nan’s expression was subtle as he glanced at Lu Bai with some sympathy and disdain. He did not answer and just looked at him quietly."]},{"number":1177,"title":"Chapter 1177 - The Real Master Of The Lu Family","paragraphs":["Chapter 1177: The Real Master Of The Lu Family","Lu Bai did not notice Ji Nan’s expression and asked unhappily, “Where are Ah Yan and Xiang’er? As the head of the family, I didn’t attend the ancestral worship ceremony. How did they hold it? Or was the ancestral worship ceremony postponed?","“The ancestral worship ceremony is a big matter for the Lu family. Our ancestors are all waiting for us to pay our respects. How could I have missed it? Ji Nan, quickly call Lu Yan over!","“By the way, why is the Lu family so quiet? Has everyone else left? They usually stay back for a family banquet and spend the night here. What exactly is going on?”","Lu Bai had a bad feeling. He did not understand how he missed the ancestral worship ceremony. If he did not appear, Ah Yan would definitely have come to wake him up. Hence, he instructed Ji Nan to call Lu Yan over. He wanted to ask what was going on.","However, when Ji Nan heard his words, he did not react at all and remained where he was.","Lu Bai frowned and berated loudly, “Are you deaf? I told you to call Ah Yan over. Hurry up and go!”","A trace of mockery appeared on Ji Nan’s calm face. The corners of his mouth curled up slightly, but his expression was still as respectful as before. “Chairman Lu, the ancestral worship ceremony has ended.”","Lu Bai widened his eyes in disbelief. “How is that possible? I didn’t attend. How could they open the door of the ancestral hall without permission? This is against the rules!”","Lu Xiang naturally did not dare to casually open the door of the ancestral hall. To Lu Yan, not opening the door of the ancestral hall was a good thing. This way, Gu Zheng would have no reason to enter.","At the thought of this, his expression suddenly changed. He slammed his fist on the bed and said hatefully, “It’s Gu Zheng! Only he could’ve done such a deviant thing! That little bastard actually dared to rashly open the door of the ancestral hall—”","“Don’t be agitated, Chairman Lu. President Gu didn’t do that. Don’t blame President Gu for everything.” Ji Nan interrupted Lu Bai, then a trace of a sneer appeared on the corners of his mouth. His voice was still respectful, but his tone carried a trace of provocation.","Lu Bai instantly choked as he looked up at his assistant in disbelief. How did this assistant who was once weak and obedient to him become so arrogant?","He was stunned for a few seconds and even suspected that he was hallucinating. “You... say that again.”","“Chairman Lu, you’re old and your ears aren’t working well anymore.” Ji Nan’s tone was filled with mockery. He recalled Eldest Miss’ instructions on how he should treat Lu Bai.","He casually leaned against the chair, and the corners of his mouth curled up slightly. “Then I’ll repeat myself. I told you not to blame President Gu for everything.”","This time, Lu Bai heard it clearly and was sure that it was not an illusion. He did not expect his assistant, who had always been submissive, to criticize him for Gu Zheng.","The anger in Lu Bai’s heart surged. He struggled to get up from the bed, but he had just woken up and his body had not recovered. He staggered and held the bed to steady himself. He pointed at Ji Nan and shouted while trembling, “What did you say?! Ji Nan, are you crazy?”","Ji Nan’s expression was indifferent as he glanced at him coldly with a disdainful smile.","Lu Bai felt as if he had been struck by lightning. A trace of horror appeared in his eyes. “Y-You’re one of Gu Zheng’s men?”","“It doesn’t matter who I am.” Ji Nan crossed his arms and looked at him wantonly. “Chairman Lu, if you have time, you should think about things thoroughly. You didn’t even attend, yet the Lu family’s ancestral worship ceremony has already been completed. Will you still have a place in the Lu family in the future?”","Lu Bai abruptly looked up. At this moment, he should not be paying attention to who Ji Nan was. What was important was who had hosted the ancestral worship ceremony. As the head of the family, he had not even attended. Who would be so bold as to open the door to the ancestral hall?","He pondered for a moment and felt that only Gu Zheng had the guts to do such a thing!","“Who else could it be but Gu Zheng? I didn’t even attend, but the Lu family still proceeded with the ceremony. Only he would’ve done that! Ah Yan is a child I raised. He wouldn’t have done that!”","“Lu Yan indeed wouldn’t have.” Ji Nan sneered. “You gave him the power and status he has today. If you didn’t attend, he naturally wouldn’t dare to hold the ancestral worship ceremony. However, there’s still someone in the Lu family who has the right to do this.”","“Who else?” Lu Bai roared.","Ji Nan smiled as if he was deliberately making Lu Bai anxious. His voice was low and slow. “Chairman Lu, don’t forget that other than you, there’s another master in the Lu family!”","He was the head of the Lu family, so how could there be another master? Ever since he took over the Lu family, he had the final say in everything. Only...","Lu Bai’s expression froze. A person suddenly appeared in his mind."]},{"number":1178,"title":"Chapter 1178 - Abolition Of The Head Of The Family","paragraphs":["Chapter 1178: Abolition Of The Head Of The Family","Looking at Lu Bai’s stunned expression, Ji Nan slowly said, “Chairman Lu, you must have figured it out. Isn’t the real master of the Lu family the old master? The old master has personally held the ancestral worship ceremony, so of what use is your position as the head of the family now?”","Old Master?","How did he suddenly wake up?","Lu Bai widened his eyes, and his legs went weak as he fell onto the bed.","“Chairman Lu, are you afraid? You’ve been living a carefree life for so many years. Now that the old master has woken up, all your power is going to disappear. After all, the next head of the family that Old Master Lu chose back then was Eldest Miss Lu Qingyun. The old master has never liked you.","“Although Miss Lu Qingyun has passed away, her son, Gu Zheng, has returned to the Lu family. You’re very afraid that the old master will give him the position of the head of the family, aren’t you? Because that means your power will be taken away.","“All the glory and power in the Lu family now were established by the old master. Even if you’re the head of the family, you can’t disobey his orders. If he wants to abolish your position as the head of the family, the old master just has to give the word.”","Ji Nan’s words were like a knife stabbing into Lu Bai’s heart, leaving behind bloody holes.","One word from the old master and his position as the head of the family would be abolished?","He had been pursuing power his entire life. It was not easy for him to stand out, but the old master wanted to give the position of the head of the family to Lu Qingyun. He actually lost to his daughter. Now, the old master wanted to abolish his position as the head of the family with just one word!","Even if he could not be the head of the family, the position had to belong to Ah Yan. Why should he give it to Gu Zheng? Ah Yan had lived with the Lu family since he was young. He was the person most qualified to be the head of the family.","Lu Bai’s eyes were red. Ji Nan looked at his crazy appearance and said with a trace of sympathy, “Chairman Lu, you want to say that you don’t mind not being the head of the family but the position has to be given to Lu Yan since he’s also Miss Lu Qingyun’s son, right?”","“Yes, yes! That’s what I want to say! Ah Yan and Gu Zheng are both Qingyun’s sons. Why should the position of the head of the family be given to Gu Zheng? Why is my father biased toward that little bastard, Gu Zheng? It’s hard to say if he’s really a son of the Lu family, but Ah Yan is—”","Lu Bai hurriedly spoke. But before he could finish, he was interrupted by Ji Nan impatiently, “Chairman Lu, I’m afraid you still don’t know that Lu Yan’s identity has been exposed. What you should be thinking about now isn’t how to let him be the head of the family but about how to let him survive.","“You want Lu Yan to be the head of the Lu family? Dream on!”","Ji Nan observed his expression and added, “Huang Lilan is the murderer who caused Miss Lu Qingyun’s death. If her son becomes the head of the family, will the Lu family still have the cheek to stay in Li City? Chairman Lu, why don’t you turn on your phone and take a look? The internet is filled with news about the Lu family now!”","Lu Bai was dumbfounded. The muscles on his face trembled slightly. He could not accept Ji Nan’s words. He even felt that he was still in a dream and had not woken up.","Lu Yan’s identity had been exposed? Impossible!","His breath got caught in his throat. It felt like a huge rock was stuck in it, making him almost suffocate. The secret they had hidden for so long had been destroyed. But the others had no evidence. So what if they knew the truth?","Back then, they had already sent all the doctors overseas and asked them to hide their identities and keep this secret for them. The surveillance footage of the hospital was also destroyed by hackers. How could Gu Zheng get the evidence?","Lu Bai forced himself to calm down. If Ji Nan was one of Gu Zheng’s men, then Ji Nan might be lying to him. Perhaps they had not obtained evidence, so they were using this method to force him to admit it.","Ji Nan seemed to have seen through his thoughts and said slowly, “Chairman Lu, you might think that I’m lying to you, but you’ve probably heard of Mo Yuan!”","Lu Bai’s face, which had just eased up, instantly turned pale. The top hacker, Mo Yuan?","“Mo Yuan personally took action and restored all the surveillance footage. Although the wait was a little long, the truth still surfaced. It took him 10 years to recover all the footage!”","“Back then, you did destroy this evidence, but so what? Your secret was still exposed in the end. The heir you carefully nurtured for 20 years has been completely destroyed.”","Lu Bai’s eyes almost popped out as his body trembled uncontrollably. Ah Yan’s identity had been exposed, so the only heir to the Lu family was Gu Zheng. He had worked so hard to scheme for so many years, but in the end, the Lu family still fell into the hands of that little bastard.","“Don’t worry, Chairman Lu. President Gu won’t snatch the position of the Lu family’s heir,” Ji Nan mocked. “After all, he looks down on the Lu family.”"]},{"number":1179,"title":"Chapter 1179 - Dreamed Back To When I Was 16","paragraphs":["Chapter 1179: Dreamed Back To When I Was 16","Ji Nan was about to leave when Lu Bai hurriedly stopped him. “Ji Nan!”","Lu Bai looked at the assistant who had accompanied him for two years. His eyes were filled with unfamiliarity as he asked in a hoarse voice, “W-Who do you work for?”","In the past two years, he had never mistreated Ji Nan. He had given him enough money. There was no reason for Ji Nan to betray him, so there was only one reason. It meant that it had been a conspiracy since Ji Nan joined the Lu family. For the past two years, he had been pretending to be his assistant.","Lu Bai did not expect that Gu Zheng had already planted someone around him two years ago.","Ji Nan was silent for a while before glancing at Lu Bai. “You’re wrong. I’m not on Mr. Gu’s side.”","Lu Bai’s voice trembled slightly. “Then who are you working for?”","“I can tell you that I wasn’t Mr. Gu’s man before. I only became one of his men half a year ago,” Ji Nan said meaningfully with a mocking smile in his eyes.","Lu Bai looked confused. He only became one of Gu Zheng’s men half a year ago?","He pondered for a moment before an idea suddenly appeared in his mind. Half a year ago, Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi got married. It was also around that time Ji Nan became Gu Zheng’s subordinate. Could it be that this matter was related to Gu Zheng’s marriage? In other words, Ji Nan was Qiao Xi’s subordinate?","Impossible! Qiao Xi was just a wild girl who had been wandering outside. How could she have a capable subordinate like Ji Nan?","Before he could think clearly, Ji Nan stood up and left the main residence. From now on, the Lu family would be drowning in pain and torture every day. Lu Bai was no longer the high and mighty head of the Lu family, and Lu Xiang was no longer the pampered daughter of the Lu family. Lu Yan’s outcome was even more miserable. It was already a miracle that he could survive.","...","After returning to Longwan Residential, Qiao Xi received Ji Nan’s message. The current Lu family no longer had the ability to turn the tables. Gu Zheng did not want to waste time on this group of people, but Qiao Xi was very happy to see the Lu family struggling in pain.","Lu Yan’s reputation was completely ruined, and Lu Bai also lost his position as the head of the family. However, Lu Xiang still had a certain amount of power in upper class society. After all, the Lu family had a place in the upper class society of Li City in the past. She had always been popular with many noblewomen.","Now that the rest of the Lu family had been punished but Lu Xiang was not too badly affected, of course, Qiao Xi could not let this be.","“Ah Zheng, if I attack the Lu family again, will you think that I’m vicious?” Qiao Xi probed.","Gu Zheng raised his eyes slightly and smiled. “Mrs. Gu, you’re so cute. How can I think that you’re vicious? Besides, they don’t deserve sympathy.”","Song Shiyu: “...”","The president was showing off his love all the time!","Qiao Xi nodded. The Lu family had done so many bad things that left a trauma in Gu Zheng’s childhood. They even tried to kill Gu Zheng. They were indeed not worthy of sympathy. They brought this upon themselves.","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed as she leaned into Gu Zheng’s arms and smiled.","Gu Zheng gently stroked the top of her head. “Xi Xi, you look so beautiful when you smile.”","...","In the dead of the night, Gu Zheng finished his work and gently pushed open the door to the bedroom. At this moment, Qiao Xi was curled up by the bed with a frown.","Gu Zheng walked into the dim room. His vision was blurry, but he could walk to the bed out of habit. He gently stroked Qiao Xi’s eyebrows and realized that she was frowning.","He rarely saw Qiao Xi with a worried expression. At this moment, she was curled up as if she was having a nightmare.","Gu Zheng lay by the bed, his slender fingers gently smoothing the space between her eyebrows. He gently pulled her into his arms before closing his eyes.","Old Master Lu’s words still echoed in her ears. The miracle doctor, Qiao Xi, and his mother seemed to be related to everything. Could it be that his poison was really incurable?","Gu Zheng gradually fell asleep. In his dream, he returned to being 16 years old. At that time, his eyes were already filled with coldness and paranoia, and his entire body exuded an aura that kept people away.","As a top hacker, he had repeatedly refused to attend all those gatherings, but that time, he went. As expected, no one was willing to pay attention to a cold and fierce-looking young man. He was dressed in black, and his drooping hair slightly covered his eyes as he looked coldly at the people around him.","He was unwilling to talk with anyone. He just sat in a corner with a laptop to deal with orders. The next second, a childish voice sounded behind him.","“There’s something wrong here. You should try another approach.”","The person who spoke was a little girl. She was only about 10 years old. Her voice was soft, but her tone was very certain."]},{"number":1180,"title":"Chapter 1180 - 0: Lost Memories","paragraphs":["Chapter 1180: Lost Memories","Mo Yuan looked up slightly and heard another voice. “Black Tide, don’t get close to that person. I heard that he’s very irritable. No one is willing to be friends with him.”","“He looks so scary. He’ll definitely hit someone! Black Tide, come here quickly. Don’t talk to him.”","After hearing this, the young girl in the dream did not leave. She still stood behind him and said patiently, “Believe me, you really did write the wrong part. Correct it.”","At that time, for some reason, Mo Yuan did not reject the girl’s suggestion and changed it as she said.","Gu Zheng knew in his heart that all of this was a dream. He had never seen Qiao Xi before they got married. They had always been communicating online, and there had never been a scene of Qiao Xi guiding him to modify the code. However, the scene in front of him seemed to be real.","He tried his best to wake up, but he seemed to be trapped in a cage. His body floated in the air as he watched the scene of Mo Yuan and Black Tide.","These scenes were not in Gu Zheng’s memory at all. He did not understand why he would dream of such a scene. Could it be that he subconsciously thought that after meeting Qiao Xi 10 years ago, his life would be glorious and he would no longer be dark and defeated?","At this moment, the young Mo Yuan lowered his head and focused his gaze on the computer. His slender fingers quickly typed on the keyboard while Black Tide leaned on the sofa behind him and pointed at the code on the screen. “You’re so awesome! You even managed to solve this problem. Can you teach me?”","Mo Yuan was about to explain when his gaze was suddenly fixed on her hands. Those hands were very inconsistent with her body.","At that time, Black Tide was only ten years old. Although she was still very young, it was obvious that she was a beauty. Her facial features were exquisite, her voice was sweet, she was small and cute, and she was obedient too. Many boys would come to express their interest in her. However, such a princess-like girl’s hands were filled with terrifying scars.","To be able to enter the hacker alliance at the age of 10 meant that she was very talented and had plenty of time to practice. However, there were knife wounds on her hands, round scars, and burn marks. It was hard to imagine how a 10-year-old girl could have so many scars on her hands.","He had thought that he was the only exception. He had struggled to survive in that woman’s hands. In order to escape the Gu family’s control one day, he secretly learned hacking skills. Now that he looked at the little girl’s hand, he realized that this girl’s life was not glamorous either.","Mo Yuan was stunned for a few seconds before looking away. He patiently explained things to her. When Black Tide heard this, her eyes were filled with admiration. “I see! You’re really smart!”","At the age of 16, Mo Yuan’s heart was as hard as a rock. His heartstrings could not be tugged. He was not moved by the girl’s praise at all.","After Mo Yuan finished speaking, Black Tide took out a brand new laptop from her backpack. This laptop was a new release. It was not cheap and seemed to be limited. Ordinary families would definitely not be able to afford it.","Perhaps because his gaze lingered for a moment longer, Black Tide noticed it and smiled proudly. “Is my laptop nice? My grandfather gave it to me!”","From her gaze, it could be seen that she was very happy to have a grandfather who doted on her so much and supported her in learning hacking skills. It seemed that she should be living a rich life, so why were her hands...","“Actually, let me tell you a secret. I’m not related to Grandpa by blood,” Black Tide said calmly. “But he took me in and has been treating me very well ever since. He knows that I’m interested in coding recently, so he bought me a new laptop. Unfortunately, he doesn’t know how to hack, so he sent me here to learn.”","Hearing the girl’s slightly regretful words, a corner of Mo Yuan’s cold heart seemed to melt. He couldn’t help but say, “Let me teach you.”","Black Tide was a little surprised. In the end, a weak and sweet smile appeared on her face. “Okay!”","Gu Zheng’s Adam’s apple bobbed. He felt that the scene in front of him was terrifyingly realistic. The girl in front of him was a miniature Qiao Xi. It turned out that she liked to pretend to be weak even at that young age.","Even if this dream felt very real, there was no trace of it in his memory. Qiao Xi became his junior because...","A portion of the memories in Gu Zheng’s mind seemed to have disappeared. He could not remember how Black Tide became his junior. He only remembered that later on, everyone knew about their relationship. Then, they called each other senior and junior for 10 years."]},{"number":1181,"title":"Chapter 1181: It’s Not Your Fault That You’re An Illegitimate Child","paragraphs":["Chapter 1181: It’s Not Your Fault That You’re An Illegitimate Child","Gu Zheng had completely forgotten how he knew Qiao Xi back then and why they became senior and junior. He and Qiao Xi seemed to have never mentioned the past as if they had both forgotten about it.","Before he could react, the scene in his dream suddenly changed. He saw a teenage girl with pigtails. She was wearing dungarees and carrying a heavy backpack. Inside was a laptop and some spare parts that she had taken from Mu Ming. The backpack was very heavy, but the moment she saw him, the girl ran toward him quickly.","When Black Tide was about to reach him, she suddenly staggered. Her eyes were red as she looked up at him weakly. “Senior, I almost fell! Come and help me!”","Mo Yuan recalled her actions just now. She was clearly pretending, but she looked so cute. He did not expose Black Tide’s trick. Instead, he quickly walked in front of her, helped her up, and put her backpack on himself.","He was carrying a pink backpack, but there was nothing strange about it. The two of them looked so compatible when they stood together that passersby could not help but take another look at them. They sighed at how good being young was.","At this moment, Gu Zheng was like a soul that had lost its body. He stood not far away and watched this scene. He had never seen Qiao Xi when she was young, but he seemed to be very familiar with her in his dream.","Qiao Xi had liked to pretend to be weak since a young age and deliberately pretended to fall to make others pity her. At that time, he did not expose her just like how he indulged in her now. There was a trace of affection in his eyes.","Did this scene really happen, or was it just his imagination?","The girl and the gloomy man walked side by side. After a long silence, Mo Yuan said, “Did you hear what they said?”","Black Tide did not hide anything and replied frankly, “Yes, I did!”","Mo Yuan’s face darkened, and his entire body seemed to be emitting black fog.","Gu Zheng did not know what had happened before, but from Mo Yuan’s expression, he could guess that only that matter could embarrass him so much. As an illegitimate son, he had to bear the malice of everyone.","At that time, he was already 20 years old. He founded Gu Corporation and completely controlled the Gu family. His heart, which was riddled with holes, became even colder. He no longer cared about the rumors outside, but he was afraid that Black Tide would find out.","The 20-year-old Mo Yuan had already opened his heart and silently doted on Black Tide. This meant that he cared about Black Tide very much, so he did not want Black Tide to know his unbearable identity and past.","The next second, a cold smile appeared on Mo Yuan’s face, and his eyes were a little distant. “That’s right. I’m an illegitimate child and everyone hates me, so it’s not surprising that you hate me too.”","Black Tide widened her eyes and shook her head. “I don’t hate you, Senior! I won’t laugh at you just because you’re an illegitimate child. Besides, it’s not your fault that you’re an illegitimate child. You can’t deny all your efforts just because of your identity!”","Mo Yuan’s pupils constricted. Gu Zheng, who was floating in the air, also had a change in expression as his heart ached.","Half a year ago, when he and Qiao Xi got married, Qiao Xi had no idea that he was Mo Yuan. Later on, Huang Lilan and Meng Wan came to the house and he asked Qiao Xi the same question. At that time, Qiao Xi’s answer was exactly the same.","Gu Zheng was even more confused. Why was he having this dream? Was it really a dream or something that had happened before?","At this moment, Mo Yuan, who was in his dream, was stunned on the spot when he heard Qiao Xi’s words. His eyes were filled with shock and confusion. From the moment he was born, he had been hated by everyone. The Lu family was unwilling to accept him, and the Gu family wished for him to die. He was a bastard, and no one had ever said that it was not his fault that he was an illegitimate child.","At that moment, a trace of light seemed to appear on Black Tide’s body, filling his dark heart with warmth and melting his already cold and scarred heart.","He pursed his lips tightly, and his body trembled slightly. That was the first time he felt warmth. In the past, even if he felt kindness, it was only fleeting as if the heavens were just doing some charity work. But now, he really felt warmth. It was as if the noon sun was shining on him, and his entire body was warm.","Black Tide did not think much about this small act of kindness. To her, her senior treated her very well, so she did not care about his identity. She did not care about what outsiders thought of her senior.","The two of them sat on the bench and chatted. Gu Zheng actually saw a smile on the 20-year-old Mo Yuan’s face. It was so unfamiliar. Was this really a dream?"]},{"number":1182,"title":"Chapter 1182 A Strange Dream","paragraphs":["1182 A Strange Dream","Just as Gu Zheng was feeling confused, his body was instantly pulled out of his dream. He suddenly opened his eyes, and his vision was blurry. He could not see a trace of light. It was still late at night, but Qiao Xi was still sleeping soundly beside him.","His back was already covered in sweat. He opened his eyes and quietly pondered. Was that just a dream? However, the dream was too real and very in line with his and Qiao Xi’s personalities. Moreover, after waking up, he still remembered every detail of the dream.","This dream was very strange. He clearly had no memory of it. He had always been alone. Song Shiyu and Song Shijing did not know his connections in Stars. If he had already known Black Tide from long ago, then why did he lose those memories?","They had known each other for 10 years, but they had always thought that they had never met before. Moreover, it was not just him. Qiao Xi thought so too.","Gu Zheng gently turned over and caressed Qiao Xi’s smooth cheek. She seemed to be dreaming of something as well. Her body curled up uneasily with a frown.","In Qiao Xi’s dream, she saw Gu Zheng’s appearance when he was in his teens. She stood beside him like a soul and watched him go from a gloomy young man to the famous president of Gu Corporation.","She had clearly never seen Gu Zheng before, but why did Gu Zheng’s teenage appearance appear in her mind?","Qiao Xi suddenly opened her eyes and took a few deep breaths before calming down. She lowered her eyes and looked at Gu Zheng. It was already so late, but he was actually not up yet. Usually, Gu Zheng would have already gotten up and gone to the study to deal with documents.","She reached out and turned off the alarm. It was already late anyway, so it didn’t matter if he slept a little longer. Gu Zheng was very busy every day, so he should take some time to relax.","Qiao Xi got out of bed, still very puzzled. Why would she dream of the teenage Gu Zheng? Could it be that it was just a random dream she had? It was also possible that it was because she had heard Old Master Lu’s words yesterday that she naturally dreamed of the teenage Gu Zheng.","She did not want to think about this dream anymore, but she suddenly remembered something. In the dream, a wind chime made of shells appeared in Gu Zheng’s hand. He had personally made it, but she clearly remembered that she had an identical wind chime.","She had been afraid of water since she was young and didn’t like anything related to water. Later on, her senior enlightened her and helped her get rid of her fear of water. Only then could she swim in the water, but she still didn’t like the shell wind chime.","Even so, she had no intention of throwing away the wind chime. She did not understand why she kept it by her side if she did not like it.","Where did it go?","Qiao Xi suddenly felt a headache as if she had lost a part of her memory. She couldn’t even remember where the shell wind chime came from. In her impression, it was just a simple shell wind chime and wasn’t an expensive gift. It didn’t matter if she threw it away, so she didn’t care about that shell wind chime at all. If she hadn’t had this dream, she wouldn’t have remembered that she had a shell wind chime at all.","Qiao Xi’s mind was filled with doubts. She leaned against the window and thought for a moment. She remembered that the last time she saw the shell wind chime, it was probably during the time it was taken away by Qiao Zhenguo and Xu Mei. At the same time, some of her mother’s belongings had been taken away as well and placed in a storage box. She felt that Xu Mei wouldn’t have thrown these things away. After all, these things could be used to threaten her into being obedient.","That meant the wind chime was still in the Qiao family’s villa!","Qiao Xi decided to find that wind chime. Why did the wind chime that she had forgotten for so many years suddenly appear in her dream? She had to know the reason. Was this just a coincidence or was there another omen?","Qiao Xi was about to get up and leave when she was suddenly grabbed by a warm hand.","Gu Zheng’s hair was a little messy, and his eyes were sleepy. He was lying on his side, revealing his muscular chest. This should have been a beautiful scene, but there was unease in his eyes. “Where are you going?”","Qiao Xi was stunned. “I have something to do at the Qiao family’s villa.”","Gu Zheng’s deep eyes were calm. He still did not let go of her wrist and continued to ask, “What is it?”","“Uh... I’m looking for a...” Qiao Xi did not know how to explain and replied truthfully, “I’m looking for a shell wind chime. Last night, I suddenly dreamed of it. I remember that it’s in the Qiao family’s villa. I want it back.”","Gu Zheng’s strange emotions confused Qiao Xi. He let go of his grip on her and got up from the bed. “I’m taking a rest today. I’ll go with you.”","Qiao Xi was a little surprised. “Don’t you work at home on weekends?”","Gu Zheng leaned on her shoulder and pulled her into his arms. He whispered in her ear, “There’s nothing urgent going on in the company. You’re my priority.”"]},{"number":1183,"title":"Chapter 1183 Taking Without Asking","paragraphs":["1183 Taking Without Asking","Outside the Qiao family’s villa.","The villa was an asset left behind by Xia Yunqiu, so Qiao Xi had gotten someone to clean it. This place was still very clean, but there were no longer any traces left behind by the Qiao family.","The property that her mother had left for her was occupied by that group of people for 20 years. Now, it was finally back in her hands. She looked up at the plaque at the door and walked in.","When she left, she did not organize her personal belongings. The things that Xu Mei had detained should be in the storage room. After Qiao Xi entered, she went straight to the storage room.","Suddenly, she stopped in her tracks, and her gaze changed.","The butler she hired often stayed here to guard the villa, but now, the door of the main residence had been opened by someone. There were two pairs of women’s shoes at the door. Who had come to the residence?","Qiao Xi’s gaze turned cold as she quickly walked in. Gu Zheng followed closely behind and also noticed the two pairs of shoes on the ground. His expression suddenly turned cold. Someone actually dared to barge into a private house and provoke his cute Mrs. Gu.","The interior of the villa had not changed much. After Qiao Xi went upstairs, she walked to her room and looked through the gap. There was no one inside.","Clang!","The sound of something falling to the ground came from the storage room. Qiao Xi’s eyes turned cold as she walked toward the storage room. Before she arrived, she heard the voices of two women.","“This is so beautiful. Aunt, can you give me this?”","Immediately after, a voice very familiar to Qiao Xi sounded. Her tone was very loving. “Of course! Mengyan, everything here is mine. Take whatever you like. These earrings are good stuff! They’re imperial jade. They’re very valuable!”","Xia Mengyan’s excited voice sounded. “Thank you, Aunt. You’re too good to me!”","Qiao Xi frowned. Xia Yunlou and Xia Mengyan?","Recently, she had been busy dealing with the Lu family, so she had not dealt with these two people for too long. Was that why they were so arrogant now? How dare they come to the residence to steal things?","The things in the storage room were all valuable items that Xu Mei had plundered. Most of them were her mother’s and her things. Xia Mengyan expressed her interest in them, and Xia Yunlou immediately agreed to give her the imperial jade earrings.","What right did she have to give away her mother’s belongings? Who did she think she was?","Qiao Xi’s eyes darkened as she pushed open the door and walked in. “Xia Mengyan, you’re the daughter of the Xia family. Don’t you know that taking without asking is stealing?”","Half an hour ago, the two of them arrived at the villa and saw the things in the storage room. Their eyes were filled with greed. Although Xia Mengyan was also the daughter of a wealthy family, she had never seen so many valuable items. All the jewelry here was worth more than 100,000 yuan. Some of them were even worth a million yuan. A few were no longer made and were priceless.","Faced with so many precious items, Xia Mengyan did not hesitate at all and asked the butler to wrap them up. Xia Yunlou could not help but take action.","In front of her was only a portion of Xia Yunqiu’s belongings, so these shouldn’t be the most valuable. In other words, Qiao Xi still had something more valuable.","As Xia Mengyan was rummaging through the box, she realized that there was a pair of imperial jade earrings in the sandalwood box. These things were naturally expensive. She pretended to pick up the earrings and asked softly, “This is really beautiful. Aunt, can you give this to me?”","At this moment, Xia Yunlou had already lost her wits and naturally agreed to Xia Mengyan’s request. She seemed to have already treated everything in front of her as her own.","Xia Mengyan had just handed the pendant to the butler and asked him to pack it for her when...","A cold female voice interrupted the two of them. The storage room was silent. Their hearts trembled at the same time. Xia Yunlou’s eyes were filled with fear for a moment before dissatisfaction appeared.","The butler had never seen Qiao Xi before. Seeing her arrogant attitude, he immediately stood up and shouted, “Who are you?! This is my master’s villa. How dare you come in casually?! You’re trespassing on private property. We can call the police to arrest you!”","“I trespassed?” Qiao Xi sneered as her cold gaze landed on Xia Mengyan. “Are you guys crazy? Do you like snatching other people’s things so much?”","This was the Qiao family’s villa. In the past, it was her mother’s asset. Now, it was under her name. No matter what, it had nothing to do with the Xia family. How dare they dream of occupying the residence?","Xia Mengyan lowered her head, looking aggrieved. She did not say anything.","Seeing that Qiao Xi did not refute, the butler said even more arrogantly, “Hurry up and leave! Don’t delay my master. If anything valuable is lost, you won’t be able to bear the responsibility!”"]},{"number":1184,"title":"Chapter 1184 You’re Fired If You Disobey","paragraphs":["1184 You’re Fired If You Disobey","Qiao Xi raised her eyes coldly and glanced at the butler. “You’re really stupid. You actually haven’t figured out who your real master is!”","The butler was stunned and looked at Xia Mengyan in confusion.","When Qiao Xi saw this, she took out her phone and sent a message to the butler. The butler’s phone instantly rang. He looked at his phone and was shocked. “Y-You’re the owner of the Xia family’s residence?”","He ran to Qiao Xi and apologized crazily. Then, he glared angrily at the two of them. “Who are you?! How dare you pretend to be Miss Qiao?!”","Xia Yunlou and Xia Mengyan had embarrassed expressions on their faces. After all, Xia Yunlou was the daughter of the Xia family. Now that she was being treated as a thief, she naturally felt terrible. She could only roar helplessly, “Qiao Xi! This is indeed your property, but I’m your biological mother! What’s yours is mine. Moreover, these things are all piled up in the storage room. You definitely don’t want them anymore, so we just want to take them away. Hurry up and explain to the butler. Don’t treat us as thieves!”","The butler was stunned. This woman was actually Miss Qiao’s mother? But the two of them did not look like mother and daughter at all!","Qiao Xi lazily leaned against the door, her eyes filled with coldness. “Butler, send the guests out!”","The butler was put in a difficult position. “Miss Qiao, uh...”","“What? You won’t listen to me?” Qiao Xi’s lips twitched as her entire body emitted a cold aura.","Qiao Xi’s words seemed to have slapped Xia Yunlou twice. She felt her cheeks burn as she roared indignantly, “Qiao Xi! What are you doing? Mengyan and I are just here to take a look. It’s fine if you don’t welcome us, but you actually want to chase us away. How can there be a daughter like you?”","Xia Yunlou shouted with a flushed face. She was so angry that she lacked oxygen and felt dizzy.","The butler stood in the middle, hesitating.","At this moment, Gu Zheng appeared behind Qiao Xi. He glanced indifferently at the butler and chuckled. “Xi Xi, this butler is taking your money but doesn’t listen to you!”","Qiao Xi said coldly, “If you won’t listen, you’ll be fired.”","The butler’s expression changed. This was a good job that was hard to find. He lived alone in a luxurious villa and did not have to serve a host. He only had to clean the place occasionally. The salary was very high, and he had a lot of freedom.","Miss Qiao wanted to fire him, but he could not lose this job. He hurriedly walked up to Xia Yunlou and Xia Mengyan and said loudly, “Ladies, since this isn’t your property, please leave immediately!”","The anger in Xia Yunlou’s heart surged. “Qiao Xi! I’m your biological mother! You actually want to chase me away? Look at the plaque outside. This place is called the Xia family’s residence. Mengyan and I both have the surname Xia. It’s only right for us to come here!”","This place was called the Xia family’s residence, but it was not Xia Yunlou’s. It was called the Xia family’s residence in memory of Qiao Xi’s deceased mother, Xia Yunqiu.","Qiao Xi nodded thoughtfully. “Madam Xia, since you think the name isn’t suitable, then let’s change it. From now on, let’s call it the Yin family’s residence. After all, my mother’s surname should have been Yin. Remember this clearly. This place has nothing to do with the Xia family. I hope you won’t be shameless enough to come over again.”","With that, she glanced around and saw the shell wind chime on the floor. Anger surged through her. She didn’t want to continue being entangled with these two.","“Madam Xia, you’re trespassing on private property. If you don’t leave now, I’ll call the police. At that time, the news of the two daughters of the Xia family being caught stealing will spread throughout Li City. I don’t think you want to see this outcome, right?”","The butler really did not understand. Since Madam Xia and Miss Qiao were mother and daughter, why were the two of them opposing each other?","Xia Yunlou was furious and roared, “Qiao Xi!”","Xia Mengyan raised her eyes slightly and carefully glanced at the cold Gu Zheng at the door. She clenched her fists tightly.","Why did Qiao Xi get to fulfill the Xia family’s arranged engagement? Gu Zheng was such an outstanding and handsome man. There were thousands of people who wanted to marry him, and she was naturally no exception. Everything she did was for the sake of pursuing true love. Gu Zheng would probably understand her.","Xia Mengyan said gently, “Xi Xi, we’re family. There’s no need to quarrel over such a small matter. Actually, I just wanted to see you.”","She noticed that Qiao Xi’s gaze had been on the shell wind chime on the ground. She had taken a look just now. That wind chime was not worth much. Although it looked quite beautiful, it was not made using any rare materials. However, Qiao Xi had always been paying attention to that shell wind chime. It was as if she had come to the Xia family’s residence for this shell wind chime."]},{"number":1185,"title":"Chapter 1185 Shell Wind Chime","paragraphs":["1185 Shell Wind Chime","Xia Mengyan suddenly had an idea. If Qiao Xi was angry at her because of a worthless shell wind chime, how would Gu Zheng react?","Perhaps Gu Zheng would think that it was just an ordinary shell wind chime and Qiao Xi was angry over nothing. He would think her temper was too bad and she was nothing like her usual weak and gentle self at all.","Grandma had taught her how to deal with women since she was young, so Xia Mengyan knew very well how to destroy Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng’s relationship without batting an eyelid. Hence, she said with a smile, “Xi Xi, I know you don’t like me, but Aunt is your biological mother and Aunt Yunqiu’s sister. She’s only here to see where Aunt Yunqiu lived when she was alive. What’s wrong with that? Why are you throwing a tantrum?!”","Xia Yunlou glared fiercely at Qiao Xi. “Look at how understanding Mengyan is. Look at you. You’re really a rival from my previous life!”","Xia Mengyan smiled. “Xi Xi, it was wrong of us to disturb you rashly, but Aunt has always missed Aunt Yunqiu, who has passed away. She knows that Aunt Yunqiu used to live here, so she brought me here. I was afraid that you would be unhappy, so I brought you a gift.”","With that, Xia Mengyan took out a velvet square box from her bag. Inside was a diamond-studded bracelet. She was supposed to wear it when she participated in events, but she had to use this bracelet to put on a show first.","Xia Mengyan smiled sincerely and took out the bracelet from the box. She said gently, “Xi Xi, I know you have a lot of precious jewelry. This bracelet is nothing to you, but I spent a million yuan to buy it. This is just a token of my appreciation. There were some misunderstandings between us in the past. Take this bracelet as an apology.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes slightly. Xia Mengyan was taking the initiative to express goodwill? There must be something fishy going on.","The next second, Xia Mengyan pointed at the shell wind chime on the ground and said with a smile, “Xi Xi, I’ve already given you a gift. Can you give this to me? I don’t want anything precious. I just want this shell wind chime. I felt a close affinity to it at first glance. This thing shouldn’t be important to you. Can you give it to me?”","Xia Mengyan was very sure that Qiao Xi valued this shell wind chime very much, so she wanted to snatch it and cause trouble for Qiao Xi.","“No,” Qiao Xi replied coldly. However, the more she refused without hesitation, the more Xia Mengyan was certain of the importance of this shell wind chime.","Xia Mengyan was neither anxious nor impatient. She said regretfully, “Xi Xi, this is just a shell wind chime. I’m willing to exchange it for a bracelet worth a million yuan. Why aren’t you willing?”","As soon as she finished speaking, Xia Yunlou shouted at the top of her voice, “Qiao Xi, why are you so petty?! Mengyan has already given you a bracelet worth a million yuan. She only wants this shell wind chime, but you’re unwilling to give it to her. How did I give birth to a daughter like you?!”","Xia Mengyan hurriedly went forward to comfort her. “Aunt, don’t be angry at me. It’s fine if Xi Xi doesn’t agree. I gave her the bracelet of my own volition. As for whether she’ll give it to me or not, I won’t force her. I’m just afraid that if this matter gets out, others will say that Xi Xi doesn’t know any etiquette and accepted a bracelet worth a million yuan but refused to return the favor.”","She gave Qiao Xi a gift of 1,000,000 yuan, then chose the most worthless item among the pile of expensive items. It was completely to accommodate Qiao Xi, but Qiao Xi was unwilling to give the worthless item to her. Anyone would think that Qiao Xi was too rude.","What would Gu Zheng think of her?","Xia Mengyan looked up at Gu Zheng with an aggrieved expression. “Mr. Gu, what do you think? I’m doing this for Xi Xi’s own good. I’m afraid that people will gossip about her. After all...”","“There are only four of us at the scene. If we don’t say anything, and if Miss Xia and Madam Xia don’t say anything, who will find out?” Gu Zheng interrupted Xia Mengyan coldly and raised his eyebrows. “Or do you want to spread this matter and ruin Xi Xi’s reputation?”","The butler had already left the storage room. There were only the four of them present, so Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi would naturally not tell anyone. In that case, only the two of them were left.","Xia Mengyan choked. Her eyes turned red as she bit her lip. “I... I don’t know what to do. I just... want this shell wind chime. If Xi Xi doesn’t want to agree to it, then forget it. I...”","Qiao Xi didn’t even look up. Xia Mengyan was right. She did look down on that bracelet. It wasn’t because the gift was expensive but because it was a gift from Xia Mengyan. She hated it.","“If you don’t leave, I’ll call the police.” As she spoke, Qiao Xi took out her phone. Xia Yunlou’s face was deathly pale. She knew that Qiao Xi was capable of doing so. If the police came and arrested them, it would be too embarrassing."]},{"number":1186,"title":"Chapter 1186 I Will Not Let Her Go","paragraphs":["1186 I Will Not Let Her Go","Xia Yunlou hurriedly pulled Xia Mengyan away. “Alright! Let’s go! I really don’t understand what’s wrong with me coming to my sister’s property! Don’t regret chasing us away today!”","Xia Mengyan was still indignant. She stared fixedly at the shell wind chime and suddenly reached out to pick it up.","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly as a trace of coldness flashed through them.","Xia Mengyan looked helpless. “Xi Xi, I really want this wind chime. If... you’re still unwilling, I won’t take it away. But I just want to take a look at it. As for this bracelet...”","“Mengyan! She’s not even willing to give you a gift in return. Why should you give her a bracelet?!” Xia Yunlou hurriedly snatched the velvet box from Qiao Xi’s hand and stuffed it into Xia Mengyan’s arms. She really hated Qiao Xi’s personality. Her eyes were filled with coldness and disdain. She had no mother-daughter relationship with her at all. She would rather not have given birth to this daughter!","It was just a shell wind chime, but Qiao Xi was unwilling to give it to Mengyan. She was too petty! It was too embarrassing!","Xia Yunlou was furious. She pulled Xia Mengyan and was about to leave when a sinister look flashed across Xia Mengyan’s eyes. She pretended to lose her balance and threw the wind chime in her hand to the ground. “Ah...” Then, she staggered a few steps and stepped on the wind chime.","The shells were thin to begin with. When Xia Mengyan stepped on it, a few of the shells shattered. The white fragments fell on the brown floor, looking so dazzling.","The storage room was silent, and the air seemed to have frozen. Qiao Xi was stunned.","Xia Mengyan looked down at the fragments and pretended to be flustered. Then, she said in a trembling voice, “Xi Xi, I’m sorry. I didn’t do it on purpose.”","She was trembling in fear like an innocent girl who had broken someone else’s things. She could only apologize profusely. “I’m sorry, Xi Xi. It’s all my fault for not holding the wind chime properly. I...”","Seeing Xia Mengyan apologize crazily, Xia Yunlou was even angrier. Her heart ached for Xia Mengyan, and she could not bear to see her apologize to Qiao Xi so humbly.","“It’s just a worthless shell wind chime. If you really like it, Mengyan will compensate you for it. Qiao Xi, don’t make things difficult for Mengyan! We’ll leave now!”","Xia Mengyan cried in fear and sobbed softly. “Xi Xi, I’m sorry. Don’t be angry with me. I can compensate you. I’ll buy whatever shell wind chime you want. If you’re not satisfied, I can personally go to the seaside to pick up shells and make you a new wind chime.”","As she spoke, Xia Mengyan was already pulled to the door by Xia Yunlou. She lowered her head and smiled triumphantly.","Since Qiao Xi did not allow her to take any jewelry, she would destroy Qiao Xi’s most cherished shell wind chime. She would even give her a reputation for being petty.","Qiao Xi watched the two of them leave and did not stop them.","Gu Zheng leaned over and picked up the shell wind chime. A few of the shells had shattered, but most of them were still intact. He held the wind chime in his palm and handed it to Qiao Xi. “Your wind chime.”","Qiao Xi reached out to take it and sized it up carefully. Her serious expression made Gu Zheng involuntarily laugh. “You came over so early in the morning just to look for this wind chime? Since you value it so much and she broke your wind chime, aren’t you going to punish her?”","She looked at it for a long time before finally placing it on the table. “This isn’t the wind chime I’m looking for.”","“Huh?” Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow.","Qiao Xi said casually, “My wind chime is very ordinary. It’s made of shells that can be seen everywhere. Moreover, the craftsmanship is a little rough. However, this seashell wind chime was carved and embedded with some gems. The largest shell is even engraved with the words ‘Zhu Jin.’ My mother has a lot of Zhu Jin’s works. This is one of them.”","“Zhu Jin’s works aren’t worth much, but they’re very valuable. Moreover, there are very few existing works. To collectors, this is a priceless treasure. Xia Mengyan has been around the world for so many years, so she must have heard of Zhu Jin.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows and said casually, “She broke my things, so of course she has to be punished. She can either compensate or go to jail. It’s up to her. In short, I won’t let her off easily.”","“My Xi Xi is so smart.” Gu Zheng smiled, hiding the killing intent in his eyes. If Xi Xi didn’t make a move, he would naturally take revenge for her. However, if he did it on her behalf, things wouldn’t end with just Xia Mengyan having to compensate for the damage.","Not long after, Qiao Xi found another shell wind chime in the storage room. It was indeed as Qiao Xi had said. It was very ordinary and could be seen everywhere. It did not have any special characteristics. Gu Zheng did not know why Qiao Xi valued this wind chime so much."]},{"number":1187,"title":"Chapter 1187 An Expensive Pen","paragraphs":["1187 An Expensive Pen","Gu Zheng fell into deep thought. He remembered that Qiao Xi was afraid of water, so she hated everything related to water. However, the Qiao Xi in his dreams was not afraid of water.","He turned his head and looked at Qiao Xi’s side profile. She was staring seriously at the wind chime. There were a lot of shells on it. She flicked the wind chime, and the shells collided with each other, making rustling sounds. It was indeed very ordinary and nothing special, but Qiao Xi held the wind chime in her hand and inexplicably felt close to it as if she had once liked this wind chime very much.","A thought flashed through her mind. In an instant, Qiao Xi could not remember if it was a dream or if it really happened. She seemed to have liked this wind chime when she was young, but why did she suddenly have a dream about it? In the dream, Gu Zheng was holding the exact same wind chime in his hand.","After a long silence, Gu Zheng asked softly, “Did you buy it?”","Qiao Xi was slightly hesitant. “I didn’t buy it, and it’s impossible for me to have made it. This should be a gift from someone else.”","In that case, everything seemed to be connected to the dream. Qiao Xi was silent for a moment before abruptly raising her eyes to look at Gu Zheng. “Didn’t you give this wind chime to me?”","Gu Zheng did not have any toys when he was young. After he grew up, he focused on improving his hacking skills and managing company matters. He had never tried to make such handicrafts that girls liked. It was hard to imagine himself seriously making seashell wind chimes.","After a long time, Qiao Xi did not hear his response and did not ask further. After all, that was just her dream. It was just coincidental that she had a seashell wind chime, and it had nothing to do with Gu Zheng.","Qiao Xi stood up to pack her mother’s belongings. She dragged out a storage box from the corner. Gu Zheng picked up a golden fountain pen from the dusty storage box and raised his eyebrows. “Who gave this to you?”","Qiao Xi thought for a moment. “I participated in a small event when I was out shopping. The boss gave it to me, but it wasn’t very useful, so I threw it in the storage box.”","Gu Zheng looked at the pen that was worth 500,000 yuan and was a little surprised. “It’s not useful?”","“Yeah.” Qiao Xi nodded. “This fountain pen is quite nice, but it’s not useful at all. Later on, I bought a 50-yuan fountain pen and it was especially useful.”","Gu Zheng’s fingers stroked the patterns on the pen as he said softly, “It’s fine if you don’t like it. Just treat it as an ornament.”","“You’re right! This fountain pen looks quite good on the table. I wanted to throw it away previously, but after all, I got it from playing a game in the event. I couldn’t bear to throw it away.”","Gu Zheng asked curiously, “What game?”","Qiao Xi thought for a moment. “When I was 13 years old, I was pulled over by a boy to participate in a game on my phone after school one day. There was a reward for winning, and I was given a fountain pen. This prize is probably the most beautiful one among the other prizes. Unfortunately, it’s not useful.”","Gu Zheng was stunned. “You didn’t tell Qin An about this?”","Qiao Xi had a puzzled expression. “Why would I tell Third Brother about such a small matter? He had something going on that day and didn’t come to pick me up from school. It had already been a few days when I saw him again. I put the fountain pen in the storage box a long time ago, so he doesn’t know about it.”","So that was how it was! No wonder this fountain pen that was worth 500,000 yuan was thrown into a storage box by Qiao Xi. However, who gave Qiao Xi such an expensive fountain pen through a game on the streets? Moreover, the other party was a man!","Gu Zheng’s eyes darkened as he continued to ask, “Xi Xi, do you still remember what that person looked like? Or how old he was and what characteristics he had?”","Qiao Xi recalled carefully. “It’s been so long, so I can’t remember clearly. I only remember that he was wearing a black casual suit and a mask. His eyes were deep and lively. He should be a handsome man. Moreover, he personally handed the fountain pen to me. He even said that he specially chose this gift for me. I think it was definitely the best among all the prizes.”","A light flashed in Gu Zheng’s eyes as he thought of investigating who bought this fountain pen seven years ago. Perhaps he would find something. Since that person was wearing a mask, it seemed that it was not convenient for him to show his face. Before the results of the investigation were out, he did not intend to tell Qiao Xi lest she thought too much.","Qiao Xi sat on the chair and packed her things, while Gu Zheng found an empty room to handle his work. Perhaps it was because he did not sleep well last night, he actually fell asleep while leaning against the desk.","In real life, he did not like those handicrafts, but in his dream, he was holding a seashell wind chime in his hand because he had heard that Black Tide liked the sound of wind chimes."]},{"number":1188,"title":"Chapter 1188 Lost The Diamond Bracelet","paragraphs":["1188 Lost The Diamond Bracelet","Gu Zheng had always found such things childish and boring. He did not have time to go to the beach to pick seashells to make wind chimes, but at some point, a seashell wind chime appeared in his hand.","Perhaps dreams did not need logic. Everything was so ridiculous.","In the dream, Mo Yuan gave the wind chime to Black Tide. Black Tide happily took it and waved it in her hand. She smiled sweetly and said, “The sound of the wind chime is beautiful!”","Mo Yuan revealed a satisfied smile, but it quickly disappeared. He had always been so cold as if he was not used to laughing. When he spoke, his voice remained cold. “What’s so nice about the sound of shells hitting each other? I’ll give you a better gift in the future.”","The next second, Black Tide put the wind chime to her ear and shook it gently. The ordinary wind chime suddenly made sounds that were pleasant to the ear.","Mo Yuan was stunned for a moment before nodding. “It does sound good. I won’t give it to you anymore. I’ll keep it for myself.”","Black Tide hurriedly protected the wind chime in her arms and smiled sweetly. “No! You’ve already given it to me. This wind chime is mine. You can’t go back on your word. Also, you have to give me more gifts in the future!”","Looking at the girl’s tender and innocent smile, Mo Yuan could not help but smile.","Gu Zheng’s consciousness was pulled out of his dream. He suddenly opened his eyes and felt a slight headache. Why was he dreaming of the shell wind chime? Could it be that he had really given that wind chime to Qiao Xi?","Gu Zheng sat on the chair and reacted for a moment before getting up to leave the room. As soon as he left, he bumped into Qiao Xi walking over with a wind chime. “It’s all packed. Let’s go.”","“Well...” She hesitated. “Get Song Shijing to help me find a more reliable butler. I’m still worried about this butler.”","“Alright,” Gu Zheng replied.","On the other hand, in a luxury car near the Qiao family’s villa, Xia Yunlou’s expression was gloomy. “I didn’t expect Qiao Xi to suddenly appear. We should’ve left long ago!”","Xia Mengyan’s eyes turned red. “Aunt...”","Xia Yunlou naturally couldn’t bear to scold Xia Mengyan. She only scolded her softly, “Mengyan, you’re the daughter of the Xia family. You’ve been treated well your whole life. Why do you have to have that worthless shell wind chime? Moreover, you just broke a wind chime. Did you have to apologize to her? Qiao Xi has so many treasures in her hands. She doesn’t care about a wind chime at all. You don’t have to lower yourself to apologize to her!”","Xia Mengyan’s voice trembled slightly. “I was just afraid that Xi Xi wouldn’t be willing to give me a valuable gift, so I chose the most worthless item, the wind chime. I didn’t expect her to be unwilling to even give me that. Later, I accidentally broke the wind chime. I was afraid that Xi Xi would think that I did it on purpose, so I hurriedly apologized. Who knew that she still wouldn’t forgive me?”","Hearing their conversation, the driver was speechless. At that time, he had been waiting at the door and heard Miss Xia apologize. However, before Miss Qiao could speak, Madam Xia pulled Miss Xia out. As Miss Qiao’s biological mother, she treated her niece better than her own daughter. It was really strange.","At this moment, Xia Mengyan quietly took out the bracelet from the box and stuffed it into the pocket of her coat. Since Qiao Xi did not give them any face, Qiao Xi could not blame her for being heartless.","The inheritance left behind by Xia Yunqiu belonged to the Xia family. What right did Qiao Xi have to take it for herself? She had to make Qiao Xi pay the price!","After Xia Mengyan stuffed the one million yuan bracelet into the inner pocket of her coat, she pretended to be flustered and looked around. Just as the driver was about to drive away, she shouted in a panic, “Wait!”","The driver slammed on the brakes.","Xia Yunlou frowned unhappily. “Mengyan, what’s wrong now?”","Xia Mengyan panicked and said, “Aunt, my diamond bracelet is missing. I originally planned to wear it when I participated in business activities, but now that it’s gone, what should I do?!”","Xia Yunlou sat up and reached for the velvet box. She opened it and saw that it was indeed empty.","Xia Mengyan poured all the things in her bag onto the car seat. Her eyes turned red from anxiety. “There’s nothing in the jewelry box or in the bag. Where did the bracelet go? Could it have dropped when we were at the Qiao family’s villa?”","“Aunt, that’s a bracelet worth a million yuan. I have to go back and look for it,” Xia Mengyan said awkwardly. “B-But Xixi won’t let me in.”","Just as the two of them were hesitating, Xia Yunlou saw Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng’s car leave. She immediately decided. “They’ve left. Let’s go in and look for it. Who cares if she agrees or not?! A bracelet that’s worth a million yuan has been lost. She has to let us go in and look for it.”"]},{"number":1189,"title":"Chapter 1189 Counterattack","paragraphs":["1189 Counterattack","The driver drove the car to the entrance of the Qiao family’s villa. After all, Xia Yunlou was Qiao Xi’s mother, so the butler did not dare to stop them. The two of them swaggered into the villa.","Xia Mengyan’s eyes were filled with schemes. “Aunt, I put the box away when I left the storage room, so the bracelet must have fallen in the storage room. Moreover, you were the one who snatched the box from Qiao Xi and gave it to me. Was the bracelet in the box at that time?”","After being suddenly asked by Xia Mengyan, Xia Yunlou was not sure if the bracelet was in the box when she handed it back to Xia Mengyan. “I don’t remember, but when I gave you the box, I closed it. If the bracelet was still there at that time, it wouldn’t have gone missing.”","Xia Mengyan looked around the storage room and finally returned to Xia Yunlou with a helpless expression. Xia Yunlou’s face was ashen, and an idea formed in Xia Mengyan’s mind.","“I’m so stupid! How could I have lost such a precious thing? I remember that after Xi Xi came in, I took out the bracelet and handed it to her. I didn’t pass it to anyone else. After that, I took the box back and closed it. I didn’t take it out again. How did I suddenly lose it?”","Xia Yunlou’s body stiffened, and her expression was extremely ugly.","Qiao Xi!","When she thought of how Qiao Xi had stolen the bracelet, Xia Yunlou felt extremely embarrassed. She could not suppress the anger in her heart and roared, “It must be Qiao Xi! She stole your bracelet!”","“Other than us, only Qiao Xi touched the bracelet. She must have wanted the bracelet but was unwilling to give you the wind chime, so she took it away. Why is she so cheap?!”","Xia Mengyan pretended to be surprised. “No way. How could Xi Xi...”","“It must be her! How did Xia Yunqiu educate her child? She actually allowed Qiao Xi to steal things! She’s dead and left her daughter here to embarrass me! I’m so angry!”","Xia Yunlou shouted crazily, “Mengyan! Follow me to the police station to report this matter. I want her to know the price of stealing! If we don’t teach her a lesson this time, she’ll definitely become worse and do even worse things!”","Xia Mengyan’s heart trembled. If they went to the police station, would they find out about what she did? However, on second thought, she was the person who reported the case and the daughter of the Xia family. Those police officers would definitely not suspect her.","She pretended to decline. “Forget it. No matter what, Xi Xi is your biological daughter, Mrs. Gu, and the daughter of the Yin family. If this matter blows up, she’ll offend many people.”","“What’s there to be afraid of?! Can she blame us for stealing something?” Xia Yunlou felt her face burning. “Now that she stole something from you, it’s fine if we teach her a lesson. If she steals something from someone else in the future, she won’t be afraid of losing face, but I’m her biological mother. I’ll definitely be criticized for not teaching my daughter well. I don’t want to lose face!”","“Mengyan, don’t be afraid. I’ll accompany you to the police. I’ll definitely get her to return your bracelet! Let’s go!”","“Aunt...”","“Driver, let’s go to the nearest police station. Qiao Xi is so young but already has so many bad habits. How dare she steal things? I have to teach her a lesson!”","The driver looked helpless. How could Miss Qiao steal something? He, an outsider, did not believe it. How could Madam Xia be so sure that Miss Qiao had stolen something?","...","Longwan Residential.","Qiao Xi leaned lazily on the sofa and listened to the news from Song Shijing. The smile on her face grew wider and wider. “Xia Mengyan lost her bracelet that costs one million yuan. Xia Yunlou thinks that I stole it, so she went to the police to report it?”","Song Shijing nodded. “Yes.”","“Stealing an item worth a million yuan is a big crime!”","“Xia Yunlou has already taken out the receipt for the bracelet. As the amount involved is too high, the police have already opened a case for investigation. As the aunt of the owner, Xia Yunlou insists that you stole the bracelet. If word gets out, it’ll affect your reputation,” Song Shijing said.","“Heh.” Qiao Xi snorted coldly. “Coincidentally, I also want to make a trip to the police station. I originally wanted Xia Mengyan to compensate me, but who knew that they would actually bite back and say that I stole the bracelet? How interesting!”","“Xia Mengyan deliberately destroyed my collection of artworks and hasn’t compensated me yet. Now, Xia Yunlou is accusing me of stealing a bracelet worth a million yuan. Will these two people end up in the police station for a while after this?”","Song Shijing knew that Madam had wanted to counterattack a long time ago, but before she could do anything, the other party had already gone to the police station. However, this was nothing to Madam.","He asked respectfully, “Madam, are you going out now?”","“Yes, which police station are they at? Send me there. I want to report a case too.” Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully."]},{"number":1190,"title":"Chapter 1190 The Big Shot Of Li City","paragraphs":["1190 The Big Shot Of Li City","“Do you need the president to accompany you?”","Qiao Xi hesitated for a moment before nodding. “Yes! I’m just a weak woman. My precious collection was ruined by Xia Mengyan. I didn’t want to report it to the police at first, but my husband encouraged me to go head-to-head with evil forces, so I finally agreed to go to the police station.”","Song Shijing was speechless. She was already pretending to be weak before reaching the police station?","At the police station.","Xia Yunlou said hatefully, “Qiao Xi stole the bracelet! Arrest her for interrogation now and ask her to hand over the bracelet!”","The police officer looked troubled. “Madam Xia, you said that Miss Qiao stole it, but you didn’t provide any substantial evidence. We can’t arrest her. As for who stole your item, we still need to investigate it. Please give us some time.”","Xia Yunlou glared at them. “What do you mean? You don’t believe me? Other than Mengyan and me, only she touched that box. She must have stolen the bracelet. She’s only 20 years old, but she’s already stealing things. If you don’t arrest her, she’ll definitely steal more expensive things in the future!”","The police officer said patiently, “Evidence is important in a case. We can’t arrest someone just because of your words. If we wrongly accuse Miss Qiao...”","Madam Xia insisted that Miss Qiao had stolen something, so they would have to investigate Miss Qiao first. However, without evidence, they had no right to arrest her. They could only go to her house to find out the situation.","Xia Yunlou’s face was ferocious as she shouted without caring about her image, “What evidence do you need? My words are evidence. Let me tell you, I’m the daughter of the Xia family. I’m also Qiao Xi’s—”","“Madam Xia, if you have anything to say, tell me directly. Why make things difficult for them?” A gentle and sweet voice sounded. The few of them looked in the direction of the voice and saw a young lady exuding a pure aura standing at the door. Beside her was a tall and handsome man. The two of them stood there like a painting, pleasing to the eye.","The place was silent for a moment. Xia Yunlou instantly exploded. She pointed at Qiao Xi and roared, “Alright! You’re finally here! Hurry up and hand over Mengyan’s bracelet! Otherwise, you’ll go to jail!”","Gu Zheng stood tall and straight beside Qiao Xi like a mountain. His deep eyes swept across Xia Yunlou. It was just a casual glance, but it made Xia Yunlou shudder, and she instantly swallowed the words in her mouth.","Xia Mengyan took two steps forward, her eyes filled with helplessness and worry. She said gently, “Mr. Gu, I’m really sorry. I told Aunt not to call the police, but she insisted on coming. I believe that Xi Xi wouldn’t steal the bracelet. Aunt came to the police station because she was afraid that Xi Xi would go astray. Please don’t blame Aunt...","“Mr. Gu, you should take Xi Xi away first! Aunt and Xi Xi are already very distant with each other. If Aunt says something bad again, Xi Xi will definitely be sad! I believe that Xi Xi wouldn’t steal anything, and I tried stopping Aunt too. Who knew that she would force me to come to the police station? I tried to persuade her for a long time, but she...”","Xia Mengyan stood in front of Gu Zheng as if she was an innocent little white flower. She made it seem that everything was Xia Yunlou’s idea, and she had tried her best to stop her.","She bit her lip, and her eyes turned red. She looked at Gu Zheng aggrievedly and shyly. “Mr. Gu...”","“Miss Xia, if I leave with Xi Xi, the entire Li City will think that Xi Xi stole something,” Gu Zheng said coldly.","Xia Mengyan’s expression froze as she explained in a panic, “No, I’m just afraid that Xi Xi...”","The police officer sized up the person in front of him and found him familiar. Before he could figure it out, Gu Zheng’s gaze landed on him. Gu Zheng slowly said, “Officer, I’m Qiao Xi’s husband. I want to confirm that Madam Xia accused my wife of stealing a bracelet worth a million yuan?”","“Yes. Since you’re here, can you cooperate with us? We want to know what happened.” With that, the police officer called for his other colleagues.","“This...” The police officer who had just arrived suddenly froze on the spot and asked the person beside him in a low voice, “Isn’t this the big shot of Li City?”","The police officer in charge seemed to realize something and quickly asked, “May I know your name, sir?”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent, and there was a cold smile on his lips. He said casually, “My surname is Gu.”","“Hiss...” The police officers gasped. This man’s surname was Gu, and his aura was very similar to the legendary big shot. Could he be the famous president of Gu Corporation?","Miss Qiao was Mr. Gu’s wife?"]},{"number":1191,"title":"Chapter 1191 There’s Surveillance In The Villa","paragraphs":["1191 There’s Surveillance In The Villa","The police officers usually did not pay attention to business tycoons, but Gu Zheng was the business emperor of Li City. Everyone had naturally heard of his reputation. Moreover, the woman who could marry Gu Zheng was naturally not an ordinary person.","They had thought that it was just an ordinary theft case, but they did not expect the amount involved to be one million yuan. Moreover, it was related to Mr. and Mrs. Gu. It had been a long time since their branch had received such a big case.","The police officer said nervously, “M-Mr. Gu, we want to ask Mrs. Gu about the situation. Do you think...”","Gu Zheng turned his head slightly and looked at the woman beside him lovingly. “Xi Xi.”","Qiao Xi glanced at Xia Yunlou and said helplessly, “It’s every citizen’s duty to cooperate with the police’s investigation. Of course, I won’t refuse. However, Miss Xia, you reported that I stole something. It really surprised me. You were the ones who broke into the Qiao family’s villa. I haven’t called the police to arrest you yet, but you came to the police to say that I stole a bracelet?”","The police officer was stunned. How could this be about trespassing?","Xia Mengyan panicked. “Xi Xi, I’m sorry. I didn’t want to report it to the police either. I was worried that you would go astray and just wanted to teach you a lesson. I don’t have any other intentions. Please don’t blame me! Let’s withdraw the case. Aunt, Xi Xi wouldn’t have stolen the bracelet!”","Seeing her compromise, Xia Yunlou was even angrier. Mengyan was too naive, which was why she thought that Qiao Xi would not steal anything. She was married to Gu Zheng now, and her value had risen. However, she was a wild girl from the countryside in the past. Her bad habit of stealing must have developed at that time. She definitely did not steal for money, but she just could not change this habit of hers.","Why did she have to withdraw the case? It was not easy for her to catch Qiao Xi in the wrong. She would not let Qiao Xi off so easily!","Xia Yunlou was unable to restrain her anger. “You’re not allowed to withdraw the case! She did such an embarrassing thing. Are you afraid of others talking about it? Mr. Gu, I know you might be unhappy, but this bracelet was stolen by Qiao Xi. Why do you have to take a fancy to such a wild girl? Our Mengyan is clearly better than her and more suitable...”","Gu Zheng’s entire body emitted a cold aura. Qiao Xi, who was at the side, suddenly whimpered and threw herself into Gu Zheng’s arms aggrievedly. Her voice was choked with sobs. “I’ll cooperate with the investigation! I never said that I wouldn’t cooperate, but even before the investigation is completed, Madam Xia is insisting that I stole something. She even said that I’m a wild girl who’s not worthy of Ah Zheng. Boo-hoo... I’m so aggrieved!”","A soft cry sounded in the hall. Qiao Xi was crying softly like a pitiful kitten, causing the police officers in the station to feel sorry for her.","Mrs. Gu was too weak. She looked like a little princess who had been pampered since she was young. She had never suffered such grievances. It was probably the first time she had been accused of stealing in her life, so she could not help but cry.","What shocked everyone was that Gu Zheng was extremely gentle. He hugged Mrs. Gu in his arms and coaxed her gently for a long time. There was no trace of impatience in his eyes.","Qiao Xi hugged Gu Zheng’s waist with her weak little hands. She raised her eyes slightly to look at him and said delicately, “Ah Zheng, I’m so scared!”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and looked at Qiao Xi, whose eyes were slightly red but without a trace of tears. He gently touched her head, bent down slightly, and whispered into her ear, “Stop fooling around.”","Qiao Xi acted as if she did not hear anything. She gently wiped the corners of her eyes and said in a soft and aggrieved voice, “If Madam Xia doesn’t believe me, then investigate me. In order to prove my innocence, I’ve already sent someone to get the surveillance cameras in the villa. There are surveillance cameras in every corner of the villa. When the time comes, everyone will know if I stole the bracelet or not.”","“I can make a statement now.” Qiao Xi took a deep breath, then a female police officer brought Qiao Xi into the interrogation room.","Everyone couldn’t help but sigh. A real big shot was indeed different. Even though Mrs. Gu felt aggrieved, she was willing to cooperate with the police. Moreover, she was willing to take out the surveillance footage as evidence, which meant that she most likely didn’t steal it.","Madam Xia, on the other hand, was making a fuss the moment she entered. She insisted that Miss Qiao had stolen something without any evidence and even ordered them to arrest her. She was really unreasonable.","At this moment, Xia Mengyan’s forehead was covered in cold sweat. There were surveillance cameras in the villa?","She bit her lip nervously, feeling uneasy. She quickly walked up to Xia Yunlou and said in a low voice, “Aunt, forget it. Xi Xi is ready to check the surveillance footage. It seems that she really didn’t steal the bracelet. We wronged her...”"]},{"number":1192,"title":"Chapter 1192 Proving Her Innocence","paragraphs":["1192 Proving Her Innocence","“Mengyan! Remember that you’re the daughter of the Xia family. How can you be timid? Are you afraid of Qiao Xi? She clearly stole that bracelet!” Xia Yunlou said firmly.","Xia Mengyan: “...”","At this moment, she despised Xia Yunlou very much. At this point, it was obvious that Qiao Xi had evidence to prove her innocence. If they continued to cause trouble, they would definitely be embarrassed. She hesitated for a moment and patiently persuaded, “Aunt, look at how confident Xi Xi is. It doesn’t seem like she stole something. Even if she really did steal something, she’s still your biological daughter and my cousin. If she’s arrested, we’ll also lose face. If this matter gets out, they’ll think that we bullied Xi Xi.","“Aunt, let’s withdraw the case. You’ve taught Xi Xi enough lessons. She’s already crying from fright.”","She had never planned to call the police in the first place. She just wanted the entire Li City to know that Qiao Xi had stolen her bracelet, but she did not intend to hold it against her. That way, not only could she let everyone know that Qiao Xi’s character was bad, but she could also let everyone know that she was tolerant and magnanimous. She did not expect that she would accidentally end up at the police station.","Xia Yunlou was silent. No matter what, Qiao Xi was still her daughter. If this matter blew up, she would also lose face. Those noble ladies would mock her behind her back.","However, would the news not spread after the case was withdrawn? At that time, everyone would say that the Xia family was afraid of Gu Zheng’s power and did not dare to stand up for Mengyan. It seemed inappropriate no matter what they did.","However, Mengyan insisted on withdrawing the case...","Xia Yunlou thought for a long time before saying, “We can withdraw the case, but...”","“Withdraw the case? That won’t do!” Qiao Xi walked out of the interrogation room and pointed at Song Shiyu, who was behind everyone. “The surveillance footage of the villa has been sent over. From Madam Xia Yunlou breaking into the Qiao family’s villa to the two’s departure, everything was recorded very clearly.”","Song Shiyu took out his laptop and played the surveillance video. Qiao Xi stared at the screen and pointed at it. “Here, you can see Miss Xia taking out the bracelet box.”","On the screen, Xia Mengyan opened an exquisite velvet box, revealing the bracelet inlaid with diamonds. Then, she closed it.","From then on, the velvet box was placed on the table without anyone touching it. Halfway through, Xia Mengyan even stuffed the box into Qiao Xi’s arms. However, Qiao Xi did not even touch it before Xia Yunlou snatched it back and stuffed it into Xia Mengyan’s hand. Then, Xia Mengyan placed the box in her bag. The surveillance footage was very clear. Qiao Xi did not have the chance to open the box and take out the bracelet at all.","Later on, Xia Yunlou pulled Xia Mengyan away. From the moment they walked out of the storage room to the entrance of the villa, there were surveillance cameras all the way. The box was in Xia Mengyan’s bag and did not fall out. The surveillance footage in the storage room was still playing. Qiao Xi was seen holding the broken shell wind chime in her hand. She did not chase after them.","At the same time, after Xia Yunlou and Xia Mengyan left the villa, they got into the car. The two parties did not meet again. In the surveillance footage, Qiao Xi did not even touch the box. How could she have stolen the bracelet?","After the surveillance footage ended, Xia Mengyan’s expression was extremely ugly.","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows and said, “Everyone saw it clearly. I didn’t touch the box containing the bracelet at all, but Madam Xia Yunlou insisted that I stole the bracelet. I don’t understand why. Are you maligning me, or do you just dislike me?”","The surveillance footage was enough to prove Qiao Xi’s innocence. What Xia Yunlou said just now had become slander. She realized that the gazes around her had become sharp.","She gritted her teeth. She didn’t like Qiao Xi, but why couldn’t this little b*tch just go along with her this once? How could she embarrass her biological mother in public?","Xia Yunlou was indignant and shouted sharply, “Why are you all looking at me? Mengyan lost her precious jewelry. There were only a few people present. Wasn’t it natural for me to suspect Qiao Xi?”","They were the owners of the jewelry, so they could suspect anyone?","Qiao Xi sneered. Xia Mengyan’s heart suddenly trembled, and cold sweat seeped out of her back. She bit her lip and racked her brains to think of a way to deal with it. Now that Qiao Xi had already proven her innocence, how could she explain the whereabouts of the bracelet?","She didn’t want to make a scene at the police station in the first place. It was Xia Yunlou, that idiot, who insisted on making a big deal out of it. Now, it was hard to retaliate.","Just as Xia Mengyan was about to explain, Qiao Xi asked, “Madam Xia, since you’re allowed to suspect anyone, why don’t you suspect Miss Xia?”"]},{"number":1193,"title":"Chapter 1193 She Slandered Me","paragraphs":["1193 She Slandered Me","As soon as Qiao Xi said this, the entire venue was silent for a few seconds. Xia Yunlou erupted into ear-piercing laughter. “Are you crazy?! Mengyan was the one who lost the bracelet. Why should I suspect her?”","“Why not?! It’s possible that Miss Xia pretended to lose her bracelet and framed me. Madam Xia, you can look for it in Miss Xia’s bag. Perhaps you’ll find it!”","Xia Mengyan’s body suddenly stiffened, and the blood in her body seemed to have frozen. She was stunned for a long time before calming down.","Qiao Xi wanted to search her bag?","Xia Yunlou was indignant. “What right do you have to search Mengyan’s bag? Mengyan is the owner of the missing bracelet and is a victim!”","“Can’t the owner steal her own belongings? Why do you insist on thinking that it was me without any evidence? Why do you firmly believe in Xia Mengyan?” Qiao Xi asked.","The female police officer received a signal from her team leader to search for Xia Mengyan’s bag.","Xia Mengyan heaved a sigh of relief. Fortunately, she did not put the item in her bag, but the next second...","After searching her bag, the female police officer accidentally touched her clothes. She touched her pocket, then took out a diamond-studded bracelet from the inside pocket of her coat.","The diamond bracelet worth a million yuan was in Xia Mengyan’s pocket!","Boom!!!","Xia Mengyan’s mind was a mess, and everything in front of her became blurry. Didn’t they say that they were going to search her bag? Why did they search her clothes?","Qiao Xi was supposed to be the one who stole the bracelet, but now, she had become the culprit!","“Oh! It’s indeed on Miss Xia!” Qiao Xi crossed her arms and leaned slightly in Gu Zheng’s arms. “This bracelet was clearly in your pocket, but you made a fuss and came to the police station to report it missing. You even slandered me for stealing it!”","Xia Yunlou felt as if she had been struck by lightning as she looked at Xia Mengyan in disbelief.","Xia Mengyan was so anxious that her forehead was covered in sweat. “Aunt, I told you long ago that Xi Xi wouldn’t have stolen anything. I... Perhaps I forgot that I put it in my pocket, so I misunderstood Xi Xi.”","Qiao Xi watched Xia Mengyan act with interest, but no matter what she said, it seemed so powerless.","Xia Mengyan pulled Xia Yunlou’s arm and said anxiously, “Aunt, since the misunderstanding has been resolved, let’s leave quickly. Grandpa is still waiting for us at home!”","At this moment, Xia Yunlou felt even more embarrassed. Everyone’s gazes were gathered on them. It turned out that the bracelet was not lost and Qiao Xi did not steal it. The unwillingness and guilt in her heart were mixed together. Xia Yunlou was like a walking corpse as she was pulled out by Xia Mengyan.","Xia Yunlou’s mind was in chaos. If this matter spread, what should she do? It was definitely ridiculous that she had accused her daughter of stealing!","She felt weak all over and walked out the door.","“Don’t leave yet!” Qiao Xi opened her mouth to stop them, and Song Shiyu quickly acted on it.","Xia Yunlou turned around stiffly, and her face alternated between red and white. She gritted her teeth and roared at Qiao Xi, “What are you doing?”","Qiao Xi turned around and said to the female police officer, “Officer, I want to report a case.”","The female police officer understood in her heart that these two women had wrongly accused Miss Qiao of stealing something. Moreover, the amount involved was as high as a million yuan, and there was also the crime of slander. Moreover, they had even called the police and occupied public resources. According to the rules, the two of them had to be severely punished. How could they think of leaving without a word?","How was that possible?!","“She slandered me!” Qiao Xi pointed at Xia Yunlou and shouted.","The female police officer was not surprised, but the next second, Qiao Xi pointed at Xia Mengyan. “She deliberately destroyed my collectible that’s worth 200,000 yuan.”","200,000 yuan was not a lot to Qiao Xi, but it had already reached the amount needed to file a case. When the policewoman heard this, she immediately recorded it, but Xia Mengyan was dumbfounded.","Qiao Xi said that she had deliberately destroyed a collectible of hers, but she did not!","Before Xia Mengyan could speak, Xia Yunlou could not help but roar. “Qiao Xi! What nonsense are you talking about?!”","Qiao Xi glanced at her disdainfully. Soon, a man in a suit walked in. He respectfully greeted Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi before introducing himself to everyone. “I’m Wei Feng, a lawyer from Chengyue Law Firm. My client is Miss Qiao Xi.”","The policewoman invited everyone to move to the mediation room and take their seats. Lawyer Wei was wearing gold-rimmed glasses and had a faint smile on his lips, but his tone was extremely serious. “My client has already told me the whole story about the slander. My client doesn’t have to say anything anymore. I’ll be handling the case.”","Everything went according to the procedure, so the police naturally nodded in agreement. However, when Xia Yunlou saw the lawyer, she was instantly unhappy. “Qiao Xi! You actually got a lawyer to come over? Are you going to sue me?”","It was just a small matter, but Qiao Xi actually invited a lawyer. She was really calculative!"]},{"number":1194,"title":"Chapter 1194 Xia Yunlou Was Punished","paragraphs":["1194 Xia Yunlou Was Punished","Translator: Henyee Translations","Editor: Henyee Translations","When Wei Feng heard Xia Yunlou’s words, the smile on his face suddenly disappeared. “Madam Xia, your actions are already suspected of breaking the law and causing mental harm to my client.”","“Don’t scare me. I’m—”","Before Xia Yunlou could finish speaking, Wei Feng interrupted her coldly. “Miss Xia’s diamond bracelet was bought at an auction in the capital a few months ago. It’s worth one million yuan. The amount involved is too high. If convicted of theft, my client would’ve been severely punished and her reputation would’ve been affected.”","Xia Yunlou was displeased. “I didn’t say I wanted to punish her.”","“Madam Xia, it’s not up to you to decide if she’ll be punished or not.” Wei Feng’s eyes were sharp. “From the moment you entered the police station to report the case, it already meant that you were seeking to punish Miss Qiao.”","Xia Yunlou instantly choked, and her heart beat violently. She only wanted to teach Qiao Xi a lesson. She had never thought of letting Qiao Xi go to jail!","“Now that the diamond bracelet has been found and it was on Miss Xia’s body, it means that Madam Xia had slandered my client.” Wei Feng did not speak quickly, but every word hit Xia Yunlou. “According to the law, slandering others requires detention for more than 10 days. Madam Xia, if you have any questions, you can ask a lawyer to negotiate with me.”","“No... No.” Xia Yunlou panicked when she heard that she was going to be detained. She had come to the police station to report a case. Why was she being arrested now?","Xia Yunlou’s face was filled with anxiety. “Why? It was reasonable suspicion. I...”","“Madam Xia, it’s still early. You can contact your lawyer as soon as possible.” Wei Feng stood up, his eyes cold.","“Madam Xia.” The policewoman gestured for Xia Yunlou to leave. Her face was deathly pale, and her body was trembling uncontrollably. She raised her eyes to look at Qiao Xi, and when she saw Qiao Xi sitting there with an indifferent expression, her heart instantly turned cold.","She shouted in panic, “No! You can’t detain me! My father is Xia Cheng! What right do you have?”","Everyone ignored her. The policewoman held her hand and was about to leave when Xia Yunlou suddenly broke free and shouted at the"]},{"number":1195,"title":"Chapter 1195 A Collectible Worth 200,000 yuan","paragraphs":["1195 A Collectible Worth 200,000 yuan","“I’m sorry, Madam Xia. You can’t leave yet.” The female police officer stopped Xia Yunlou and glanced at the trembling Xia Mengyan. She asked respectfully, “Miss Qiao, regarding the intentional destruction of the collectible...”","Xia Mengyan’s face turned pale as she bit her lip uneasily.","Xia Yunlou roared, “Qiao Xi! Are you done?! I wronged you, but are you going to wrong Mengyan now? She’s innocent! Don’t make things difficult for her!”","Xia Mengyan’s mind was in chaos. When did she destroy Qiao Xi’s collectible? Qiao Xi was clearly taking revenge and wanted to frame her!","Qiao Xi ignored the crazy Xia Yunlou and said casually, “Everyone has seen the surveillance footage. Xia Mengyan deliberately smashed my wind chime and stepped on it a few times. Many pieces of that shell wind chime have already shattered, and the piece has lost its value.”","Xia Mengyan’s entire body trembled. The female police officer went forward to take a look at the surveillance footage. Although Xia Mengyan kept saying that she didn’t do it on purpose, when she slowed down the video, she could tell that Xia Mengyan had deliberately thrown the wind chime on the ground. Moreover, Xia Mengyan’s eyes and expression revealed a trace of smugness. She had deliberately destroyed the shell wind chime in order to anger Qiao Xi.","Her acting skills were so bad that all the police officers present could see her triumphant smile.","Xia Mengyan’s body stiffened, and she was about to break down. She had only accidentally broken a wind chime. What right did Qiao Xi have to be so relentless? Now that Xia Yunlou was already detained, was she going to be detained too? Was the daughter of the Xia family actually going to be thrown in jail? If this matter got out, the socialites of upper class society would definitely laugh at her. How could she face others in the future?","Xia Yunlou was already suppressing her anger. When she saw Xia Mengyan’s entire body trembling, she immediately roared with a ferocious expression, “Qiao Xi! What exactly do you want? Are you crazy?! Mengyan only broke a wind chime, and it’s not anything valuable. You actually want to sue Mengyan because of this? Are you crazy? If I had known earlier, I wouldn’t have given birth to you back then!”","As soon as she said this, everyone’s sharp gazes suddenly turned to Xia Yunlou.","Gu Zheng exuded a cold killing intent, and his gaze was terrifyingly cold.","The female police officer couldn’t stand it anymore. “Madam Xia, as Miss Qiao’s mother, you helped your niece wrongly accuse her of stealing. This time, your niece deliberately broke your daughter’s valuables, yet you’re saying that your daughter is calculative. You really don’t know who your biological daughter is.”","Everyone only found out today that Miss Qiao was abandoned when she was young and had been wandering outside. She was only found not long ago. They did not understand why Xia Yunlou, the daughter of a wealthy family, would abandon her daughter.","At this moment, Xia Mengyan lowered her head and was about to break down. Her eyes were bloodshot, and tears fell like beads. She sobbed softly, “Xi Xi, it’s all my fault. I shouldn’t have misunderstood you, but I accidentally broke that wind chime. Moreover, it’s just a worthless thing. Do you have to target me like this?”","Qiao Xi chuckled, her eyes filled with disdain. “Miss Xia, your ears might not be good. Let me repeat myself. That shell wind chime is a part of a rare collectible that’s no longer in production. It’s worth 200,000 yuan.","“200,000 yuan might not be a big deal to you, but it’s enough to count as a crime. You have to take responsibility for it!”","“200,000 yuan? How is that possible? That’s just an ordinary shell wind chime. It can be found everywhere! Why are you so unreasonable?!”","When Xia Mengyan saw Xia Mengyan crying aggrievedly, she couldn’t help but roar loudly. She shouted at the top of her voice, “She’s slandering us! Arrest her and detain her!”","Everyone: “???”","The female police officer had a headache. She didn’t expect this rich lady to be so rude as to shout at the police station.","Xia Mengyan looked up aggrievedly and said pitifully, “Xi Xi, I know you hate me, but it’s just an ordinary shell wind chime. I didn’t break it on purpose. Are you really going to extort 200,000 from me?”","“Extortion? You can’t say that. This shell wind chime is indeed worth 200,000 yuan. I’m not lying. Now that we’re at the police station, Miss Xia, there’s no need to pretend anymore. Whether you intentionally broke it or not, it’s been made very clear in the video. I hope you can confess and ask for leniency. Otherwise, you’ll be punished even more severely,” Qiao Xi said casually. Then, she took out the wind chime that Xia Mengyan had damaged."]},{"number":1196,"title":"Chapter 1196 I Don’t Accept The Settlement","paragraphs":["1196 I Don’t Accept The Settlement","“This is a handicraft designed by Zhu Jin. My mother loved collecting the works of this artist. This shell wind chime is part of her collection. The name and seal of Zhu Jin are engraved on the shell wind chime. If you don’t believe me, you can ask someone to investigate and see if I lied to you.”","The female police officer took the shell wind chime. Sure enough, she saw the carved name and red seal in the shell at the top of the wind chime. She took a closer look at the wind chime. The craftsmanship was indeed exquisite. It was different from ordinary wind chimes.","This shell wind chime was considered cheap among Zhu Jin’s works, but each of them was unique. The shells of each wind chime were different, so if the shells were broken, the chime would lose its value.","As the amount involved was too high, the police station specially hired professionals to verify the authenticity of the artwork. After a moment, the other party came to a conclusion. “This is indeed a piece designed by Zhu Jin. The current market price is at least 200,000 yuan.”","“Miss Xia, you’re suspected of destroying Miss Qiao’s collection and causing the other party to lose 200,000 yuan. Now that the evidence is conclusive, please come with us!”","Xia Mengyan’s eyes widened in disbelief. “It’s really worth 200,000?”","Xia Yunlou’s face was also filled with shock, but then she pointed at Qiao Xi and screamed, “Qiao Xi, why are you so calculative? Isn’t it just 200,000 yuan? Is there a need for you to do this?”","“This is a relic left behind by my mother, but Xia Mengyan deliberately destroyed it. I’ve never cared about money. I just want to punish her.”","Xia Yunlou immediately blurted out, “She’s already dead. What’s precious about the things she left behind? Don’t forget that I’m your biological mother...”","“Madam Xia.” The female police officer frowned unhappily. “This is the police station. Please don’t shout. Besides, I have to remind you that the victim now is your daughter. Instead of speaking up for your daughter, you actually think that your daughter is being calculative. How many mothers like you exist in this world?”","After the policewoman finished speaking, she looked at Xia Mengyan coldly. “Miss Xia, the 200,000 yuan has already reached the filing amount. Your actions constitute a crime...”","“No! I didn’t do it!” Xia Mengyan panicked and shouted, “I can compensate her! I apply for a settlement. I don’t want to be detained!”","At this moment, Xia Mengyan’s forehead was covered in sweat. She was no longer as calm as before. She shouted in panic, “Xi Xi, I’m your cousin! You can’t sue me. How can you be so heartless? Let’s reconcile, okay? I can compensate you with 200,000 yuan!”","“There’s no need.” Qiao Xi refused coldly. “Miss Xia, I’ve already said that I’m not calculative about money. This is about getting justice. I want the person who destroyed my mother’s belongings to be punished, so I won’t accept a settlement.”","She looked up at Wei Feng. “Lawyer Wei, I’ll have to trouble you next.”","“Miss Qiao, you’re too kind. I’ll definitely settle everything and seek justice for you!” Wei Feng promised. Then, he turned to look at Xia Mengyan. “Miss Xia, I’m sorry. My client won’t accept the settlement. Quickly hire a lawyer. It won’t be long before we meet in court.”","Xia Mengyan felt as if she had been struck by lightning. Her head felt like it was about to explode, and her breathing stopped. She stood rooted to the ground for a few seconds before fainting.","A week later.","Qiao Xi sat comfortably in the teahouse, drinking hot flower tea while waiting for Gu Zheng to finish his work. At the side, Li Xing’er was chatting with a few good friends.","“You guys don’t know yet, right? Something big happened in Li City’s socialite circle!” Li Xing’er’s mysterious tone and exaggerated expression immediately attracted everyone’s curiosity.","“What is it? Tell me!”","Li Xing’er cleared her throat and said, “You guys haven’t seen Xia Mengyan for a long time, right?”","“That’s right! It’s strange that someone like her who likes to join in the fun didn’t attend Miss Ye’s birthday banquet. Moreover, it was Old Madam Xia who rejected the invitation for her. Miss Ye was so angry that her face turned green!”","“The Xia family has just moved to Li City, but they’re already putting on airs. Not only did they reject Miss Ye, but they also rejected others. Xia Mengyan is really arrogant!”","Just as they were discussing, the ‘Miss Ye’ they were talking about happened to come to the teahouse. She was accompanied by Madam Ye. The mother and daughter had come out to shop. When they were tired from walking, they came to the teahouse at the side to rest.","When Madam Ye saw Li Xing’er, she pulled her daughter back and said in a low voice, “Let’s sit at the side and listen to what they’re saying.”"]},{"number":1197,"title":"Chapter 1197 I Have My Own Plan","paragraphs":["1197 I Have My Own Plan","Miss Ye was still brooding over Xia Mengyan rejecting the birthday banquet invitation. She did not expect that this matter had already spread throughout Li City. Now, countless people were laughing at her behind her back.","At this moment, one of Li Xing’er’s friends asked curiously, “Xing’er, do you know something? Tell us quickly. Not only did Xia Mengyan reject Miss Ye, but she also rejected Miss Bai a few days ago!”","“I heard that Miss Ye is very angry. After all, Xia Mengyan is not a socialite in Li City. Madam Ye sent her an invitation because she was giving her face. Who knew that she would reject it and not even show her any respect? She’s really too rude. How dare she say that she’s a socialite?”","“Listen to me...” Li Xing’er smiled meaningfully. “Actually, Xia Mengyan didn’t mean to refuse. It’s just that she really couldn’t go.”","“Why?”","Everyone was curious. Miss Ye, who was at the side, also pricked up her ears to listen. Because of Xia Mengyan’s rejection, she was mocked by many people. The Xia family was an outsider and did not have a deep foundation in Li City. They actually dared to reject the Ye family’s invitation. They simply did not take the Ye family seriously. Therefore, Miss Xia really wanted to know why Xia Mengyan did not come.","Li Xing’er’s lips curled into a smile as she said mysteriously, “Let me tell you, Xia Mengyan and Xia Yunlou have both been detained, so she couldn’t attend the gathering at all.”","Everyone was stunned.","Madam Ye and Miss Ye also gasped in shock. Xia Mengyan was actually detained?","Under everyone’s shocked gazes, Li Xing’er said proudly, “The Xia family was afraid that this matter would spread, so they’ve been hiding it from everyone. However, when my father and Gu Yao were discussing business that day, Gu Yao happened to be drunk and let it slip. Only then did I know that Xia Mengyan and Xia Yunlou have been arrested!”","When Qiao Xi heard Li Xing’er’s words, she almost choked on her tea.","Li Xing’er had gathered so many of her friends to gossip. She knew what Xia Mengyan and Xia Yunlou had done and stood up for her. Although they were both detained, it did not affect them much. Only by spreading this news throughout Li City would it be the greatest punishment for them.","Two days later, when Xia Mengyan and Xia Yunlou were released and they found out that the entire Li City was talking about their detention, how could they still have the face to stay in Li City?","When Qiao Xi told Li Xing’er about this earlier, Qiao Xi had asked her how she would reveal it to everyone and explain how she knew.","At that time, Li Xing’er had a mysterious expression on her face. She said that she had a brilliant plan. She did not expect her brilliant plan to involve Gu Yao. Gu Yao was really pitiful!","At this moment, Li Xing’er cleared her throat and said, “Gu Yao was the one who told my father about this. Gu Yao has many friends and connections. Moreover, this matter is related to his sister-in-law, Qiao Xi, so it’s not strange for him to know. He was also drunk and accidentally let it slip. My father told my mother and me. I thought that I had to share such a big piece of news with my good friends, which is why I’m telling you.”","“This has something to do with Qiao Xi? What’s going on? Xing’er, tell me quickly. Why was Xia Mengyan arrested?” The young ladies were so anxious that they stomped their feet. They all wanted to know how the usually high and mighty Xia Mengyan fell from grace.","Madam Ye and Miss Ye were also focused on waiting for Li Xing’er to speak.","Li Xing’er stopped keeping them in suspense. “You all know that Qiao Xi was abandoned when she was young. Later on, although she reunited with Xia Yunlou, the mother and daughter didn’t have a good relationship. A week ago, Xia Mengyan and Xia Yunlou secretly went to the Qiao family’s villa and happened to meet Qiao Xi. After the two of them left, Xia Mengyan said that she lost her diamond bracelet and incited Xia Yunlou. Xia Yunlou went to the police in a fit of anger and said that Qiao Xi stole it and demanded the police arrest Qiao Xi. That bracelet was worth a million yuan. If she was sentenced, she might be jailed for 10 years! As Qiao Xi’s mother, she actually believed a few words from Xia Mengyan. She said that she was afraid that Xia Mengyan would be sad after losing the bracelet and insisted on making Qiao Xi pay the price!”","The eyes of the daughters of wealthy families were filled with shock. They were born into wealthy families and had seen many dirty things like mistresses and illegitimate daughters working together to deal with the legitimate daughters of wealthy families. However, they did not expect to hear that a biological mother had helped her niece and wronged her daughter. She even insisted on calling the police and demanding her daughter go to jail!","Li Xing’er said, “They went too far!”","The young ladies said, “Yes! They really went too far!”"]},{"number":1198,"title":"Chapter 1198 You Deserved It!","paragraphs":["1198 You Deserved It!","On the other hand, Li Xing’er was still talking confidently. “Xia Mengyan wasn’t detained just because she framed Qiao Xi. Most importantly, she deliberately broke Qiao Xi’s adoptive mother’s belongings in the Qiao family’s villa. It’s a collectible that’s no longer in production, and it’s worth 200,000 yuan. Moreover, it’s impossible to repair it. According to the procedures, the police naturally had to detain Xia Mengyan!”","The disdain in the ladies’ eyes deepened. “This is too much! Xia Mengyan framed Qiao Xi and even smashed her adoptive mother’s belongings. Why didn’t she go straight to hell?! Fortunately, Second Young Master Gu told your father about this. Otherwise, we would have thought that Xia Mengyan was a gentle and kind socialite! Now, it seems that she’s just a scheming b*tch wearing a hypocritical mask!”","“I’ll send a message to my brother now and tell him the true colors of the Xia family. My brother has been discussing business with the Xia family recently. I think we should cancel the cooperation. Who would dare to cooperate with people like them?”","“That’s right! There are no good people in the Xia family!”","“I also want to tell my family to be careful of Xia Mengyan. I heard that she’s a perfumer. I don’t dare to use the perfumes she developed.”","Madam Ye took a sip of tea and stood up. “Let’s go. We’re going to discuss business with the Zeng family later. Miss Zeng will also be there. In the future, you have to interact more with Miss Zeng. She’s the person you should befriend.”","“I remember that the Zeng and Xia families have always had business dealings. When we meet later, find a chance to remind Miss Zeng and tell her to be careful of the Xia family. I’ll also remind President Zeng.”","Miss Ye replied and felt even more disgusted. Xia Mengyan was a fool. She framed someone else but was detained. Her intelligence would be lowered if she made friends with such a person!","Li Xing’er kept glancing at Madam Ye and Miss Ye from the corners of her eyes. After the two of them left, she revealed a victorious smile in Qiao Xi’s direction.","Qiao Xi replied with a smile. It seemed that she had to thank Li Xing’er properly this time.","Soon, Madam Ye told this matter to the Zeng family, and the Zeng family told their other partners. The news spread like wildfire, and gradually, everyone in Li City knew about it.","Everyone knew that Gu Yao had gotten drunk and let it slip, but no one blamed him. Instead, they praised him for exposing the matter. Such a thing should be said to let everyone denounce the Xia family. Gu Yao had done another good deed on behalf of the heavens.","The elders of the Gu family looked at Gu Yao with admiration. “Ah Yao, you did the right thing. There’s no need to feel pressured. Gu Zheng has been taking good care of you all these years. Now that Mrs. Gu has been wronged, it’s only right you spoke up and let the matter spread. Well done!”","Gu Yao’s eyes were filled with confusion.","What are you talking about? What did I spread?","Li Xing’er’s friends quickly told their relatives and friends about this. Not long after, all the women in high society knew that Xia Mengyan and Xia Yunlou were detained for framing Mrs. Gu."]},{"number":1199,"title":"Chapter 1199 Madam Ye’s Banquet","paragraphs":["1199 Madam Ye’s Banquet","10 days passed in the blink of an eye. Xia Yunlou and Xia Mengyan’s detention period ended, and they were picked up in the Xia family’s car. After the two of them returned to the Xia family, Old Madam Xia hugged the two of them and cried until she was out of breath. Xia Cheng’s face was also gloomy.","Xia Yunlou complained, “Dad! Mengyan and I were detained. Why didn’t you come over and let us out earlier?! You forced us to stay inside for 10 days. I’m afraid everyone outside knows about it now.”","Xia Cheng’s eyes were malicious. “Don’t worry, I’ve already suppressed this news. The outside world doesn’t know that you and Mengyan were detained. I’ve also rejected all your invitations on behalf of you. It’s just that we rejected Madam Ye’s invitation too, and the Ye family doesn’t seem too satisfied. You and Mengyan need to visit and apologize.”","“The Ye family’s company has been doing well in recent years, and they’ve worked with our family. We have to obtain Madam Ye’s forgiveness.”","Xia Mengyan hurriedly agreed. “I understand, Grandpa.”","“Yes, you’ve suffered for the past 10 days. You couldn’t eat or sleep well in there. Hurry up and go upstairs to take a shower and have a good rest. I’ll get the chef to cook something delicious for you tonight.” Xia Cheng’s tone was gentle, but his eyes were filled with coldness. “Qiao Xi actually disregarded her family ties and caused you to be detained. I’ll settle this score with her sooner or later!”","At the mention of Qiao Xi, the anger in Xia Cheng’s heart surged.","10 days ago, when he found out that Xia Yunlou and Xia Mengyan were detained, he immediately called Qiao Xi. He had already tried his best to persuade her, but Qiao Xi was unmoved. He had no choice but to go to Longwan Residential, but Qiao Xi actually refused to see him.","From the moment the two of them were captured until today, he had never seen Qiao Xi at all. She was clearly avoiding him on purpose!","Xia Cheng was furious. Xia Mengyan hurriedly comforted him in a low voice, “Grandpa, don’t be angry with Xi Xi. It’s all our fault. We shouldn’t have misunderstood her. She suffered grievances, so she insisted on us being punished. I understand her. Forget it.”","Xia Mengyan was indignant. “Mengyan, you’re still speaking up for her at a time like this!”","Xia Mengyan sighed helplessly. “Aunt, I understand that Xi Xi finds it unfair. If she hadn’t been wandering outside back then, she would have been the beloved daughter of the Xia family and the Yin family. She has suffered a lot in the past 20 years, so no matter what she does, I won’t hate her. After all, she’s your biological daughter!”","“I don’t have a daughter like her. Only an ingrate like her would do such a thing!” Xia Yunlou roared with a ferocious expression.","Xia Cheng’s heart couldn’t help but ache when he saw that Xia Mengyan didn’t have the slightest trace of resentment and was instead defending Qiao Xi. “Mengyan, you’re too kind. That’s why you were bullied by Qiao Xi. If it weren’t for us protecting you, Qiao Xi would have bullied you even more badly!”","The few of them chatted for a while. Xia Yunlou and Xia Mengyan went upstairs to take a shower before hurriedly calling Madam Ye and Miss Ye to ask them to meet. The two of them knew that Madam Ye and Miss Ye had been rejected previously and would definitely be dissatisfied with them, so there was a high chance that they would reject them this time. However, they did not expect Madam Ye to agree so readily.","When they arrived at the restaurant, Xia Yunlou realized that Madam Ye had also invited some daughters and noblewomen from the upper class society of Li City. As she had invited these people to eat together, Madam Ye had specially booked a small banquet hall in Fragrance Hotel. After the dozens of women sat down, everyone’s phones rang at the same time.","Xia Mengyan and Xia Yunlou looked at each other and realized that everyone was holding their phones and covering their mouths while laughing as if they had seen something funny.","Xia Mengyan was about to join in the fun when she heard Madam Ye say with a smile, “Everyone has heard, right? Something big has happened in Li City recently!”","As Madam Ye spoke, her gaze landed on Xia Yunlou. Xia Yunlou could only casually respond, “I’ve been a little busy recently, so I didn’t hear about it. What’s the matter?”","Madam Ye and the other noblewomen looked at each other and replied meaningfully, “This matter has already spread. I found it really funny when I heard it! Therefore, since all my friends are here today, I’ll tell you about it.”","Before Xia Yunlou could respond, Miss Ye said, “That’s right! This matter is indeed funny. I just happened to hear about it.”","There was no curiosity in everyone’s eyes as if they already knew what Madam Ye would say next. Only Xia Yunlou and Xia Mengyan were kept in the dark and were dumbfounded."]},{"number":1200,"title":"Chapter 1200 The Forest Is Large, And There Are All Kinds Of Birds","paragraphs":["1200 The Forest Is Large, And There Are All Kinds Of Birds","Xia Yunlou met Madam Ye’s gaze and felt uncomfortable all over. Her heart beat uneasily. She had only rejected Madam Ye’s invitation once, and she was already prepared to apologize in person and treat her to a meal to apologize. Madam Ye wouldn’t make things difficult for her in public over such a small matter, right?","Xia Yunlou comforted herself in her heart before gradually calming down. Madam Ye cleared her throat and said, “Everyone has seen the news, right? It’s been a long time since such a funny thing happened in the socialite circle! Madam Xu, what do you think?”","She addressed Madam Xu as Xia Yunlou. Xia Yunlou was married to Xu Zhi. Although Xu Zhi had been arguing with Xia Yunlou about a divorce recently, the two of them had not terminated their marriage yet. There was nothing wrong with Madam Ye addressing her as Madam Xu.","However, Xia Yunlou found it strange. Everyone in high society knew that her marriage with Xu Zhi only existed in name, so they usually wouldn’t call her Madam Xu in case she got unhappy. Now that Madam Ye suddenly called her that, she had a bad feeling.","The next second, Madam Ye sneered and said, “I believe everyone has heard that a certain someone listened to her niece’s instigation and called the police to arrest her biological daughter. In the end, the police found out that her niece was deliberately framing her daughter. Her biological daughter was innocent, and her daughter’s identity was extraordinary, so she sued both her mother and cousin. In the end, that person and her niece were both detained! Counting the days, they should have been released today!","“Isn’t it funny? It’s so funny!”","Madam Ye’s words exploded in Xia Yunlou’s ears. She felt as if she had been struck by lightning, and the blood in her body seemed to have frozen. There was an ear-piercing buzzing in her ears, and the sounds around her became blurry.","At this moment, a rich lady who was on good terms with Madam Ye said sarcastically, “Sister Qi, who is this person? She actually believed her niece and didn’t believe her own daughter. She even wanted to send her daughter to prison? Is she crazy?”","When Madam Ye heard the noblewoman’s words, she chuckled and said, “I heard that the stolen diamond bracelet is worth one million yuan. That person insisted on calling the police. If her daughter was convicted of theft, I’m afraid she would’ve been sentenced to 10 years in prison! However, that person didn’t care about her daughter’s reputation and future at all. She insisted on reporting it to the police, saying that she was afraid that her niece would be sad and suffer.”","“That niece isn’t a good person either. She pretended to have lost something to frame her cousin. It’s better to stay away from such people. She might scheme against us one day.”","Madam Ye’s gaze landed on Xia Mengyan and Xia Yunlou. “Hey, do you know who this person is? This is something that happened in Li City recently. I believe it won’t be long before news of it spreads. That’s too embarrassing! By the way, they were detained for 10 days. During these few days, we’ve been holding banquets. Those who didn’t attend are suspicious candidates!”","As soon as these words were spoken, Xia Yunlou could not remain calm anymore. Her breathing became chaotic.","The rich ladies laughed wantonly. “Sister Qi, do you mean that this person is in our circle? This person is too heartless. She wanted to send her own daughter to prison. There are all kinds of birds in the forest! Wait, I remember now. Mrs. Xu and Miss Xia didn’t attend any of the banquets for the past 10 days!”","“That’s right! Miss Xia happens to be Madam Xu’s niece! Could it be them?”","Xia Yunlou immediately choked. Cold sweat seeped out of her forehead, and her throat felt like it was blocked by a stone. She could not say a word, and her face turned red.","Seeing that she didn’t say anything, Madam Ye smiled. “What nonsense are you talking about?! It can’t be Madam Xu. Madam Xu has just acknowledged her daughter and should be doting on her! Why would she get the police to arrest her daughter? Madam Xu, what do you say about this?”","Xia Yunlou raised her eyes slightly and said bitterly under everyone’s burning gazes, “Yes, Madam Ye is right. It’s not... me.”","Miss Ye’s gaze landed on Xia Mengyan. She lowered her head and asked softly, “Miss Xia, where have you and Madam Xu been these past few days? I invited you to my birthday banquet, but you rejected me.”","Xia Mengyan’s clothes were already drenched in sweat. Her eyes were filled with fear, and her heart seemed to be about to jump out of her chest. Didn’t Grandpa say that this matter hadn’t spread? Why did everyone know?","It was Qiao Xi! She must have spread the news!","No, she could not let everyone know that she was detained!","Everyone’s eyes fell on the two of them, waiting for their answer. Xia Mengyan felt as if a fishbone was stuck in her throat and stammered, “W-We...”"]}]);
